window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":4001,"title":"Chapter 4001: Fighting over the mine","paragraphs":["Chapter 4001: Fighting over the mine","“Rob their stores?” Chi Xuan was taken aback. This step was really too big. “Do you have a better idea?” Ling Han asked.","Chi Xuan only hesitated slightly, then nodded, “All right.”","They continued to observe, capturing the rhythm of these people.","“Every ten days, the Ghost Spirit Crystals dug out will be transported away.”","“The three guards are Spiritual Transformation Tier Yin souls, and the weakest is the one in the middle.”","“We’ll start with him.”","Ling Han and the empress waited. The three Spirit Transformation True Lord yin souls would take turns to stand guard here. The strength of their souls were early stage, middle stage, and late stage Spirit Transformation Tier. Thus, if they wanted to make a move, they would definitely have to wait until the early stage Spirit Transformation Tier yin soul was on duty. When that Yin soul arrived, Ling Han and Chi Xuan counted the days, and it was right until the tenth day, when they moved.","They had long since figured out the location of the storehouse. In truth, it could not really be considered a store. The crystals simply stacked together. That Yin soul of the early stage Spirit Transformation Tier was standing guard at the side, and in theory, it could be claimed to be absolutely safe.","“Are you really confident?” Chi Xuan asked.","They were both only in the Core Formation Tier. Though their souls were strong and healthy, and had advanced into the True Self Tier, there was still a gap of a major tier between their cultivation levels and Spirit Transformation Tier. This gap was extraordinarily wide.","Ling Han nodded, “Don’t worry, I won’t go to my death.”","Although Chi Xuan was still worried, she could only trust him.","The value of the Ghost Spirit Crystal was too great.","With a leap, Ling Han had already charged towards that great yin soul. At this time, he no longer had to suppress the undulations of the soul, and flames of light instantly rushed out of his body, incredibly bright.","In the Netherworld, a living soul was practically a small walking sun, incredibly dazzling. “Yi?” That great yin soul immediately looked over, revealing an astounded expression, “There is actually a living soul that dares to attack? Haha, just in time, to satisfy this lord’s craving!”","A True Self Tier living soul could only be considered a delicious feast for it, but could not increase the strength of its soul by much.","Its palm struck over, and its arm actually continued to extend. From afar, it had already arrived in front of Ling Han.","Indeed, there was no need for the soul to be restricted by size. Extending one’s arm was naturally no big deal.","Boom, a palm strike shot out, its power astonishing.","Spiritual Transformation Tier!","If this were the Living Realm, and Ling Han encountered a Spiritual Transformation True Lord, he would definitely turn around and leave without another word. Otherwise, he would spit out the Heavenly Dao Flames from the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","However, this place was different. The strength of his soul was comparable to the middle stage of the True Self Tier, and the Destructive Energy had a powerful restraining effect on Yin souls.","‘Come!’","Boom, Destructive Energy surged and entwined around his fists. Ling Han let out a loud roar, and shot out punches like rain.","“What!” The Spirit Transformation Tier Yin soul was shocked. Destructive Energy struck it, and it felt as if even its soul was trembling.","However, it had taken the initiative to attack, so how could it hold back now? Peng! It collided with Ling Han.","“Ah!” It immediately released a terrible scream, and one of its palms immediately melted. It was like water that had encountered fierce flames, and had been forcefully evaporated.","It hurriedly retracted its arm, its face filled with fury and shock.","With just a single strike, it had lost the soul in one of its arms, which could be said to have been a very heavy injury.","Meanwhile, Ling Han shook his head internally. As expected of a Spirit Transformation Tier Yin soul. The damage caused by this strike was far below his expectations. Furthermore, he had also been completely numbed by the other’s palm strike, and felt indescribably terrible. If they continued to exchange blows like this, it was hard to say whether he would destroy the other completely first, or the other would shatter his soul first.","However, no matter what, he could not lose in terms of bearing.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and took the initiative to rush forwards, beginning to attack. For a moment, the Spirit Transformation Tier Yin soul didn’t dare to face this head-on. That attack just now had caused it to lose more than one percent of its soul, and it didn’t want to lose any more.","One had to realize, was it easy for it to advance another step further?","There was no way to cultivate in the Netherworld, so he could only rely on devouring those at the same cultivation level to improve his soul. Moreover, the higher one’s cultivation level, the fewer yin souls there would be at the same cultivation level. Thus, it was extremely difficult to even raise one’s cultivation level by a tiny bit.","The more Ling Han looked like he was putting his life on the line, the more wary he would be, and the more cowardly he would appear.","Under Ling Han’s coercion, it continued to retreat.","Chi Xuan took the chance to run over, and began to collect the Ghost Spirit Crystals – she was only a spirit now, so she naturally stored the Ghost Spirit Crystals inside her own body.","“How dare you!” the Spirit Transformation Tier Yin soul roared loudly, and was just about to charge towards Chi Xuan.","However, Ling Han moved forcefully, forcing this Spirit Transformation Tier yin soul to retreat.","It really didn’t want to fight Ling Han head-on at all.","It was only nine days’ worth of mining, and sacrificing one’s own soul for it was not worth it","at all.","With such a passive attitude, it allowed Chi Xuan to take away all the Ghost Spirit Crystals. “Thank you for your cooperation. See you next time.” Ling Han laughed loudly, and strode","off.","That Spirit Transformation Tier Yin soul only chased a few steps before stopping. So what if it caught up?","Previously, when Ling Han had fought all out with it, it had only been continuously dodging. It had not wanted to clash head-on with Ling Han, and lose even the slightest bit of its soul. If","it caught up with them now, it would definitely be the same result.","It could be said that even if the Western Desert King moved, and could kill Ling Han with a single strike, he would definitely lose some of his soul. However, for a Sect Master-level Yin soul, this little loss was negligible.","Ling Han strode away, and very soon caught up to Chi Xuan. The two of them did not hesitate, and immediately exited the formation, and fled into the distance.","Perhaps the Western Desert King would soon arrive. If a Sect Master-level Yin soul made a move, they would only be waiting for death.","After they had walked far away, the two of them stopped, and shared the Ghost Spirit Crystals","evenly.","However, when Ling Han stored the crystals that belonged to him into his body, a strange","feeling rose up in him.","That was because this was something that had just been stored in Chi Xuan’s soul. There","seemed to still be a sliver of her soul fluctuation remaining, which gave rise to an","indescribably amazing feeling.","Chi Xuan also seemed to realize this, and couldn’t help but blush.","F***, this little girl clearly looked ordinary, but why could she give him a feeling of","wonderful enjoyment?","Ling Han hurriedly composed himself. He had more Ghost Spirit Crystals to refine.","“The two of you, please put down the Ghost Spirit Crystals.” A voice rang out, and a young man also walked out. His whole body was exuding white light, and his features were unclear, but it could be seen that his head was completely bald.","The soul could change form in a myriad of ways, but usually, it would simulate the original. Could it be that this guy itself was also bald?","“The Imperial Son of the Buddhist Race, Shi Yongming!” Chi Xuan’s expression became","serious.","“Benefactor actually recognizes this humble monk?” This bald young man gave a Buddhist proclamation, “Good, good, good. Previously, I was in the same team as the female benefactor. You claim that you are only a minor character in the Donglin Imperial Clan, but from the look of things now, the female benefactor should have an extraordinary","background.”","Ling Han also agreed internally. If she did not have some skill, she would have long since died","at the mine.","“Put down the Ghost Spirit Crystals, and you two can leave safely.” Shi Yongming said calmly, “I do not like to commit murder, so please do not make things difficult for me.”"]},{"number":4002,"title":"Chapter 4002: Battling Buddha Son","paragraphs":["Chapter 4002: Battling Buddha Son","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I have a line about f*ck you, but I don’t know if I should say it or not.”","Shi Yongming faltered at first, then showed a sliver of anger.","You’ve already f****** said it, and you still want to ask if you should speak or not? “Benefactor is Ding Yi, right?” Shi Yongming gave another Buddhist proclamation, “I heard that you are very extraordinary. When you were in the Cauldron Forging Tier, you already possessed battle prowess above Third Heaven. However, even if you have advanced into the Core Formation Tier, it is not enough in front of me. Furthermore, this is the Netherworld, which can be considered my territory.”","The most awesome thing about the Buddhist Race was that they could exorcise the souls of the dead. Thus, if they battled with their souls, Shi Yongming would be able to unleash 200% of his battle prowess. In fact, he would be able to unleash even more battle prowess.","“The two of you, I am a monk. I am a benevolent monk, and do not like to commit murder, so please do not make things difficult for me,” Shi Yongming repeated.","Ling Han looked at Chi Xuan, and asked, “Which Heavenly Realm’s Buddha Son is this?”","“West Heavenly Realm,” Chi Xuan replied.","Ling Han gave an ‘oh’, “Among the four Heavenly Realms, West Heavenly Realm is ranked third. Thus, compared to the Buddha Sons of the East and South Heavenly Realms, you should be considerably inferior, right?”","When these words fell, Shi Yongming finally looked furious.","The four Heavenly Realms formed their own circle, and there was always endless comparison among them. Furthermore, the Buddhist Race had their own strongholds in the Heavenly Realms, and had established four Buddhist Sons respectively. Naturally, there was also much competition among them.","However, Ling Han had hit the nail on the head. He was no match for the Buddha Sons of the East and South Heavenly Realms. This was a scar on him, and after Ling Han exposed it, he was naturally extremely displeased.","“Benefactor Ding, your mouth is truly toxic. You are so determined to anger me, and turn me into an angry Guardian Deity!” Shi Yongming stated calmly, but killing intent was already circulating within him.","Ling Han stretched out his right hand, then retracted his four fingers, leaving only his index finger sticking out. He hooked his finger, “Come on then!”","This was a provocation!","How could Shi Yongming hold back any longer? He immediately charged over.","“An!” He opened his mouth, and called out the Six Characters Bright King Curse. Instantly, it turned into a massive golden character that blasted towards Ling Han.","This was a Buddhist Race technique that could suppress evil and obliterate souls.","Ling Han humphed and wrapped his fists in Heavenly Dao Flames, greeting the An. Peng, peng, peng! Under his barrage of attacks, this “An” character was instantly shattered. Shi Yongming appeared slightly surprised. He had not thought that Ling Han’s attack would be so powerful, that he could even stand against the Buddhist Race’s Six Characters Bright King Curse, an Imperial Technique that countered the soul.","However, he immediately opened his mouth again, “Oh!”","The Six Characters Bright King Curse was continuously fired out, turning into multiple golden characters that pressed down on Ling Han.","Peng, peng, peng! All of the attacks were shattered by Ling Han.","Ling Han shouted loudly. He had never been the type to take a beating passively, and immediately began his counterattack.","Xiu, he charged towards Shi Yongming, the power of his fist blazing, as he shot out a punch. “Subduing Demons, Expiating Evil Spirits!” Shi Yongming chanted softly, and also shot out a punch. Instantly, a vast and mighty aura surged out. His whole person was glowing, and a halo of Buddhist light formed behind his head.","In the Living Realm, the Buddhist halo looked pure and holy, but it was only boosted in terms of aura, making it appear grand. However, in the Netherworld, the Buddhist halo definitely didn’t just look awesome, but was really awesome.","This light was incredibly intense, and had a colossal destructive and deterrent effect on the soul. It was a natural restraint.","Ling Han instantly felt as if his body were about to split apart. It was as if if if he went any further, his whole person would be torn into pieces.","The Buddhist Race was indeed skilled in dealing with souls.","Buddha Ah Han became an Emperor because of this, and Buddha Doga also wanted to travel through hell and become an Emperor in a different way, which showed how amazing the Dao of the soul was. After reaching Great Accomplishment level, one was completely capable of becoming an Emperor, becoming an Ancestral King.","However, he wanted Ling Han to back off just like that?","Impossible.","Ling Han channelled the Destructive Energy, and as his attack landed, the light of Buddha immediately shattered, and he had forcefully carved out a path for himself.","Shi Yongming was moved. He was a Buddha Son, and had grasped a great many amazing techniques that targeted the soul, but whether it was the Six Characters Bright King Curse or the Buddha Halo, they were all neutralized by Ling Han. What kind of freak was this guy?","When it came to dealing with Yin souls, there should be no one more awesome than the Buddhist Race. In the past, the reason why Buddha Ah Han could become an Emperor was because he had expiated countless dead souls, and was loved by the heaven and earth. Only then did he manage to take that step that only a few dozen or over a hundred people in history had the right to take.","“Who exactly are you?” he couldn’t help but shout.","“Your grandpa!” Ling Han had already rushed over, and shot out a punch, “Grandson, take this.”","Shi Yongming almost twisted his nose in anger. How could there be such a tasteless person? They were all prodigies, so which of them didn’t respect their own status? However, Ling Han didn’t care about his image at all. He was simply outrageously vulgar.","“Humph, though Buddha is merciful, subduing demons and eliminating demons is also part of our duty.” Shi Yongming moved, and delivered a palm strike. Golden light dazzled, like he was an enlightened monk, boosted by the heaven and earth’s righteousness.","In truth, he had indeed expiated a considerable number of dead souls, and had gained the approval of the heaven and earth, so he had meritorious service.","Yet Ling Han did not care. Whether the heaven and earth acknowledged you was the business of the heaven and earth, but if I want to beat you up, so what if the heavens come?","Fight!","He unleashed the murderous aura attack, with Destructive Energy entwined around his fists. He didn’t need anything else. This was the most terrifying killing move against the soul.","Shi Yongming didn’t dare to face it head-on either. He summoned a Soul Tool, a demon- subduing staff, and blocked the furious barrage of fists that Ling Han continuously threw at","him.","However, Ling Han’s battle became more and more intense, with each punch becoming fiercer and fiercer. Shi Yongming was shocked to discover that even his soul was trembling, as if it was about to be shattered.","This was too terrifying. How could this person’s soul be so powerful?","He was the Imperial Son of the Buddhist Race. Since childhood, he had cultivated the most brilliant cultivation technique in the world, and cultivation resources could be obtained with a wave of his hand. Furthermore, there was no shortage of natural treasures. Thus, the strength of his soul far surpassed any ordinary Core Formation Tier cultivator. However, after clashing with Ling Han, he discovered that his soul was actually weaker than Ling Han’s. How could he accept this?","Consummate level of Core Formation Tier, Imperial Son of the Buddhist Race, and the strength of his soul was actually inferior to an unorthodox early stage Core Formation Tier?","How was this possible?","However, this was the reality. Ling Han’s iron fists rained down, beating Shi Yongming so","hard that he couldn’t fight back at all.","Shi Yongming felt extremely sullen. He was the Buddha Son of the West Heavenly Realm, and","he would be able to attain venerate Tier in future, at the very least. Yet now, he was being bashed by a person whose cultivation level was lower than his, which was completely unacceptable to him.","However, even if he didn’t want to accept it, he had to accept it. In the cultivation world, strength was all that mattered. They didn’t believe in tears or defiance.","Shi Yongming roared in fury, then turned around and left quickly.","Ling Han set off in pursuit, causing Shi Yongming to pay the price of losing an arm before he","finally stopped his pursuit.","It was not that he wanted to let Shi Yongming off the hook, but rather that he had sensed a frightening fluctuation of aura, and did not dare to pursue any further.","Probably, the Western Desert King knew about the robbery of the mine, and in his fury, personally came to hunt down living souls like them.","In front of such a great monster, Ling Han naturally chose to retreat.","In any case, Shi Yongming would not be able to escape. He would call him to account in future."]},{"number":4003,"title":"Chapter 4003: Her Imperial Highness, the Princess","paragraphs":["Chapter 4003: Her Imperial Highness, the Princess","Ling Han and Chi Xuan went into hiding, and began to refine the Ghost Spirit Crystals.","They were ambitious, and wanted to snatch a few more Ghost Spirit Crystals, because the Western Desert King couldn’t personally oversee the mine, right? Moreover, even if he did,","how many days could he stay?","Furthermore, if the strength of their souls could soar all the way up, then even if it was a Yin soul on the level of Sect Master, so what? They were completely unafraid.","However, after only three days, Ling Han sensed that someone was approaching.","He immediately stood up, and assumed a stance to greet an incoming attack.","“Enemies?” Chi Xuan asked. The strength of her soul wasn’t as high as Ling Han’s.","“I don’t know yet, but someone is coming over,” Ling Han said.","When these words fell, three people walked out from a pile of rocks.","“Your Highness!” Without waiting for Ling Han or Chi Xuan to speak, the three people quickly rushed over, all of them filled with excitement as they looked at Chi Xuan.","Yi, a princess?","Ling Han faltered. Though he knew that Chi Xuan’s status in the Donglin Imperial Clan was definitely not weak, he had still underestimated her. She was actually the princess of the Donglin Imperial Clan.","Hold on, even if it was an Imperial Clan, how many princesses could there be?","Chi Xuan frowned, but since her identity had already been exposed, she had no intention of trying to make things right again. Thus, she nodded, “Why have you guys come in?”","“Your Highness, the tokens of the clansmen accompanying you have all been shattered, and only yours is still here. Thus, Ancestor was worried, and ordered us to enter in batches to find Your Highness,” one of them said.","Chi Xuan nodded, “We failed in our assault on the mine, and suffered heavy losses.”","“Then, Your Highness, what should we do next?”","“I have my own measures,” Chi Xuan said.","“Understood.” The three of them obeyed strictly.","One of them looked towards Ling Han, humphed, and said, “How dare you, you actually dare to sit casually in front of Her Highness, the Princess. Hurry up and stand up!”","Yi, am I in the way of others by sitting here?","Ling Han pursed his lips, and looked towards that person. Looks like someone was asking for a beating.","Chi Xuan knew Ling Han’s pride and abilities, and immediately shouted, “This is Ding Yi, Brother Ding. Don’t be rude.”","“Yes, yes, Your Highness.” That person hurriedly bowed and agreed. His flattery had completely failed, which made him feel very depressed.","“Brother Ding, apologies for the rudeness,” Chi Xuan apologized to Ling Han.","Seeing their princess actually think so highly of Ling Han, the three of them were extremely stunned. It should be known that they were members of the Imperial Clan, and Chi Xuan was the brightest pearl of their clan, and she actually took the initiative to apologize to another.","This was too scary. What was so amazing about this Ding Yi?","Meanwhile, Ling Han smiled proudly, “For the sake of ‘Your Highness’, I’ll forget this matter.”","He emphasized the words ‘Your Highness’.","Chi Xuan smiled, “Brother Ding, are you blaming me for deliberately concealing my identity?”","“Dare I ask, Your Highness, Chi Xuan should not be your real name, right?” Ling Han countered.","“Brother Ding, Ding Yi isn’t your real name, is it?” Chi Xuan countered.","Ling Han secretly blamed himself for being too casual when coming up with a name, but how shameless was he? He declared boldly, “That is naturally my real name. I, Ding Yi, will not change my name, and will not change my surname no matter what!”","Chi Xuan laughed delicately, and shook her head, “All right. In any case, you will find out eventually. Chi Xuan is indeed not my real name. That is a cousin of mine, and my name is... Chi Menghan.”","Yi?","The Imperial Daughter of the Donglin Imperial Clan was using as a gimmick this time? However, did the seductive beauty ranked third on the Beauty Roll look like this?","Ling Han teased, “If Your Highness looks like this, then I definitely won’t be the ideal son- in-law.”","“How dare you!” the three members of the Donglin Imperial Clan shouted in unison. Chi Menghan, meanwhile, waved her hand dismissively, “I’m really sorry that my looks are not up to expectations, and have been the cause of regrets for Brother Ding.” Ling Han felt a chill in his heart. Previously, he had deliberately provoked this Imperial Daughter. He had not thought that she would be so subtle, and would not be provoked at all. Being able to become the Imperial Daughter, it was indeed not just her natural talent that was astonishing, but also her temperament that was outstanding.","“I hope that when my soul returns, I can have a good conversation with Your Highness,” Ling Han said.","“If there’s a chance, yes,” Chi Menghuan said.","This woman was really calm, as if she was immune to all poisons. Who knew if the large black dog would be able to make her lose her composure.","“We have to refine the Ghost Spirit Crystals as soon as possible. When the soul is strong enough, perhaps even a middle stage or even late stage Spirit Transformation Tier Yin soul would be nothing to fear,” Chi Menghan said.","“All right.”","The two of them began to refine the Ghost Spirit Crystals again. After close to a month, they finally refined all of the Ghost Spirit Crystals.","Ling Han frowned, and said, “Shouldn’t we return once? After all, it’s been too long since I left my physical body.”","Without the vitality brought about by the soul, the physical body would gradually wilt.","Chi Menghan smiled, “I forgot to tell Brother Ding that the flow of time here is different from the flow of time in the Living Realm. Ten days have passed here, and only one day has passed","in the outside world.”","Yi?","Ling Han looked at Chi Menghan. This Imperial Daughter deliberately concealed such important information. What was her purpose?","“Brother Ding, I only forgot to mention it. You didn’t ask, did you?” Chi Menghan asked with","a smile.","It would be strange if he believed her.","Ling Han sighed. Now, not only were these seductive beauties on the Exquisite Leaderboard astonishingly beautiful, they were also so smart that it gave him a headache?","Couldn’t she be simpler like Hu Niu? Couldn’t she be proud like the empress?","How tiring was it to place all one’s intelligence on scheming and plotting?","“What level has the strength of your soul reached now?” Ling Han asked. “The middle stage of the True Self Tier,” Chi Menghan said, “What about you?”","“A little higher than you, late stage.”","Chi Menghan pondered for a moment before saying, “Although our strength has increased to a certain extent, we probably still can’t rival a Yin soul at the middle stage of the Spiritual Transformation Tier, let alone a late stage Spiritual Transformation Tier.”","“If we want to strengthen the soul, we have to either hunt down Yin souls that are similarly in the True Self Tier, or snatch the Ghost Spirit Crystals. We seem to have entered a dead end, and we still have to clash with a yin soul at Spirit Transformation Tier,” Ling Han said.","“I have a technique that requires two people to cultivate and use it at the same time. It’s boundlessly powerful.” Chi Menghan paused for a moment before continuing, “Brother Ding,","do you want to learn it?”","Yi, could this be the Heavenly Brilliance Technique?","Ling Han immediately nodded, “Sure!” Whether it was or not, there was no harm in learning another technique.","“Your Highness!” The three members of the Donglin Imperial Clan were extremely anxious.","This was an Imperial Technique, so how could it be taught so easily?","Chi Menghan ignored them completely, and said, “You should have guessed by now. That is the Heavenly Brilliance Technique.”","“Imperial Technique?” Ling Han rubbed his hands, appearing very expectant.","“That’s right.” Chi Menghan nodded, “This was created by Ancestral King Donglin, but at the beginning, our clansmen could not learn it no matter what we tried. Afterwards, an extremely talented Saint Tier ancestor appeared. He said that the Heavenly Brilliance Technique was too powerful, and could not possibly be used alone by one who was not an Ancestral King. Thus, it was split into two, and was to be used through the combined efforts of two people.” Hearing her say this, Ling Han’s brain whirred, “Then if one’s aptitude was even slightly inferior, wouldn’t it be possible if three or four people worked together?”"]},{"number":4004,"title":"Chapter 4004: Heavenly Brilliance Technique","paragraphs":["Chapter 4004: Heavenly Brilliance Technique","When Ling Han said this, the four members of the Chi Clan, including Chi Menghan, were all moved.","Especially those three people. Their expressions were even more exaggerated, as if they had seen a ghost.","Yi, have you guys encountered a ghost?","“Brother Ding, you’re really good at making inferences,” Chi Menghan said with a nod. “That’s right. The Heavenly Brilliance Technique can be unleashed by two people at the same time, or three people at the same time. In fact, it can be unleased by even 100 people at the same time.”","“This is the most widely known Imperial Technique of our clan. Usually, we use it in groups of ten, and when they work together, the might is astonishingly great.”","Ling Han laughed loudly. As it turned out, his casual words had hit the nail on the head. He was really too much of a prodigy.","“Come, come, come. Your Highness, let us now cultivate dual cultivation.”","Chi Menghan rolled her eyes. This guy must have done it on purpose. They were both cultivating a simultaneous Technique, not a double cultivation technique. He was really too shameless.","“All right, I will teach you the precious technique,” she said.","“Your Highness!” the other three members of the Chi Clan exclaimed again.","“Don’t be so shocked, it’ll scare people, all right?” Ling Han immediately rebuked.","Really, they kept wanting to stop him from learning the precious technique.","Chi Menghan waved her hand dismissively, “It’s fine. I know what I’m doing.”","She would only teach Ling Han half of the Heavenly Brilliance Technique, not the complete Heavenly Brilliance Technique. And if he only learnt half of the Imperial Technique, then casting it alone would not have the slightest bit of power.","In history, the Chi Clan had also taught half of their Imperial Technique to outsiders, but so what? Countless years had passed, and the Heavenly Brilliance Technique was still the ultimate technique that belonged solely to the Chi Clan. There was no outsider that could use it at all.","Chi Menghan began to teach Ling Han the Heavenly Brilliance Technique. This was an Imperial Technique, and it was targeted at the soul. Its might was astonishing, and even Saints were unable to cast it alone. They could only rely on numbers to make up for it.","The more prodigious a cultivator was, the fewer people they would need to use the secret technique together.","Chi Menghan was the Imperial Daughter, so there was naturally nothing to be said about her natural talent. Meanwhile, Ling Han had been able to pummel even an Imperial Son along the way, so there was naturally no need to mention his natural talent or abilities. He was one of the top in the world.","If the two of them weren’t qualified to cultivate the Heavenly Brilliance Technique together, then there wouldn’t be a second pair of prodigies in the world that were qualified to do so.","Chi Menghan taught him the verbal chant, and this also involved a large amount of seals and Spiritual Power channelling techniques. It was extremely complicated, and even a prodigy like Ling Han felt a headache coming on.","It was too complicated. Was this really something that could be understood by humans?","Ling Han calmed down and tried his best to search for the core of the technique. He would then expand upon this core.","Chi Menghan had been cultivating this Imperial Technique since childhood. Thus, there was naturally no problem with her half. Once Ling Han had a slight grasp of it, the two of them would be able to cultivate it together.","The flow of time here was different, so it could be said to be a good place for comprehending Dao.","Yi, the Time Chamber on the Galaxy Network, could it be that it was based on this place? He had digressed, he had digressed.","Ling Han hurriedly pulled his attention back, and completely immersed himself in the understanding of the Heavenly Brilliance Technique.","“Hmph, wanting to cultivate the Heavenly Brilliance Technique to be used by two people, this requirement is too high.” A member of the Chi Clan smirked coldly, “If you ask me, it would already be good enough if he can cultivate to Small Accomplishment in three years.” “Even if the flow of time here is faster, it would take at least a few months,” another person said.","“Perhaps he’ll need even longer,” the third person said.","A look of displeasure spread across Chi Menghan’s face, and she shouted softly, “Leave.”","The three of them shuddered. They knew that they had angered this Imperial Daughter, so they hurriedly stepped back respectfully.","Three months later, Ling Han finally had some idea. Another month later, he had already achieved some minor accomplishments.","Ling Han was naturally overjoyed. However, he remained calm and collected, and said to Chi Menghan, “Er, the half I cultivated is too difficult. Why don’t we trade?”","-If the large black dog was here, he would definitely be incredibly pleased. He had completely obtained the true essence of Grandpa Dog’s shamelessness.","Chi Menghan didn’t fall for it. “The two halves of the Heavenly Brilliance Technique are both","the same.”","“I don’t believe it. Show me.” Ling Han began to act shamelessly.","Chi Menghan shook her head, and said, “Brother Ding, you’ve already mastered the Heavenly Brilliance Technique, haven’t you?”","‘What?’","The other three members of the Chi Clan were shocked. This was too exaggerated, wasn’t it? Only four months had passed, and this guy had already grasped half of the Heavenly Brilliance","Technique?","It should be known that even their Imperial Daughter, a supreme prodigy like Chi Menghan, had taken close to two years to succeed.","Ling Han sighed upon seeing this. This woman was far too intelligent, so it wasn’t easy to","deceive her.","“Cough, cough, how could that be possible!” Ling Han shook his head, “Let me take a look at the other half of the Heavenly Brilliance Technique. Who knows, I might be able to comprehend it by analogy. It would have great reference value, right?”","Chi Menghan acted as if she hadn’t heard anything, and said, “Brother Ding, come, let’s cultivate the precious technique together!”","F***, can you listen to me properly?","Ling Han was exasperated. No matter how shameless he was, he couldn’t continue","pretending.","The two of them began to cultivate the technique together. Ling Han couldn’t help but be impressed. The Saint that had dismantled the technique was really too prodigious. The Heavenly Brilliance Technique that he had cultivated was extremely complex, but the might it delivered was pitifully small, but used together with Chi Menghan, it was completely","different.","This might had surpassed the Demonic Monkey Fists.","Why? Could it be that Ancestral King Donglin was even more awesome than the Battle Saint","Emperor?","Impossible.","Ling Han shook his head. The Ancestral King had already reached the pinnacle of the Celestial Path, so which one of them wasn’t a prodigy among prodigies? Who would be weaker than the","other?","Standing at such a height, though the techniques they created were all different, their might should be more or less the same.","Why had the Heavenly Brilliance Technique surpassed the Demonic Monkey Fists?","Firstly, it should be the two of them working together, so their combined power would naturally be greater than one person. Secondly, the Imperial Technique was too powerful. Without reaching this cultivation level, how could one possibly attain the true essence and unleash its true might?","Ling Han believed it. If Ancestral King Donglin used the Holy Emperor to clash with the Battle Saint Emperor using the Demonic Monkey Fists, the two of them should be equal in power/","However, it was a shame that only one Emperor would appear in a single era. There was no way to truly battle to see who was the strongest in all of history.","Ling Han put away his wild thoughts and focused on cultivating the technique with Chi","Mengguan.","Another month passed, and the two of them had already developed enough tacit","understanding.","It couldn’t be helped. They were in a pure soul state now, so how could they not cooperate","well? “Right now, we’re powerful enough to rival elites at the early stage of the Spiritual Transformation Tier,” Chi Menghan said.","Ling Han nodded. The Heavenly Brilliance Technique was truly terrifying. The combined power of the two of them could rival the Yin soul of an early stage Spirit Transformation cultivator. This was a head-on confrontation, and not relying on Destructive Energy to scare the latter into not daring to fight.","Now, with the Heavenly Brilliance Technique, he could withstand the Yin soul of an early stage Spirit Transformation Tier elite head-on. Then, he could use the Destructive Energy to attack, and it would not be impossible for him to kill an early stage Spirit Transformation Tier","yin soul.","“Come, let’s go to the mine.”","They once again arrived at the mine, but did not act rashly. Instead, they waited until the Yin soul of the early stage Spirit Transformation Tier took up his position again, and only then did they immediately move out, charging over.","“It’s the two of you again!” The yin soul gritted its teeth, feeling an urge to explode in anger.","‘You guys did it on purpose, didn’t you? Just when I was on duty, you came over.’","Was he very easy to bully?","“You guys have miscalculated this time. Right now, there isn’t even a single Ghost Spirit","Crystal!” he laughed loudly.","“We didn’t miscalculate. We’re here to kill you,” Ling Han said calmly."]},{"number":4005,"title":"Chapter 4005: Waiting for an opportunity","paragraphs":["Chapter 4005: Waiting for an opportunity","Hearing Ling Han and Chi Menghan’s words, the early stage Spirit Transformation Tier great yin soul was immediately enraged.","The crystals had been snatched by Ling Han and Chi Menghan once, and he had already been harshly scolded by the Western Desert King. Now, not only had these two people come over when he was on duty, they were even shamelessly boasting that they would kill him.","Hehe, were living souls all so fond of jokes?","“You guys are really courting death!” it said balefully.","“Kill it!” Chi Menghan commanded.","“All right!”","Ling Han joined forces with her. The Heavenly Brilliance Technique was used, and instantly, their souls lit up. Shua, shua, shua! Multiple rays of brilliant light shot out like arrows from the sky.","The Yin soul in the early stage of the Spiritual Transformation Tier was shocked. The strength of these two living souls were only on par with the True Self Tier, so how could their combined might actually reach the level of the Spiritual Transformation Tier, and actually be capable of matching it?","However, it was naturally unafraid.","This giant monster approached, exchanging blows with Ling Han and Chi Menghan.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The Heavenly Brilliance Technique unleashed its full might. With a single strike, the giant monster stumbled, and actually looked like it was outmatched.","The large monster was astounded. Were these two living souls transcendent above the gods? How could they be so terrifying?","Ling Han laughed loudly. His right hand and Chi Menghan unleashed the Heavenly Brilliance Technique together. Meanwhile, his left hand was wrapped with Destructive Energy, and he launched a barrage of attacks at the Spirit Transformation Tier yin soul.","This would be fatal.","In the first place, the large monster was already experiencing great strain, and now added with the Destructive Energy, it had become the last straw that was pressing down on it.","It didn’t dare to fight anymore, and hurriedly turned around to run.","However, how could Ling Han and Chi Menghan allow it to do as it pleased? The Heavenly Brilliance Technique unleashed its might, firmly trapping it. Then, the Destructive Energy unleashed its might, blasting its soul into continuous destruction.","Spiritual Transformation Tier elites were indeed powerful, but they couldn’t withstand this kind of expenditure. In less than half an hour, it was exhausted to death by Ling Han and Chi Mengguan.","Er, it was a yin soul in the first place, and was as dead as could be. Exhausting it to death was not a very appropriate word. In short, this time, it was really gone, completely disappearing from the world.","“We now have ten days.”","Ling Han and Chi Menghan moved, eliminating all the Yin souls that had been mining here. Then, the Donglin Imperial Clan sent a large number of people to replace the original miners, and began to mine madly.","The next time the Western Desert King sent someone over, that would be ten days later. It should be a Yin soul of middle stage Spiritual Transformation Tier. At present, even if Ling Han and Chi Menghan joined forces, they would only be able to fight to a tie, at most, but would not be able to destroy it.","Thus, when the time came, the yin soul only had to retreat, and bring the Western Desert King over. Then, Ling Han and the others would be completely wiped out.","In just ten days, they would dig with all their might!","They had a large number of people, so the efficiency of mining was naturally incomparable to those Yin souls from before. Meanwhile, Ling Han and Chi Menghan were personally mining as if their lives depended on it.","However, they were all souls, and the soul technique only had great destructive power against souls. However, against these mountain rocks, the effects were far inferior. The best method was still to use the Soul Tool as a tool to cut open the stone.","Ten days passed very quickly. They had also dug up a large pile of Ghost Spirit Crystals, and the Spirit Transformation Tier Yin soul under the command of the Western Desert King also","came.","Ling Han and Chi Menghan joined forces to fight, but though they could match this great monster, they couldn’t trap it. Though there was only a gap of a minor cultivation level between them, it was still much, much stronger.","Finally, this giant monster was scared off by Destructive Energy.","“Retreat.”","It was clear that the late stage, or consummate stage of Spirit Transformation Tier, and even the Western Desert King would be personally making a move next. It would be too dangerous to stay.","Moreover, they had mined for ten days, and their gains were already huge enough.","They retreated to the place where they had just entered. Most of the members of the Chi Clan had to return, and Ling Han and Chi Menghan still planned to stay here for a while longer.","In terms of the distribution of Ghost Spirit Crystals, Ling Han received 30%, while the Chi Clan received 70%.","This seemed very unfair to Ling Han, but firstly, this was indeed the territory of the Chi Clan, and secondly, the Chi Clan had also mobilized a large number of people to excavate. If it was Ling Han alone, his gains definitely wouldn’t be so great.","Actually, the fact that he was given 30% was because Chi Menghan had fought for it. Otherwise, giving him 10% would have been enough.","Ling Han only felt rueful about this, and that was Chi Menghan was indeed very good at conducting herself. She was generous, and her future prospects should be very amazing. The two of them had great ambitions. In fact, they even wanted to kill the Western Desert King, but this would require them to increase the strength of their souls to at least Spiritual Transformation Tier.","Thus, they began to refine the Ghost Spirit Crystals with all their might.","However, when the strength of Ling Han’s soul reached the peak stage of the True Self Tier,","he discovered that he couldn’t take another step further.","Just like how the strength of his soul had advanced into the True Self Tier, killing ordinary Yin souls would have no effect on him, and it was the same now.","He wasn’t the only one. Chi Menghan was the same.","This could only mean one thing, and that was there was an upper limit to how much the Ghost Spirit Crystals could improve one’s Spiritual Power, and that was the peak stage of the True","Self Tier.","Now, if they joined forces, they could even match Yin soul elites at the peak stage of Spirit Transformation Tier. However, against Yin soul elites at the level of Sect Master, they could only flee in panic, completely outmatched.","No wonder those Spirit Transformation Tier yin souls didn’t think of stealing from the Ghost Spirit Crystals they were guarding at all, because this was completely useless to them.","Ling Han still had many Ghost Spirit Crystals in his possession. Of course, these were still useful, as he could bring them out for the empress and the others.","“What do we do? Are we just going to retreat like this?” Chi Menghan was unwilling to give","up.","If they could kill the Western Desert King, the entire mine would belong to the Chi Clan. At that time, the younger generation of the Chi Clan would be able to cultivate their soul to an astonishing level, far surpassing their peers.","Ling Han remained silent. After a while, he turned to look at Chi Menghan, only to see that she was also looking at him. Her eyes were burning, and it was as if her entire soul was glowing.","“You’re not thinking the same as me, are you?” the two of them asked at the same time.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “The Western Desert King has been nurturing troops all this while. Sooner or later, a battle will break out, and at that time, we will take advantage of the opening","to cut him off!”","“That suits me,” Chi Menghan said with a smile.","The two of them were really extremely bold. They actually dared to cut them off and reap the gains of an existence like that.","“Let’s have a good discussion. If we really get into a battle, how should we proceed?”","The two of them were in high spirits. Now, the only thing that could make them wary was the Sect Master yin soul, and once the Western Desert King started fighting with other yin soul forces, their attention would definitely be focused on the Sect Master yin souls.","This gave them a chance to fish in troubled waters.","Of course, this was also plucking chestnuts from the fire, so it would definitely be extremely","dangerous.","They were livinb souls, so no matter how much they suppressed their aura, as long as they were close enough, they would naturally be seen clearly.","However, this was a great opportunity, and they didn’t want to miss it.","Time passed faster here, and Ling Han began to deduce formation techniques. He and Chi Menghan cultivated the Heavenly Brilliance Technique together, trying their best to unearth the profound secrets contained within.","This was an Imperial Technique. It would not be an exaggeration to say that one would gain new comprehensions even if he cultivated diligently for his whole life.","Just like that, a month passed, and the two of them finally saw their chance.","The Western Desert King was about to mobilize his troops against the Heavenly River King."]},{"number":4006,"title":"Chapter 4006: Fishing in troubled waters","paragraphs":["Chapter 4006: Fishing in troubled waters","The chance had finally come.","Ling Han and Chi Menghan were both rubbing their fists. This was the best chance for them to break through to the Spirit Transformation Tier in terms of strength of their souls, and what made the two of them feel that it was a pity was that that early stage Spirit Transformation Tier yin soul shouldn’t have been killed so early, but should have been used to help them break through.","It was too late for regrets now.","Thankfully, they didn’t necessarily require a great yin soul of Spirit Transformation Tier to take this step, but rather one in True Self Tier was enough, so they would have a greater range of choices.","They waited patiently. A month later, they saw the Western Desert King lead an army into battle. All his elite subordinates followed him, and there was no one to mine or guard the","mine.","This opportunity naturally could not be missed. Chi Menghuan once again summoned the clan members to continue mining, while she and Ling Han set out with the Western Desert King’s team.","The army travelled for three days, and another army appeared ahead of them. It was vast and boundless, and the weakest was at the level of the Core Formation Tier.","The two sides did not speak any nonsense, and immediately began an intense battle.","Boom!","The commanders-in-chief of both sides also moved. They were all Sect Master-level great yin souls. In a clash of blows, the yin soul elites in the surroundings instantly collapsed in droves, causing the remaining yin souls to hide far away, not daring to approach and deliver themselves to their deaths.","“This is our chance.” Ling Han and Chi Menghan exchanged a glance before charging forward together.","‘Die!’","They used the Heavenly Brilliance Technique. Multiple rays of dazzling light flickered, and the Yin souls in the surroundings also collapsed continuously.","“Mere living souls dare to take advantage of the crisis!” A great Yin soul charged over. This was a Spirit Transformation Tier, and a late stage at that.","Ling Han and Chi Menghan merely defended and didn’t attack this large monster. They roamed around and started to massacre the other small monsters.","Countless Yin souls collapsed, and there was no shortage of True Self Tier ones among them, causing the strength of Ling Han and Chi Menghan’s souls to begin to slowly increase again, charging towards Spiritual Transformation Tier.","In this kind of war, they were not the only ones who had improved.","It could be seen that there was an endless stream of Core Formation Tier yin souls breaking through to True Self Tier, and True Self Tier yin souls breaking through to Spiritual Transformation Tier. However, comparatively speaking, there were pitifully few yin souls breaking through to Spiritual Transformation Tier.","Boom, amidst a terrifying aura fluctuation, a Spiritual Transformation Tier peak stage Yin soul also completed its breakthrough, leaping into Sect Master-level in a single stroke.","However, this was the beginning of its misfortune.","The Western Desert King and Heavenly River King, who were battling fiercely, immediately stopped. Then, they charged towards the Yin soul that had just broken through to Sect Master Tier. The two of them actually joined forces.","Their strength far surpassed the early stage of Minor Advanced Tier, and it was the two of them working together at that. How could the newly promoted Sect Master Yin soul possibly match them? It was only about a hundred moves, and it was forcefully torn to shreds.","Then, its copious amount of soul energy was immediately absorbed by the Western Desert King and the Heavenly River King, causing their strength to increase by a significant amount. Seeing this scene, Ling Han couldn’t help but curse internally. Then, he looked towards Chi Menghan, and the two of them had the same thought.","-Had this Western Desert King and Heavenly River King attained previous agreement? Their opposition was only an act, and their true motive was to have their subordinates develop and improve, so that they would be able to devour them?","Perhaps there were other Yin souls that thought the same, but now that the flames of war were raging, no one could turn back. Otherwise, they would be overwhelmed by the boundless Yin souls. Additionally, every Yin soul that was still alive was becoming stronger, and this had also become a powerful temptation that they were unwilling to give up.","Becoming stronger, this was a longing that was written in their bones.","“Something’s not right. Let’s go after breaking through to Spirit Transformation Tier.”","“All right.”","Ling Han and Chi Menghan also set their targets. Although the longer they battled here, the better. However, if they were too greedy, the consequences would also be extremely severe. Both of them had great intelligence, as well as great decisiveness, and knew that this was not a good place, and they could not stay too long.","Not long after, another Spiritual Transformation Tier Yin soul broke through, but it immediately suffered the same fate, being jointly killed by the Western Desert King and the Heavenly River King.","It was as if they were rearing venomous insects, waiting for the strongest to appear, and then kill and devour them.","Ling Han suddenly thought that the Netherworld beings should not only be Yin souls on the level of Sect Master. Then what about Yin souls on the level of Venerate Tier, or even Saint-level?","Were they hiding in the dark, waiting for the breakthrough of Sect Master-level yin souls? Then, would they move, and use these Yin souls as nutrients to improve themselves?","F***, this place was really chaotic.","After battling for a while longer, Ling Han and Chi Menghan both lit up. They had broken","through.","Spiritual Transformation Tier!","They could not be greedy to the point of insatiableness.","The two of them exchanged a glance before turning around to leave.","“Humph, you still want to flee?” A cold laugh rang out, and the Western Desert King suddenly abandoned the Heavenly River King and charged towards the two of them, “Since you’re","already here, then just stay behind.”","It stretched out a hand to grab, and with a single hand, it could blot out the skies. It was a dark mass, and there were endless seals flickering, terrifying without bounds.","Ling Han and Chi Menghan hurriedly shot out the Heavenly Brilliance Technique. The Imperial Technique was naturally extraordinary. Boundless brilliance dazzled, raising their battle prowess to the level of Sect Master.","However, their battle prowess was at most at the early stage of Minor Advanced Tier, but the Western Desert King’s strength was at the middle stage of Minor Advanced Tier. The gap was","huge.","Peng!","With just a single strike, Ling Han and Chi Menghan were both sent flying.","“Let’s go!”","Though their souls were trembling violently, they did not even recover for a moment, and","immediately began to flee.","“You think you can leave?” Heavenly River King also charged over, a cold smile on his lips. “What a pity. Such a delicious living soul has to be eaten when it’s so weak. If I could wait until you attain Minor Advanced Tier, that would really be delicious and nourishing.” “Humph, these two living souls have mastered an amazing technique. When they advance into Minor Advanced Tier, will you still be a match for them?” the Western Desert King","scoffed.","“True.” Heavenly River King nodded.","F***, these two Yin souls had indeed long since collaborated. The so-called war was merely breeding venomous insects.","How could Ling Han and Chi Menghan dare to continue fighting? They hurriedly leaped into","the air and fled.","However, their cultivation level was far inferior, so how could their speed compare to the Western Desert King and Heavenly River King’s? They quickly caught up to them.","As Ling Han attacked, he said, “Are you two Ghost Kings going to chase out just like this?","Aren’t you afraid that one of your lackeys will break through to the level of Sect Master, sneak away, and establish their own forces?”","“Humph, it won’t take much time to kill the two of you!” The Western Desert King was","unmoved.","Ling Han’s left hand shook. Boom! Destructive Energy surged, and he said proudly, “Then why don’t you guys give it a try!”","Seeing the black energy, a hint of wariness appeared on the Western Desert King and Heavenly","River King’s faces.","Though Ling Han was so weak that he couldn’t even withstand a single blow from them, this black energy was incredibly terrifying. To them, it was definitely a deadly weapon, and possessed an indescribable threat.","“How about it?” Ling Han asked calmly. “It’s indeed possible that you people will kill us.","However, it’s hard to say how much time you’ll need. Moreover, if I put my life on the line,","one of you will definitely be severely wounded. At that time... hoho, I wonder if the other person will be benevolent?”","When these words fell, both the Western Desert King and the Heavenly River King looked","hesitant."]},{"number":4007,"title":"Chapter 4007: Persuasion","paragraphs":["Chapter 4007: Persuasion","Though Ling Han’s words were a little exaggerated, they were not without reason.","Though this living soul was not strong, and the black energy was not very strong either, just that little bit was enough to wound them, and even if they were only slightly injured, it would cause a change in the comparison of strength between the two great Sect Master yang soul yin souls.","Once the balance was broken, it would be impossible for them to continue cooperating. Instead, they would fight to the death.","“Thus, you all had best go and reap the rewards of your subordinates,” Ling Han once again tossed out his suggestion.","The Western Desert King and Heavenly River King looked at each other, both unwilling.","Let the living souls escape?","It would be a pity to let go of such a delicious dessert. Furthermore, this was also a matter of pride.","But Ling Han was right. This would lead to a stalemate.","The two great Yin souls were both resolute. They had been preparing for this battle for a very long time, and definitely could not allow a mishap to happen just because of two mere living souls.","Let’s go.","Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief. He looked toward Chi Menghan, only to discover that she was also drenched in cold sweat. This was despite the fact that they were both in spirit form.","They didn’t dare to stay any longer. In any case, they had already successfully raised the strength of their souls to the Spiritual Transformation Tier. Now that they had achieved their goal, there was naturally no need for them to stay any longer.","The two of them turned around, and arrived at the place where they had first entered. After sending out a signal, the elite of the Donglin Imperial Clan immediately controlled the green-skinned gourd, and sucked out their souls.","Instantly, Ling Han discovered that his body was light and airy, as if he could not be restrained at all, and was naturally incredibly close with the heaven and earth.","He had absolutely no wish to return to his own body. That would cause him to be heavily bound.","But the moment this thought arose, he hurriedly suppressed it.","Without the support of his physical body, how was he supposed to cultivate?","If there was only a soul, he would be like duckweed without roots, and could not be maintained for long.","He hurriedly returned to his physical body and fused into his mind. Instantly, he felt a swelling pain in his mind, as if it was about to explode.","This was very normal. His spirit had suddenly advanced from the Core Formation Tier to the Spiritual Transformation Tier. It was much, much stronger, and the mind was still unable to adapt to it.","His entire body was glowing. His soul was too powerful, surpassing the cultivation level of the physical body, as if it was about to burst out.","Ling Han worked hard for a long time, and finally allowed his body to accommodate his soul. However, if he wanted to completely fuse with his body like before, he still needed some time.","“Why hasn’t our prized heir returned yet?” someone shouted loudly.","This was a Dao Protector. He looked indescribably old, and was definitely not a prodigy that had come this time.","“Why hasn’t the Dao Child of our sect woken up for so long?” another Dao Protector cried out in grief.","Obviously, the souls of these people had all been obliterated in the Netherworld, and it was eternally impossible for them to come back to life.","The Donglin Imperial Clan only expressed regret about this. As for compensation, they didn’t mention it at all.","They had already expressed that it was extremely dangerous to enter into the Netherworld, and anyone who entered would bear the consequences.","If this were any other force, the likes of the Soaring Snake Holy Land and the Three Flowers Sect would definitely not let the matter go. However, this was the Imperial Clan, so who dared to behave atrociously? Wouldn’t they be afraid that the Saint of this clan would appear and destroy everything?","Thus, they naturally could only swallow this humiliation.","Ling Han and Chi Menghan were the last to return, but they weren’t too late either. Because time passed differently, even if they stayed in the Netherworld for a few dozen more days, only a few days had passed here.","As long as they could come back alive, they would all receive great benefits. The strength of their souls would at least reach the level of the True Self Tier.","This couldn’t help them advance their battle prowess to the True Self Tier, but it did help them establish a firm foundation in advance. In the future, once they advanced to the True Self Tier, their battle prowess would definitely be able to crush their peers.","None of the kickass prodigies died, such as Sha Yang, Yi Yuanrong, Zhu Yixiu. They all received astonishing benefits, their whole person exuding light, as if they could take that crucial step at any time, and advance into the True Self Tier.","“Brother Ding, welcome back,” Shen Yutang said to Ling Han with a smile as he walked over. Ling Han also nodded. He glanced at this guy, and felt that this person was becoming deeper and deeper. His aura was hidden, and he was hiding his strength.","“Hahaha, young friends, congratulations on your return. You can be considered to have passed the second round of the assessment,” the old Sect Master of the Donglin Imperial Clan said. He glanced at each of them, but his gaze lingered on Ling Han for a moment longer. Though it was really a very negligible instant, Ling Han could still sense it.","“Next, it will be the final test.”","The old Sect Master smiled calmly, “It just so happens that a mother tree of our clan has ripened, and a total of seven fruits can be plucked. Thus, this time, we plan to invite seven young friends to enter into our clan, and share the celestial fruits with us.”","Mother tree!","Instantly, everyone’s eyes lit up. This was the mother tree, something that a planet could only nurture one of. That was at least a Venerate Tier Celestial Plant, so just how nutritious would the fruits it produced be?","However, there were only seven spots!","Everyone looked at each other. Meanwhile, those prodigies of consummate level Core Formation Tier smiled. These seven people would definitely only come from among them.","“In martial arts, though strength is the most important, one also has to see potential. You can’t think that you’re definitely the strongest just because you’ve cultivated a few years earlier and have a higher cultivation level.” The old Sect Master spoke again, “So, next, please attack with all your might on the Black Heaven Stone.”","“This Black Heaven Stone was created by a Saint of our clan. It can examine the cultivation level, age, and battle prowess of the user in a comprehensive manner, and ultimately obtain a","potential value.”","“This may not be the most accurate, but the gap would not be too far.”","Hearing his words, those Core Formation Tier cultivators who were at the consummate level all frowned, while those who were at a lower cultivation level smiled.","In a comparison of strength, with a higher cultivation level, it was indeed very difficult to compensate for the difference. However, this was a comparison of potential, and that was a","different story.","They were all supreme prodigies, so who would be afraid of who?","Very soon, a large rock was brought over. It looked very ordinary.","The old Sect Master smiled calmly, and said, “This is the stone that the Saint of our clan has been sitting on to comprehend Dao. At first, it was very ordinary, but in the end, it has become a precious treasure. You all can use your full power to attack it. The potential value is shown in terms of the number of stars you have. The more stars you have, the higher your potential.”","“Dare I ask, senior, how many stars would qualify?” someone asked.","The old Sect Master pondered for a moment, then said, “Those who have reached Three Stars in the test of our Clan, the lowest accomplishment would be Sect Master, and those who have reached Five Stars have all become Venerate Tier.”","This involuntarily caused everyone’s interest to be piqued. Though they all firmly believed that they could become Venerates, having such clear proof could still make them more","confident.","“Senior, may I know how many Stars can the most prodigious prodigy of your noble clan blast out?” another person asked.","The old Sect Master’s eyes involuntarily lit up. He seemed to have thought of someone, and a relieved expression appeared on his face, “In our race, the strongest person has lit up seven","stars!”","Hiss, if he could become a Venerate with a result of five Stars, then seven Stars... could he","become a Saint?","Who was it?","The old Sect Master smiled calmly, “Becoming a Saint does not only require potential, but also luck. Thus, it is not certain. It is not definite.”","Though he said that it was not definite, that smug look on his face clearly signified that he","was extremely proud."]},{"number":4008,"title":"Chapter 4008: Black Heaven Stone","paragraphs":["Chapter 4008: Black Heaven Stone","Everyone was curious. Which clansman of the Donglin Imperial Clan was so awesome?","It was either the Imperial Son or the Imperial Daughter. Furthermore, he or she must be from the present generation. Otherwise, the old Sect Master would have had a nostalgic expression on his face, and not this incredibly proud expression.","Who exactly was it?","Yet a thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind, and he thought of someone.","Chi Menghan.","Though he had only come into contact with her soul, Ling Han had a feeling that this woman was very strong.","“Hehe, young friends, come on.” The old Sect Master withdrew his smugness, and beckoned everyone over.","“I’ll go!” Immediately, a man walked out. He was in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier, and couldn’t be considered the strongest among them. However, this Black Heaven Stone was only a test of potential, and cultivation level wasn’t the key.","“How about this? Each person has three chances to make a move,” the old Sect Master said. “Among the three chances, take the one with the best result. However, after the first time is over, don’t drag things out any longer.”","“Understood,” the man replied with a nod. He then composed himself before throwing another punch at the Black Heaven Stone.","This punch was really terrifying. He had even stimulated high-level energy. Multiple patterns lit up, and there were also multiple shattered seals, exuding an incredibly terrifying aura.","Boom!","When this punch landed, a fierce light suddenly exploded on the Black Heaven Stone, as if nothing could be seen clearly even if one’s eyes were open.","After a while, the brilliance dispersed completely, and the man still maintained the posture of having his right fist land on the Black Heaven Stone, while the Black Heaven Stone was completely unmoved.","This surprised everyone. That was because the Black Heaven Stone was only laid out on the ground, and had not been fixed with any kind of technique, but such a fierce punch actually did not move it in the slightest.","Something that the Saint had once used was really that amazing.","Everyone looked again, and saw that multiple stars had also lit up on the Black Heaven Stone. Upon counting, there were a total of three stars, and the third one was still flickering, as if it would dim at any moment.","However, in the end, this star still stabilized, and maintained its brightness.","Three Stars!","The man immediately looked disappointed. Though from the experience of the Donglin Imperial Clan, his future accomplishments would be at least Sect Master, he was one of the top hundred of the Galaxy Network, and Sect Master was definitely not his ultimate goal. “Hehe, young friend, you don’t have to be concerned. There are still two chances,” the old Sect Master said. “You’re allowed to use the Spirit Tool, but it can’t be activated.”","Allowing the use of a Spirit Tool was to ensure that those who were skilled in using weapons would not be at a disadvantage, and the fact that it could not be activated was also for the sake of fairness. That was because added with one’s own power and the power of a Spirit Tool, battle prowess would definitely soar greatly.","This wasn’t a competition of Spirit Tools.","The man nodded, and took out a sword. After standing quietly for a while, he had already accumulated enough power, and struck out with the sword again.","It was still three stars, but this time, the third star did not flicker continuously. Instead, it had long since stabilized.","The man refused to give up, and delivered another powerful strike. In the end, it was still only three stars, and he was not even able to make the fourth star flicker for a moment.","He was defiant, and was just about to deliver another strike, when someone pushed him aside.","“Trash, step aside.” The person who pushed him was a burly man. His right hand pushed the person away, while his left hand delivered a palm strike.","Barely four stars!","Previously, the man had wanted to flip out, but when he saw that the other had actually activated his fourth star, his aura instantly weakened. Added with the fact that the old Sect Master’s sharp gaze was already directed at him, his heart trembled, and he chose to swallow his anger.","In the end, the sturdy man’s result was still four stars after three strikes.","This was not an easy feat. If he worked harder in future, he may even be able to become a Venerate.","Everyone stepped forward to undergo the test, one after another. They could see that the majority of them were Three Stars, and only a rare few could reach Four Stars. This caused those who had achieved a result of Four Stars to look pleased.","The mother tree’s celestial fruits were in sight.","Slowly, the majority had completed the test, and only a few people were left.","These people were either keeping a low profile or wanting to show off.","Ling Han was also among them, but he naturally didn’t think that he was showing off. Really, he was just keeping a low profile.","“Let me take the lead.” Zhu Yixiu walked out. He was ranked fourth in Core Formation Tier on the Galaxy Network, and was also the top Core Formation Tier of the East Heavenly Realm.","Thus, when they saw him walk out, those who had achieved a result of four stars all showed expressions of interest.","This person was a great rival.","After Zhu Yixiu focused slightly, he immediately sent out a palm strike. Boom, the Black Heaven Stone exploded with light, soaring into the skies, making everyone dumbfounded and feeling an indescribable fear.","If this attack landed on him, would he be able to survive?","However, Zhu Yixiu was indeed so strong, firstly, because of his natural talent, and secondly, because he had reached the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier. Probably, he could take that step at any time, and become an elite of the True Self Tier.","However, it wasn’t long before five stars lit up on the Black Heaven Stone!","Hiss, five stars... this only meant that his natural talent was indeed superior to others, and his potential was astonishing.","As long as this guy did not die, he would definitely become a Venerate in future. Everyone looked envious. Now, there were only about ten people left that had yet to be tested. Then, if he achieved a result of five stars, it meant that he would definitely be able to win a ticket into the Donglin Imperial Clan.","Yet Zhu Yixiu was very dissatisfied with this result. He was actually only a five-star genius?","It should be known that someone from the Donglin Imperial Clan had achieved a result of seven stars. Compared to them, was the gap that wide?","He did not believe it.","Zhu Yixiu drew out a purple-gold staff. This was a Three Star Spirit Tool, but he did not activate it. Instead, he directly channelled out the Saint Technique, and then smashed the","staff onto the Black Heaven Stone.","Five Stars... and it was still only five Stars.","After using the Saint Technique, his battle prowess had directly increased by twofold, and it","was still only five stars?","“Hehe, this is only a test of potential. Thus, using the Saint Technique, or even an Imperial Technique Technique would not add much points,” the old Sect Master said with a smile.","When these words fell, everyone immediately dismissed the idea that the prodigy from the Donglin Imperial Clan had relied on Imperial Techniques to add points.","Zhu Yixiu launched a third attack, but there was no change to the result. It was still five stars,","so he could only step aside.","This was the best result so far, but Zhu Yixiu didn’t look very happy – if no one’s best result was seven stars before, then he would definitely be proud now, because he had suppressed all","the other prodigies.","“Let me give it a try.” Yi Yuanrong walked out. She was stronger, ranked third in Core","Formation Tier on the Galaxy Network, adn was the top Core Formation Tier of the West Heavenly Realm. Her battle prowess was also twenty plus Heavens, at least.","She used a kick. Peng, her kick landed on the Black Heaven Stone, and instantly, a brilliance","exploded.","Five Stars.","Yi Yuanrong frowned slightly. Initially, she had the confidence to surpass Zhu Yixiu. At the very least, she would be able to make the sixth star flicker. She had not thought that it would only be the same result as Zhu Yixiu’s.","She drew out her Spirit Tool, and used the most powerful technique to fire two more times. The result was that both were five stars.","This time, everyone was stunned. As it turned out, even Galaxy Network’s top prodigies could","only shoot out five stars. Then, the person from the Donglin Imperial Clan was too terrifying,","wasn’t he?","As expected of the Imperial Clan."]},{"number":4009,"title":"Chapter 4009: Pseudo-Eight Stars","paragraphs":["Chapter 4009: Pseudo-Eight Stars","Editor: Henyee Translations","“Hehe.” A cold laugh rang out, and Fu Huoyang walked out.","Fu Huoyang, Imperial Clan!","Of course, he was only from a side branch of the Imperial Clan, but being able to be associated with the Imperial Clan meant that he was powerful.","Fu Huoyang didn’t activate his Spirit Tool. Instead, he casually delivered a palm strike, and after the Black Heaven Stone trembled for a while, six stars lit up at the same time.","p***l","Immediately, exclamations of shock rang out from the crowd. A six-star genius had actually appeared.","Meanwhile, Fu Huoyang frowned slightly. Before the test, everyone thought that they would definitely be overwhelmingly awesome, but ideals always went against reality.","Six stars, compared to the prodigy of the Donglin Imperial Clan, he was still one star short.","Even though it was only one star and didn’t seem like much, top-notch prodigies like Yi Yuanrong and Zhu Yixiu were only five stars. It could be seen just how colossal the gap of one star was.","Fu Huoyang launched two more attacks, but this still didn’t change his final result of six stars.","He stepped to one side, slightly displeased, but the gazes that everyone directed at him were filled with envy and jealousy. This was the Imperial Clan. Merely a side branch clansman was capable of producing a result of six stars. What would happen if the Fu Clan sent the real Imperial Son or Imperial Daughter, over?","Seven stars?","So that the Chi Clan would not be the only shining star ahead of them? Subsequently, Zhu Chengyun, who had once been the strongest person in the Cauldron Forging Tier, also stepped forward to take the test. At present, he was only in the early stage of the Core Formation Tier, but this was not a competition of battle prowess, so he too had achieved a result of five stars. This caused those four-star geniuses to complain internally. Looks like the awesome people were all lined up behind them. If there were a few more five-star geniuses, they would all be eliminated.","Calculating, there were already three five-stars and one six-star.","Sha Yang also went up, but though he was the second in the current generation of the Core Formation Tier, he was still unable to change his destiny of five stars, and was unable to break through to six stars.","“Let me try.” Shi Yongming walked out.","The Buddhist Race’s Imperial Son. Of course, he was from the branch in the West Heavenly Realm,","Everyone couldn’t help but widen their eyes, watching carefully.","This was an Imperial Son, so he should not be inferior to Fu Huoyang, or even surpass Fu Huoyang.","Peng!","Shi Yongming shot out a strike, and multiple stars immediately popped up on the Black Heaven Stone.","Six!","No, five stars.","The sixth star indeed lit up, but after flickering for a moment, it dimmed again. What did this mean?","Shi Yongming was no match for Fu Huoyang.","What a joke. The Imperial Son was actually inferior to a clansman from the branch family?","Could it be that the Buddhist Race was far inferior to the Fu Clan?","It could not be said that way, because Fu Huoyang possessed the bloodline of the Great Emperor of the Fu Clan, and the Buddhist Race was too unique. As long as one believed in the Ancestral Buddha, he would be able to become a member of the Buddhist Race. Even the Imperial Son actually did not have any relation in terms of bloodline.","Something like bloodline really could not be underestimated.","And Ling Han had a further deduction, and that was the Buddha Son of the East, South, West and North Heavenly Realms were all not the true trump cards of the Buddhist Race. That was because Prosperous Heaven had once said that the true land of the Buddhist Race lay beyond the thirty three Heavens. Was there no Buddha Son there?","The true inheritance of the Buddhist Race should belong to the Buddhist Son there.","After three consecutive attacks, Shi Yongming was still unable to completely stabilize his record of six stars. He could only be considered close to six stars. This caused him to be ranked second now. Taking into account the number of people remaining, he would definitely pass, but second place was obviously not enough to satisfy him. Thus, his expression was still very tense.","Shen Yutang looked towards Ling Han, and asked, “You first?”","“You go first,” Ling Han said.","“AU right.” Shen Yutang did not hold back. He walked in front of the Black Heaven Stone, and tapped out a finger, which he pressed onto the stone.","He didn’t show any anger, and it was as if he were doing this casually. There was no flash of brilliance.","This caused quite a number of people to shake their heads. Everyone was trying their best to perform, yet you are so casual. Aren’t you afraid of angering the Imperial Clan?","Pu, the attack landed, and seven stars flickered.","What!","Everyone was numb with shock. This was too terrifying, wasn’t it? Seven stars and he had caught up to that prodigy from the Donglin Imperial Clan.","No, the seventh star has dimmed,” someone immediately said.","“That’s right!”","Although Shen Yutang’s attack had activated seven stars, the seventh star was not stable. It seemed to be hesitating whether or not to give him a judgement of seven stars.","After a while, the seventh star finally dimmed.","Six stars, but it could also be considered close to seven stars.","First place!","Though Fu Huoyang was also a six-star genius, he was not even qualified to make the seventh star light up. Compared to Shen Yutang, the gap was very obvious.","Instantly, the gazes everyone directed at Shen Yutang changed. This guy, it was possible that he would become a Saint in future. In this world, Saints were the most powerful!","Shen Yutang, meanwhile, scratched his head, looking completely laidback. He did not launch a second or third attack, but rather returned with his hands clasped behind his back.","“Young friend, you still have two chances!” the old Sect Master reminded.","“No need, it’s fine as long as it is a pass,” Shen Yutang said.","F***, just how lazy was this guy? He was not even willing to fight for a better result.","Hehe, good, good.” The old Sect Master smiled, and the gaze he directed at Shen Yutang was very gentle. Clearly, he was extremely satisfied with this young man.","Counting again now, four five stars, one pseudo six stars, one six stars, one pseudo seven stars... fine, the seven spots had all been filled.","Those four-star geniuses all sighed in despair. They had been smug for so long, yet in the end, their hopes had all been dashed.","“Brother Ding, go,” Shen Yutang said calmly to Ling Han as he walked back to him.","Ling Han nodded, and walked forwards.","Ding Yi arrived.","Many people “recognized” him. This was the newly risen super genius in the West Heavenly Realm recently, it was said that he was capable of defeating Core Formation Tiers when he was only in Cauldron Forging Tier, and was overwhelmingly awesome.","How many stars could he unleash?","Previously, everyone had hoped that the fewer stars that others could light up, the better, so that they could pass the test, but now, there was no hope at all. ’ Their mentality immediately changed. Instead, they hoped that Ling Han could light up a result of five or six stars.","In this way, even five-star geniuses were destined to be eliminated, which made them feel much better.","You see, even the five-star geniuses had been eliminated, so they didn’t feel that it was unjust.","“Ding Yi, go!”","“I have a high opinion of you.”","“Don’t cower, just do it!”","Ling Han was rendered speechless. He was going to test his potential; what did this have to do with these people?","He walked closer, raised his right fist, and thought for a moment. He did not use any technique, nor did he draw on any high-level energy. He merely unleashed his mystical power, unleashed his full power, and then blasted it onto the Black Heaven Stone.","Instantly, a series of stars lit up.","One, two, three, four, five, six, seven... eight!","p***l","All of a sudden, everyone’s eyes widened, as if they had seen a ghost. Though everyone hoped that Ling Han would achieve a good result, and thus disrupt the situation, none of them had expected that Ling Han would actually be so awesome, to actually blast out eight stars.","Eight stars, even surpassing the one from the Donglin Imperial Clan.","“Yi, not eight stars.”","“The eighth star is flickering.”","“It’s getting dark.”","Everyone exclaimed in shock, and saw that the eighth star was not stable It was flickering, and after a while, it finally dimmed, and became seven stars.."]},{"number":4010,"title":"Chapter 4010: Psychic fruits of cultivation","paragraphs":["Chapter 4010: Psychic fruits of cultivation","Even if the result of eight stars hadn’t been stabilized, this still caused an incomparable commotion.","Seven stars!","To be more precise, it was close to eight stars.","Could the person from the Donglin Imperial Clan compare? More importantly, Ling Han’s attack had been too casual. He hadn’t used the celestial technique, nor had he drawn on high- level energy. Everyone could see this clearly.","If he could deliver an attack that was close to eight stars with such an attack, then if he delivered a full-power attack, to say nothing of nine stars, it should be no problem to stabilize it at eight stars.","F***, f***, f***.","At this moment, everyone was dumbfounded as they stared at Ling Han. They were rendered completely speechless.","Fu Huoyang’s expression instantly became as dark as could be.","He was a six-star genius, and there was a gap of almost two stars between his potential and Ling Han’s pseudo eight stars. This was too terrifying, and it meant that as long as their cultivation levels were equal, he probably wouldn’t even be able to block a single move from Ling Han.","As a member of the Imperial Clan, he was actually inferior to Ling Han?","It should be known that this person was also his enemy – though he did not take him to heart at all, from the look of things now, this could possibly become a great danger to him.","Damn it, what natural treasures had this brat ingested?","However, it was also precisely because of this that Fu Huoyang wanted even more to obtain Ling Han’s blood. The Ten Thousand Spirit Blood Pill that he concocted from this should have extremely good effects.","Shi Yongming’s expression didn’t look any better. He had attempted to rob Ling Han in the Netherworld, yet he had been defeated by Ling Han in the end. He had fled in a sorry state, and now that he saw that Ling Han’s potential was far superior to his, he was extremely embarrassed.","Even Shen Yutang was slightly surprised. Though he already had a very high opinion of Ling Han, he had not expected that the latter’s potential would actually surpass his own.","However, his temperament was calm, and he couldn’t be bothered to compete with others. Thus, he only smiled and left.","Meanwhile, Ling Han gritted his teeth. See, he had initially wanted to keep a low profile, and deliberately did not use celestial techniques, Destructive Energy, and so on. He wanted to pass the test without being too high-profile.","Unexpectedly, he had only thrown an ordinary punch, and it was actually a result that was close to eight stars.","Sigh.","Forget it. Since it had already come to this, it would be useless even if he regretted it.","Ling Han smiled, turned around and walked back.","“Young friend, are you not going to try again?” the old Sect Master asked.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “No, it’s better to keep a low profile.”","‘You want to keep a low profile?’","Everyone was speechless. A casual strike had produced a result close to eight stars, and even the prodigy from the Donglin Imperial Clan was suppressed. You have the nerve to say low- key?","F***, showing off, he was really too good at showing off.","The old Sect Master was also taken aback for a moment. Though he too had given up the chance to continue trying, Shen Yutang was clearly lazy, while Ling Han was showing off. It was too different.","“Now, you four five-star geniuses will have to go through a selection. One has to be eliminated.” The old Sect Master looked towards Zhu Yixiu and the others. They had all achieved a result of five stars.","There was no need for Ling Han to worry about this. He only had to wait to eat the celestial fruits after entering into the Donglin Imperial Clan.","“Little Han, I heard that you’re showing off again today,” the large black dog immediately said after returning to his room.","Ling Han chuckled, and threw out a pile of Ghost Spirit Crystals, “Here, these are for you. I wonder if they are enough to stuff your dog’s mouth, so I can have a moment of peace.”","The large black dog naturally knew what was what. He immediately cracked a grin, “You even brought gifts back. You’re treating me like an outsider.”","Although it said this was treating him as an outsider, it had already hidden the Ghost Spirit Crystals tightly. Now that it was in its pocket, it was naturally impossible for it to spit it out again.","After waiting for two days, the Donglin Imperial Clan also finished their preparations, inviting Ling Han, Fu Huoyang and the others to the ancestral grounds of the Imperial Clan.","Who had been eliminated?","Yi Yuanrong.","Why her?","Ling Han felt that the biggest reason was because she was a woman, and the Donglin Imperial Clan had held this prodigy gathering in the name of finding a husband for Chi Menghuan. What was the point of having a woman here? So that they could develop homos*xual love?","As for whether it was or not, Ling Han didn’t care.","They entered into a Transfer Formation, and then arrived at the true ancestral grounds of the Imperial Clan.","This was a celestial mountain, and the heaven and earth here was extremely abundant with","energy.","Ling Han felt like every single hair on his body was floating, as if they were feathers that could","ascend to the heavens.","“F***, Black Spirit Ginseng.”","“Great Yin Flower.”","“Heaven’s Fortune Vine!”","Everyone was exclaiming in shock. This was practically a paradise on earth. There were incredibly valuable Celestial medicines everywhere, and their grade was not low either. They were at least Four Stars. In fact, there was no shortage of Six or Seven Stars Great Herbs, and they were just growing along the path.","Was this the Imperial Clan? They were far too wealthy!","They climbed the mountain, and arrived halfway up the mountain. Aside from the Celestial medicines that were still scattered all over this place, there were also numerous divine beasts","resting here.","There were Azure Phoenixes, White Tigers, and Qilins. Of course, these definitely weren’t pure-blooded Divine Beasts, because pure-blooded Divine Beasts had already been","exterminated since ancient times.","Ling Han couldn’t help but drool. Even if it wasn’t a pure-blooded Divine Beast, it should be","very nutritious to eat.","“Brother Ding, you’re drooling,” Shen Yutang said from the sidelines. He was slightly","surprised. What was wrong with him?","Ling Han sighed. Too bad, he could look but not eat. This was practically a tragedy of life.","After walking for a while, they arrived at a courtyard at the waist of the mountain. There were walkways and pavilions here, and every stone and pillar exuded Spiritual Qi. “Please sit, please sit,” the old Sect Master said. There was a long stone table here. To say nothing of seven people, even seventeen people could calmly sit around it.","By now, the highest-ranking person dispatched by the Donglin Imperial Clan was only this old Sect Master. It couldn’t be helped. These prodigies were only at the Core Formation Tier, at most. How could it be that the Imperial Clan would send out Venerate Tiers or even Saints","to receive them?","The Imperial Clan was the strongest force in the world, and did not need to curry the favour of","anyone.","The seven of them sat down respectively, and the old Sect Master also waved his hand. Immediately, someone delivered seven jade boxes, which he placed in front of each of them.","“This is the Spiritual Dao Fruit that my clan has just harvested,” the old Sect Master said. “The Spiritual Dao Fruit was formed by the mother tree, and flowers only bloom once every million years. Another million years, fruit will be borne, and another million years will pass before it ripens. Even Saints might not be able to wait until the fruits ripen.” Everyone nodded in agreement. After all, Saints could only live for millions of years. If they were unlucky, they definitely wouldn’t encounter the ripening period.","“The effect of the Spiritual Dao Fruit is to improve one’s physique in all aspects. Furthermore, it also has a hidden effect, and that is if you suffer a fatal injury, the medicinal effects can still take effect once, saving your lives,” the old Sect Master said solemnly.","The fruit being unable to increase their cultivation level caused the seven of them to feel slightly disappointed, but true treasured medicine actually did not increase their cultivation level, but rather increased their natural talent and potential, paving the way for their future.","And the Spiritual Dao Fruit actually had a life-saving effect, which was naturally even more","miraculous.","“However, this life-saving effect has an upper limit, and that is Sect Master-level.” The old Sect Master continued, “If you guys become Venerate Tier elites, the medicinal effects would","be greatly reduced.”","When these words fell, the seven of them knew that this mother tree was Venerate Tier-level. Thus, its effects on Venerate Tier-level elites were much worse.","This was very normal. They weren’t any relation to the Donglin Imperial Clan, so why would the Donglin Imperial Clan give them the fruit of a Saint-level mother tree?"]},{"number":4011,"title":"Chapter 4011: Stunning","paragraphs":["Chapter 4011: Stunning","A Treasured Fruit from a Venerate Tier-level mother tree was still overwhelmingly awesome.","The seven of them opened the jade box, and saw that there was a fruit that looked like a peach, but also looked like a plum. It was not big, and was slightly smaller than a fist. It was","completely crystalline, like crystal, and its surface was covered with veined patterns, having an indescribable Dao rhythm.","Including Fu Huoyang and Shi Yongming, everyone picked up the celestial fruit and started to eat it.","Treasured Fruits like this would lose a portion of their effects with every second that passed after they were plucked. Thus, the sooner they were consumed, the better.","Ling Han didn’t eat it at the first instant. Although he was a glutton, he didn’t crave it at this moment. He held this Spiritual Dao Fruit and examined it carefully, because he discovered that the veined patterns on it intrigued him even more.","In truth, he also thought that his natural talent was high enough, so a Venerate Tier-level celestial fruit may not be able to improve him much.","What he valued was actually the life-saving effects of the Spiritual Dao Fruit.","However, the veined patterns on the fruit gave him a great appreciation.","When the others had finished eating, Ling Han turned to the old Sect Master and asked, “Senior, would I be qualified to observe that mother tree?”","Yi, what would you be observing the mother tree for?","The old Sect Master had not expected that Ling Han would make such a request, and couldn’t help but feel a little confused. Though the mother tree was the most precious treasure of the world, the process of blooming and bearing fruit was too long. Now that the Treasured Fruits had just been plucked, so what if you went to take a look?","Even if the mother tree was gifted to you, you would not be able to live until the next time the fruits ripened.","“All right, I will agree on behalf of Uncle Wenrui.” A pleasant female voice rang out, and a woman with an exquisite figure also walked over.","How could there be someone with such a perfect figure?","Though she was dressed in a very loose palace dress, it still could not hide the graceful bearing of her figure. Where she should be thin, it was slender enough to be just barely held with a single hand, and where she should be shapely, she would be surging, making one sigh at how big she could be.","Unfortunately, there was actually a veil covering her face, concealing her appearance. Chi Menghan!","Hearing this voice, Ling Han immediately felt a sense of familiarity. Wasn’t this the Imperial Daughter of the Donglin Imperial Clan?","The old Sect Master was stunned for a moment, then nodded, “Since Menghan has already agreed, it would not be proper for me to refuse, so I will agree.”","“Thank you, Senior,” Ling Han said with a bow. He then nodded at Chi Menghan before starting to eat the celestial fruit.","He was a glutton, and in a few moments, he had eaten the whole celestial fruit. This caused Fu Huoyang, Shi Yongming and the others to all cast him looks of disdain. ‘You are too uncultured, and have no image at all.’","However, was this masked woman Chi Menghan?","Everyone looked intoxicated, and even Shi Yongming was no exception.","Although Chi Menghan hadn’t revealed her true appearance, her figure alone was already breathtaking enough. Moreover, with such a beautiful figure, her appearance was definitely breathtakingly beautiful as well. After all, she had been seen by others before, and she was stunningly beautiful. She was ranked third on the Exquisite Leaderboard.","Fu Huoyang was extremely assertive, and he immediately said with a smile, “I’m Fu Huoyang. May I have the honor to see the princess’s true appearance?”","If he could marry the Imperial Daughter of the Donglin Imperial Clan, then not only would he be able to obtain the Imperial Technique of the Chi Clan, even the Fu Clan would view him in a new light, and freely teach him the Imperial Technique.","Thus, he definitely had to seize this opportunity.","Chi Menghan smiled faintly, “You want to see my true appearance? Simple, just defeat me.”","“Your Highness, though this is a bit abrupt, I still want to ask for some guidance from you.” Fu Huoyang stood up, and clasped his hands in Chi Menghan’s direction.","Chi Menghan stepped into the air, and said, “Then, let’s battle in the sky!”","“Wait!” Ling Han wiped his mouth, then smiled at Chi Menghan. “Er, princess, can you leave this person to me?”","‘Hmm?’","Chi Menghan hesitated slightly, then nodded, “All right.”","She stepped lightly with her lotus feet, and returned to the ground.","Fu Huoyang instantly exploded in fury. ‘It wasn’t easy for me to use sparring as an excuse and win the chance to interact with Chi Menghan at close range. Why the f*ck are you butting in?’ “Fu Huoyang, just because you’re a major tier higher than me, you’re bullying me just because my abilities are inferior to yours. You even sent some random nobodies to apprehend me,” Ling Han said with a shake of his head. “Today, we’ll settle this debt.”","He felt very regretful that he had not been able to meet Fu Huoyang in the Netherworld. Otherwise, with the strength of his soul, and the terrifying destructive power of Destructive Energy, killing Fu Huoyang should have been a piece of cake.","In this place, even if his battle prowess overwhelmed Fu Huoyang’s, the Donglin Imperial Clan definitely wouldn’t allow him to kill a person from another Imperial Clan. Otherwise, conflicts might arise between the two great Imperial Clans, and that would be a huge matter. However, even if he couldn’t kill him, he couldn’t let him do as he pleased. No matter what, he had to make him suffer a little.","This had indeed taken effect. Fu Huoyang’s expression was as dark as the bottom of a pot.","“Are you in such a rush to die?” Fu Huoyang asked coldly. In the first place, he had no plans to spare Ling Han, but he also knew that he could not possibly kill anyone in the Imperial Clan. How could it be that the Donglin Imperial Clan did not want face?","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Come!”","He was the first to fly into the air, stepping on empty space. This was the unique ability of Core Formation Tier.","Fu Huoyang also ascended step after step. He felt extremely sullen.","Ling Han was only in the early stage of the Core Formation Tier. He could tell, and so could everyone else. Meanwhile, he was in the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, so defeating Ling Han was only a matter of course. Thus, seeing as he couldn’t kill Ling Han, what benefits","would this battle bring him?","But if he did not fight, he would be even more displeased.","“You are really outrageously bold!” Fu Huoyang shouted loudly, and shot out a punch at Ling","Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and also threw a punch, “Fu Huoyang, without the identity of the Imperial Clan, what else do you have?”","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow. Fu Huoyang’s battle prowess of fourteen Heavens exploded, instantly sending Ling Han flying.","However, Ling Han’s current raw power had reached Ninth Heaven. Though this blow had","sent him flying, the Primal Chaos Celestial Core in his body gave a light tremor, and dispersed","all the power that was assailing him.","After flying for several hundred meters, Ling Han finally stopped. He stood with his hands clasped behind his back, completely unharmed.","This!","Everyone was stunned. Though there was no shortage of super geniuses whose battle prowess","had surpassed twenty Heavens, and any one of them was stronger than Fu Huoyang and Ling Han, once Fu Huoyang and Ling Han exchanged blows, they could roughly deduce the battle prowess of the two of them.","One was around Fourteenth Heaven, while the other was only Ninth Heaven, and at most Tenth Heaven. There was a gap of at least four Heavens of battle prowess between them, and","the result was actually a tie?","That’s right. Ling Han was sent flying, but he was completely unscathed. This could only be","considered a tie.","What a freak!","What did it mean by having high battle prowess?","‘I’m stronger than you, so that’s what it means to have higher battle prowess, but now,","someone with higher battle prowess actually didn’t get the upper hand. This is completely","illogical.’","“What a freak!” someone murmured.","This won everyone’s resonance. In fact, even the eyes of that old Sect Master shone with a strange light. Then, he glanced at Chi Menghan, and somewhat understood why the pearl of","their clan would agree to Ling Han’s request.","His performance was too stunning."]},{"number":4012,"title":"Chapter 4012: Fighting Fu Huoyang","paragraphs":["Chapter 4012: Fighting Fu Huoyang","Fu Huoyang’s expression instantly became extremely ugly.","It wasn’t that he didn’t know about Ling Han’s freakishness. At that time, when Ling Han was only in the Cauldron Forging Tier, he would only spit out a little blood after taking a strike from him. His freakishness index was off the charts.","But at the time, at least, he had been able to wound Ling Han, and could pose a threat to him, but now?","With this strike, Ling Han actually looked like he was completely unscathed.","How could he accept this?","“Damn it!” he cursed softly, and charged towards Ling Han.","This time, he activated the Imperial Technique. When he launched another attack, the sky was filled with brilliant seals, as if even the heavens could be suppressed.","Battle prowess... Fifteenth Heaven!","Ling Han humphed. The Primal Chaos Celestial Core surged out, releasing the aura of Primal Chaos. Instantly, Fu Huoyang’s battle prowess was pulled downwards in a straight line, falling as much as three Heavens.","Fu Huoyang couldn’t help but feel shocked. This time, his battle prowess had dropped by three Heavens. This was inconceivable, and he was completely stupefied.","Ling Han greeted Fu Huoyang’s attack with his God Slaying Technique.","Boom!","The two of them exchanged another blow, and instantly, it was a draw.","‘Holy motherf*cker!’","Everyone’s eyes widened in shock.","‘Holy f*ck! Is he even human?!’","The early stage of the Core Formation Tier against the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, and it was an Imperial Clan member like Fu Huoyang at that, a prodigy with potential value of six stars, and they actually fought to a tie.","F***, so this was pseudo eight stars?","Fu Huoyang couldn’t accept this either. He stared blankly at Ling Han, but Ling Han threw another punch, forcing him to parry at the first instant.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two of them exchanged blows.","At present, Fu Huoyang did not have the sligthest advantage in terms of battle prowess. Under the clash of Imperial Techniques, the rebound of every blow caused his blood to boil, making him feel extremely terrible.","On the other hand, Ling Han’s Primal Chaos Celestial Core replaced the effects of the only Celestial Cauldron, which could disperse all power attacks within six Heavens. Naturally, he was completely unscathed.","How could Fu Huoyang withstand this?","Furthermore, how many moves of Imperial Technique could he channel?","It was only a few times, and his battle prowess had already fallen to Eleventh Heaven. He had no choice but to switch to using the Saint Technique. However, Ling Han was using the God Slaying Technique, and it would last for a much longer time. Instantly, he possessed the advantage of battle prowess of one Heaven, and was completely unafraid of being devoured by the power of the Saint Technique.","In this way, Ling Han’s advantage was naturally extremely obvious.","When one had reached a height like they had, could they afford the gap in battle prowess of one Heaven?","Peng, peng, peng! Fu Huoyang was instantly suppressed. Not only was he in an extremely sorry state, but he was even beginning to suffer injuries. His image was instantly ruined.","“Ah!” Fu Huoyang roared in fury, his eyes turning bloodshot.","He could not tolerate this kind of humiliation. He was a member of the Imperial Clan, so how could he lose at the hands of an ordinary person?","If this matter spread out, not only would he be completely humiliated, he would even be looked at with disdain by his clansmen. In future, he would never be able to raise his head again.","“You are really courting death!” he shouted loudly. Boom, his whole person exuded a frightening aura, and his body was also rapidly expanding, turning into a golden giant that was as tall as 150 meters.","He ignited the Imperial Bloodline, causing his battle prowess to soar.","Shua, he sent out a palm strike. Ling Han brandished his fist to parry, but he was completely outmatched, and his whole person was instantly sent flying.","With a bang, a circle of clouds appeared in the skies.","Ling Han felt a powerful power surge over, making him want to vomit blood.","After combusting his Imperial Bloodline, Fu Huoyang’s battle prowess soared by a whopping ten Heavens. In other words, Fu Huoyang was now ahead of Ling Han by nine Heavens in terms of battle prowess. This had far surpassed the upper limit of the Primal Chaos Celestial","Core.","Thankfully, Ling Han had already activated his Starlight Screen in advance when he sensed the danger. Even so, he was still blasted quite terribly.","The gap in battle prowess was really too wide.","However, the spectators were even more astonished.","“After Fu Huoyang combusts his Imperial Blood, his battle prowess probably reaches 24","Heavens!”","“But Ding Yi’s battle prowess is twelve Heavens.”","“Hiss, there is a whole gap of twelve Heavens, and he only suffered a slight injury after taking","a blow head-on?”","“F***, what kind of freak is this?”","Because everyone was too far away, they did not realize that Fu Huoyang had been affected by Ling Han’s Primal Chaos Celestial Core so his battle prowess had dropped by three Heavens. they would still be incredibly stunned, because there was still a gap of","But even if they","nine Heavens in battle prowess between them.","This was an absolutely one-sided battle. With a single strike, no matter how prodigious you were, taking it head-on would definitely lead to your death.","However, Ling Han didn’t die, and he only suffered some minor injuries. Just how","inconceivable was this?","The old Sect Master looked stunned. He had already lived for a very, very long time, and was used to seeing what ordinary people considered prodigies, as well as what prodigies considered freakish prodigies, but now that he had seen it with his own eyes, he could say with absolute certainty that this was definitely a freakish prodigy, freakish among freaks.","Menghan really had good taste.","However, even Chi Menghan hadn’t expected that Ling Han would be so freakish. Her beautiful eyes lit up, and it was as if she were making some kind of decision. Unfortunately, no one could see the expression on her face.","Fu Huoyang faltered upon hearing this. He hadn’t expected that he would still be unable to defeat Ling Han even though he was being suppressed by an advantage of nine Heavens in","battle prowess.","If nine Heavens was not enough? Then ten Heavens!","He charged over, his power boiling, and channelled out the Imperial Technique again.","Previously, his body had already been overwhelmed, but after combusting the Imperial Blood, not only had his bodily functions recovered to peak stage, they had also far surpassed that. Naturally, he could cast the Imperial Technique again.","This time, Fu Huoyang’s battle prowess reached twenty two Heavens, suppressing Ling Han","by a whole ten Heavens!","Ling Han was calm and collected. He used his eye technique, capturing the weak points or weaknesses in Fu Huoyang’s attacks. Then, he charged over, and with a shake of his fist, Destructive Energy surged.","The strengthening of the soul would naturally affect all skills related to Spiritual Power.","The murderous aura attack was one of them. With a thought from Ling Han, the murderous aura attack had already blasted into Fu Huoyang’s mind. The murderous aura actually took the form of a small black figure that wreaked havoc in Fu Huoyang’s mind.","This tiny figure had a terrifying destructive ability against the soul. As it wreaked havoc, Fu Huoyang only felt a sharp pain in his head, and couldn’t help but cry out in pain. The attacks","The shot out naturally had no accuracy.","Yi?","Ling Han also hadn’t imagined that the murderous aura would become so powerful after his","soul returned to his body.","However, thinking about it, it made sense. The strength of his Spiritual Power had advanced into the Spiritual Transformation Tier, and theoretically far surpassed the Core Formation Tier. If this wasn’t powerful, then it couldn’t be justified, right?","Ling Han took advantage of the opening to charge out, and shot out a punch.","Peng!","Fu Huoyang’s colossal body was instantly sent flying. It was as if a golden mountain were","dancing in the sky.","However, he had, after all, burnt all his Imperial Blood. Whether it was battle prowess or recovery ability, they were both indescribably strong. When the tiny black figure disappeared,","he immediately recovered, and steadied his footing in the skies.","He looked at Ling Han, flames burning in his eyes.","For him, this was too damaging to his pride. His battle prowess had an overwhelming advantage of ten Heavens, but not only had he not managed to insta-kill Ling Han, Ling Han","had instead succeeded in his counterattack.","This was utterly humiliating."]},{"number":4013,"title":"Chapter 4013: Great Monster","paragraphs":["Chapter 4013: Great Monster","To Fu Huoyang, he was only enraged from embarrassment, and to others, this was no different from the sky collapsing down on them.","Just how powerful was Fu Huoyang now?","Everyone naturally knew that battle prowess was at 24 or 25 Heavens, and what about Ling Han? He was only at the early stage of the Core Formation Tier, and couldn’t burn Imperial Blood, so battle prowess was at most around 10 Heavens.","Of course, this fact alone was enough to scare them to death, because even a Buddha Son like Shi Yongming only had battle prowess of Eighth Heaven when he reached the end of the early stage of the Core Formation Tier. Compared to Ling Han, he was not just a little bit weaker.","But now, it was even more terrifying. This guy faced Fu Huoyang, whose battle prowess was 24 or 25 Heavens, and actually had the upper hand?","‘Holy f*ck!’","Everyone couldn’t believe their eyes. Even the old Sect Master, who had been preparing to stop the battle, looked constipated. He forcefully retracted his foot.","They were witnessing a miracle.","Heavens, how could there be such a freak?","Even in the past, did the Great Emperor have that kind of strength?","Everyone exchanged looks, and shook their heads. This kind of battle prowess was too nature-defying, so how could it be allowed to exist in this world?","The old Sect Master looked at Chi Menghan again, and a look of realization appeared on his face. The pearl of their clan truly had foresight, and had long since formed a friendship with Ling Han. By the looks of it, this ideal son-in-law would not be able to escape from the grasp of the Chi Clan.","Wonderful! Wonderful!","Perhaps, another Great Emperor would emerge from their Chi Clan. At the very least, they could also produce an incredibly powerful Saint, who would similarly be able to sweep aside all opposition in the world.","If a Great Emperor did not appear, who would be able to match him?","Fu Huoyang naturally could see the expressions of the people below him. His fists were clenched tightly, and his heart was practically weeping blood.","He had “stepped out” this time because he wanted to form some kind of friendship with Chi Menghan first. He hadn’t expected that with Ling Han’s interference, he would become a clown and embarrass himself.","His battle prowess was ten Heavens ahead of Ling Han, yet he was still no match for Ling Han. How could he accept this?","Who would still take him seriously?","“Damn it! Damn it!” His eyes were bloodshot, and he further ignited his Imperial Bloodline, guarding his mind tightly. Then, he charged towards Ling Han again.","Weng!","Ling Han unleashed a barrage of murderous aura attacks. However, Fu Huoyang was fully prepared this time. The tiny black figure hadn’t even entered Fu Huoyang’s mind yet, when it was completely burnt by the Imperial Blood.","It could not be helped. This was Imperial Blood, and its level was too high.","“Hahaha!” Fu Huoyang couldn’t help but laugh loudly upon discovering that the Imperial Blood had taken effect. He leaped over, clasped his palms together, and smashed them down at Ling Han.","With his current colossal size of more than 150 meters, the combined smash of his hands was no less than a great mountain crashing downwards.","Ling Han frowned. The murderous aura attack was ineffective?","He used Imminent Skyline to dodge. If he clashed head-on with Fu Huoyang at this moment, it would truly be a foolish idea.","Hehe, how long can your Imperial Bloodline burn for?","Fu Huoyang attacked madly. However, Ling Han had activated his eye technique, which allowed him to clearly see the weak points or weaknesses in his attacks, and added with the fact that Imminent Skyline was no weaker than the movement technique that he had grasped, he was actually unable to attack for the moment.","Hong, hong, hong! From the surface, he was completely on the upper hand, beating Ling Han so hard that he could only dodge, but in truth, he did not manage to wound Ling Han at all. He was only wasting his energy in vain.","He gradually became anxious. If this continued, what would he do when the burning of the Imperial Blood ended?","At that time, he would return to his previous routine, where he would be ruthlessly beaten up by Ling Han.","No!","He went berserk, and his offensive became even more rapid. Imperial Techniques and Saint Techniques channelled endlessly in his hands, their might world-shaking. However, Ling Han wasn’t facing him head-on at all. Instead, he was circling around in the sky.","No matter how strong your attack was, what was the use if it could not hit its target? “Hehe, all right, all right. Young man, don’t be so angry. Enough is enough,” the old Sect Master said with a smile. He stretched out both hands, and they both turned into a colossal hand that grabbed Ling Han and Fu Huoyang respectively, forcibly bringing them back to the","ground.","Ling Han and Fu Huoyang didn’t make another move. A Sect Master had already made a move, and if they still dared to fight, wasn’t that not giving him face?","Ling Han naturally didn’t mind. He hadn’t suffered any losses this time, and as for Fu","Huoyang?","He had ignited his Imperial Bloodline.","After burning the Imperial Bloodline, it would take a very long time to recover. As for how much time it would take, that would depend on the purity of the bloodline. For those who had thinned their bloodline, they would only be able to recover two to three times in their","lifetime, at most.","Hence, after Fu Huoyang’s burst of power this time, the next burst of power could possibly be a hundred years, or a thousand years later.","Fu Huoyang naturally knew this as well. His expression was dark, and ugly to the extreme. He couldn’t bring himself to flirt with Chi Menghan anymore.","“Fairy Menghan, I would like to ask for guidance.” Zhu Yixiu stood up, clasping his hands in greeting towards Chi Menghan.","His potential certainly wasn’t as high as Fu Huoyang’s, and his battle prowess at the same cultivation level was far inferior to Ling Han’s. However, what he was competing in now wasn’t potential and battle prowess at the same cultivation level! He was the consummate level of Core Formation Tier, and his battle prowess was as high as 24 Heavens, so he was naturally qualified to battle her.","Chi Menghan stepped into the air, her white dress fluttering, as if she was a celestial being.","“Please.”","The two of them rose into the air, and then began fighting.","At first, Zhu Yixiu was very restrained, but after a few moves, he had no choice but to go all","out.","Chi Menghan was far too powerful. Even though each of her attacks didn’t carry any heat and were extremely ethereal, they still exerted a tremendous amount of pressure on him. He couldn’t hold back at all as he unleashed all of his powerful attacks.","However, this still didn’t change the outcome of the battle. He was strong, and Chi Menghan’s battle prowess also increased accordingly. She continued to maintain a huge","pressure on him.","After about a hundred moves, Zhu Yixiu took the initiative to admit defeat.","He had no choice but to admit defeat. He wasn’t an idiot, so he could naturally tell that Chi Menghan still had power. Moreover, Chi Menghan was a member of the Imperial Clan, and she could also combust her Imperial Bloodline. Thus, she had many more trump cards.","Thus, taking advantage of the fact that he was only at a disadvantage at this moment, he obediently admitted defeat. Otherwise, he would be in a difficult position.","Seeing Zhu Yixiu admit defeat, Sha Yang and Zhu Chengyun both shook their heads. Sha Yang was not much stronger than Zhu Yixiu, and Zhu Chengyun’s cultivation level was too low. His battle prowess was not even at 10 Heavens, so how was he supposed to fight?","Now, it was only up to Shi Yongming and Shen Yutang now.","Shi Yongming stepped out first, and said with a smile, “Please give guidance, Fairy","Menghan.”","“Please.” Chi Menghan was still ethereal and graceful.","The two of them rose into the air at the same time, and then exchanged blows.","Shi Yongming was able to achieve a result of pseudo six stars, so his battle prowess at the same cultivation level naturally surpassed Zhu Yixiu’s. Moreover, he was also at the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier, while his battle prowess was at 26 Heavens.","Even though there was only a gap of two Heavens, this was enough to decide the outcome of","the battle.","However, Chi Menghan became stronger and stronger with each strike. Her palms danced lightly, and her jade-like palms looked weak and powerless, but every palm strike had a great","might that could shake heaven and earth, making Shi Yongming feel extremely","uncomfortable.","Similarly, within a hundred moves, Shi Yongming had no choice but to admit defeat.","-He did not have the Imperial Bloodline to burn. When he had used all his ultimate moves,","the only thing he could do was admit defeat.","Everyone believed that Chi Menghan was the super genius from the Donglin Imperial Clan who had scored seven stars."]},{"number":4014,"title":"Chapter 4014: Observing the mother tree","paragraphs":["Chapter 4014: Observing the mother tree","Shi Yongming had also lost. Everyone’s eyes turned towards Shen Yutang.","Shen Yutang, meanwhile, raised his hands, and said, “Firstly, I have no interest in fighting and killing. Secondly, I am only in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier. Do you guys think I can win?”","Er, this was the honest truth.","Excluding Chi Menghan, the two people with the highest potential here, Ling Han was in the early stage of the Core Formation Tier, Shen Yutang was in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier, and Ling Han’s cultivation level was far inferior to Chi Menghan’s. Thus, it was impossible for him to win.","“Hahaha, young friends, it’s rare for you to come here, so why don’t you stay here for a few days?” the old Sect Master said. This also announced the end of the prodigy gathering.","“Brother Ding, please come with me.” Chi Menghan nodded at Ling Han.","Ling Han stood up, and walked side by side with Chi Menghan.","This made everyone extremely envious. Chi Menghan was the seductive beauty ranked third on the Exquisite Leaderboard, and her potential value was as high as seven stars. Anyone would want to marry her, and it was practically a sure bet that she would definitely become a female Saint in the future.","This was of great significance.","Saint, the strongest in the present world. Additionally, if he could also become a Saint, that would mean having a lifespan of as long as a million years. Aside from Saints, who would be able to accompany him through such a long lifespan?","Hence, this kind of lover was really too rare.","“Fairy Menghan, I too wish to observe that mother tree.” Fu Huoyang immediately stood up. F***, you are really quite thick-skinned.","Everyone was speechless. You f****** have just embarrassed yourself so terribly, and you actually recovered so quickly?","Fu Huoyang couldn’t do anything about this. He was hell-bent on obtaining Chi Menghan. To him, this was a huge problem that concerned whether or not he could obtain the Imperial Techniques of both clans. Thus, so what if he lost face? He definitely had to cling to her. “Hehe, the mother tree can’t be disturbed by multiple auras. Young friend, it’s better to leave it for later,” the old Sect Master spoke up, directly rejecting his request.","Fu Huoyang was about to say something else, but the old Sect Master had already glared at him. His gaze was as terrifying as an ancient Demon God, and it instantly made Fu Huoyang’s chest constrict, rendering him speechless.","How blind!","The old Sect Master thought internally. Didn’t he see that even he was very polite towards Ding Yi? This was a son-in-law that their Chi Clan had their eye on. Why the f****** were you getting involved and causing trouble?","Did he really think that just because he was a member of the Fu Clan, he couldn’t kill him?","What a joke!","Ling Han and Chi Menghan left. Everyone felt very regretful, and had no interest in staying any longer. They all took their leave and left.","As for whether they would snipe Ling Han or not, that was not certain.","Ling Han followed Chi Menghan, but they didn’t go to the Medicinal Garden or whatnot. Instead, they arrived at the Transfer Formation.","“Do you think that this mother tree is on the Donglin Planet?” Chi Menghan shook her head, and said, “A planet can only nurture a single mother tree. Transplanting it will only cause the mother tree to die. Thus, the mother tree naturally isn’t on the Donglin Planet.”","Ling Han nodded in realization.","The two of them rode the Transfer Formation, and in a flash of white light, they had already arrived at another planet.","“Princess Han!” There were four guards outside the Transfer Formation. When they saw Chi Menghan, they all knelt down to pay their respects. Not only were they respectful, but there was also a kind of fanaticism about them.","Ling Han found this strange, and asked, “You’ve covered your face, and they can still recognize you?”","Chi Menghan felt a muscle twitch in her cheek. ‘Can’t you be a little more curious about something normal?’","Sometimes, Ling Han’s freakishness was unbelievable, making her certain that this person’s lowest accomplishment would have to be a Saint, and an incredibly powerful Saint at that. And if heaven and earth allowed it, this guy would even have a chance of breaking through to the Imperial Path.","However, sometimes, this guy’s thoughts would be so strange that others would be speechless, making her feel baffled.","If this guy became a Saint, would he become the most amusing Saint in history? “Follow me.” Chi Menghan led the way, and brought Ling Han to a Medicinal Garden that was heavily guarded. Not only was there a Sect Master, but there was also a great formation. At least, Ling Han was completely unable to break through it, and only knew that he would definitely die if he barged in.","There were too many Celestial medicines here, ranging from One Star to Seven Stars. There were so many that he wanted to drool. Unfortunately, they could only be seen and not harvested, which made him extremely depressed, and his whole person became listless.","Chi Menghan saw this, and she could guess why he was feeling so gloomy. She instantly wanted to laugh.","Anyone would want the Celestial medicine, but after entering the treasure mountain, they could only come out empty-handed. No one would be happy at that. However, who would be like Ling Han, who showed it on his face?","Sometimes, this guy was extremely cunning, and at other times, he was extremely innocent.","Finally, they arrived at the mother tree’s location.","This mother tree was not tall at all. At first glance, it looked like an ordinary peach tree. It was only about three meters tall, and stretched out a crown that was about six meters wide. Green leaves were all over it, and it looked very ordinary.","However, Ling Han saw very clearly that the bark and leaves were covered with strange veined patterns that looked like dragon scales, but also looked like phoenix patterns.","However, this mother tree’s roots had suffered severe damage, sustaining heavy slashes or strikes. In any case, it had been struck by a sharp weapon, and only a sliver of bark was left attached to it. It could be said that it was extremely difficult for it to live.","Ling Han’s heart jolted. If this mother tree hadn’t been so severely wounded, what grade of fruit would it have borne?","Saint Fruits?","Or Imperial Tier-level fruits that even Ancestral Kings would desire?","No wonder when he saw the veined patterns on the Spiritual Dao Fruit, he had a feeling like he was looking at an Imperial Technique. At the time, he was baffled. How could a Venerate Tier- level mother tree possibly have any relation with Imperial Techniques?","But now, he understood. Before this mother tree was injured, it was definitely a Great Emperor Tier-level Celestial Plant!","The Chi Clan probably didn’t know, right? Otherwise, they definitely wouldn’t have asked him","to come and observe.","“All right, you can just stay here and observe. I’ll give you ten days,” Chi Menghan said.","Ling Han bargained, “One month.”","Chi Menghan shook her head, “Impossible.”","“I won’t steal medicines, so a month isn’t a big deal. It’ll pass very quickly.” Ling Han didn’t","give up.","Chi Menghan hesitated for a moment, before saying, “I’ll give you a month’s time. At that time, I’ll take you away. However, if you dare to steal Celestial medicines, even if they’re only","One Star Celestial medicines, I’ll still sever your arms.”","“Che, am I that kind of person?”","Chi Menghan didn’t answer, but the gaze she directed at Ling Han was clearly filled with","certainty.","This guy dared to steal the mine of the Western Desert King when he was still in the","Netherworld. With prior incident as proof, who would believe him?","Faced with this kind of gaze, Ling Han could only laugh dryly.","He waved his hand, “Go on, go on.”","Chi Menghan was slightly infuriated. ‘Don’t you know that I’m ranked third on the Exquisite Beauty Leaderboard? And there is actually someone who took the initiative to chase me away?","It’s as if even the mother tree is more beautiful than me.’","That’s right, this guy had never seen her true appearance. Humph, then go on and look for the tree bark of the mother tree.","Chi Menghan turned around and left angrily.","Ling Han found this strange. He realized that Chi Menghan’s emotions had become a little","off, but this change was too baffling.","Forget it, who cares about her?","Ling Han sat down in a cross-legged position, right underneath the mother tree. He raised his head to look at every single leaf of the mother tree, as well as the veined patterns on the tree","trunk."]},{"number":4015,"title":"Chapter 4015: Treasured Technique Obtained","paragraphs":["Chapter 4015: Treasured Technique Obtained","Why was Ling Han so determined to see this mother tree?","That was because before Ling Han ate the Spiritual Dao Fruit, he discovered that the patterns on the fruit actually had a common origin with the Heavenly Brilliance Technique.","He had a guess. It was possible that Ancestral King Donglin had studied this mother tree, and had a sudden inspiration, which led to the creation of this Imperial Technique.","Thus, Ling Han wanted to join in on the excitement and see if he could completely deduce this precious technique.","It was impossible for him to start from scratch. Who could create an Imperial Technique when they were in the Core Formation Tier?","However, he had already mastered half of the Heavenly Brilliance Technique, and he had more so used it together with Chi Menghan. Thus, he had a considerable understanding of this Heavenly Brilliance Technique. Thus, if he could obtain the original model of the technique, he still had a chance of successfully deducing it.","He sat quietly and comprehended. He corresponded the Heavenly Brilliance Technique with the veined patterns on the tree trunk, and instantly, an amazing enlightenment arose.","The first step was not to directly complete the restoration of the precious technique, but to correspond to the parts that he already had. In this way, the target that he had to focus on would be very clear.","After spending seven days, Ling Han matched some of the technique he had mastered with the veined patterns on the tree trunk and leaves.","Then, he didn’t need to care about this part of the veined patterns, and focused on the other veined patterns.","Bit by bit, his improvement was obvious.","He had turned into a stone statue. In fact, he didn’t even have any signs of life. This was because he was completely focused on comprehending.","A month later, Chi Menghan came over. At first, she was given a fright. Why had Ling Han’s life force disappeared? However, she soon discovered that it wasn’t that this guy had lost his life force, but that it was extremely weak.","With a sweep, she discovered that all of Ling Han’s divine sense had retreated to the depths of his mind, and was presently comprehending at the deepest level.","What was going on here?","Chi Menghan was incredibly astonished. ‘You can comprehend Dao just by looking at a mother tree? What kind of monster are you?’","This was definitely not an act. She could sense that there was Regulations circulating around Ling Han’s body. Though this was something that they could not touch at their present level, when they were comprehending Dao, the Regulations of heaven and earth would naturally take form.","Furthermore, she had also reached the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier, and would soon be able to leap into the True Self Tier, and the True Self Tier would begin to cultivate the Regulations of heaven and earth. Thus, with her extraordinary talent, she was indeed qualified to come into contact with even a sliver of it.","Prodigy, he was really too prodigious.","Chi Menghan gave up on the idea of bringing Ling Han out of the Medicinal Garden. Instead, she decided to let Ling Han continue comprehending Dao. After all, it was rare for a cultivator to have such a chance to comprehend Dao on a deeper level.","If she knew that Ling Han was actually comprehending the Heavenly Brilliance Technique, she would definitely drag Ling Han out of this place.","No matter how much she admired Ling Han, there was no way she would allow the supreme celestial technique of her clan to be taught to outsiders.","Unfortunately, she did not know.","Ling Han could vaguely sense that someone was coming over, but they bore no malice towards him, so he did not awaken. After all, it was too rare for him to enter into this state. If he exited, he would definitely have to expend an extremely great amount of time to enter into this state again.","Time flew by, and in the blink of an eye, another two months had passed.","Ling Han finally awoke from his deep comprehension. He swayed his body, then stood up.","Heavenly Brilliance Technique, initial accomplishment!","However, he didn’t practice here. Firstly, this was the Medicinal Garden, and if he practiced here, the damage would be too great, and it would be hard to clean up. Then, he would really have to sell himself into service here. Secondly, if the Chi Clan found out that he had learnt the Heavenly Brilliance Technique, what would happen?","“Young Master Ding, you are finally awake!” Immediately, a man dressed as a servant walked over, “Please come with me, and I will take you away.”","He was very polite, and did not have the pride of a member of an Imperial Clan at all.","This was because he knew that this young man was extremely favored by the elders of the clan. In fact, it was even possible that he would become the ideal son-in-law of the Donglin Imperial Clan. How could he offend this young man?","Ling Han nodded, and followed that person out of the Medicinal Garden.","On the other side, the young man also sent out the news that Ling Han had woken up. Thus, when they walked out of the Transfer Formation and returned to Donglin Planet, they saw that there were already people waiting for them outside the Transfer Formation.","“Are you Ding Yi?” a delicate voice asked.","Ling Han looked over. This was a little girl who was only about ten years old. She was really beautiful, like a little fairy, but the way she looked at him was incredibly cunning. He reckoned that she was definitely not an obedient little girl, but rather a little demon.","“I am Ding Yi.” Ling Han smiled, “Young lady, what’s your name?”","“Yi, you’re not so good looking after all.” The little girl, however, acted very experienced. She circled around Ling Han once, as she sized him up, and made her final evaluation.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t be shocked by a little girl. He touched his face, and said narcissistically, “I think I’m extremely handsome, world-shakingly handsome.”","The little girl instantly laughed loudly, “As for you, you may not be handsome, but you are extremely shameless. Just in time, my sister is also very two-faced. The two of you are quite a","good match.”","What kind of honest lie was this young girl spouting?","“Who’s your sister?” Ling Han asked.","“Huh? You chased my sister for so long, so how could it be that you still don’t know that my","sister is Chi Menghan?” the little girl said.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “I really couldn’t tell. You are much more beautiful than your","sister.”","The little girl was instantly pleased, and nodded, “At least you have good taste. I think so","too.”","Seeing how Ling Han and the little girl were chatting more and more happily, the young man beside them hurriedly said, “Young Master Ding, Princess Shan, the Lords are still waiting.” “Come, brother-in-law, I’ll take you there.” The little girl directly changed her address of","him.","Even Ling Han’s expression darkened. This little girl really had changed her address. “Let’s go.” He naturally didn’t mind. In any case, he was now “Ding Yi”, and had nothing to","do with Ling Han.","The little girl brought Ling Han to a courtyard. There were pine trees that had been planted here for tens of thousands of years. They were verdant and dark green, and occasionally, there would be Earth Qi that would soar out, turning into multiple gray dragons. They were astonishingly mysterious.","Ling Han was surprised. This was because of the formation. There was a large formation set up here, and that was why the energy of heaven and earth was gathered here. In fact, there was","also something that he couldn’t see now, but could sense.","The Regulations of heaven and earth? “Sister, sister, I’ve brought my brother-in-law!” the little girl called out loudly.","Immediately, Chi Menghan flew out, but her pretty face was stern as she delivered a knock","right at the little girl.","“Wa!” The little girl instantly grabbed her head and screamed. This time, it was really quite a","heavy knock.","“Chi Menghan, you ungrateful brat. I called my brother-in-law over for you, yet you entered the bridal chamber and threw the matchmaker over the wall. You’re kicking me to the curb after I’ve outlived my usefulness!” The little girl was truly stubborn as she continued.","Even Ling Han was slightly impressed by her. Just how unafraid of death was she?","Sure enough, Chi Menghan was enraged. She grabbed the little girl and gave her another harsh","slap.","“Chi Mengshan, do you want to be imprisoned again?”"]},{"number":4016,"title":"Chapter 4016: Son-In-Law Recruitment","paragraphs":["Chapter 4016: Son-In-Law Recruitment","The little girl, Chi Mengshan, finally became obedient after be She pouted, looking like she had a deep hatred.","“I say, Ding Yi, you’re really too disloyal. I’m speaking up for y show from the sidelines.” Unfortunately, the little girl’s mem minute, and she immediately began to court death again. “Sist husband. In any case, he looks too ordinary.”","Peng! “Ah!”","Paragraph comment","Paragraph comment feature now on the Web! Move mou over any paragraph and click the icon to add your commer Also, you can always turn it off/on in Settings.","GOT IT","She suffered another knock on the head, and the pain caused tears to stream down her face. “Chi Menghan, remember, when I grow up and become stronger than you, I’ll definitely take revenge!” the little girl sobbed. “At that time, I’ll marry you to whoever you hate the most!” Chi Menghan couldn’t help but chuckle upon hearing this. She could only shake her head in exasperation. This little sister of hers was far too mature, and she was more so fearless. Thus, there was nothing she could do about this.","“Brother Ding, please follow me.” She decided not to tangle with this little girl, and said to Ling Han.","Ling Han nodded, and followed her into the courtyard.","After entering the courtyard, Ling Han saw an old man watering flowers. He was holding a water bottle, and looked to be in his seventies or eighties. He was filled with the aura of an old man, and it felt like it wouldn’t be strange for him to die at any moment.","“Ninth Grandpa, Ding Yi is here,” Chi Menghan said respectfully to the old man.","The old man merely nodded, but did not stop what he was doing, nor did he turn around. Ling Han clasped his hands and bowed, saying, “Ding Yi pays respects to Senior.”","“Ninth Grandpa, Big Sister hit me again!” The little girl said angrily, “You don’t even discipline her, old man. With such violence, how will she be able to get married in future?” Chi Menghan’s expression darkened, and she felt an urge to beat someone up again. “Hahaha!” The old man laughed loudly. He finally put down the water bottle, then turned around, and said, “Mengshan, did you cultivate well today?”","Hearing these words, the little girl instantly became obedient. She lowered her head, and began playing with her fingers, pretending that she had not heard anything.","The elder turned to look at Ling Han again, and when their eyes met, Ling Han instantly felt his heart go blank. Then, he suddenly shivered, and came back to his senses.","He couldn’t help but feel shocked. Just how much time had passed?","It seemed like an instant, but also seemed like an eternity.","This elder was far too terrifying. Merely a single glance from him was enough to cause him to lose his sense of self.","“Yi?” The old man was surprised, “Young man is really too remarkable. He actually used only three breaths’ time to come back to his senses. Sigh, geniuses appear in every generation. Previously, I did not believe that anyone could be more outstanding than Menghan. I never thought, never expected it.”","He shook his head repeatedly, appearing to be extremely rueful.","F***, three breaths’ time had actually passed?","Meanwhile, Ling Han’s heart was beating wildly. He felt like only an instant had passed.","If that old man had wanted to kill him just now, he would have died who knew how many times over.","The elder turned to look at Ling Han again. This time, nothing strange happened. His eyes were also very gentle, and the gaze he directed at Ling Han was also filled with admiration, “Young man, what are your next plans?”","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “I’m naturally going to wander around and become an Emperor through hundreds of battles!”","This!","The old man couldn’t help but be rendered speechless. This brat was really boastful, actually directly aiming to become an Emperor.","However, when he recalled how Ling Han had previously shot out a pseudo eight stars, and his potential was even above Chi Menghan’s, he was indeed qualified to be arrogant. However, if you wander around, how would the Donglin Imperial Clan recruit you?","“Young people have ambitions in all directions. It’s a good thing to have such aspirations.” The old man nodded, “However, duckweed without roots is ultimately not stable enough, and does not have much confidence.”","He paused, then continued, “Are you interested in joining our Donglin Imperial Clan? I can arrange a good marriage for you. From now onwards, you would be half a son of our Chi Clan.”","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “Is it with this Chi Menghan, Miss Chi?”","The elder’s expression instantly darkened.","This damn brat’s appetite was really too big!","Although Ling Han was freakish, he was only a prodigy without any background, after all. How could he be qualified to marry the princess of their clan?","If Chi Menghan was about to marry, her partner would have to be an Imperial Son. In the future, when the two great elites joined, the child that they gave birth to would have a chance of breaking through to the Imperial Path.","“Young man, there are many beautiful women in our Donglin Imperial Clan,” the old man said with a smile.","“But I fell in love with Lady Menghan at first sight,” Ling Han also said with a smile.","F***, have you ever seen Chi Menghan’s true appearance? And you claim that it was love at first sight!","The elder mocked internally, but he was presently recruiting Ling Han, and not here to argue. Thus, he could only say, “Young man, consider carefully. If you join our Chi Clan, your future prospects would be boundlessly bright.”","“Alright, I’ll consider it,” Ling Han said with a casual nod.","Chi Menghan stood up in a timely manner, saying, “Brother Ding, I’ll send you off to rest","first.”","“I’ll have to trouble you,” Ling Han said.","The two of them exited the courtyard, and Ling Han used the excuse of wanting to see the large black dog. He passed through the Transfer Formation and arrived at the outskirts of the","Donglin Imperial Clan.","“Brat, you’ve been gone for a few months, and Grandpa Dog thought that you have married and had children in the Donglin Imperial Clan, and don’t even want to leave anymore,” the","large black dog said.","“Enough with the nonsense. Hurry up and let’s run,” Ling Han said.","“What’s wrong?” the large black dog asked.","“If we don’t leave now, I really have to stay behind to marry and have children.”","“F*ck! Is there such a good thing?”","Ling Han and the large black dog once again changed their appearance and soul fluctuations. Then, they used the Void Beast hide to hide themselves, and left quietly. Only after they had walked far away did they remove the hide, and quickly arrived at the Transfer Formation.","After paying, they activated the Transfer Formation. When they arrived at the next planet, they finally breathed a sigh of relief.","Afterward, they were teleported again and again, and they were already far away from","Donglin Planet.","After half a year, Ling Han and the large black dog finally returned to the North Heavenly Realm. After several more transgers, they returned to the Nine Suns Planet that they had long","been absent from.","They returned to their original appearance and entered the Holy Land. As for the trip to","Donglin Planet, they treated it as if it had never happened. Ding Yi and Ding Er would also be left behind in the past forever.","After exchanging longing feelings with Hu Niu and the empress, Ling Han began to practice the Heavenly Brilliance Technique.","Previously, he had only obtained the essence of the technique, and left in a hurry. He had not had the chance to truly practice.","He channeled the precious technique, and instantly, a terrifying aura circulated, terrifying","without bounds.","The Imperial Technique was naturally awesome.","After Ling Han delivered a few punches, he stopped, and began to recall the scene of him and Chi Menghan using the Heavenly Brilliance Technique together. Then, he made a comparison. The Heavenly Brilliance Technique he had grasped was slightly weaker in terms of power, but the Heavenly Brilliance Technique couldn’t have been used by one person in the first place.","Hence, it was logical that its might was weak now.","The might of this previous technique was equivalent to the Demonic Monkey Fists.","As expected, with both of them being Imperial Techniques, which was weaker than the other?","Ling Han laughed loudly. He had mastered another Imperial Technique, which allowed him to have another powerful move.","“Now, I’m only one step away from stepping out of the early stage of the Core Formation Tier. It’s time for me to buy natural treasures and make preparations for the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier.”"]},{"number":4017,"title":"Chapter 4017: Return to Moonlight Planet","paragraphs":["Chapter 4017: Return to Moonlight Planet","In Ling Han’s mind, the only Celestial Cauldron was more or less melted. All the celestial substances had been absorbed by the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, and the Primal Chaos Celestial Core had inherited all its characteristics.","“The second step of the Core Formation Tier is to use various natural treasures to nurture the Celestial Core. The higher the level of the natural treasures, the stronger the Celestial Core would become.”","“These natural treasures are all used to nurture the soul.”","Ling Han rummaged through the Galaxy Network for relevant information. There were many soul nurturing treasures, and they could also be divided into extremely detailed categories according to their level. Very naturally, the lower the level, the easier it was to obtain, and the higher the level, the harder it was to obtain.","“Sigh, after advancing to this level, the use of Dao Stones is becoming lesser and lesser. At the drop of a hat, transactions would only accept trading of natural treasures. The high-level Celestial medicine is the real currency.”","Ling Han took a look. It was not that no one was selling soul nurturing treasures, but only extremely low grade Celestial medicines would be marked to be sold for Dao Stones. As long as they were of a slightly higher grade, they would all require Three Star or Four Star Celestial medicines to be traded in exchange.","“It’s not that I can’t cultivate with low-level treasures, but it would cause too much dregs to be dyed into the Celestial Core, and while it grows stronger, I still have to remove these impurities. Undoubtedly, it would waste a lot of time.”","“But there’s no other way now. I can’t get high-level natural treasures, so I’ll use this to make up the numbers first. It’s better than nothing.”","Ling Han began to buy wantonly. In any case, he did not lack money. Furthermore, what was the point of leaving money aside?","“However, now that I’ve advanced into the Core Formation Tier, should I return to the Celestial Sea Planet?” Ling Han mulled over this. Although he had already obtained the Nine Suns Saint’s cultivation technique, he had also promised the Nine Suns Saint that it wouldn’t be taught to outsiders.","Thus, after the empress and the others advanced into the Core Formation Tier, there would be no other cultivation technique that they could cultivate.","After returning to the Celestial Sea Planet and passing the Ancient Sun Saint’s third test, he would naturally be able to obtain the corresponding Core Formation Tier-level Ancient Sun Divine Scroll. This scroll would be given to the empress and the others to cultivate.","Furthermore, if he advanced another level, and crossed into the True Self Tier, he would be able to pass all the tests of the Ancient Sun Saint. Who knew how many good things the Ancient Sun Saint had left for him.","There should be a Saint Tool, right?","Ling Han conversed with the empress and Hu Niu, and then decided to set out immediately.","“Yi, why don’t I see those seven babies?” He swept an eye over them, and discovered that the seven Calabash Brothers had not appeared all this while.","“Hehe, they were chased out,” Hu Niu said.","Ling Han was astonished. Why had they been chased out?","“What’s going on?” he asked.","“You’ll know when you go see for yourself.” Hu Niu kept him in suspense.","That shouldn’t be a big problem.","Ling Han exited the Holy Land, and soon found the place according to the address that Hu Niu had provided.","This was a very large manor. When Ling Han leaped in, he saw a white python immediately swim over and coil towards him.","Yi?","Ling Han leaped to dodge, and very quickly, another white python attacked. Then, it was the third, the fourth, and a total of seven pythons.","Realization dawned on him. These were the snake eggs that he had brought out from the White Lotus Mystery Realm. Because neither Hu Niu nor the empress liked snakes, he had given them to his seven babies, one for each of them. Unexpectedly, after close to two years, not only had these snake babies hatched, they had even advanced into the Foundation Building Tier.","No wonder the seven babies had been chased out. With seven such large snakes, who would dare to let them stay?","“Father!” At this moment, the seven babies finally appeared. They all jumped onto the snakes’ heads, each occupying a spot. Under their command, the seven white pythons all stopped attacking, but they were still very fierce, and stuck out their tongues at Ling Han.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. These seven babies were already out of control, and now they seemed to have become even worse. Who knew what kind of little devils they would become in future.","What puzzled him was that they were all still babies. None of them had grown up in the slightest, which was indeed very strange.","When they found out that Ling Han wanted to go to Celestial Sea Planet, the seven babies were all in high spirits, and requested to go play together.","Ling Han pondered for a moment. He had truly failed in his duty these past few days. He hadn’t properly educated these kids, so he agreed.","He returned to the Holy Land, and was just about to call the empress, Hu Niu, and the large black dog to set out, when he saw that Song Lan had come to pay him a visit.","As it turned out, she had received news that Ling Han had returned.","Since she had gotten the news, would the news reach Prosperous Heaven late?","Sure enough, after a short while, the Holy Daughter of the Buddhist Sect of the North Heavenly Realm also arrived.","They all asked about Ling Han’s experiences in the past two years, and Ling Han naturally brushed them off. However, when they found out that Ling Han was about to leave again, the two women expressed their desire to go with him.","What was going on here?","Ling Han couldn’t stop others, so if you guys want to go together, then we could go together.","He made some last minute changes, and decided to go to the Moonlight Planet first. The Azure Dragon Majestic Empire had been destroyed, and now the Moonlight Planet had become the territory of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire. Strictly speaking, this was the territory of the Buddhist Race. Ling Han hadn’t returned for a very, very long time.","He wanted to take a look at Tang Yan. Though they had also contacted each other through the Galaxy Network, it had been a long time since they had last seen each other. Ling Han indeed wanted to take a look.","Moreover, wasn’t Prosperous Heaven accompanying them?","This was the Buddhist Race’s Holy Daughter. Just let her step out and ask for a pardon from","the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire. Then, the Tang Clan wouldn’t have to hide here and there","anymore.","Now that they had made their decision, everyone set out.","After transferring for almost a month, they arrived at the Moonlight Planet.","Of course, this naturally couldn’t compare to the Nine Suns Planet. The power of heaven and earth was clearly inferior by a level. After all, the planet had never produced a Saint before, so there couldn’t possibly be Regulations intertwined together. This was a power that only","Saints possessed.","Ling Han had long since contacted Tang Yan, and after telling him the address, had this former Little Marquis come over to meet him.","It wasn’t long before Tang Yan appeared.","“Ling Han!” Tang Yan strode over, his face full of smiles.","Ling Han also approached, embracing Tang Yan.","“How’s the situation recently?” Ling Han asked.","“It’s all right. I just moved a few more times,” Tang Yan said casually, appearing to be","completely unconcerned.","After the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was destroyed, moving was already a common occurrence for him.","“What about you?” Tang Yan didn’t want to talk about this anymore. “Two years ago, I saw on the Galaxy Network that there was a person called Ling Han who was mighty. He even","defeated the Imperial Son, so it shouldn’t be you, right?”","To defeat the Imperial Son, this was like a fantasy story, a myth among myths. Thus, he would rather believe that this was only a coincidence. The two of them only had the","same name. Though he knew that Ling Han was very freakish, it was definitely impossible","that he would be freakish to this extent.","“Ling Han!”","“Tang Yan!”","Ling Han hadn’t even spoken yet, when he heard a loud shout filled with shock.","He looked over, and saw that it was a young man. He was about twenty-eight or twenty-nine years old, and his cultivation level was Earth Cauldron.","Yi, he looked a little familiara| oh!","Ling Han finally remembered. This person was Han Bing, and previously, just like him, he was also a hostage of the Jia Yuan Manor, and had also targeted him before. However, as he advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier, returned to the Jia Yuan Manor, and gave Han Bing, Zhao Xiao, Liu Xunyu and the others a good beating, these people were also thrown to the","back of his mind.","Unexpectedly, he had just returned to Moonlight Planet, when he encountered this person","again."]},{"number":4018,"title":"Chapter 4018: All Arrived","paragraphs":["Chapter 4018: All Arrived","“Hahaha, I didn’t expect the two of you to still dare to return!” Han Bing laughed loudly, but his voice was filled with killing intent.","This was natural. When they had been in Jia Yuan Manor, he, Zhao Xiao and Liu Xunyu had repeatedly targeted Ling Han because this guy knew how to concoct alchemical pills, and wanted to take his completed alchemical pills for their own. He had not thought that this guy would be so troublesome, and not long after entering into the Political Hostage Manor, he successfully left.","And all this naturally was due to Tang Yan’s involvement.","Thus, he hated Ling Han, and also hated Tang Yan.","As he saw it, the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire had already fallen, so Ling Han and Tang Yan had both become stray dogs. If they still dared to appear now, wouldn’t that be courting death?","What a coincidence, this was really too much of a coincidence.","“HanBing, don’t seek death!” Tang Yan said coldly. In these few years, he had been cultivating the Venerable Tier-level cultivation technique, and his cultivation level and abilities had improved very quickly. Now, he had already advanced into the early stage of the Core Formation Tier.","“Tang Yan, the present is not like how it used to be!” Han Bing was naturally unafraid. He stood with his hands clasped behind his back, looking down at Tang Yan in a condescending manner, “Aren’t you in some remote corner, staying with your tail between your legs, and you actually dare to jump out? You are the one seeking death!”","Tang Yan wanted to make a move, but thinking that there were too many people here, if he dared to commit murder here, he would definitely become a wanted criminal of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire.","Previously, though the Tang Clan had also been hiding here and there, that was because they were the surviving dregs of the previous dynasty. As a person, he had not received much attention. Otherwise, he would not have dared to come out to receive Ling Han.","Thus, he chose to endure.","“Get lost, don’t seek death!” He released the aura of Core Formation Tier.","Han Bing suffered the impact, and his face instantly paled. This was the suppression of the cultivation level of a major tier. He was completely unable to fight back.","However, he was not afraid, because he had said so much previously, and it was completely just to buy time.","In the past, he had already been no match for Ling Han. Though he had improved greatly now, he believed that compared to Ling Han, his battle prowess was still far inferior. Thus, he had long since contacted Zhao Xiao, Liu Xunyu, and Tan Zhengjie through the Galaxy Network.","That’s right. Even if they joined forces, they should not be able to defeat Ling Han. However, they were not all by themselves, but had rather established a strong foundation here. They were completely capable of mobilizing elites of the Core Formation Tier to come here.","Once there were too many of them, even drowning them in numbers would be enough to drown Ling Han and Tang Yan.","“Tang Yan, you can only talk tough now.” Though Han Bing’s face was frighteningly pale, he was still talking tough.","Tang Yan thought for a moment, then suddenly came to a realization. He said to Ling Han, “This guy is deliberately stalling for time!”","This caused Han Bing’s expression to change again. F*ck, the reinforcements were still on the way. If Ling Han and Tang Yan fled, he would not be able to stop them at all.","Yet Ling Han smiled, “Alright, we can settle the score today.”","He wasn’t afraid of blowing things up at all. Even if the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire appeared in the end, there was still the Holy Daughter of the Buddhist Race of the North Heavenly Realm with him. Was she not qualified to settle all this?","“Brother Ling!” Tang Yan wanted to persuade him. ‘Don’t be stubborn at this moment. The Shadow Moon Majestic Empire was in control now. We can’t go against them.’","“It’s all right. Have a good chat with this Fairy Prosperous Heaven. I guarantee that your Tang Clan will be fine.” Ling Han pointed at Prosperous Heaven. However, Prosperous Heaven, just like the empress and Hu Niu, had a white veil covering her face, so her true appearance could not be seen.","Otherwise, the first reaction of Tang Yan and Han Bing would have been stunned.","Tang Yan was completely baffled. Could it be that this masked woman was the princess of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire?","Yet Han Bing was delighted. If Ling Han didn’t run, very good. Then just wait for death.","One wanted to buy time, while the other was very cooperative. Not long after, Han Bing’s reinforcements naturally arrived.","Zhao Xiao, Liu Xunyu, Tan Zhengjie, as well as the elites that they had brought with them, numbered in the dozens of elites of Core Formation Tier. Of course, there was also a portion of them that were members of their own clan that had been summoned by Han Bing.","Tang Yan couldn’t help but feel nervous. He was only in the early stage of the Core Formation Tier, and even if he cultivated the Venerate Tier-level technique, his abilities were only at the Third Heaven. He could only just barely match the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier. If he encountered the late stage of the Core Formation Tier or the consummate level, he would definitely be outmatched.","The problem was, there were actually 14 Core Formation Tier elites here, so how were they supposed to block this?","The problem was, there were actually 14 Core Formation Tier elites here, so how were they supposed to block this?","How was he going to deal with this?","Tang Yan’s heart was filled with anxiety. Could it be that he had to ask the elites of his clan to step out?","But firstly, there may not be enough time, and secondly, the elites of the Tang Clan were all wanted criminals. If they stepped out, the matter would become serious.","At this moment, he was in an extremely difficult position.","“Ling Han, Tang Yan, it really is you two!” Liu Xunyu forced out through gritted teeth, looking like she wanted nothing more than to devour them.","In her eyes, being thrashed by Ling Han in public was a stain on her life, the greatest humiliation.","At first, she had thought that Ling Han and Tang Yan would never appear again in this lifetime, so that she would not be able to get her revenge. She had not thought that only a few years had passed, and they would actually appear again.","Good, very good!","“Father, they’re so fierce!” Eldest Baby was in high spirits. “Why don’t we beat them up?”","This violent maniac was already unbearably thirsty.","Ling Han chuckled, “Sure.”","Eldest Baby immediately roared in excitement. A small white snake coiled around her arm immediately enlarged, turning into a colossal creature that measured 30 meters in length. Its vicious might was on full display, and the people in the surroundings all shivered in fear. This wasn’t a Demonic Beast, but rather a ferocious beast that only had the instinct to kill. Second Baby, Third Baby and the others also released the small white snakes one after another, turning into great fierce beasts. They stood on top of the snake’s head, making a big fuss, looking very excited.","Ling Han was astonished. He hadn’t expected that the White Snake would actually become so obedient under the guidance of the children, and shrink or enlarge obediently.","Weren’t they ferocious beasts?","Since when had he become so obedient?","“You’re nothing but a Foundation Building Tier vicious beast!” Liu Xunyu smirked coldly. By now, she was already at the Heaven Cauldron cultivation level, so she naturally wouldn’t take a few Foundation Building Tier small snakes and babies seriously.","“Old witch, take this!” The babies controlled the snakes to charge over.","Liu Xunyu was unafraid, and merely sent out a palm strike.","In her mind, the attack of Heaven Cauldron was enough to kill hundreds or even thousands of Foundation Building Tier cultivators.","However, the seven babies began to release their own auras, instantly causing her face to turn","pale.","The seven of thema| were all in the Core Formation Tier!","“Not good!” The few Core Formation Tier elites from the Liu Clan hurriedly rushed over and grabbed Liu Xunyu. They then hurriedly retreated, not daring to face this head-on.","Liu Xunyu had escaped death, and her pretty face was instantly as pale as a sheet. She was unable to come back to her senses for a long time.","“No wonder he dared to be so arrogant. As it turned out, there are also cultivators at the Core Formation Tiera|” A cultivator at the Core Formation Tier from the Liu Clan said. He was a cultivator at the Core Formation Tier, and he was confident in his abilities. However, what","were these seven kids?","Dao Protectors? How could there be such a small Dao Protectors?","But to say that they were hired thugs? Hehe, that was also a joke.","Most importantly, these seven babies were really too small. How could there possibly be such","a young Core Formation Tier cultivator? Thankfully, they were only in the early stage of the Core Formation Tier. Even if they were joining forces, they would not be a match for him.","“Humph, no matter what, in front of me, you guys can only wait helplessly for death,” he said proudly, “If you obediently restrain yourselves, you can also suffer less.”","Tang Yan had just relaxed a little, when he became nervous again. Now, there were eight of them in the early stage of the Core Formation Tier. Could they charge out of this siege?"]},{"number":4019,"title":"Chapter 4019: Exterminated with a Single Strike","paragraphs":["Chapter 4019: Exterminated with a Single Strike","Ling Han patted Tang Yan’s shoulder, “Don’t worry. Even if the sky collapsed, there would still be someone taller to hold it up.”","“Ling Han, you think you’re that taller someone?” Tan Zhengjie couldn’t help but ask. He had suffered too much at Ling Han’s hands, and every time he thought about it, he couldn’t sleep well for a good few days.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Believe it or not, I will kill you on the spot?”","“Ha!” Tan Zhengjie almost spluttered in laughter. This was truly the biggest joke in the world.","“Come on!” He crooked a finger at Ling Han. Though he had not advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier yet, there were still a considerable number of elites of the Core Formation Tier by his side. With such protection, Ling Han still wanted to kill him?","“I really want to see how you will die,” he said coldly.","Xiu, Ling Han’s figure moved. He was as fast as lightning, but also like a streak of light. In a flash, he had already appeared in front of Tan Zhengjie. With a palm strike, Tan Zhengjie was lifted up by the chest.","The defensive power of the Core Formation Tier elites was practically useless.","This!","F***, this caused Han Bing and the others’ eyes to almost pop out of their heads.","Core Formation Tier!","This guy was actually a Core Formation Tier cultivator.","“Impudence! Hurry up and release Zhengjie!” an elite from the Tan Clan roared. Tan Zhengjie was naturally the most beloved clansman of the Tan Clan. Even though his cultivation level wasn’t high, his status wasn’t low either.","Now that he had been captured by Ling Han, the members of the Tan Clan were naturally","nervous.","And in the eyes of Prosperous Heaven and the others, this was a matter of course. When Ling Han was in Cauldron Forging Tier, he had even overturned a cultivator in the early stage of the Core Formation Tier. Now that he had advanced into the Core Formation Tier, just how strong would his abilities be?","A normal Core Formation Tier consummate level martial artist couldn’t possibly rival him!","Yet Tang Yan did not know this. He was both pleased and worried.","What was delightful was the fact that Tan Zhengjie, this despicable person, had been captured by Ling Han. However, what worried him was the fact that Ling Han was also under heavy siege. Previously, it could be said that he had caught Tan Zhengjie off guard, but now that everyone was prepared, how was he supposed to charge back?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and completely ignored the elite from the Tan Clan. He merely looked at Tan Zhengjie and said slowly, “Tell me, do I dare to kill you?”","Tan Zhengjie didn’t know how to answer.","He was still in Ling Han’s hands. If he angered Ling Han, and Ling Han killed him, then even if the elite of the clan subsequently killed Ling Han and Ling Han paid with his life, what meaning would that have for him?","If he was dead, he was dead.","However, if his answer was weak, then similarly, there were a great many elites of the clan here. If news of this spread back, what would his ancestor think?","Would he still be doted upon?","Thus, he was stuck in a dilemma, not knowing whether to speak tough or admit defeat.","“Let him go!” the elite from the Tan Clan shouted.","“So noisy.” Ling Han shook his head. Boom, the Heavenly Dao Flames surged, instantly enshrouding Tan Zhengjie.","“Ah!” Tan Zhengjie immediately screamed in agony. He was only a martial artist at the Ultimate Foundation Tier, so how could he withstand such high-level energy? He felt as if his vitality was rapidly disappearing.","“B@stard!” The elites of the Tan Clan all moved, blasting towards Ling Han. Now, they naturally did not have any more reservations.","Peng, peng, peng! One after another, attacks landed on Ling Han’s body, all of them landing solidly.","Sigh, what was the point?","The elites from the Han Clan, Zhao Clan, and Liu Clan all shook their heads. For the sake of killing a measly Foundation Building Tier cultivator, they had actually sacrificed their lives as well. This was really not worth it, was it?","Tang Yan even stretched out a hand, his expression filled with grief.","In his eyes, Ling Han definitely wouldn’t be able to live for much longer, being simultaneously attacked by so many Core Formation Tier elites.","This was his brother!","“Don’t worry. Good people don’t live long, while bad people live for 1000 years.” The large black dog stretched out a paw and patted Tang Yan’s shoulder, “Little Han is just a cockroach. His life is tougher than you can imagine.”","As expected, when the brilliance of the attack disappeared, Ling Han was still standing there unscathed, while Tan Zhengjie had completely turned into dust, not even a bit left behind.","What!","Seeing this scene, Han Bing, Zhao Xiao, Liu Xunyu, and the others almost went crazy. They could not believe their eyes at all.","Are you a f****** monster?","Being bombarded by a group of Core Formation Tier elites, he was actually completely unscathed.","This was too terrifying. How could there be such a person?","Ling Han’s cold eyes swept over them. Those few Core Formation Tier cultivators of the Tan Clan all stepped back in fear. As they saw it, Ling Han wasn’t even human.","“Scram!” Ling Han shouted. He couldn’t even be bothered to make a move on these minor characters.","The Core Formation Tier cultivators from the Tan Clan all exchanged looks before coming to a","stop.","Tan Zhengjie had been killed in front of them. If they still ran away with their tails between their legs, just what kind of punishment would they receive when they returned to the clan?","There was still the Core Formation Tier elites from the Zhao, Liu and Han Clans here. They didn’t believe that so many Core Formation Tier elites working together wouldn’t be able to deal with Ling Han.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I gave you people a chance, yet you people insist on seeking death. Don’t blame me then.”","“Everyone, attack together!” The elites of the Tan Clan shouted.","“En!”","The Core Formation Tier elites from the Han, Zhao, and Liu Clans all nodded in agreement. This person was far too freakish, so they definitely had to team up to deal with him.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! These elites all jumped out, and joined forces to attack Ling Han. Ling Han was completely unconcerned, and merely sent out a murderous aura attack.","Weng, this was what true terror was. The murderous aura barrage ignored all distance, and instantly penetrated into everyone’s minds, turning into numerous black figures, exuding an endlessly terrifying aura.","It should be known that the strength of Ling Han’s present soul had reached the level of Sect","Master. What kind of concept was that?","Pa! Pa! Pa! Pa!","Those cultivators of the Core Formation Tier collapsed one after another. If one examined them closely, they would discover that their auras had been completely severed, and their","minds had all been shattered.","Even if he had ignited his Imperial Blood, and his battle prowess had surpassed Ling Han by ten Heavens, even a supreme prodigy like Fu Huoyang had almost become an idiot from the barrage of murderous aura. The rest were mediocre, and could not even withstand a single","blow.","Now, the only ones remaining on the opposing side were Han Bing, Zhao Xiao, and Liu Xunyu. However, their bodies were trembling continuously, as if they had gone mad.","They were scared out of their wits. This was too terrifying. There were a total of fourteen Core Formation Tier cultivators, and they had all died at the same time. How could they not be","scared silly?","To say nothing of them, even Prosperous Heaven and Song Lan were given a fright.","This battle prowess caused them to feel pressure and fear.","Meanwhile, it was as if Tang Yan had become a complete fool. He could only widen his eyes,","and had completely no reaction at all.","Ling Han shot out another finger. Pa, pa, pa! The heads of Han Bing, Zhao Xiao, and Liu Xunyu","exploded in unison.","Fine, an old grievance was completely settled.","“Impudence!” At this moment, the soldiers of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire also rushed","over. They all shouted at Ling Han, “Maniac, you actually dare to publicly commit murder here! Hurry up and surrender yourself!”","Tang Yan’s heart clenched, and he was already prepared to make a move. Worse come to","worst, he could just leave Moonlight Planet. The world was huge, so where couldn’t he go? “Humph, I have just taken office today, and have already caused such a great commotion. Brat, you are really courting death!” A voice rang out, and a figure stepped into the sky,","exuding an incredibly domineering aura.","True Self Tier!"]},{"number":4020,"title":"Chapter 4020: Resolve","paragraphs":["Chapter 4020: Resolve","He was done for.","Tang Yan wailed in his mind. Ling Han was indeed powerful, and he had witnessed it with his own eyes. However, no matter how powerful a Core Formation Tier cultivator was, he was still only a Core Formation Tier cultivator. Compared to a True Self Tier cultivator, what could he do?","This True Self Tier elite looked to be around 40 years old, but his true age should be far from that. His body was sturdy, and he had a stocky build. His whole face was covered with sideburns, and he looked very rough.","Elites were elites. He merely stood there, and he was already exuding an extremely powerful aura, causing others to not even dare to breathe loudly.","This elite’s eyes swept over the empress, Song Lan and the other women, and his eyes involuntarily lit up.","Though their true appearance could not be seen, just from the looks of their figures, the women could be considered perfect, causing his heart to beat wildly.","Wasn’t power, status, and beautiful women the reason why men cultivated?","Now that he had both power and status, there was naturally no reason for him not to accept beautiful women.","“All of you, take off your veils!” he commanded.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Say, it’s best that you curb your lust. Otherwise, things won’t end well.”","“Brat, just how much do you want to die?” the True Self Tier elite said coldly. He stared at Ling Han, killing intent circulating within him.","Ling Han turned to look at Prosperous Heaven and said, “Little Prosperous, I’ll leave it to you.”","A muscle twitched in Prosperous Heaven’s cheek. When had she become Prosperous Heaven? But who asked her to have such a high opinion of Ling Han, and wanted to draw him into the Buddhist Race, so that he could become the Buddhist Son of the North Heavenly Realm?","Thus, she could only step forward.","“Step down,” she said calmly.","“Hehe, the youngsters nowadays are a bit too arrogant, aren’t they!” The True Self Tier elite shook his head, and said, “Fine, since you’re unwilling to take off your veils, let me help you!”","He stretched out a hand, and grabbed out at Prosperous Heaven.","“An!” Prosperous Heaven exclaimed. It was the Six Characters Bright King Curse.","She was the true heir of the Buddhist Race. With a soft exclamation, not only was she thought-provoking, a halo of Buddhist light appeared behind her head, making her appear sacred and elegant.","The True Self Tier elite was astonished. ‘F*ck! This is a disciple of the Buddhist Race!’","The entire Shadow Moon Majestic Empire believed in Buddhism, evey single one of them studied and discussed the studies of Buddhism, and those like the members of the Imperial Family would even join the Buddhist Race, learning the mysterious techniques of the Buddhist Race.","He wasn’t qualified to cultivate the Buddhist Race’s cultivation technique, but how could it be that he hadn’t seen it before?","The Six Characters Bright King Curse and the Buddha Halo were images that could only be possessed by those disciples of the Buddhist Race.","“Female Bodhisattva!” The masses around them all knelt down, their expressions filled with reverence.","The True Self Tier elite instantly started to hesitate. What should he do?","If he continued to insist, he would offend the higher-ups of the Buddhist Race. This wasn’t a joke. Now that the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s citizens were all praying to Buddha, even the emperor would treat the Buddhist Race disciples with utmost respect. Thus, how could he dare to offend them?","But these women’s figures were so captivating, and their bearing was so enchanting. He really did not want to give up.","He thought for a moment, then pointed at Prosperous Heaven and said, “You can leave.”","He didn’t dare to touch the disciples of the Buddhist Race, but as for the others? Hehe, he had every reason to capture them.","Prosperous Heaven couldn’t help but feel angry. This person was too tactless. He clearly knew her identity, yet still dared to have perverted thoughts.","“I am Prosperous Heaven, Holy Daughter of the Buddhist Race of North Heavenly Realm!” She revealed her own identity.","What, Holy Daughter!","The True Self Tier elite couldn’t help but shudder, revealing an expression of fear.","He naturally knew how powerful the Buddhist Race was. This was an Imperial Clan, one of the most powerful forces in the universe, and what did the Buddhist Race’s Holy Daughter","represent?","This was equivalent to the Imperial Daughter.","Who dared to offend the Imperial Daughter?","However, these three women... He was in an incredibly difficult position, and was very conflicted.","“Greetings, Holy Daughter!” At this moment, a few figures flew past in the sky, then descended. They were all wearing monk robes, both men and women, and there were cultivation levels ranging from the Core Formation Tier to the Spiritual Transformation Tier.","However, even the Spirit Transformation True Lord paid his respects with a reverent expression.","The True Self Tier elite sighed internally. Now that the elites of the Buddhist Race had arrived, how could he still have the right to speak?","He also clasped his hands in greeting, and said, “Greetings, Holy Daughter!”","Prosperous Heaven humphed and pointed at him, saying, “This person’s heart is filled with filth, and he needs to be purified.”","“As you command!” Those elites of the Buddhist Race moved, and apprehended that True","Self Tier elite, escorting him away.","As for how exactly he was going to be purified, that was unknown. The Buddhist Race specialized in purifying the mind. Probably, when that guy came out again, not only would he no longer lust after women, he would treat them as poison instead.","“Little Prosperous, be a good person until the end,” Ling Han said. “This brother of mine was originally from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Now that the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire has been destroyed, he’s also become a wanted criminal. Help me eliminate this","criminal record for him and his clan.”","Prosperous Heaven couldn’t help as her face darkened. She, a Holy Daughter, actually had to","do such a trivial thing?","“If you join the Buddhist Race and become a Buddha Son, this will naturally be a small matter.” However, she immediately switched from passive to active.","Ling Han shrugged and said, “Forget about it. You won’t even help me with such a small","favor, so what kind of good friends are we?”","This made Prosperous Heaven furious. Who was asking who for help? Did he not have any estimates in his heart?","There was neither anger nor fury; Buddha was merciful.","She hurriedly recited the Immovable Heart Sutra in her mind, stopping her anger and","irritation.","“Brother Tang, let’s go and pay you a visit,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“All right.” Tang Yan nodded. By now, he was really impressed by Ling Han.","This brother of his was doing far better than he had imagined. Not only was his abilities outstanding, he had even gotten to know the Holy Daughter of the Buddhist Race, and was","very strong.","Ling Han led everyone to the Tang Clan. They were presently living in seclusion in a remote valley, and had casually built a few dozen wooden houses. They were considerably simple and","crude.","Ling Han and the others received a warm welcome. Now that the Tang Clan had fallen, and everyone had betrayed them, those that could still come to visit the Tang Clan at this time","were real friends.","After Ling Han stayed for two days, he left quietly, heading towards Celestial Sea Planet.","He didn’t want Song Lan and Prosperous Heaven to know that he had obtained the inheritance of a Saint. Thus, he could use the Tang Clan as a cover.","Now that the Transfer Formation had also been constructed on the Celestial Sea Planet, it was much more convenient to go there. Entering the Transfer Formation would allow one to arrive immediately after exiting.","He had obtained the coordinates of the next Mystery Realm in the Azure Cloud Mystery Realm, so it was very easy for him to find the location. Then, he used a special method to open","it and enter.","The Viper Mystery Realm really lived up to its name. From top to bottom, this place was filled","with poisonous snakes.","However, this was the Ancient Sun Saint’s test for Core Formation Tier. Thus, these poisonous snakes were also at the level of the Core Formation Tier.","Ling Han didn’t need to attack at all as he continued to advance. He continued to unleash his","murderous aura, and the poisonous snakes here all turned over and died. They didn’t even","have the chance to attack.","This was something that even the Ancient Sun Saint wouldn’t have imagined, right? The test that he had set up had been so easily resolved by Ling Han.","The core of this test was in an ancient palace. As long as one entered, they would be able to","control the entire Mystery Realm, and thus obtain the Core Formation Tier portion of the","Ancient Sun Divine Scroll.","However, this ancient palace was covered with extremely poisonous snakes, and they were all ferocious beasts at the level of the Core Formation Tier. They only knew slaughter.","Ling Han smiled, and strode in."]},{"number":4021,"title":"Chapter 4021: Assassination","paragraphs":["Chapter 4021: Assassination","Ling Han strode into the palace.","Hiss, hiss, hiss! A large number of poisonous snakes slithered out and attacked him, but under the barrage of murderous aura, not one of them could get close at all. Their minds all cracked, their souls shattered, and they died soundlessly.","The might of the barrage of murderous aura was really too terrifying. With Ling Han’s current soul strength, killing Core Formation Tier was as easy as turning over his palm.","He effortlessly arrived at the depths of the palace, and obtained control of the Mystery Realm. He also obtained the things that the Ancient Sun Saint had left for him.","Ancient Sun Divine Scroll’s Core Formation Tier chapter, as well as three natural treasures.","These three natural treasures were all used to nurture the soul, and could be used to strengthen Ling Han’s Celestial Core, after he advanced into the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier.","Good!","Ling Han instantly felt that this trip had not been in vain. Merely for these three natural treasures, it was worth it.","He obtained the coordinates of the next and final Mystery Realm, the Honest Mystery Realm, as well as the method to open it. However, this would require him to advance into the True Self Tier first.","It was no big deal. These three Mystery Realms were only testing to see if Ling Han’s battle prowess had declined in this new cultivation level. Thus, as long as Ling Han maintained this freakish performance, passing through the last Mystery Realm would only be going through the motions.","He exited the Mystery Realm and returned to the Moonlight Planet. He didn’t contact or meet with Chen Fengyan.","Right now, the Dark North Nation had also submitted to the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire. As long as Chen Fengyan wasn’t planning to rebel, he would naturally be able to sit firmly on the throne.","This nephew of his should be trying to break through to the level of Sect Master, but it was too difficult to take this step. Thus, several years had already passed, and Chen Fengyan was still in a state of seclusion. Who knew when he would succeed.","Ling Han returned to the Tang Clan. Although Song Lan and Prosperous Heaven hadn’t seen him for two days, they would never have imagined that he would actually go to Celestial Sea Planet.","After staying in the Tang Clan for a few days, Ling Han decided to return to the Nine Suns Holy Land.","This matter had already been settled, and he had already seen him, so what was the point of him staying here any longer?","Everyone set out, and the Prosperous Heaven also resolved the matter of the Tang Clan. In future, the Tang Clan could completely appear openly on the Moonlight Planet, and the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire wouldn’t do anything.","Everyone began to traverse through the stars. This time, they were not so anxious. Every time they reached a planet, they would stop and ask around if there were any ancient sites that they could join in on.","Unfortunately, there were indeed ancient sites that had opened, but it was either Foundation Building Tier or Cauldron Forging Tier-level. The level was too low, so it did not have much benefit for them.","Who would do something without benefits?","They continued to advance. They were still three transfers away from returning to the Nine Suns Planet.","On this day, after they had rested and reorganized, they arrived at the Transfer Formation here.","Ling Han walked forwards. It was not just their group. There were also a few passers-by that were following him. They too wanted to go to the next planet.","Two people seemed to have had an argument. At first, they were still talking quietly, but very soon, it became serious. In fact, there was even a physical conflict.","Peng!","One of them pushed with all his might, and the other person was sent flying, crashing towards Ling Han.","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and a gentle power surged out, stabilizing the person that had crashed towards him.","Right at this moment, shua, the person that he had supported actually turned around quickly, and launched an attack at him. A cold light streaked out, and that was a piercingly cold saber","light.","At the same time, the few people who seemed to be completely unconcerned previously moved at the same time. They all drew their weapons, and attacked Ling Han.","‘Hmm?’","This was a planned assassination.","However, Ling Han shook his head. The mastermind had underestimated his strength too much. He had actually only mobilized forces of Core Formation Tier.","The murderous aura charged towards them!","Boom! A thought flashed through his mind. Pa, pa, pa! Immediately, three people fell from the sky and were knocked unconscious. Meanwhile, the remaining four people all wore twisted expressions, as if they were experiencing immense pain.","Effortlessly, this wave of assassination was easily resolved.","Prosperous Heaven and Song Lan moved, apprehending the remaining four people.","These four people weren’t weak, but firstly, Prosperous Heaven and Song Lan were both extremely powerful in the first place, and secondly, their souls were severely wounded, so their battle prowess dropped drastically. Naturally, they were completely outmatched.","“Who are you people? Why do you want to assassinate Ling Han?”","“Who commanded you?”","The large black dog immediately asked.","Unexpectedly, these four people were quite stubborn, and kept their mouths shut.","“If you don’t tell me, I’ll feed you guys to the dogs,” Hu Niu said, hands on her hips. Her expression was filled with fury. They actually dared to kill her Ling Han.","The large black dog bared his teeth. He had been innocently implicated.","“Feed to the snakes.” Eldest Baby and the others approached excitedly.","One of the assassins finally spoke up. However, his expression was filled with arrogance, and","he did not have the slightest awareness that he was a captive. He said, “Let me give you a word of advice. Hurry up and release us!”","“Heh, so you guys can assassinate me again?” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Don’t worry. As long as people from the Battle God Palace fails and are captured, the mission will be terminated,” the assassin said. Then, his tone changed, “However, if you dare to kill members of the Battle God Palace, you’re dead!”","“Next, there will be True Self Tier elites, Spiritual Transformation Tier elites, Sect Master","Tier assassins, right until they kill you.”","Yi, the Battle God Palace?","Ling Han was astonished. He had passed the test of the Young Dragon and obtained the Three","Styles of the God of War. This was a Saint-level celestial technique. Although it wasn’t the complete version, it was indeed extremely powerful. It was one of his most powerful","techniques from long ago.","Brother Monkey had said before that the Three Styles of the God of War was the ultimate technique of the Battle God Palace.","These people actually came from the Battle God Palace? The Battle God Palace was actually an organization of assassins?","Ling Han was a little dazed. As for the fact that he was targeted by an assassin organization, there was no need to make a fuss about it, because he had offended too many people, and there were a few among them that were rich and imposing, so it was normal for them to hire assassins to deal with him.","“Battle God Palace!” Prosperous Heaven frowned at the same time, appearing very wary.","“What do you know about the Battle God Palace?” Ling Han asked.","“The Battle God Palace is an ancient assassin organization that has produced more than one Saint.” Prosperous Heaven said first, “The Battle God Palace is very terrifying, because they are eternally in shadow. No one knows where their base is, how many people there are, and","how many supreme elites there are.”","“This organization specializes in assassination techniques, and it’s said that even Saints have been assassinated by them. They’re extremely difficult to deal with.”","“If it was a head-on confrontation, the Imperial Clan would only have to have the Saint bring the Imperial Weapon, and they would be able to easily destroy it. However, the difficulty lies in the fact that though the Battle God Palace has the word ‘palace’, no one knows where their headquarters are at all. It would not be easy to clear them out at all.”","“After innumerable years, this Battle God Palace has always been able to exist. Even the Imperial Clan is unwilling to easily offend it.”","The Imperial Clan was indeed awesome, being invincible in a head-on confrontation. However, they were assassins, and they didn’t engage in a head-on confrontation at all. Instead, they continued to launch sneak attacks from the shadows. Add to that the Saint-level assassin kings, and this was indeed enough to give the Imperial Clan a headache.","“So, let us go!” the assassin from before said. His face was filled with arrogance, as if he was certain that Ling Han would definitely compromise."]},{"number":4022,"title":"Chapter 4022: Battle God Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 4022: Battle God Palace","How arrogant.","Ling Han didn’t know what else to say. He had come here to assassinate him, and when he didn’t succeed, he still had the audacity to ask others to let him go. Just how thick-skinned was he?","“Let us go. We can guarantee that we will give up on this business deal,” the assassin said, his face filled with certainty, as if he was certain that he had Ling Han in his grasp.","This was natural. They dared to assassinate even the Imperial Clan, and even Saints had suffered grievances before. Naturally, they would not care about a minor character like Ling","Han.","I am in the dark, and I can continuously attack. This is my advantage, and even the members of the Imperial Clan would frown at this.","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, “In other words, if there is a request to kill me, you guys would still send someone to take action?”","“Naturally. Business is business,” the assassin replied without hesitation.","“All right.” Ling Han tapped out a finger. Pa, the assassin’s head immediately exploded like a watermelon.","This scene directly stupefied the other three assassins.","However, after only an instant, they looked angrily at Ling Han.","“You’re dead!”","“Now, even if there is no request, our Battle God Palace will still kill you!”","“Just you wait, there is no one in this world that can save you!”","“Even if you are the disciple of the Nine Suns Holy Land, our Killing Saint will still barge in with the Saint Tool, and take your life!”","“Hahaha, no one can kill a member of our Battle God Palace. The doors to hell have already been opened for you.”","The three of them said one after another, as if they were completely unafraid of death.","“Is that so?” Ling Han said calmly, “Bring it on, see what I’m afraid of!”","He stretched out a hand and pressed it on the head of an assassin. He began to search his soul, wanting to know where the Battle God Palace was.","However, he immediately discovered that there was a restriction in this person’s mind. It would explode at the slightest touch, and destroy that person’s mind.","As expected, there was no such simple matter. If the Battle God Palace could be so easily found, would it have stood for millions and millions of years, and become a poisonous tumor that even the Imperial Clans would have a headache over?","“Hahaha, don’t even think of finding out where the Battle God Palace is!” That assassin clearly knew what Ling Han was planning. He laughed loudly, “Even if I am willing to tell you, I don’t have to say it out loud. As long as you touch this memory, my mind will explode and die.”","“Thus, you should give up this thought, and just wait for your death!”","Ling Han was unmoved. He flicked out a finger, and pa, pa, pa, six taps shot out. The remaining six assassins were also killed by him.","F***, what he hated the most was being threatened. Furthermore, they had clearly come to kill him, and after failing, they actually wanted to leave boldly. How could there be such a good thing?","“Brother Ling!” Prosperous Heaven and Song Lan both frowned.","This wouldn’t be easy to deal with.","The Battle God Palace was definitely not the strongest force in the world, but the vitality of this organization was extraordinarily tenacious. It was said that there was always a Saint keeping watch, and they had always been in the dark. No one knew where exactly this Battle God Palace was.","Thus, this assassin organization had the right to threaten the Imperial Clan. Because they could only be thieves for 1000 days, how could one be on guard for 1000 days?","Ling Han smiled calmly, “Counter pawns with the king, and water with an earth weir. The Battle God Palace is only a force in the universe, so how could it be that it can blot out the skies single-handedly?”","The two women shook their heads. This time, the assassins from the Core Formation Tier had failed, so the assassins sent by the Battle God Palace could possibly be the True Self Tier elites. If they failed again, they would be the Spiritual Transformation Tier elites, the Sect Master elites, right until they killed Ling Han.","Moreover, these assassins all carried out assassinations, and it was impossible to guard against them.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He indeed could let these assassins go, and bear with it for the moment. In future, when his cultivation level had reached a certain level, he would seek","revenge.","However, firstly, this was out of character for him. If he had a grudge, he would take revenge. If he was bullied, he would immediately slap the perpetrator back. Secondly, he had so many enemies, and if every single one of them went to make a request, how many times would he have to spare the assassins from the Battle God Palace?","Hence, this was a dead end that could not be undone. It would be better to be forceful from the very beginning.","They rode the Transfer Formation back to Nine Suns Holy Land, and the news that Ling Han was targeted by the Battle God Palace also spread on the Galaxy Network.","Ling Han believed that this definitely wasn’t a leak from Song Lan or Prosperous Heaven. The most likely culprit was the person behind the assassination request, who was already jumping up in impatience.","“What, Ling Han is actually targeted by the Battle God Palace?”","“Then he’s definitely done for. No one who’s been targeted by this assassin organization has ever survived.”","“Who asked him to be too arrogant? He’s in the limelight too much, and has offended too","many people.”","“Going by that theory, I can even hire assassins to kill the Imperial Son?”","“Hehe, that would have to depend on whether the Battle God Palace accepts this request or","not.”","“Yi, isn’t the Battle God Palace unafraid of even the Imperial Clan?”","“You can’t say that. The Imperial Clan is too powerful, and the Battle God Palace won’t actively trifle with them either. Otherwise, when the Imperial Clan mobilizes the world to investigate, they’ll eventually find some clues. Then, the Saint of the Imperial Clan will carry the Imperial Weapon to suppress them, and the Battle God Palace will also collapse.”","“That’s true. The Battle God Palace is not stupid, and would not bring such great trouble to themselves.”","Upon entering the Holy Land, Ling Han was met with strange gazes all the way. It was as if they were looking at a corpse.","Unless Ling Han never left the Holy Land, once he left, it was possible that he would be","assassinated by the Battle God Palace, or if it really dragged on for too long, even the Killing Saint of the Battle God Palace could possibly move personally. Then, would the Nine Suns Holy Land be able to protect Ling Han?","Ling Han returned to his residence, and began to think of a strategy.","He couldn’t hide in the Holy Land forever. In fact, the Holy Land might not even be","completely safe.","Was it possible to counterattack?","This was much, much too difficult.","If the Battle God Palace was so easy to find, how could it have existed for so many years?","Then, since he could not destroy this assassin organization, he would have to increase his own strength, or the ability to preserve his life.","Strength was linked to cultivation level. Even if Ling Han was freakish beyond compare, he couldn’t possibly possess the battle prowess of a True Self Tier at this time. Moreover, even if he did, so what? It wasn’t like Battle God Palace didn’t have Spirit Transformation True Lord","assassins.","Thus, life-saving ability was the most important thing.","He had the Heavenly Dao Flames, and even Venerate Tier elites had to give him a wide berth. Otherwise, they would definitely die. This was his trump card.","Was there anything else?","The Spiritual Dao Fruit could take effect when he suffered a fatal injury, saving his life.","There was too little.","Ling Han went to the treasure storage of the Holy Land, wanting to start from formations,","and find another way.","Having unleashed might in Cauldron Forging Tier, winning glory for the North Heavenly","Realm, this naturally also gained great fame for once for the Nine Suns Holy Land. Thus, Ling Han was rewarded with a great many contribution points, which was enough for him to spend","lavishly.","He flipped through carefully. If he wanted to greatly increase his battle prowess for a short period of time, and turn this into his new trump card, then the only way was definitely","through formations.","After searching for a long time, Ling Han’s eyes suddenly lit up.","He hadn’t found an astonishingly powerful formation technique, but rather a method to use the power of heaven and earth. This could allow him to borrow the power of heaven and earth.","Theoretically speaking, he could borrow the power of the planet and instantly move from the northernmost point of the planet to the southernmost point.","Amazing, too amazing."]},{"number":4023,"title":"Chapter 4023: Formation Grandmaster","paragraphs":["Chapter 4023: Formation Grandmaster","If he could grasp this kind of teleportation, then Ling Han would really be safe.","Unless he encountered a terrifying existence like the Saint, who could destroy the entire planet with a single strike, even Venerate Tier elites would find it very difficult to kill him.","However, it was too difficult to master this kind of technique.","The requirements for formation mastery were too high, and only the highest grade of Grandmaster could cast this.","If this was before in the Nine Suns Holy Land, Ling Han would definitely have only been able to look and sigh in disappointment. However, things were different now. He had gone to the Netherworld and raised the strength of his soul to the level of the Spirit Transformation Tier, qualifying him to touch the Grandmaster level.","He spent all of his contribution points in an instant, and then obtained the right to study this technique.","To learn this kind of technique, there were two things that needed to be done.","Firstly, one would have an incredibly profound grasp of formations, and secondly, being able to teleport required one to have a complete understanding of the ley lines. Thus, every time one arrived at a new planet, one would need to once again grasp the ley lines.","Hence, this technique itself was not difficult. What was difficult was how to increase the level of formations, and then grasp the ley lines of a planet.","Ling Han logged into the Galaxy Network and rented a top-notch Time Chamber.","He wanted to quickly improve his formations skills.","This stay lasted for half a year.","In the eyes of outsiders, Ling Han was clearly terrified. He knew that there were people from the Battle God Palace waiting to assassinate him outside, so he had been cooped up in his abode for more than half a year. To say nothing of the Holy Land, he didn’t even dare to leave his own abode.","Rumors flew, and they were all belittling Ling Han. It could not be helped. Previously, he had been too famous. With the cultivation level of Cauldron Forging Tier, he had defeated the Core Formation Tier, and even the Imperial Son could only bow in submission. How many people were envious, jealous, and hateful of him for this?","Thus, many pairs of eyes were focused on him, hoping to grab hold of his sore spot, so that they could harshly belittle him.","This time, they had found a chance.","However, Ling Han was completely unaware.","Half a year had passed in the outside world, so how long had his soul spent on the Galaxy Network?","A whole twenty-five years!","After such a long time, he finally stepped into the Grandmaster level of formations.","It was extremely difficult. It was as difficult as ascending the heavens for him to create Grandmaster-level formation foundations. However, he didn’t need to set up such","formations. Instead, it was fine as long as he had this kind of understanding and could control the ley lines.","He ended his seclusion, and all of a sudden, his Universe Coins were completely exhausted. He was now extremely poor.","Ling Han naturally didn’t regret it at all. Wasn’t money used to strengthen his abilities? It was worth it.","Without money, he could just earn more.","Ling Han returned to reality, and as his feet stepped on the ground, endless enlightenment instantly rose up in him.","This planet was different from before. It was as if it had a life of its own, and was breathing. Ling Han closed his eyes, and touched it with his soul.","If he had only released his divine sense, he would only be able to sense any movement within a 500-kilometer radius. However, it was different now. It was as if he had fused with this planet. Every blade of grass, every tree, every rock and every drop of water had become his eyes and hands, allowing his senses to endlessly extend.","But if that was all, it was not enough for an instant.","Ling Han started to capture the ley lines.","He viewed planets as living beings, and ley lines were equivalent to the veins of the planet. Thus, after he grasped the ley lines, he could use them to surge, and instantly travel from one place to another.","His divine sense extended endlessly, penetrating deep into the land’s heart. Here, he touched an incredibly ancient willpower.","This was the willpower of a planet. Although it was incredibly powerful, it was also filled with Primal Chaos. It was like a giant infant. By nature, it was clearly powerful, yet it didn’t understand anything at all. It was filled with blankness.","Ling Han didn’t dare to come into contact with this kind of willpower. Although his current Spiritual Power was powerful, compared to the willpower of a planet, he was nothing but child’s play, unable to withstand a single blow.","He had grasped the ley lines. There was Earth Qi surging within, which was incredibly powerful.","Ling Han finally understood. If he could teleport on a planet and walk freely, it was because of this Earth Qi that he was able to traverse through the body of the planet.","The path of formations was truly amazing.","Ling Han’s interest was greatly piqued. He could imagine what kind of might could be unleashed by using this Earth Qi.","“No wonder it’s said that Formation Grandmasters can completely be regarded as elites of martial arts.” Ling Han nodded, “Furthermore, extracting Earth Qi to temper the body, though its effect on increasing cultivation level is not great, it can strengthen the physique to","a chilling extent.”","“The soil of the Five Elements represents defense in the first place.”","“Interesting, truly interesting.”","Ling Han continued to extend his divine sense, grasping the ley lines of the entire Nine Suns Planet. In this way, he felt that this planet was him, and he was this planet.","Theoretically, he could see every single part of the Nine Sung Planet, but in truth, there were too many places that he could not see through at all, as if they were enshrouded in fog.","There should be formations in these places, so they blocked his senses.","Not only that, but he also saw a few elites. He had just looked over with his willpower, when the other party sensed his presence. They shot out a punch, and easily destroyed the Earth Qi, causing him to instantly become blind.","Ling Han sighed. The strength of his soul was only at the Spiritual Transformation Tier, after all. If he encountered Sect Master-level or Venerate Tier-level elites, he would naturally be","discovered.","“Instant teleportation isn’t as easy as I thought.”","Ling Han frowned. The foundation of this instant teleportation was actually Earth Qi, but Earth Qi originated from the ley lines, and could be extended to a certain extent. However, it could not possibly seep out too far. Thus, if he wanted to instant teleport, firstly, he had to","stand near the ley lines.","Let’s give it a try first.","He walked for a while, and arrived at a ley line. Then, with a thought, an Earth Qi wrapped around him. Xiu, he was gone.","This was too amazing. It was clear that the ground was still whole, and there was no pit at all, but he just sank into the ground. It was as if he had fused with the ground.","With another thought, he had already appeared from underground, appearing at least 50,000","km away from Nine Suns Holy Land.","Of course, this place just happened to correspond to a ley line.","With another thought from Ling Han, xiu, xiu, xiu, he continuously shuttled through this","planet.","Wonderful, wonderful, this was really too wonderful.","In terms of intergalactic travel, he was definitely no match for the Venerate Tier elite. The latter could instantly travel millions and millions of miles by tearing a rip into the Void, but in terms of traveling on a planet, he should not be inferior to the Venerate Tier elite.","More importantly, with the ley lines as his eyes and ears, he could sense the killing intent in advance, and from there, prepare ahead of time.","In this way, even if he wasn’t near the ley lines, he could still have time to make","arrangements.","“Can I also teleport away from the ley lines?” Ling Han read the information, and said that","the true Formations Grandmasters could teleport anywhere, and did not have to be near the","ley lines.","He began experimenting, and discovered that this was feasible.","That was to wrap himself in Earth Qi. As long as he could stimulate Earth Qi, he would be able","to teleport.","“There is a limit to the extension of the Earth Qi. However, it can be replenished through","one’s own Spiritual Power, which connects with the Earth Qi, forming a passageway that","solves the problem of distance.”","“That would have to depend on the strength of my soul.”","“With the strength of my current Spiritual Power, this distance is about a hundred miles.”","“Just barely enough.”"]},{"number":4024,"title":"Chapter 4024: Star Steps","paragraphs":["Chapter 4024: Star Steps","Xiu, right at this moment, a figure appeared out of thin air.","Ling Han’s first reaction was that the people from the Battle God Palace had charged over. He was already prepared to use the ley lines to escape, but at the same time, he was also surprised. He had only mastered this kind of technique for half a day, so how did the people from the Battle God Palace know?","But in the next instant, Ling Han was relieved, because the person who had come was not an assassin from the Battle God Palace, but rather the Nine Mountains Venerate.","“Brat, you’ve already died once,” the Nine Mountains Venerate said solemnly.","Ling Han was astonished. ‘Didn’t I see through you?’","“Wrong. The reason why the assassins of the Battle God Palace are so hard to guard against is because they are not only good at launching sneak attacks from the shadows, but would also disguise themselves as someone familiar to you, causing you to be unguarded, and then succeed with a single strike,” the Nine Mountains Venerate said solemnly.","Ling Han nodded, then put on a defensive stance, “Then are you in disguise now?”","The Nine Mountains Venerate instantly laughed. This junior was truly worrisome. He had actually angered the Battle God Palace with a single trip.","“I really didn’t expect that you have actually mastered the Star Steps.” He sighed, “In that case, I will be at ease. Even if you are outmatched, you would still have a chance to escape.” “Star Steps?”","“Don’t you know that this is called the Star Steps?”","Only now did Ling Han know that this kind of technique that borrowed the power of Earth Qi to move was called the Star Steps.","True, he was walking within the planet, so wasn’t it Star Steps then?","“Such a young Formations Grandmaster!” The Nine Mountains Venerate was filled with emotion. “Martial arts, alchemy, formations, you’re proficient in all of them. You’re a prodigy in all of them, so how can there be a freak like you? You’re practically a little maniac.” Was this a compliment? Er, it could be considered a compliment.","Ling Han was extremely shameless, so he nodded and gladly accepted the Nine Mountains Venerate’s praise.","“At first, I had planned to be your Dao Protector for a while, but I never thought that a brat like you would actually cultivate the Star Steps. Now, I can rest assured,” the Nine Mountains Venerate continued.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel warmth in his heart. Hurriedly, he said, “Thank you for your concern, Senior.”","“However, even if you’ve mastered the Star Steps, you still can’t be careless,” the Nine Mountains Venerate said solemnly. “The Battle God Palace has been able to move unhindered for so many years, and it’s said that there is no one that they dare not or can’t kill. This definitely isn’t an empty boast.”","“Yes.” Ling Han nodded. He naturally could distinguish his good intentions.","“All right, let’s go back.” The Nine Mountains Venerate waved his hand, appearing very satisfied.","The Battle God Palace was indeed terrifying, but in history, there was no shortage of people who had been ordered to kill by the Battle God Palace. However, in the end, they were still alive and well, and this kind of person had all become a Saint in the end.","This kind of tribulation and pressure could stimulate a person’s potential a hundredfold.","Thus, as long as Ling Han didn’t die, he would definitely be able to become a Saint.","Ling Han returned to the Nine Suns Holy Land. At this time, the empress and the others also discovered that he had come out of seclusion, and all came to see him.","“I’ve now cultivated the Star Steps, and even Venerate Tier elites would find it difficult to wound me,” Ling Han said. They were all family here, so there was no need for him to deceive them.","The empress, the large black dog and the others all nodded. Though the Battle God Palace had a Killing Saint, if they still sent out a Saint to kill a Core Formation Tier cultivator, then wouldn’t the Battle God Palace be too demeaning?","Furthermore, the last time the Battle God Palace had failed was only the Core Formation Tier. Who knows, they might even send out the Gold-medal assassins, ultimate elite assassins, and so on from the Core Formation Tier. When they failed, only then would they send out True Self Tier elites. What kind of Saint would make a move right away?","Everyone relaxed.","After a few days, Lin Luo, Zhou Heng and the others came to bid farewell to Ling Han. They planned to venture into the galaxy.","In the Holy Land, though they did not have to worry about the problem of cultivation resources, it could only be considered standard. If they really wanted to obtain such good things like the Ghost Spirit Crystal, the Spiritual Dao Fruit, and so on, they would definitely have to fight for it themselves, and it not be bestowed upon them by anyone.","They were all ultimate elites in the Genesis World, so how could they accept being ordinary? Thus, they wanted to go and take a look.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t object. He taught them all of the cultivation techniques of the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll. Unfortunately, if he could advance to the next level, he would be able to obtain the complete Ancient Sun Divine Scroll and teach it in one go.","There was no hurry. It wasn’t like Lin Luo and the others would never return.","After sending Lin Luo and the others off, Ling Han also felt like exercising.","Staying in the Holy Land, there was indeed no shortage of resources, but it was also impossible to obtain top-grade treasures.","He searched for the location of any martial arts tournament on the Galaxy Network. There was news of ancient ruins opening, but they were all too far away. By the time he arrived, the tournament would have long since ended, and the ancient site would have long since been","exploited.","He sighed, so bored that his bones were aching.","Since that was the case, he would get along well with his beautiful wife, and cherish this kind of peaceful, beautiful time.","However, this was destined to be an extravagant hope. After Prosperous Heaven found out that he had come out of seclusion, she immediately ran over, planning to expiate him and bring him into the Buddhist Race.","This annoyed Ling Han so much that he felt an urge to pummel this Holy Daughter of the","Buddhist Race.","Two days later, the large black dog ran over.","“Little Han, a big, big event!” This despicable dog was very excited.","“What is it? Have you discovered a female dog that has the same traits as you?” Ling Han’s mouth was also unforgiving.","“Shoo, shoo, shoo, don’t play this kind of dirty joke with Grandpa Dog!” The large black dog waved its paw, “The resting place of Divine Rain Venerate has appeared!”","Divine Rain Venerate?” A thought flashed in Ling Han’s mind, but he wasn’t too excited. After all, he had cultivated more than one Imperial Technique, and grasped quite a few Saint Techniques, so he naturally couldn’t take a Venerate Tier-level inheritance too seriously.","Of course, if he had the chance, he would definitely take it gladly.","“Little Han, now you’re a frog at the bottom of a well.” The large black dog chuckled, and said, “Do you know who Divine Rain Venerate’s ancestor is?”","“Who?”","“Ancestral King Lingtian!” the large black dog said in an exaggerated tone.","Only now did Ling Han feel shocked.","Ancestral King!","Which also meant-","“That’s right. This Divine Rain Venerate is in possession of the Ancestral King Lingtian’s inheritance.” The large black dog’s eyes almost popped out of his head. “Little Han, just think, the Ancestral King Lingtian’s inheritance... How many treasures are there?” “He’s Ancestral King Lingtian’s only descendant?” Ling Han found this strange. “That’s true,” the large black dog said. “The Ancestral King Lingtian’s branch has always had few people. Thus, with Divine Rain Venerate’s death, the Ancestral King Lingtian’s inheritance was completely severed.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but sigh in pity. Although the Nine Suns Saint had lost to Ancestral King Lingtian and failed to become an Emperor, at least there was still the inheritance of the","Nine Suns Holy Land. It was indestructible for all eternity.","But what about Ancestral King Lingtian?","Only a legend was left behind.","Thinking about it, it was the same for Brother Monkey. Wasn’t the Battle Saint Emperor also","an overlord of his own generation? But in the end, his descendant was suppressed at the foot of the mountain. If it was not for the fact that they were afraid that he was not completely","dead, Brother Monkey would have been done for eight hundred years ago.","“Little Han, are you going or not?”","“Of course I’m going.”","Ling Han snickered. He was currently so bored that his bones were aching."]},{"number":4025,"title":"Chapter 4025: Ziming Mountain","paragraphs":["Chapter 4025: Ziming Mountain","Ling Han discussed with the empress and the others, and decided that he still wouldn’t bring them along this time.","After all, there were assassins from the Battle God Palace outside. Ling Han could take care of himself, but if he still had to bring his family with him, he might not be able to take care of them in time.","It was still the Holy Land that was safer.","If it was the large black dog, he wasn’t Ling Han’s relative, so no one knew about him and Ling Han. They only thought that they both came from the Nine Suns Holy Land. Moreover, he was a Demonic Beast, so it was unlikely that they would use the large black dog to threaten Ling Han.","“Where is the resting place of Divine Rain Venerate?”","“Nine Springs Planet, Ziming Mountain.”","“It seems a little far.”","“Er, should we go and find the Nine Mountains Old Baldy again?”","“F***, he’s not bald!”","Ling Han and the large black dog went to find the Nine Mountains Venerate, and asked this great elite for help, sending them directly to the Nine Springs Planet. This would save them a lot of time.","With how shameless Ling Han and the large black dog were, they naturally wouldn’t be too embarrassed to ask.","Regarding this, the Nine Mountains Venerate was speechless. These two little guys really didn’t treat him as an outsider.","However, he was also very optimistic about Ling Han’s future prospects. Thus, he did not mind helping Ling Han.","When a Venerate Tier elite made a move, it was naturally different. Merely nine days later, they had arrived at the Nine Springs Planet.","“Senior, are you not interested?” Ling Han asked.","The Nine Mountains Venerate pondered for a moment, then said, “I can’t say I’m not interested, but at my cultivation level, I believe even more in karma. If you want me to rummage through the tombs of cultivators of the same cultivation level, then it’s possible that Venerate Tiers would come to rummage through my tomb in the future.”","This was just like how even if new Ancestral Kings appeared, they would not plunder from those Imperial Clans. They would return the favor generation after generation. Though there were some rules that were not explicitly stated, they were silently adhered to.","Of course, if an Imperial Weapon really appeared in the tomb of Divine Rain Venerate, then to say nothing of Nine Mountains Venerate, even Saints would appear and join the battle for it.","Whether they would make a move or not would only depend on whether the temptation was strong enough. Moreover, since the treasure had appeared, for Nine Mountains Venerate and the others, it could not be considered as robbing a tomb.","Ling Han and the large black dog headed towards the Ziming Mountain. Ling Han immediately began to explore the ley lines here, while the dog checked the news on the Galaxy Network. This time, how many elites had come?","“Incredible, incredible, north, south, east, and west. The young prodigies from the four Heavenly Realms and elites from the older generation have all come.” The large black dog called out loudly, “Though Divine Rain Venerate himself does not have such great ability, it is very possible that he is related to an Emperor Tier inheritance. Even Saints would not be able to resist such temptation.”","“This time, it’s extremely likely that a Saint is hiding in the shadows. Once an Imperial Weapon or an Imperial Technique appears, they’ll join in on the robbery.”","The large black dog looked at Ling Han and said, “Little Han, could it be that we’ve worked for so long, yet ended up working for someone else?”","Ling Han chuckled, “So you’re quitting?”","“Of course not, no way!” The large black dog immediately jumped up again.","Ling Han had already grasped the ley lines of the Nine Springs Planet. With a thought, he brought him and the large black dog to the place nearest to the Ziming Mountains. If he went further, it would only be a mere 5000 km away.","“Little Han, this move is really convenient.” The large black dog nodded, “Grandpa Dog also wants to learn it.”","“So it would be convenient for you to steal things?”","“Er, so be it if you know. Why do you have to say it out loud?”","Not long after, they arrived at Ziming Mountain.","This mountain was as tall as the heavens, and was completely purple in colour. It was not covered with some kind of purple-coloured plants, but rather the mountain rocks were all purple in colour, exuding a faint light.","Originally, this mountain could not be considered all that mystical. It was just that the mountain rocks were different from other lands, but now, the whole mountain was enshrouded in purple-coloured clouds and mists, turning into the appearances of multiple","Divine Beasts.","This was not something as simple as looking mysterious, but rather that these Divine Beasts really had great might, and even Venerate Tier elites would not be able to break through them.","“As expected of the descendant of the Ancestral King. He’s also a Venerate Tier elite, and his methods are astonishing.”","“What do we do now? We can’t enter!”","“Huh? Don’t you know that the weaker one’s cultivation level, the more unrestricted they’ll","be?”","“A few days ago, there was a Foundation Building Tier cultivator who could enter. I’m sure that it won’t take too long for a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator to enter.”","“Sigh, I’m a Core Formation Tier cultivator, so how long do I have to wait?”","“I am in True Self Tier myself!”","There was a great deal of discussion on the Galaxy Network. It was not difficult at all to obtain relevant information. Thus, Ling Han and the large black dog also knew that they could not enter now, and would have to wait for a while.","“I’ve mastered a Grandmaster-level formation. Would it be able to open a path?” Ling Han","murmured.","He began to make an attempt.","This was indeed a formation. At present, Ling Han was not qualified to set it up. However, if it was just to carve out a path, this should still be feasible.","“Old Black, come.”","“What are you doing? Little Han, if you want to try it out, you can try it out on your own. Grandpa Dog should just wait outside for a while longer. I don’t mind at all! Hey, hey, hey,","why are you grabbing Grandpa Dog? Ah-”","The large black dog screamed in agony. Ling Han had grabbed him, and he was already walking toward the mist.","Boom, immediately, a Divine Beast pounced over.","This was formed from the energy of heaven and earth. Though it was not a physical body, it","was similarly boundlessly terrifying.","“Ah, I’m done for!” The large black dog didn’t even dare to look anymore.","Yet Ling Han stepped down. Weng, stimulated by Spiritual Power. the heaven and earth immediately underwent a subtle change.","He couldn’t set up formations with steps, but deactivating formations with steps, and creating a safe path wasn’t anything difficult.","Boom, this Divine Beast pounced past him. It was as if there was something wrong with its","eyes, and it had missed him by just a hair’s breadth.","Ling Han smiled, and continued to walk forwards. He saw another Divine Beast charge","towards him.","“Ah!”","“Yi!”","“Mother of God!”","The large black dog continued to wail in agony. After several times, he should have already realized that there was no problem. However, he still couldn’t calm down.","However, after walking for more than ten minutes, Ling Han finally walked out of the formation area. Ahead of him was still that purple mountain, but it was no longer enshrouded","in clouds and mist.","Ling Han tossed the large black dog onto the ground, and said, “Blackie, are you done yet?”","The large black dog had already begun to howl like a wolf. Hearing Ling Han’s words, it finally","stopped and scrambled to its feet. “Yi, we’ve already entered?”","Then, he became excited, “Great Emperor’s inheritance, Grandpa Dog is here!”","Pa, pa, pa! It broke out into a run and ran forwards.","In its mind, only Foundation Building Tier cultivators could enter at this moment. As a Nine Cauldrons, wasn’t it powerful enough to suppress all living beings?","Ling Han shook his head, and followed speechlessly.","They soon discovered a cave. It hadn’t been broken open for long, and Ling Han could see","clearly that the traces of broken mountain rock were very new.","Was this the abode where Divine Rain Venerate had passed away? Because the seal on the abode had been accidentally broken, the formation of the Ziming","Mountain was triggered, which led to the present situation.","“Little Han, quick.” The large black dog led the way.","“Be careful,” Ling Han warned. After all, this was where a Venerate Tier elite had passed","away. Anyhow, he could easily leave behind a trump card that could insta-kill a Core","Formation Tier.","“Grandpa Dog knows.”","However, they had not even entered into the cave, when they saw two people walk out from","within. They shouted at Ling Han and the large black dog, “Scram, you are not qualified to","enter!”"]},{"number":4026,"title":"Chapter 4026: Abode","paragraphs":["Chapter 4026: Abode","Ling Han and the large black dog both faltered upon hearing this. What was going on here? There was a restriction on unauthorized entry here?","“Grandpa Dog wants to enter, so what? Can you guys stop me?” the large black dog said with a chuckle.","“If you want to die, then come!” one of them declared disdainfully.","Right now, only Foundation Building Tier cultivators could enter this abode. As fellow Foundation Building Tier cultivators, did they need to be afraid? Moreover, there weren’t just two of them. There were also a large number of people in the abode. If they all came out, each of them could punch this person and dog into smithereens.","“Hehe, Grandpa Dog really doesn’t believe it.” The large black dog whistled, and walked towards the abode. At the same time, he turned around and warned Ling Han, “Little Han, Grandpa Dog will take care of everything here.”","With the large black dog’s personality of bullying the weak and fearing the strong, as well as his fondness of showing off, the present situation was really too suitable for him.","“You’re seeking death!” The two Foundation Building Tier cultivators both humphed and attacked the large black dog at the same time.","However, a Foundation Building Tier cultivator versus a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator... Moreover, one was at the level of the Nine Cauldrons at that. No matter how one looked at it, this would be a tragedy.","The large black dog unleashed his aura lightly. Pa, pa! The two of them instantly collapsed to the ground, feeling as if their hearts were about to jump out of their chests. This was an indescribably agonizing feeling.","“Brat, watch your eyes. Do you think I’m someone you can trifle with?” The large black dog wore a smug expression as he stepped on the two of them.","“Humph, a mere wild dog dares to strut around?” People continuously walked out of the abode. They were all Foundation Building Tier geniuses from various planets.","The large black dog was naturally enraged, and he waved his paw, saying, “Little b*stards, bring it on! Grandpa Dog will teach you a lesson!”","The prodigies all charged over, each of them brandishing their Spirit Tool and unleashing their full power.","“Lie down!” The large black dog unleashed his aura, and under the pressure of the Nine Cauldrons aura, pa, pa, pa, everyone collapsed to the ground. Not a single person could get back up.","This was suppression on the level of being. No matter how much of a prodigy you were, it was unavoidable, unless you had formed the Primitive Celestial Foundation like Ling Han had.","“Y-you’re a Cauldron Forging Tier elite!” With this, those young prodigies could also tell the large black dog’s cultivation level.","“That’s right. Grandpa Dog is a Cauldron Forging Tier elite!” the large black dog said proudly.","“How is this possible!” Those young prodigies were all dumbfounded. By now, only Foundation Building Tier cultivators should be able to enter. How could Cauldron Forging Tiers so quickly come in?","“All of you, hand over what you have found in the abode.” The large black dog wore a ferocious expression, “Behave yourself. If Grandpa Dog discovers that you dare to hide it, I guarantee that you will all suffer.”","All the prodigies shook their heads, and said that this abode was practically poor, and did not have any treasure at all.","The large black dog didn’t believe them, and he started to search them one by one.","“No, this sword is my inherited Spirit Tool!”","“I just bought this Celestial medicine on Galaxy Network.”","“Ah, this celestial technique was bestowed on me not too long ago by my seniors. Give it back to me quickly!”","Everyone exclaimed. This large black dog was really evil. He would snatch whatever valuable item he saw. He was completely like a gangster and a robber combined.","How could anyone possibly take out something that had entered into the large black dog’s pocket?","However, the large black dog shook his head at Ling Han, expressing that he had really not discovered anything that had originated from the ancient times.","“Little Han, it’s possible that we’ve all been tricked this time!” the large black dog said angrily.","F***, they had created such a huge commotion, yet in the end, there was nothing at all. Wasn’t this a joke?","“Yi, you are Ling Han?” Someone recognized Ling Han.","At first, they didn’t think so, because everyone knew that Ling Han had long since advanced into the Core Formation Tier, so how could he possibly come in? However, the large black dog was a Cauldron Forging Tier, and called Ling Han Little Han. Even if they didn’t believe it, they had to believe it.","“Haha, so you’re the supreme prodigy of the North Heavenly Realm?”","“Unfortunately, being targeted by the Battle God Palace, your only fate is death!”","Quite a few people smirked coldly, their animosity towards Ling Han very great.","The large black dog was displeased, and he said coldly to the others, “F***, you bunch of chickens, you actually dare to look down on my Little Han?”","“Hmph, we either come from a Holy Land, or come from a Venerate Tier force. What is there to be afraid of?”","“To be honest, no one has ever been able to live after the Battle God Palace issued a must-kill","order!”","“There’s not much time left for you.”","“North Heavenly Realm is the weakest among the four great Heavenly Realms, after all. Your glory is only short-lived this time, and is about to be beaten back to its original state.”","These people were really arrogant, and very stubborn.","The large black dog was naturally angered. Even a captive was so arrogant now?","It thrashed these people, then tied them up one by one, and said, “Aren’t these guys from extraordinary backgrounds? Sell them to their own clans, that should be worth a lot of","money.”","The prodigies were astonished, and they were all transfixed with shock.","You guys have robbed us quite a bit, and still want to sell us off for money?","This was too black-hearted, wasn’t it?","Ling Han nodded apprehensively, “This is not a bad idea.”","“Grandpa Dog also thinks it’s not bad.”","It asked Ling Han for the Essence Nurturing Gourd, and stuffed these people in one by one. “Brats, consider yourselves lucky to be able to strengthen your souls in this kind of treasured gourd. Shouldn’t I collect a little protection fee from you?”","Then, the large black dog looked towards Ling Han, “Are we just going to leave like this?”","Ling Han shook his head and said, “Since we’re already here, let’s just take a look. Moreover, they didn’t discover anything, but it doesn’t mean that we wouldn’t find anything either.”","“That’s right.”","Ling Han walked into the abode and began to search carefully.","This was an ordinary abode. The difference was that this place had changed the general trend","of heaven and earth. It was like the spirit of heaven and earth, and one could see spring water gushing out, bringing with it a dense Celestial Qi. Merely smelling it would make one’s pores open completely, and make one feel comfortable all over.","Yi?","Judging by the furnishings here, there should be two people living inside the abode, and it was not Divine Rain Venerate and his Dao Apprentice, but rather him and his dao partner, because they were obviously eating, drinking and sleeping together.","However, these two people seemed to have left this place long ago. Ling Han didn’t find any","clothes.","Could it be that this wasn’t the place where Divine Rain Venerate had died, but rather a place where he had once lived?","Just as Ling Han was about to leave, he suddenly faltered.","He had already released his divine sense to stimulate the ley lines, observing this abode from","all directions, and now, he suddenly made a discovery.","“Little Han, what are you standing around for? Let’s go!” the large black dog urged.","Ling Han shook his head, “Wait.”","“Yi, have you discovered something?” The large black dog immediately approached. He knew","Ling Han very well.","Ling Han nodded, “Don’t be anxious.”","He closed his eyes, and his whole mind and spirit became one with this planet. With the planet","as his eyes, he observed the abode, bit by bit, revealing all the details.","Very quickly, a smile appeared at the corners of his lips.","He walked to the side of a cabinet, then moved it away.","“Grandpa Dog has seen this place, but there are no hidden doors behind it,” the large black","dog couldn’t help but say. He didn’t want Ling Han to waste his time.","Ling Han shook his head, “Don’t be impatient.”","He continuously tapped on the wall, and his spiritual power drew on the power of heaven and earth. Multiple formation patterns actually appeared on the wall."]},{"number":4027,"title":"Chapter 4027: Entering","paragraphs":["Chapter 4027: Entering","“F*ck! You can do this?” the large black dog immediately shouted.","It had clearly examined this wall, and there was nothing strange about it. However, in Ling Han’s hands, multiple patterns appeared, so how could it not be shocked?","“This is an entrance that has been concealed by a formation,” Ling Han said. “However, according to my deductions, even if I don’t break through it, this entrance will appear on its own in a very short period of time.”","“The same time that the formation outside dissipates?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han nodded and said, “That’s probably the case.”","The formation of the entire Ziming Mountain seemed to be one and the same. Thus, when the formation enshrouding the outside disappeared, all the mechanisms and restrictions here would also lose their effects.","“Grandpa Dog is here for the inheritance of the Great Emperor!” The large black dog rubbed its paws together, appearing very excited, “In future, Grandpa Dog will also become an Ancestral King or Great Emperor. Mortals, tremble in front of Grandpa Dog!”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “If you ever became an Emperor, that would be a vile character getting his own way. The heavens are really too blind.”","“Go, go, go. Hurry up and break the formation.” The large black dog waved his paws, looking like he couldn’t be bothered to deal with Ling Han.","Very quickly, Ling Han broke through this formation, and a revolving doorway of light appeared on the wall.","“Little Han, will this be dangerous?” the large black dog asked Ling Han.","Ling Han spread out his hands, and asked, “How should I know?”","“Grandpa Dog has a solution.” The large black dog grabbed a person from the Essence Nurturing Gourd, and xiu, threw him into the doorway of light.","Shua, that unlucky guy was thrown in, but there was no terrifying event like his body being crushed by the doorway of light.","“There should be no problem,” the large black dog nodded.","Ling Han laughed, and walked towards the doorway of light. Not only was the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower floating above his head, but even the Starlight Screen had been activated, activating his strongest defense.","He stepped through the doorway of light, and an indescribable power surged out. Xiu, he appeared on a desolate plain.","The person who had been tossed in by the large black dog was lying on the ground, still unconscious.","However, Ling Han looked behind him, and there was no doorway of light.","This was a one-way transmission.","He tried to contact the large black dog, but discovered that this place could not connect to the Galaxy Network.","En, this should be a Mystery Realm that was cut off from the rest of the world.","No wonder Divine Rain Venerate and his dao partner’s change of clothes couldn’t be seen in the abode outside. As it turned out, this place was connected to another space.","Ling Han walked further away, and true enough, after only a while, a large black dog appeared out of thin air.","“Little Han, where is this?” the large black dog exclaimed in shock. “Yi, is this a Mystery Realm?”","“You guessed correctly.” Ling Han nodded, closed his eyes slightly, and began to search the ley lines here. He immediately discovered that there were pitifully few ley lines here, and the Earth Qi here was also incredibly weak.","This place... seemed to be missing something.","As a Formation Grandmaster, Ling Han was sensitive enough to discover that there was something missing in this heaven and earth, but as for what exactly it was, he could not say.","“This must be because my cultivation level is not high enough.”","“And linked to my cultivation level, that can only be the Regulations of heaven and earth.”","“What is missing here should be the Regulations of heaven and earth.”","“Under normal circumstances, how could there be no Regulations of heaven and earth? Thus, it is very possible that this is a small world created by a great elite, so the Regulations are incomplete.”","Just like the White Lotus Mystery Realm. Though the people there cultivated extremely fast, firstly, their lifespans were limited, and secondly, the True Self Tier was their limit, and they could not advance any further.","In terms of cultivation techniques, there was no shortage of high-level cultivation techniques.","Thus, since Spirit Transformation Tier was unable to appear, it could only be assumed that it lacked the corresponding Regulations of heaven and earth.","Ling Han related his deduction to the large black dog, and the large black dog nodded, “Thus, this Mystery Realm must be a small world like that, and that is why the signal to the Galaxy Network is cut off.”","“More or less.”","“Since there’s no turning back now, let’s continue forward?”","“M-hm.”","The large black dog stuffed the person on the ground back into the Essence Nurturing Gourd, then followed Ling Han’s footsteps.","“The energy of heaven and earth here is very weak, so it’s probably impossible for any powerful elites to appear,” the large black dog said as he walked.","“Oh, that’s right. Do you have any chance of attaining Ten Cauldrons?” Ling Han changed the","topic.","“Sigh, it’s hopeless.” The large black dog shook its head, and said, “I’ve already tried for half a year, yet there’s still no hope at all. Little Han, only a freak like you can reach Ten Cauldrons. Grandpa Dog is only so-so, just barely passable, and a Fusion Cauldron from Nine Cauldrons","is enough.”","When the Nine Cauldrons fused together, they would be on the level of Imperial Son and Imperial Daughter, all right? Furthermore, it was not every Imperial Son and Imperial Daughter that could successfully fuse the Nine Cauldrons. This large black dog was really showing off.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “All right. I’ll see if I can help you create the Fusion Cauldron.”","The man and dog walked on this desolate plain, their speed very fast. Merely half an hour later, they had walked out of the desolate plain, and a mountain range appeared ahead of them. It was a continuous chain of mountains, covered by green plants, exuding an exuberant","vitality.","“I can finally see signs of life. Grandpa Dog was almost scared to death. I thought this place was a land of death.” The large black dog patted his chest.","After they had climbed over the mountain, they saw a city appear before their eyes. It was rectangular in shape, and was surrounded by city walls. Furthermore, there was also a moat of water outside the city walls, but what flowed in the river was no ordinary river water, but","rather blue lightning.","This was very awesome, wasn’t it? There was actually a river comprised of lightning? “Little Han, this place doesn’t seem simple. There might be a local tyrant,” the large black","dog said.","“Are you comparing yourself to a powerful dragon?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Wrong, we are ferocious dragons crossing the river, capable of toppling mountains and overturning seas,” the large black dog boasted shamelessly.","Ling Han shook his head, and took the lead. He had already gained a preliminary grasp of the ley lines here. Though the Earth Qi was weak, which would greatly decrease his mobility, it","could still be used in the end.","However, there were pitifully few ley lines here, only a dozen over. This greatly limited Ling Han’s “vision”, because his divine sense also had to be extended through the ley lines. Thus, he was also seriously lacking in understanding of this Mystery Realm. Otherwise, with a sweep of his divine sense, the general structure of a planet should be in his mind.","“Wait for Grandpa Dog!” The large black dog hurriedly followed behind him.","Very soon, they arrived at the city gates. There was a suspension bridge laid down here, and they could safely pass over the lightning river. They could clearly see that the power of lightning would occasionally soar into the skies with a terrifying momentum. However, neither Ling Han nor the large black dog took this to heart. Its might was only that","of Foundation Building Tier, so even if they entered the river, they could completely treat it","as a bath.","There were guards at the city gates, and there were quite a number of them.","“Stop!” Immediately, a soldier stretched out a hand towards them, and shouted loudly.","With these words, Ling Han’s heart calmed considerably.","It was human language, and he could understand. Ling Han stopped as instructed, appearing to be very cooperative.","“Entering the city will cost ten Dao Commands,” the soldier said.","Yi, Dao Commands?","With Ling Han’s intelligence, he naturally could immediately guess that the Dao Commands","was the currency of this place. However, he had just arrived here, so where would he get this","thing?"]},{"number":4028,"title":"Chapter 4028: Greed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4028: Greed","Ling Han smiled, “This brother, you see, I am just a herb gatherer. I have just gone out and spent all my Dao Commands, so how about I use herbs as compensation?”","“Sure,” the soldier said.","Ling Han pretended to fumble around in his luggage, yet through his Spatial Tool, he found a Celestial medicine of the lowest level. Then, he took it out.","It could not be helped. With the height he was at now, the medicinal ingredients that he could store away were naturally Celestial medicines.","“Godly medicine!” The moment Ling Han took out the Celestial medicine, the soldier’s eyes almost popped out of his head.","“What!”","When the other soldiers heard the news, they all ran over. When they saw the medicinal herb that was exuding a soft red light in Ling Han’s hand, they could no longer maintain their composure.","This Celestial medicine was really very ordinary. It was left over from when Ling Han had concocted alchemical pills previously, and could not possibly be used in future. However, he had obviously underestimated the cultivation level of this place. It should be known that these soldiers were only Mystery Realm Tiers, and had not set foot on the Celestial Path. How could they not be shocked when they saw the Celestial medicine?","Ling Han gritted his teeth. He had thought that he had taken out an ordinary Celestial medicine, but in the end, these people’s level was too low, and they had all been shocked silly.","Forget it. In any case, it was not valuable to him, so he wouldn’t feel heartache even if he gave it away.","“Captain!”","“Captain!”","“Captain Qin!”","The soldiers all stepped aside, and then a middle-aged man with a large belly walked over. He looked to be in his forties, and was also a Mystery Realm Tier.","This captain was very good at putting on airs. As he walked, he swayed back and forth, appearing very overbearing.","Captain Qin snatched the Celestial medicine from the hands of the soldier. His eyes swept over it, and a greedy expression instantly appeared on his round, fat face. Then, he looked towards Ling Han, “How could such an ordinary medicinal herb be enough? At least ten!”","Hiss, when the soldiers heard this, they all shook their heads secretly. Looks like their captain was going to screw someone over again.","It could not be helped. Who asked his daughter to marry into such a good family? Even if he was a tyrant, so what? No one could deal with him.","Ling Han smiled. Looks like he had taken out this Celestial medicine too easily. Naturally, others would think that he had even more Celestial medicines on him, and their quality was even higher.","This was called having already revealed his wealth. Furthermore, Ling Han hadn’t revealed any background, so who else would they rip off if not a fat sheep like him?","“F***, you actually dare to scam us?” The large black dog immediately jumped up, “It has only ever been Grandpa Dog that would be slaughtering others. A mere Mystery Realm Tier like you dares to be insolent in front of Grandpa Dog?”","“Demonic, Demonic Beast!” Captain Qin’s expression changed drastically, and he took a few steps back. There was a look of shock on his face, and the other soldiers didn’t look any better. They all looked terrified.","Yi, was that really necessary?","The large black dog stood up on his hind legs, and asked, “What is it? Do you want to fight?” Captain Qin laughed loudly, and said, “Brat, you actually dare to collude with a Demonic Beast? Even if a Heavenly King comes, he won’t be able to save you!” In his eyes, this was a chance, and he could use this opportunity to apprehend Ling Han and confiscate all his property.","Couldn’t the people here be associated with Demonic Beasts?","“Guards, apprehend this human and demon pair!” Captain Qin retreated on his own, one hand pointing at Ling Han, while the other hand gripped tightly onto the Celestial medicine.","Although the soldiers were afraid of the large black dog, a Demonic Beast, they didn’t dare to retreat. They all raised their weapons and aimed them at Ling Han and the large black dog.","To be more precise, most of the weapons were targeted at the large black dog, and thought that it was more dangerous.","The people here seemed to have an extraordinary fear and disgust towards Demonic Beasts. The large black dog stood on his hind legs, hands on his hips, “Come on then. Grandpa Dog isn’t afraid of trash like you.”","It would definitely not miss out on a place where it could show off.","“Go, charge!” Captain Qin had already retreated to a place that he thought was safe enough, and began to order around again.","The soldiers were exasperated, so they could only grit their teeth and charge over. However, the large black dog merely sent a palm strike over, and pa, pa, pa, everyone collapsed to the ground, groaning and moaning.","Of course, this was because the large black dog had held back. Otherwise, how could it be that a Nine Cauldrons wouldn’t have been able to insta-kill a bunch of Mystery Realm Tiers?","Captain Qin was almost scared out of his wits by this scene. As he ran into the city, he shouted loudly, “Beast attack! Beast attack! The Demonic Beast is here!”","One could not help but be impressed. Even in such a state of fright, his hand was still tightly gripping onto that Celestial medicine, as if he would not let go even if he died.","Ling Han smiled, and his Spiritual Power transformed into a large hand that grabbed Captain Qin by force. Captain Qin’s legs were still moving rapidly, but his figure was retreating. Captain Qin was scared out of his wits, and his face became as white as a sheet.","“Hand it over!” The large black dog snatched the Celestial medicine back, and tossed it over to Ling Han.","“Give me back my Celestial medicine!” Captain Qin screamed, brandishing his claws, wanting to fight Ling Han to the death.","It was really rare to see someone who was so greedy that he was not afraid of death.","“Do you know who I am?” His eyes were red, as he shouted at Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled, “I really don’t know.”","“I am Qin Botao, and my son-in-law is Liu Long!” Captain Qin called out loudly. “Liu Long, do you know that he is the supreme prodigy of the Liu Clan, and has already been bestowed the title of Fifth Grade Guard by His Majesty, the Emperor!”","The large black dog approached, and examined Qin Botao closely. Then, he said to Ling Han, “With how this guy looks like, how good-looking can his daughter be? This Liu Long shouldn’t be all that impressive either, right?”","“Pei, my daughter is as beautiful as a celestial maiden!” Qin Botao hurriedly argued.","Ling Han and the large black dog exchanged a glance before shaking their heads in unison.","The large black dog added, “If your daughter is really as beautiful as a celestial maiden, then she must be the child of the old man next door.”","F***, how could a demonic dog like you be so vicious?","Qin Botao trembled in anger. In truth, he would also occasionally mull over how he could give birth to such a beautiful daughter with his appearance. He could only console himself that his child looked like her mother.","“Humph, a demon and a Demonic Beast actually dare to invade our Golden Fetus City!” A voice filled with a murderous aura rang out, and a man in full armor also strode out. There were Celestial Qi entwined around him, making him appear incredibly handsome. “Son-in-law, save me! Save me!” When Qin Botao saw this, he hurriedly waved his hand and","called out.","This man was none other than Liu Long, a well-known prodigy of martial arts. In fact, he had even gained the attention of the sovereign of the Galewind Nation, and bestowed the title of Fifth Grade City Guard on him.","For a young man who was only twenty-four or twenty-five years old, this was an honor.","Liu Long showed a hint of disgust. Towards his beautiful wife, he really liked her, but towards this money-grubbing, materialistic father-in-law, he absolutely detested him.","“Let him go!” he said coldly.","“What if I don’t?” The large black dog bared its teeth and asked.","“Then you can all die with him!” Liu Longhu said balefully.","“F***, this son-in-law is really two-faced.” The large black dog patted Qin Botao, “This son-in-law of yours is clearly using provocation tactics, wanting us to kill you in a fit of anger! Sigh, he probably has his eye on your wife, and wants to take in both mother and daughter. Tsk, tsk, tsk, too vulgar!”"]},{"number":4029,"title":"Chapter 4029: Galewind Nation","paragraphs":["Chapter 4029: Galewind Nation","Qin Botao thought about it. This son-in-law really had the suspicion of using someone else to do his dirty work.","He knew that Liu Long had always disliked him, but no matter what, he was still Liu Long’s father-in-law. His thoughts were really too vicious, weren’t they?","Meanwhile, Liu Long’s expression changed drastically. He had indeed thought of using someone else to do his dirty work, but now that the large black dog had exposed him in public like this, he naturally couldn’t bring himself to accept it.","“You’re seeking death!” He charged over, Celestial Qi overflowing from all over his body, like a god that had descended into the mortal world.","Neither Ling Han nor the large black dog took it to heart, because Liu Long had only just reached the Foundation Building Tier.","A cold smile tugged at the corners of Liu Long’s lips. ‘Humph, you actually dare to look down on me? Then I’ll kill all of you with a single strike. As for this father-in-law of mine, I’ll naturally kill him as well. My excuse is also very open and aboveboard. It’s inevitable that there will be accidental injuries.’","Qin Botao didn’t dare to look anymore. He closed his eyes tightly.","Pa, he suddenly heard a heavy sound, as if something heavy had fallen.","He opened his eyes, yet shockingly discovered that Liu Long was actually kneeling on the ground.","What was going on here?","In truth, Liu Long was even more stunned than he was.","He delivered a great blow, but all of a sudden, an indescribable fear rose up in him. Then, he knelt on the ground, completely baffled.","Was this because of the man in front of him?","He raised his head to look at Ling Han, only to see that Ling Han was about the same age as him. In fact, Ling Han was even younger than him. How could he possess such unfathomable strength that he couldn’t even resist?","This was absolutely unbelievable.","“How dare you, to actually dare insult the prized son of our Liu Clan!” A loud shout rang out, and an old man rode a weapon over. With a xiu, his figure descended. He looked to be quite old, his face covered with a white beard, and even his hair was greyish white.","This was the strongest elite of the Liu Clan. His name was Liu Kui, and he had already advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier.","However, his lifespan was also nearing its end. It wasn’t easy for him to wait until a prodigy appeared in his clan that had stepped onto the Celestial Path. This gave the Liu Clan hope of having a successor. At that time, he could also enjoy life in peace and rest easy on his way to the afterlife.","But who would have expected that there would be such a calamity today? A Demonic Beast actually brought a villain with it, and trampled all over the prodigy of the Liu Clan.","However, the large black dog ignored him. Instead, he looked at Qin Botao, and said, “Old brother, what do you say we do with this brat?”","Qin Botao’s expression was filled with awkwardness. Just now, his son-in-law had wanted to get rid of him as well. With his cold-blooded nature, he naturally wanted nothing more than to get rid of him as well. However, the reason why he could have his current status was completely because of the Liu Clan and Liu Long. Without this son-in-law, what was he worth?","“Lord Demonic Dog, please be magnanimous and spare me and my son-in-law,” he hurriedly said with a smile.","“Old Qin, you really don’t have any backbone at all.” The large black dog shook his head, “Sigh, if worse comes to worst, you can just start all over again. You are still young. Even if you want to have another beautiful daughter, it would be completely in time. Furthermore, your daughter can just remarry.”","Both Qin Botao and Liu Long’s faces turned green. This damn dog’s mouth was really too despicable, wasn’t it?","“Let him go!” Liu Kui shouted with forced patience. If it was not for the fact that Liu Long was still in Ling Han’s hands, he would have made a move long ago.","“What if I don’t?” The large black dog wouldn’t lose to anyone verbally.","Shua, Liu Kui immediately charged towards the large black dog. He did not dare to touch Ling Han, because he was afraid of harming Liu Long. However, the large black dog did not have any hostages in his hands. Furthermore, he could also capture the large black dog, and use him as hostage, to trade with Ling Han for Liu Long.","The older one was, the wiser they were. He knew that he definitely could not allow Ling Han to lead him by the nose.","“You actually dare to make a move on Grandpa Dog? Where did you get such courage from?” The large black dog humphed. Boom! The aura of Nine Cauldrons exploded.","Pa!","Instantly, Liu Kui’s body shook, and he fell directly onto the ground.","He was only an Earth Cauldron, and was too far away from Nine Cauldrons. Not only could he not withstand a single blow, he was unable to withstand merely the aura alone.","At this, whether it was Liu Kui, Liu Long or Qin Botao, their expressions all changed drastically. Not good, this demonic dog’s strength was heaven-defyingly strong. There was no one in Golden Fetus City that could subdue it, and they had to seek help from the Imperial Capital.","“Come, Grandpa Dog will ask a question, and you all have to answer. Otherwise, don’t blame Grandpa Dog for being impolite. I will cut off your manhoods and feed them to others!” The large black dog threatened fiercely.","Liu Kui and the others were already completely intimidated, and nodded numbly.","The large black dog started to ask questions. They were all about the Mystery Realm, such as the distribution of forces, the overall level of cultivation of the Mystery Realm, and whether there were any treasures.","Liu Kui and the others said everything they knew.","This Mystery Realm had not been named by the natives. However, the territory occupied by humans was called the Galewind Nation, and correspondingly, there was the territory ruled by the Demonic Beasts. This was not a unified kingdom, but was rather divided into a dozen over scattered forces.","However, every large Demonic Beast led a force that was not inferior to the Human Race. Thus, the situation of the Human Race was not very good. They could only hide in the city, and did not dare to barge into the territory of the Demonic Beasts at all.","Because Demonic Beasts were aggressive, Demonic Beasts would often attack the territory of humans, attempting to conquer the territory of humans, reducing humans to slaves and rations. However, after so many years, humans had always stood firm, which was proof of","their toughness.","In this place, the strongest was the True Self Tier. Whether it was humans or Demonic Beasts, none of them could surpass this barrier.","The large black dog sent a message through divine sense to Ling Han, saying, “Little Han, do you think there’s an Ancestral King inheritance here?”","Ling Han frowned upon seeing this. Although this was a small world, its territory was extremely vast. If he wanted to search this whole place, perhaps 10,000 years wouldn’t be","enough.","“If Divine Rain Venerate really left behind an inheritance, then there would definitely be clues,” he said slowly.","“Then should we go to the Imperial Capital now?” the large black dog asked.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded.","“Then what about these people?”","“Just minor characters, there’s no need to pay attention to them.”","“All right.”","The large black dog ransacked all three of them. The currency circulating here was Dao Commands, but it was actually a currency forged from a rare metal. It was extremely difficult to forge, because there was a clear cost. The fake currency created were actually also worth a","lot of money.","He found a total of over 30,000 Dao Commands on the three of them. The majority came from Liu Kui, and they were in notes of 5,000. He had a total of six.","The large black dog waved his paw, and said, “Let’s go, Little Han. Grandpa Dog will treat you.”","Ling Han laughed loudly, and left with the large black dog.","By now, they had a comprehensive understanding of the Galewind Nation, so they naturally knew the way to the Imperial Capital. However, Demonic Beasts ran rampant on their way, launching attacks at them at the drop of a hat, not giving the large black dog any face at all.","It could not be helped. The man and dog walking together was practically in a dilemma. They were both seen as traitors by the humans, yet were not accepted by the Demon Race either.","Thankfully, they were strong enough, and after spending half a day’s time, they had also arrived at the imperial city of the Galewind Nation.","The large black dog transformed into a sturdy man. Right now, he didn’t want to cause any","trouble either.","The two “people” arrived at the city gates together, and were just about to hand over their coins to enter into the city, when a shield of light descended, landing on the large black dog.","Instantly, the large black dog’s true form appeared."]},{"number":4030,"title":"Chapter 4030: Identity Revealed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4030: Identity Revealed","The large black dog appeared in its true form, and instantly, a commotion broke out at the city gates.","In this Mystery Realm, humans and Demon Race were completely incompatible like fire and water. Whenever they met, it was as if they were meeting an enemy that had killed their father. Thus, the sudden appearance of a demonic dog at the city gates of the Imperial Capital was naturally going to cause chaos.","Was the Demon Race about to attack?","Everyone was in danger. Though the Demonic Beasts were sent retreating every time they invaded, and were unable to eliminate the human race, they had indeed caused massive damage. Thus, everyone was traumatized, and the first reaction they had when they saw the Demonic Beasts was there was going to be another invasion.","“Enemy attack!”","“Full alert!”","“Activate the great formation!”","There was an uproar, and it could not be resolved.","Ling Han looked upwards of the city gates. There was a mirror hanging there, and it was precisely this mirror that had shot out light, enshrouding the large black dog. It was because of this that the large black dog had revealed its true form.","This should be a Spirit Tool, possessing the ability to see through falsehoods.","Meanwhile, the large black dog was extremely innocent. He had only wanted to sneak into the city, and had completely no intention of invading. And now, he had become the public enemy? In just a short while, a large number of soldiers had already rushed out of the city, all of them holding crossbows. Then, they aimed at the large black dog.","“Hehe, Grandpa Dog bears no malice. Don’t be rash.” The large black dog stood on his hind legs, and smiled at the people around him.","It would have been fine if it had not smiled. He would just be an ordinary demonic dog, but this smile was filled with a despicable intent, causing one to involuntarily want to pummel it. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Suddenly, a sky full of arrows shot towards the large black dog.","“F***, who did Grandpa Dog offend?” The large black dog hurriedly dodged. Though these soldiers were very ordinary, the arrows they used were extraordinary arrows, which made even it feel threatened.","The large black dog used the Imminent Skyline, and its speed even surpassed the average Core Formation Tier cultivator. Naturally, not a single arrow hit it.","“I already said that Grandpa Dog has no malicious intent. If anyone dares to shoot Grandpa Dog again, Grandpa Dog will not be reserved!” the large black dog declared angrily.","However, no one paid any heed to it, and another barrage of arrows that filled the skies arrived.","“Grandpa Dog is angered now!” the large black dog roared. It was about to launch a counterattack.","Ling Han opened his mouth, and said, “Everyone, this is a demonic dog that I have raised. It will not hurt anyone.”","The large black dog almost bit him. This guy actually dared to take advantage of him. He was too despicable. However, they had come for the Great Emperor’s inheritance, and they were completely clueless now. Thus, it was best not to cause trouble, so that they could slowly investigate.","Thus, the large black dog still held back.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! However, not only did the rain of arrows not stop, some arrows even shot towards Ling Han.","Ling Han frowned. He stretched out a hand and pressed down. The rain of arrows that shot over all stopped, and then fell simultaneously onto the ground.","Even if these arrows were fired through a Spirit Tool, what level could an arrow fired by a Spirit Tool fired by a Mystery Realm Tier who had not yet entered the Celestial Path reach? With how strong his battle prowess was, he was naturally able to press them down easily.","This time, it also caused those soldiers to lose their wits in shock, and involuntarily, lowered the crossbow in their hands.","This was too shocking. Was he still human?","“Humph, are you also a member of the Demon Race in disguise?” Xiu, a person arrived in midair. It was a man in his thirties, dressed in military attire, appearing to be extraordinarily heroic.","“Seven Winds Marquis!”","“Greetings, Lord Marquis!”","Those soldiers hurriedly knelt, their expressions extremely respectful.","The Seven Winds Marquis, Xu Liang, was the Marquis of the Galewind Nation. His cultivation level was at the Core Formation Tier, and he stood in the second tier of cultivation here. It could be said that he was quite extraordinary.","Xu Liang stood with his hands clasped behind his back, “You two members of Demon Race are so bold, to actually want to sneak into the city! Hehe, your dog eyes are really blind. Don’t you know what kind of place this is?”","These words instantly angered the large black dog. What did he mean by ‘dog eyes are really blind’?","You clearly saw Grandpa Dog, yet still dare to deliberately say ‘dog eyes’. What kind of provocation was this?","“Shorty, are you seeking death?!” the large black dog said with a grimace.","Xu Liang’s appearance was average, but his shortcoming was that he was a little short. This was also something that he was more wary of, and disliked others mentioning his height the","most.","A furious expression appeared on his face, and he stretched out a hand to grab the large black dog. His mystical power condensed into a large green hand that was several meters tall. It was covered densely with seals, and it was very powerful.","“Lord Marquis is mighty!” All the soldiers immediately cheered, cheering him on.","The large black dog didn’t dare to face it head-on. Although it was a Nine Cauldrons, Nine Cauldrons couldn’t possibly match the early stage of the Core Formation Tier, what more when Xu Liang was in the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, which was not just a little bit stronger than it.","“Little Han, hurry up and help me!” It hurriedly used Imminent Skyline, dodging this attack. Xu Liang delivered another blow. This time, Ling Han did not just sit by and watch. Instead, he moved as well, and with a light pat, dispersed this blow from Xu Liang.","This caused Xu Liang to frown. This demon was extraordinary.","“Which Demon Race are you from?” he shouted. He had to find out which Demon Race the other party came from. Only then would he be able to know which Demon Race might be invading, so that he could prepare his defenses in advance.","Ling Han shook his head and said, “I’ve already said this before. I’m a human.”","“Haha!” Regarding this, Xu Liang merely smirked coldly.","“Little Han, this guy can’t be persuaded at all. Just move and apprehend him,” the large black","dog advised.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded.","This conversation naturally enraged Xu Liang. F***, you guys are really looking down on him, the Seven Winds Marquis, too much, aren’t you?","He was in the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, and the aura that seeped out from Ling Han was only in the early stage of the Core Formation Tier. There was a gap of a whole two minor levels between the two of them, and it was practically a one-sided suppression. “Haha, how preposterous!” he said coldly. With a flash, he charged towards Ling Han.","Ling Han cracked a smile, and said softly, “Kneel!”","Pa, Xu Liang’s aura instantly vanished completely, and his whole person fell from midair. His legs knelt on the ground, releasing a heavy, muffled sound. It was a solid sound.","At first, those soldiers were still cheering for Xu Liang, but this scene had happened too suddenly. A great many people could not stop at all, and were still shouting there. In the end,","it was as if they were cheering for Ling Han.","This!","The dignified late stage Core Formation Tier elite was actually dealt with by Ling Han before","he could even make a single move?","This Demon Race was too terrifying.","The True Self Tier, it must be the True Self Tier!","“Humph, insolent Demonic Beast, you actually dare to behave atrociously in my Imperial","Capital!” Xiu, another figure streaked through the air and arrived. He was obviously much stronger than Xu Liang. There were Regulations entwined around him, turning into multiple","divine chains of order.","The True Self Tier.","Ling Han thought to himself. He was also very curious. With his current abilities, how many moves could he take from a True Self Tier elite?","It was impossible to match him, but he had the barrage of murderous aura and Star Steps, which allowed him to have the ability to contend with the True Self Tier.","“Sea City King!” Instantly, all the soldiers cheered loudly, their expressions incredibly","fanatical.","Sea City King, Qian Lang, the ultimate elite of the True Self Tier!","Qian Lang did not say another word, and immediately delivered a palm strike towards Ling Han. Mystical Power manifested, turning into a bronze sledgehammer. The body of the sledgehammer was entwined with dense Regulations, which was boundlessly terrifying.","The murderous aura charged forwards!","With a thought from Ling Han, his attack arrived first."]},{"number":4031,"title":"Chapter 4031: The legend of opening the sky","paragraphs":["Chapter 4031: The legend of opening the sky","The murderous aura attack was divine sense-level, and with a single thought, the attack would arrive.","Qian Lang instantly felt a pain in his head, and felt as if a foreign divine sense was invading, wanting to overturn his mind, causing extreme damage.","He hurriedly went to suppress it. In this way, the attack he delivered immediately slanted, and lost its accuracy.","Boom! This attack landed, yet it didn’t even touch a single hair on Ling Han’s head.","What!","Qian Lang was shocked. Was this guy really a Core Formation Tier cultivator? He could actually affect him? Then if he advanced into the True Self Tier, wouldn’t he be unable to survive even a single move from him?","He swept an eye over Xu Liang, who was kneeling on the ground, and actually gave an ‘oh’ in his heart. No wonder this person had knelt down. It was not because he was cowardly and weak, and had surrendered to the Demon Race, but rather his divine sense had been affected, and he had no choice.","Terrifying, what kind of Demonic Beast was this?","Could it be that it was the legendary Divine Beast, and that was why it had such might? However, humph!","No matter what, he was only a Core Formation Tier cultivator, which was good. He had to quickly get rid of him while he was still weak. Otherwise, he would definitely become a great problem in the future.","Qian Lang moved again, stretching out his right hand. Boom, this time, he was really going all out. Regulations materialized, turning into multiple divine chains of order that shot towards Ling Han.","This was formed from Regulations, and could be claimed to be indestructible. If he was hit head-on, his physical body would definitely be directly pierced through, and then he would be tied up by the divine chains, unable to escape.","Ling Han immediately turned around. Using the Imminent Skyline, he grabbed the large black dog and started to flee.","Xiu, in an instant, he had already disappeared without a trace.","Yi?","Qian Lang couldn’t help but be startled. He had never imagined that Ling Han and the large black dog would come to the Imperial Capital so arrogantly, and actually run off just like that.","He chased for a few steps before immediately stopping.","He could not give chase. What if this was a trap that the Demon Race had dug out for him? Then, if he gave chase, that would be equivalent to falling into a trap.","“Your Highness is mighty, Your Highness is domineering!” All the soldiers did not know of Qian Lang’s reservations. They only saw that Qian Lang had chased off the “two” members of the Demon Race, so they naturally raised their weapons and shouted in unison.","Qian Lang showed an expression of pride, as if everything was as it should be, but internally, an alarm bell rang. Just who exactly was that member from the Demon Race that had not revealed his true form? His Spiritual Power was too terrifying, that even he felt pressured.","It could be said that in terms of pure Spiritual Power, he was definitely no match.","Ling Han brought the large black dog with him and fled into the distance. If there was no need, he had no wish to show off his Star Steps. This was his trump card – the location of the Imperial Capital just happened to be one of the few ley lines exits in this place.","“Damn it, why is there a Demonic Mirror hanging at the city gates!” The large black dog cursed. If it was not for that thing causing trouble, he and Ling Han would have long since snuck into the city, so how could they have fled?","“It’s all right. Later, I’ll just sneak in alone.” Ling Han smiled. He didn’t know where the inheritance of Divine Rain Venerate was, so he had only wanted to enter the city to scout around and see if there were any clues.","“All right. Be careful, brat.” The large black dog nodded.","Ling Han changed his appearance and soul fluctuations, and returned to the city gates of the Imperial City. Because the matter of the Demonic Beast wanting to sneak into the city had just happened, the inspection here was considerably stricter now.","However, this did not have any effect on Ling Han. He was a human in the first place, and under the effects of the Soul Forming Technique, the fluctuation of his soul was completely different. Unless it was someone Sect Master-level and above, he would not be able to sense anything off.","After paying the entrance fee into the city, he entered into the Imperial Capital. First, he found an inn to stay in. Then, he used the hide of the Void Beast as cover, and quietly entered into the Imperial Palace to search for clues.","Listening to the discussions of the people in the palace, they were either discussing which Imperial Prince would inherit the throne, or discussing the threat of the Demonic Beasts. There was no mention of Divine Rain Venerate’s inheritance, what more the Ancestral King’s inheritance.","However, Ling Han heard someone grumble that it had something to do with “opening the sky”.","Yi, this small world giant could still “soar”?","Obviously not. This wasn’t the Genesis World.","Ling Han entered the Imperial History Pavilion. This place was heavily guarded, and aside from the core members of the Imperial Family, even the empress and the Imperial Princes were not qualified to enter.","What secrets were hidden here?","Ling Han took a look. It was nothing more than some cultivation techniques and martial arts techniques, but there was nothing especially profound. There was also a chronicle about this Mystery Realm.","This piqued Ling Han’s interest, and he immediately started to flip through the book.","After reading it once, Ling Han couldn’t help but murmur, “Divine Rain Venerate, are you that kind of person?”","In this historical record, the origins of this Mystery Realm were recorded in detail.","Many years ago, Divine Rain Venerate had fallen in love with a woman called Bai Nanzhen, and began an intense courtship. However, Bai Nanzhen already had a lover, so she chose to resolutely reject Divine Rain Venerate’s courtship.","Divine Rain Venerate flew into a rage out of humiliation, and split off the Bai Clan along with a large area from the great world, forming a small world independent of the heaven and earth.","It was unknown whether he was deliberately toying with the members of the Bai Clan, but Divine Rain Venerate had left behind a hatchet that could open the sky. Whoever could brandish this hatchet would be able to cut open the small world and return to the great world. However, after so many years, there was no one that could hold up this axe that opened the sky. Naturally, they were unable to break through the barrier, and have this Mystery Realm return to the great world.","Thus, it was extremely likely that Divine Rain Venerate was deliberately toying around with them, giving them false hope.","Ling Han searched for several days in the Imperial Palace, but did not find the so-called Sky Opening Axe. He exited the Imperial Palace and walked among the crowds, as if he was a","mortal.","He made some queries, and discovered that the common people had no doubts about the world they were in. They lived and died here, and their lives were ordinary and fulfilling. They had no intention of exploring the world outside the Galewind Nation.","In truth, since they were besieged by Demonic Beasts, they did not have that kind of ability","even if they did.","However, the common people haven’t even heard about Divine Rain Venerate and the Sky Opening Axe. This made Ling Han feel very strange. If they wanted to escape, shouldn’t they mobilize the entire population, and stimulate more people to work hard? Who knows, a person that could wield the Sky Opening Axe might really emerge.","After staying in the Imperial Capital for nine days, Ling Han finally left to find the large black","dog.","He related the matter, and the large black dog was also slightly dazed.","Had they been tricked into coming here?","There was no way back now, so how were they supposed to leave this Mystery Realm?","“This Divine Rain Venerate is really too much. If he likes her, he could have just snatched her back directly, but he actually imprisoned her. What hardcore tastes!” The large black dog mocked, “Little Han, we won’t be trapped here, right?”","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “That’s not the case. If we don’t come out for a long time, the Nine Mountains Venerate will definitely act. Since this Mystery Realm was created by a Venerate Tier, with the Nine Mountains Venerate’s power, it shouldn’t be a problem for him","to bring us out of here.”","“True.” The large black dog breathed a sigh of relief. At least, he didn’t have to worry about being trapped here forever.","“Since we’re free anyway, Little Han, come and help Grandpa Dog with the Fusion Cauldron.”"]},{"number":4032,"title":"Chapter 4032: The large black creates a Fusion Cauldron","paragraphs":["Chapter 4032: The large black creates a Fusion Cauldron","The large black dog had already cultivated Nine Cauldrons to its limit, and he had no hope of forming Ten Cauldrons either. Thus, if he didn’t fuse the Nine Cauldrons now, there was no point in dragging things out either.","Ling Han nodded. In any case, he didn’t have any ideas for the moment. He couldn’t find the way out, nor did he have any clues about Divine Rain Venerate’s inheritance. Since he had nothing to do, he might as well help the large black dog complete the Fusion Cauldron first. The man and dog began to experiment. This was undoubtedly incredibly difficult.","Even among the Imperial Clans, they would need to mobilize the Imperial Weapon to help shatter the Celestial Cauldrons with the Imperial Weapon, and there were very few who succeeded. It was not every Imperial Son and Imperial Daughter that could succeed.","Ling Han had the large black dog prepare on his own first. When he reached a certain extent, he would make his move. Weng, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower appeared from his mind, enshrouding the large black dog’s head.","Why was it that while the Imperial Clan could help others join the Fusion Cauldron, the Holy Land couldn’t?","The difference lay in the Imperial Weapon!","However, to say nothing of the Saint Tool, even the precious tool of a Venerate Tier could easily shatter the Celestial Cauldrons – even tit was a Primitive Celestial Cauldron, that was not enough in front of Venerate Tier-level power.","Then why was a Verate Tier-level precious tool, or Saint Tool unable to help create the Fusion Fuldron and only the Imperial Weapon could?","It could only mean one thing, and that was the extraordinary nature of the Imperial Weapon itself.","In terms of might, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower in Ling Han’s hands was only on the level of theCore Formation Tier and only a Three Star Celestial Tool. At most, it was only on the level of kings and overlords among Three Star Spirit Tools. There was definitely still a gap between it and the level of a Four Star Celestial Tool.","However, what was the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower made of?","Origin Gold!","Not only was it number one in the world, but it was also one of the strongest in the highest grade. Thus, Ling Han believed that using the unique trait of the Origin Gold, it may be possible to help the large black dog create his Fusion Cauldron.","If he succeeded, he would be able to help the empress, Hu Niu, Lin Luo, and the others combine the Fusion Cauldron, and he alone would be equivalent to an Imperial Clan.","Thus, this attempt was extremely important.","Weng, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower poured down Primal Chaos Qi, and a supreme pressure enshrouded. That was the might of the Origin Gold itself.","“Old Black, let’s begin!” Ling Han shouted through divine sense.","“Come at me!” the large black dog roared.","Boom!","The large black dog took the initiative to stimulate the nine Celestial Cauldrons in his body to collide with each other. Because it was an odd number, they could not correspond to each other. They could only engage in a chaotic battle. Peng, peng, peng!","The Primal Chaos Qi entered into the large black dog’s mind, forming a layer of protection, preventing the ripples caused by the Celestial Cauldrons’ collision from destroying the mind. Otherwise, it would not be a Fusion Cauldron, but rather death.","It was not enough!","Though the Primal Chaos Qi was awesome, he kept feeling like there was something missing, and could not stop all the shockwaves. One after another, shockwaves surged out, causing the large black dog to grunt repeatedly, and bleed from all his apertures.","After Ling Han frowned, he immediately stimulated the life force in the dimensions in his body to help the large black dog.","In the past, he had used this move himself, but this was the first time he had used it to help others.","It was effective!","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. When the power of living beings surged into the large black dog’s mind, a wall of life was immediately built, blocking all the shockwaves. However, this was also extremely taxing on the power of living beings.","“Hurry!” “Hurry!” “Hurry!”","The large black dog clearly knew this as well, and continued to shatter the Celestial Cauldrons. Kuang, kuang, kuang! One after another, cracks appeared on the Celestial Cauldrons, and then they began to shatter.","Finally, the nine Celestial Cauldrons all shattered, but they varied in size. Some shards were as big as one fifth of the original Celestial Cauldron, while some were only ten thousandth.","At this time, the large black dog was already unable to continue, and Ling Han’s life force was also close to exhaustion.","Fusion Cauldron!","The large black dog ignored everything, and used a larger fragment as the core. Then, he drew all the shards over, and combined them to forge a Celestial Cauldron.","Because the Celestial Cauldron had not been completely shattered, reconstructing it was also filled with great difficulty. The large black dog had to work a little bit harder to fuse the only Celestial Cauldron.","However, when the Nine Cauldrons became one, they would not be able to cultivate a Mystical Power like Ling Han’s Mystical Power, which could absorb attacks. The Celestial Cauldron did not have the mark of the Divine Beasts. This was merely a step forward, and increased in","power.","Of course, this step was large enough to allow the large black dog to possess the battle prowess of a one or even two Heavens.","Meanwhile, Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief. Next, it could only depend on the large black dog.","He felt like his whole person was about to collapse, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower also seemed to have something taken away from it, needing a considerable amount of","time to recover.","After all, this was helping another create a Fusion Cauldron. Even the Imperial Clan would only be able to nurture one or two such prodigies in each generation. Thus, it was not surprising that this would expend a lot of energy.","Ling Han rested for two days, recovering to his prime condition.","The large black dog was still in deep seclusion. By the looks of it, he still needed some time before he could successfully createthe Celestial Cauldron. Ling Han pondered for a moment, but still didn’t act on his own volition. Instead, he remained by the large black dog’s side as a","protector.","He wasn’t idle, either. He had been cultivating all this while. He had already cultivated to the end of the early stage of the Core Formation Tier, and was just a little bit away from advancing into the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier. However, he was just that little","bit away.","Ling Han knew that this was because his cultivation level had increased too quickly, and required a certain amount of time to accumulate. Thus, he was not in a rush, and merely stabilized his foundations. The more solid his foundations were, the higher he would reach when he definitely broke through.","“At present, merely in terms of raw power, I have reached Tenth Heaven. The majority of Core Formation Tier elites would not be able to withstand a single punch from me.”","“However, if I encounter those guys ranked in the top ten, merely the suppression of the Primal Chaos Celestial Core would not be enough for me to win. I would have to use the","murderous aura to barrage them.”","The barrage of murderous aura now was too terrifying. It couldn’t be helped. Who asked Ling Han’s soul strength to advance into the Spiritual Transformation Tier? If it weren’t for the fact that the Core Formation Tier was still unqualified to come into contact with the Regulations of heaven and earth, with the strength of his soul, it was possible that he could even kill the True Self Tier.","After dragging on for half a month, the large black dog finally succeeded.","It severed the internal demon in its heart, and successfully cultivated the only Celestial","Cauldron.","“Little Han, Grandpa Dog has succeeded!” the large black dog shouted in excitement.","With its current accomplishments, it was not the slightest bit inferior to an Imperial Son or","Imperial Daughter.","Ling Han was also very happy. The large black dog had succeeded, which meant that this path could be taken. The empress, Hu Niu and the others could all create the Fusion Cauldron.","This was too awesome!","“Let’s go and investigate the situation.”","Ling Han set off again, entering into the Imperial Capital. This time, it was bustling with","noise and excitement.","Close to twenty days had passed, and the great formation of Ziming Mountain had further weakened. Not only could the Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators enter, even the Core Formation Tier cultivators were no longer restricted.","Thus, large amounts of Core Formation Tier cultivators and Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators surged in. Because the humans and Demon Race cultivators here were absolutely hostile toward each other, the humans and Demon Race cultivators that entered each went their own","way.","And it was precisely at this moment that Bai Xiangming, the nation leader of the Galewind Nation, threw out the legend of opening the sky, and guaranteed that as long as the Demon Race was eliminated, every subject that had performed meritorious service could try and see if they could pick up the Sky Opening Axe.","He also said that there was a secret hidden in the Sky Opening Axe, regarding the inheritance of a supreme elite, but only those who could hold the axe would be able to see clearly. Because of this guarantee, everyone was eager to give it a try, wanting to cooperate with the Galewind Nation to eliminate all the Demon Race elites."]},{"number":4033,"title":"Chapter 4033: Taking advantage of the chaos","paragraphs":["Chapter 4033: Taking advantage of the chaos","Ling Han returned, and told the large black dog what he had found out.","“What are we going to do?” the large black dog asked. “Could it be that we sneak our ways into the army that’s going to battle?”","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “I keep feeling that Divine Rain Venerate wouldn’t do such a thing out of boredom.”","“That’s right. He can snatch whatever girl he likes,” the large black dog expressed his full agreement, “Even if he can’t snatch her, he can still steal some underpants!”","Ling Han shot out a kick, “Only a despicable dog like you would do that!”","He retracted his foot, and said, “Firstly, to reject an elite like Divine Rain Venerate would require extraordinary courage. Even if that Miss Bai is extremely loyal to her beloved, how could her lover be like this as well? Would her clan be so stubborn?”","“That’s right!” The large black dog clapped his paws, “That is a Venerate Tier elite, and in fact, he even has the secret of the Emperor’s inheritance!”","This kind of temptation was something that even a Holy Land would not be able to resist. They would be willing to gift a Holy Daughter in exchange, right?","“So, there’s a problem with the Bai Clan’s resolute refusal.” Ling Han pondered for a moment, then said, “Don’t forget, all of this originates from the Bai Clan’s records. And if you were asked to write your own biography, would you beautify yourself?”","“That’s for sure. Who doesn’t want to be worshipped for all eternity, but rather be notorious for all eternity?” The large black dog nodded.","“Heh, as for you? Whether you beautify it or not has only one result. You’re destined to be infamous for ten thousand years.” Ling Han struck a blow at the large black dog, then continued, “So, what we’re seeing now is only one side of the story from the Bai Clan. As for the truth, that may not be the case.”","“Then what do you mean?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han smiled, “Let’s go and take a look at the Demon Race.”","“Great! Now, Grandpa Dog doesn’t need to hide anymore. Instead, you’re going to become Grandpa Dog’s human pet!” The large black dog was instantly amused. “Come, call me master dog.”","“Get lost!”","Ling Han and the large black dog set off. The large black dog was naturally his original form, and Ling Han was also his original form. He only had to say that he had taken human form.","-The Imperial Family had a “Demonic Mirror”, and the Demon Race also had a “Human Mirror”?","They had not walked for too long, when they saw a majestic group of people, all of them human.","“Yi, they’re moving so fast, they’re already mobilized?” Ling Han activated his Eye Technique. With a glance, he discovered a great many elites, mainly those in the Cauldron Forging Tier and the Core Formation Tier. There were also a considerable number of Foundation Building Tiers, but there were not many True Self Tier elites, only two.","A killing intent suddenly appeared in his eyes.","Fu Huoyang.","He actually saw that heir of the Imperial Clan, Fu Huoyang. Even if there were True Self Tier elites standing guard here, Fu Huoyang was still extremely arrogant, putting on airs.","Hehe, he was merely a member of a side branch of the Imperial Clan. What was so impressive about that?","It was not just Fu Huoyang. There was also Lu Qi, Feng Jixing, and so on. There was really quite a number of top-notch prodigies.","Ling Han felt an urge to charge over and kill Fu Huoyang and the others, but when he thought about how there were two True Self Tier elites here, it would be too difficult to kill someone right in front of their eyes.","Thus, Ling Han forcefully suppressed this urge.","“Little Han, what do you plan to do?” the large black dog approached and asked.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Let’s follow them. Aren’t they going to start a war with the Demon Race? At that time, we can just kill those guys, and treat it as a greeting gift to the Demon Race.”","“Alright.” The large black dog was in high spirits. He loved screwing others over.","The man and dog followed this group, advancing very quickly. Thus, in just half a day’s time, they had arrived in front of a great mountain.","“This is the territory of the Blue Demon Tiger King,” someone introduced. “The Blue Demon Tiger King is a Demonic King of the True Self Tier. Though there is only one True Self Tier elite here, the battle prowess of the Blue Demon Tiger King is extremely terrifying. It has the ability to fight one against two, or even in fact, against three.”","“Of course, the commander-in-chief, the Sea City King and the Solemn Heavenly King are also well-known figures among True Self Tier elites. If the two Lords join forces, it would be enough to match the Blue Demon Tiger King!”","“Our purpose this time is to destroy all the Demon Race elites under the True Self Tier. Merely the Blue Demon Tiger King alone would not be able to cause much damage, and there would eventually come a day when it would die of old age.”","This strategy was very good. With a large population, only would it be able to ensure that a race’s prosperity would not decline. Otherwise, so what if it was the descendant of someone as strong as a Great Emperor? Even Brother Monkey had been suppressed by a Venerate Tier","force!","“All right, we will begin our attacks. If we encounter enemies, there is no need to show mercy, and not a single one will be spared!”","After a round of pre-battle mobilization, this army began to charge.","On the other side, the Blue Demon Tiger King was already prepared. When the expedition army rushed out for more than ten miles, a large number of Demonic Beasts suddenly appeared on the mountain, greeting the army below them, and birds appeared in the skies, launching a surprise attack.","“Aerial team, move out!” Qian Lang was one of the commanders-in-chief. His expression was calm, and with a wave of his hand, multiple cultivators flew on their respective weapons, launching an offensive against those birds in the skies.","“Little Han, should we make a move now?” The large black dog rubbed his paws together, eager to give it a try.","It had just successfully created the Fusion Cauldron, and its battle prowess had soared into the Core Formation Tier. It was presently impatient to test out its own strength. “Wait,” Ling Han said with a shake of his head. “We’ll act after the commander-in-chief arrives and makes his move.”","Ling Han didn’t want to be targeted by those two True Self Tier cultivators.","“All right.” The large black dog nodded. In this kind of situation, he naturally could not allow","his temper free rein.","“Insolent human, you actually dare to violate my authority!” With a loud roar, an incredibly burly man leaped into the air. However, though he had a human body, he retained a thick and","long tail, which was waving back and forth.","The Blue Demon Tiger King!","“Charge!” The Sea City King the Solemn Heavenly King leaped into the air at the same time,","and charged towards the Blue Demon Tiger King.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The three elites exchanged blows, battling fiercely in the skies. One after another, shockwaves rippled out, and shards of Regulations surged out.","This was too terrifying. No one dared to approach, and even those in the Core Formation Tier would have to keep their distance.","This Blue Demon Tiger King’s force naturally had outsiders from the Demon Race as well. They deliberately avoided the humans that had entered here, and instead made a move on the people of the Galewind Nation. On the other side, it was the same for the humans that had come from outside. They only made a move on the native Demonic Beasts, each killing their","own.","“The chance is here!” Ling Han said.","The large black dog’s expression was also filled with excitement. He could finally show his","strength.","“Charge!”","The man and dog also charged out, and quickly separated, each finding their own opponent.","Ling Han changed his appearance and soul fluctuations. Killing a member of the Imperial Clan in public, killing fellow disciples, the implications were too great and too terrible. Thus, it","was better to let someone who did not exist bear the blame.","He quickly cut in, and was already very close to Fu Huoyang.","At this moment, Fu Huoyang was unleashing a massacre on the Demonic Beasts. Although he couldn’t combust his Imperial Bloodline anymore, his battle prowess at the Fifteenth Heaven surged. If it wasn’t a supreme prodigy, how could anyone rival him?","Thus, killing Demonic Beasts was as easy as cutting weeds for him. He was completely","unmatched.","“How dare you, human! You actually dared to kill a member of our Demon Race! I’ll kill you!” Ling Han roared as he charged over."]},{"number":4034,"title":"Chapter 4034: Your Grandpa Ding","paragraphs":["Chapter 4034: Your Grandpa Ding","Not only had Ling Han’s appearance changed, but he even had a tail behind him.","This naturally was imitating the Blue Demon Tiger King, which was equivalent to announcing that he was a member of the Demon Race.","The Demon Race cultivators here had been massacred by Fu Huoyang, and they were already on the verge of collapse. When they saw Ling Han step forward, it was as if they had seen their savior. They all roared loudly, cheering Ling Han on.","Fu Huoyang was slightly surprised. This Demon Race cultivator was clearly not a native of this place, so why had he taken the initiative to provoke him?","They had long since formed a tacit understanding, and that was to kill their own targets, and not interfere with each other.","This was very normal. A great many people had powerful backgrounds. Could it be that they would have to fight to the death for the sake of the natives of this small Mystery Realm?","If it weren’t for the sake of obtaining the Sky Opening Axe as soon as possible, they wouldn’t have needed to make a move at all. As long as they waited until the True Self Tier elite or even the Spirit Transformation Tier elite entered this space, would the natives still have the right to speak?","But this member of the Demon Race actually dared to trifle with him!","Are you blind? Don’t you know that I am Fu Huoyang from the Imperial Clan?","“You’re seeking death!” Fu Huoyang was a member of the Imperial Clan, so how arrogant and domineering was he? It had always been him who trifled with others, so how could he allow others to bully him?","‘It doesn’t matter whether you’re truly stupid or just pretending to be stupid. Just die!’","Boom, his palm struck out, its might soaring to the heavens.","Ling Han smiled slightly, and casually used a Venerate Tier-level Technique, clashing with Fu Huoyang.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two of them exchanged blows, but the gap in battle prowess was too wide. Naturally, it was Ling Han who was forced into continuous retreat, but the Primal Chaos Celestial Core showed its might, easily dispersing the power that was assailing him, so it naturally could not wound him in the slightest.","“Yi!” Fu Huoyang wasn’t stupid, and he immediately came to a realization.","The other’s abilities were clearly far inferior to his, but the force of his attack did not cause any damage at all. What did this mean?","This guy could absorb power attacks!","He had only seen this kind of Mystical Power on one person, and this kind of Mystical Power was too unique. He did not believe that he would be able to encounter any random person that also had this power.","Thus, there was only one truth.","This member of the Demon Race was that person, the guy who had caused him great humiliation.","“Ding Yi!” Fu Huoyang roared through gritted teeth. “So it’s you!”","“Haha, it’s your Grandpa Ding!” Ling Han laughed loudly. Since he had been recognized, there was nothing for him to hide. Shua, a murderous aura burst out, and Fu Huoyang instantly grabbed his head and screamed.","The barrage of this murderous aura was too terrifying. It could be considered Ling Han’s strongest killing move.","He took advantage of the opening to charge over, and shot out a punch.","However, Fu Huoyang was a prodigy of the Imperial Clan, after all. Moreover, he had also entered into the Netherworld and obtained many benefits. The strength of his soul had advanced into the True Self Tier, and his willpower was also extremely tenacious. In the end, he still managed to catch his breath.","“Damn it!” He shot out a punch, greeting Ling Han’s attack.","Peng!","However, the result of this punch was that he was sent flying. He was completely no match for Ling Han.","Under the barrage of murderous aura, it was already good enough that he could fight back. How much battle prowess did he want to keep?","“Impressive!”","“Formidable!”","“Brave warrior!”","When the Demon Race saw this, they immediately cheered Ling Han on.","Fu Huoyang was beside himself with rage, and he wanted nothing more than to tear Ling Han into pieces. However, during the “spar” at the Donglin Imperial Clan, he had been inferior to Ling Han. Even after combusting his Imperial Bloodline to raise his battle prowess by 10 Heavens, he had still been brutally pummeled by Ling Han.","Now, how could he possibly be a match for Ling Han?","Let’s go!","He made a prompt decision, and immediately turned to flee. There was no need for him to fight head-on with Ling Han now. When he advanced into the True Self Tier, he would use the advantage of a major tier to kill Ling Han.","Ling Han smirked coldly. Since he had already made his move, how could he allow you to","escape?","Primal Chaos Divine Lightning!","Zi, a bolt of lightning shot out. It had not even reached him, when Fu Huoyang’s figure suddenly paused, as if he had become stupid.","He had fallen into an illusion.","Though the black light of illusion was intertwined with the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning, it itself was effective on divine sense. It could reach its target as long as it was within the rangen of attack.","Thus, before the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning had even struck him, the black light of illusion ha I already affected Fu Huoyang’s mind.","However, the speed at which the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning was sent flying was also extraordinarily fast. Just as Fu Huoyang was startled, the divine lightning had already struck","him.","Zi, lightning flashed, and a charred hole had already appeared in Fu Huoyang’s chest.","However, after sustaining such a heavy blow, Fu Huoyang finally came back to his senses from the illusion. At this moment, Ling Han also charged over with a punch, his killing intent","blazing.","Fu Huoyang was astonished. He had never seen Ling Han use this move before.","Was this a new ultimate technique that this person had obtained, or was this person hiding his strength, and had not used it all this while?","However, how could he have the time to mull over this at this moment? He hurriedly launched an attack, greeting Ling Han’s attack. Otherwise, his only fate would be death.","Peng!","In this exchange of blows, Fu Huoyang was once again sent flying. He was completely outmatched by Ling Han.","This was natural. He had been suppressed in battle prowess by three Heavens, and his chest had also been severely wounded. At most, he could only unleash battle prowess on par with eleven Heavens. And what about Ling Han? His base power was as high as Tenth Heaven. If he used any Saint Technique, he would be able to overwhelm him in terms of battle prowess.","Ling Han caught up to him, unleashing a barrage of deadly attacks.","Fu Huoyang was both furious and shocked, yet he could only take the beating passively.","Previously, in that “spar”, though he had not ignited all his Imperial Blood, there was not much left. It was far from enough to allow him to reignite it. Thus, he was really at his wit’s end now. He did not have any trump card that he could use at all.","He could only suffer a beating. Under a series of attacks, he screamed repeatedly.","What made him even more depressed was the fact that though every strike from Ling Han was","heavy, it was not fatal.","-If it was a little heavier, and threatened his life, the treasure in his possession would show","its might, and teleport him away.","This guy must have done it on purpose.","Fu Huoyang shouted in fury. As a member of the Imperial Clan, he was actually being toyed with like this. What justice was there left in this world?","Peng!","Finally, Ling Han’s punch landed. This power was a little heavy, and directly threatened Fu Huoyang’s life. Instantly, a ray of light wrapped around him. Xiu! Then, he disappeared. The treasure unleashed its might, saving him from death. It even allowed him to travel millions and millions of kilometers to ensure that he was safe enough.","However, could he really succeed?","Ling Han was now a Formations Grandmaster, and keenly discovered that in truth, as that","light surged, it had also extracted Qi from the ley lines, borrowing the power to send Fu","Huoyang away.","Hehe, so this was the principle of the Ten Thousand Escape Talisman.","Ling Han stood quietly, and spread out his divine sense, entering into the ley lines.","There were pitifully few ley lines in this Mystery Realm, and there were only a dozen over.","Thus, it was a very simple matter to investigate.","Found it.","A smile spread across Ling Han’s face. Xiu! He instantly disappeared as well.","It was unknown whether it was his luck or Fu Huoyang’s misfortune, but there just happened","to be a ley line here, so he didn’t need to move to another place.","On the other side.","With a flash, Fu Huoyang was teleported out through the ley lines. At this moment, he was at","least tens of thousands of miles away from the battlefield, so it was naturally impossible for","Ling Han to find him.","He touched the necklace around his neck. It was this thing that had saved his life, and he could activate it a total of seven more times.","The background of the Imperial Clan was indeed astonishing. Their life-saving trump card","could actually be used so many times.","He would heal his injuries first, and then make plans.","However, before he could even take out his medicine, a figure flashed before him, and a","person appeared."]},{"number":4035,"title":"Chapter 4035: Killing Fu Huoyang","paragraphs":["Chapter 4035: Killing Fu Huoyang","Ling, Ling Han!","At this moment, Fu Huoyang was completely stupefied.","What was going on?","‘I was teleported here, so how did you follow me out as well?’","Even if you have the means to travel ten thousand miles, with such a large area, how did you know that I was here?","“How could it possibly be you!” Fu Huoyang exclaimed in shock. He had really gotten a scare. Ling Han cracked a smile, “Why can’t it be me? You can run, but I am not allowed to chase?”","‘This isn’t a question of running or chasing. Rather, it’s a question of how you can possibly catch up to me!’","Fu Huoyang naturally didn’t believe that Ling Han would be so lucky and just happened to catch him in the path of escape. Without another word, he broke into a run and fled.","Ling Han caught up to him, unleashing his full battle prowess as he launched an attack at Fu Huoyang.","Fu Huoyang parried, but his injuries had not been treated. As time passed, they were still worsening. This caused his battle prowess to fall further, so how could he possibly be a match for Ling Han?","In just a few moves, he was “killed” again. A ray of light swept past, sending him away again. “Where did you go this time?” Ling Han murmured. His divine sense spread out, and he followed the ley lines to search for Fu Huoyang.","“Found it.”","Xiu, he also followed the ley lines. With a flash, he too quickly disappeared.","On the other side, Fu Huoyang immediately broke into a run as soon as the teleportation ended. He didn’t know if Ling Han would chase after him, but he didn’t dare to take the risk.","However, he had only run a short distance, when he saw a figure appear out of thin air behind him.","Ling Han!","As expected, this guy had come again.","“Fu Huoyang, why are you running?” Ling Han asked as he pursued Fu Huoyang. With Fu Huoyang’s current state, how much of his speed could he unleash? Ling Han caught up to him in just two or three steps.","Subsequently, it was naturally another violent beating.","Needless to say, Fu Huoyang was “killed” again in just a few moments. With a flash of white light, he once again disappeared without a trace.","“Even if you have a hundred chances to escape, I will still continue to pursue you, right until I send you on your way to the afterlife!” Ling Han murmured. This time, there was absolutely no way he would let the other go.","Fu Huoyang finished the teleportation, and this time, he didn’t run again.","A prodigy like him naturally had no lack of decisiveness. He knew that there was no way he could escape. Thus, the most effective method was not to flee, but to counterattack with all his might.","He waited for Ling Han to appear. Once Ling Han appeared, he would launch a powerful attack.","-Having just come out of the teleportation, Ling Han would definitely be careless, and this was the best chance for him to attack.","If he could kill Ling Han, then not only would he be able to solve the problem of being hunted down, he would also be able to get his revenge completely.","Xiu, after a while, Ling Han appeared as expected.","“Die!” Fu Huoyang roared. He unleashed his full power as he launched an attack at Ling Han.","In this strike, he had really gone all out. With what little power he had left, he shot out the Imperial Technique, swearing that he would kill Ling Han with a single strike.","However, how could Ling Han not be on guard?","Peng!","When this attack arrived, it did not even manage to penetrate the defenses of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. It was blocked by the air of Primal Chaos.","“What?!” Fu Huoyang’s expression was filled with disbelief. He had used the Imperial Technique to attack Ling Han, catching him completely off guard. Yet, he hadn’t even managed to penetrate Ling Han’s defenses?","“Fu Huoyang, no matter how many times you flee, you’ll still die!” Ling Han said calmly. He was already determined to kill Fu Huoyang.","Fu Huoyang gritted his teeth, and said, “Who are you? Who exactly are you!”","“I’m your uncle,” Ling Han said with a smile, completely having no intention of revealing his identity.","Fu Huoyang fought as he retreated, “I know that Ding Yi is definitely not your true identity. What is it? Are you afraid to show yourself? Your true identity is very lowly, and you are the son of a prostitute?”","He was naturally trying to deliberately enrage Ling Han, wanting to worm out Ling Han’s true identity.","However, how could Ling Han fall for it? He simply increased the speed of his punches.","After a few punches, Fu Huoyang was “killed” again.","Again and again. Fu Huoyang’s expression became uglier and uglier. He was only left with one last chance to teleport. If he was “killed” by Ling Han again, he couldn’t die again. Otherwise, he would be consigned to eternal damnation.","“Ding Yi, there’s actually no great enmity between us.” He switched to a gentle strategy, and played the sympathy card, “Why don’t we turn from enemies into friends? I am the prodigy of the Imperial Clan. If you have a friend like me, it would be greatly beneficial for you.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, saying, “Fu Huoyang, is this your first day out? You’re actually saying such childish things? Since you’ve planted your own cause, even if you die, you have to straighten your back and endure the consequences!”","No kidding, he didn’t want to die.","Fu Huoyang roared in fury, “No, I am the prodigy of the Imperial Clan. I will definitely become a Saint in future, and cannot die!”","“No one can’t die, what more trash like you.” Ling Han said calmly, “If you become a Saint, wouldn’t that be the misfortune of heaven and earth?”","Peng!","He threw another punch, and Fu Huoyang was sent on his way again. This was another","teleportation.","“How many more times can you teleport?” Ling Han searched the ley lines, and soon located","Fu Huoyang. With a flash, he immediately set off in pursuit.","This time, Fu Huoyang was completely flustered.","He no longer had a trump card, and could no longer save his life.","Ling Han knew what he was doing with a single glance, and said, “Looks like your life-saving technique has been used up.”","Fu Huoyang clenched his fists. He would never have dreamed that he would be forced to this","extent by Ling Han.","He had a total of seven life-saving chances, and Ling Han had actually caught up to him every time. Not a single time had he managed to successfully escape.","What could he do? What could he do?","Thoughts flashed through his mind like lightning, yet he couldn’t think of any strategy.","At this moment, Fu Huoyang felt extreme despair and regret.","He naturally didn’t regret refining the Ten Thousand Spirit Blood Pill. Nor did he regret being","so overbearing toward Ling Han. Rather, he regretted not killing Ling Han while he was still","weak.","It couldn’t be helped. He knew that he was the heir of the Imperial Clan, and his cultivation level far surpassed Ling Han. Even in his dreams, he would never have imagined that there would come a day when he would actually be forced into desperate straits by Ling Han.","“Your uncle will always be your uncle!” Ling Han had already charged over, and once again used the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning. As the attack landed, another hole appeared in Fu Huoyang’s chest. This time, it was in his heart.","Fu Huoyang roared loudly, and began to combust his Celestial Core. He was going to take the","final gamble.","“Die!” Ling Han launched another attack, and amidst the barrage of murderous aura, Fu","Huoyang’s action of burning the Celestial Core suddenly came to an abrupt stop. Then, he collapsed onto the ground, his vitality rapidly dissipating.","Ling Han didn’t feel a shred of sympathy. Fu Huoyang had sought death on his own; he actually wanted to use the blood of millions of living beings to concoct the Ten Thousand Spirit Blood Pill. Just for this, this guy deserved to die.","He grabbed Fu Huoyang’s corpse, and with a flash, he had already returned to the battlefield.","However, the battle had already ended.","“Little Han!” The large black dog ran over, “How is it?”","“I killed one.” Ling Han nodded.","“The one surnamed Fu?”","“M-hm.”","“All right!” The large black dog appeared very excited, “Grandpa Dog has already formed","relations with that great tiger. Let’s go.”"]},{"number":4036,"title":"Chapter 4036: The base of the Demon Race","paragraphs":["Chapter 4036: The base of the Demon Race","Ling Han and the large black dog walked into the mountains, while the large black dog talked about the battle situation after Ling Han left.","It was very tragic, with many people and Demonic Beasts dying. However, most of them were natives of this place, and not many outsiders had died.","Precisely because both sides had suffered heavy losses, the generals on both sides called for a retreat.","“Grandpa Dog!”","“Grandpa Dog!”","When they entered into the camp of the Tiger King, they saw that there were minor demons calling out to the large black dog along the way, looking like they were trying to curry his favour.","“Yi, you seem to be doing quite well?” Ling Han found this a little strange.","“Of course,” the large black dog said proudly. “Grandpa Dog almost became sworn brothers with that tiger. How can these lackeys not flatter Grandpa Dog?”","Ling Han clicked his tongue. He hadn’t spent much time hunting down Fu Huoyang, yet the large black dog had already developed such a strong “friendship” with the Tiger King. This was truly impressive.","“How did you, er, lie to the tiger?” he asked, smiling.","“What lie!” The large black dog’s expression was filled with righteousness, “Grandpa Dog only shared his views on underpants with him.”","Ling Han was instantly speechless. This damn dog was really too indecent.","This was the territory of the Demonic Beasts, and the Demonic Beasts’ aesthetic tastes were naturally completely different from humans’. The buildings here were all built of stone, and there was no beauty to be seen at all, but it was really rugged.","“Brother Black!” They had not even walked to the largest stone house, when they saw the Blue Demon Tiger King come out to receive them, his face all smiles, “Come, come, come. I’ve been waiting for you for a long time.”","“Brother Tiger!” The large black dog nodded, his face full of smiles, looking extremely despicable.","Ling Han couldn’t bear to watch, and turned his head away.","They entered into this stone house. Actually, this should be considered a great hall. It was very wide and tall inside, and there were multiple stones placed there. They could be considered stools, and most of them were occupied.","Ling Han swept an eye over them, and already knew what was going on. These were basically the members of the Demon Race from the outsiders.","“Ling Han!”","Seeing Ling Han enter, a considerable number of Demon Race elites immediately stood up, revealing covetous expressions.","Even the Imperial Son had been defeated, which caused Ling Han to become completely popular. As long as they were prodigy-level, most of them had seen Ling Han’s appearance before. This was an opponent that they had to be extremely wary of.","Now, everyone was clearly separated. The Human Race was on the side of the Galewind Nation, while the Demon Race was on the other side. Yet, you, a mere human, had come here. What was the meaning of this?","“Yi, you are a human?” The Blue Demon Tiger King asked, his voice booming, bringing with it endless might.","The large black dog hurriedly said, “Brother Tiger, don’t be anxious. My brother is a human with a beast in his heart. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have become his best friend.”","“Humph, those who are not of our race must have ulterior motives!” A Demon Race member declared coldly. He had a pair of goat horns on his head. This was obviously a deliberate manifestation, showing that he was a member of the Demon Race.","The large black dog immediately retorted, and said, “Hehe, speaking of non-humans, it seems like you’re not a member of the Tiger Race either, right? Grandpa Dog doesn’t think that you look to have a very righteous heart either! Moreover, you should be a member of the Goat Race, and your race have been devoured quite a bit by the Tiger Race. You must be displeased with Brother Tiger!”","That Demon Race cultivator was so infuriated that the corners of his mouth twitched. He was a member of the Iron Goat Race. This race was born powerful, so how could they be eaten by a tiger?","“Bullsh*t, our Iron Goat Tribe has produced a Demonic Saint before, what elite of the Tiger Race have we not killed before?” he couldn’t help but retort.","However, as soon as the words left his mouth, he knew that he was done for.","“Humph, you’ve even killed a tiger before?” The Blue Demon Tiger King glared over, its eyes filled with might, exuding a powerful killing intent.","“No! No!” That member of the Iron Goat Race said, “That is a matter of my ancestors, and has nothing to do with me.”","“Little lamb, don’t you know what a father’s debt is repaid by his son?” the large black dog said calmly. “Brother Tiger, I think this guy doesn’t look like a good person at first glance. With such a protruding back of his head, he must be rebellious!”","That Iron Goat Race member really wanted to come up and fight the large black dog to the death. ‘Do I have any enmity with you? Is there any need to smear my name so harshly?’","The Blue Demon Tiger King did not respond at the first instant, but rather looked coldly at the Iron Goat Race member.","“Hehe, everyone calm down!” A tall, slender man stood up, and waved his hand at the Blue Demon Tiger King and Iron Goat Race member. “In the end, we are all members of the Demon Race, and are all descendants of the primitive Divine Beasts, so we can be considered a family. However, this human is a different story!”","He pointed at Ling Han, and changed the topic.","The Iron Goat Race member thought that this was right. His original intention for stepping out was to reveal Ling Han’s identity as a human. At the very least, he wanted to chase Ling Han away. Why had the large black dog changed the topic, dragging himself into the matter? Meanwhile, Ling Han said to the Blue Demon Tiger King, “Lord Tiger King, may I speak with you in private?”","The Blue Demon Tiger King glanced at him, and nodded slowly, “All right.”","He was at the True Self Tier, and his strength was also formidable. If he exchanged blows with a cultivator of the same cultivation level, one of him could match two of them. Thus, he was completely unafraid that Ling Han would play any tricks.","The two of them arrived at a secluded place. Ling Han took out Fu Huoyang’s corpse, tossed it onto the ground, and said, “Milord, can this prove my sincerity?”","The eyes of the Blue Demon Tiger King immediately lit up. Though he had not taken Fu Huoyang seriously, he had seen how Fu Huoyang had gone on a killing spree, and slaughtered a considerable number of his subordinates. His abilities were definitely extraordinary.","“I trust you!” He nodded, a smile appearing on his face.","“However, this person’s identity is extraordinary. Please keep it a secret for me, Lord,” Ling","Han said.","“All right.” The Blue Demon Tiger King nodded.","They returned to the stone house, and the Blue Demon Tiger King immediately announced, “From this moment onwards, no one is allowed to speak of Ling Han’s human identity again. If you speak of this again, don’t blame me for taking actions!”","This caused all the Demon Race elites to feel surprised. Just what had Ling Han said to the Blue Demon Tiger King that he had managed to convince him so quickly?","“Tiger King, when are we going to attack the Imperial Capital of the Human Race?” someone","asked.","The Blue Demon Tiger King pondered for a moment, “This is extremely difficult!”","“If we join forces with the other Demonic Beasts, how could it be that we won’t be able to conquer the human race?” another person asked.","The Blue Demon Tiger King shook his head slowly, “The human race has deep roots, and is not as weak as we think! Us great Demon Kings, as well as our ancestors, have tried to conquer the Imperial Capital of the human race, generation after generation, and all ended in failure.” Everyone exchanged looks. According to their understanding, there were at most ten True Self Tier elites in the human race, and in the case of the Demon Race, not only were there even more True Self Tier elites, but their battle prowess was also terrifying. One of them was equivalent to two of them, so how could they not be able to break through the defenses of the","human race?","“Humans have a powerful weapon that will unleash its might at the most critical moment.” The Azure Demon Tiger King shook its head, “My father was severely wounded by that powerful weapon, and died when he was only two thousand years old.”","What kind of deadly weapon was so awesome?","Was this a treasure that had been left behind by Divine Rain Venerate?","Everyone’s eyes lit up. They had finally found out a sliver of the secret of Divine Rain","Venerate’s inheritance.","However, the Blue Demon Tiger King stopped here, and did not continue this topic. He even","told everyone to go and rest.","With this shooing order, everyone naturally could only leave."]},{"number":4037,"title":"Chapter 4037: Shi Yuan","paragraphs":["Chapter 4037: Shi Yuan","Ling Han communicated with the large black dog through divine sense, telling it to probe again. With how despicable the large black dog was, it should be able to discover a lot of secrets that others didn’t know.","The large black dog nodded and left, calling out, “Brother Tiger, wait for me.”","Ling Han crossed his arms behind his back, planning to walk around. Was there any Celestial medicine in this mountain?","Now that he had grasped the ley lines, it was equivalent to having eyes and ears all over this world. The chances of finding Celestial medicine was very high.","“Ling Han!” A voice rang out from behind him.","Ling Han suddenly stopped in his tracks, and turned around to look.","This was a young man. He was tall and sturdy, and there was actually a circle of golden fur around his neck. It was thick and long, making him appear furry.","“I am Shi Yuan,” the man declared proudly.","“None of my business!” Ling Han retorted.","-If the other had spoken politely, he naturally would not mind speaking calmly, but this guy looked like he had come to cause trouble, so what was the point of being polite?","Shi Yuan faltered upon hearing this. He hadn’t expected Ling Han to speak so vulgarly.","He humphed and said, “I’ll only say one thing. I’m from the Western Heavenly Realm!”","“Are you retarded?” Ling Han shrugged, “What business is it of mine where you come from?” T-twice!","Shi Yuan bared his teeth, a cold glint in his eyes.","“Hahaha, this brat is going to be in big trouble. Shi Yuan is one of the few prodigies of the West Heavenly Realm and is ranked 27th on the Galaxy Network.”","“This brat suppressed the Western Heavenly Realm to the point of having lost so much face. He’ll definitely be targeted!”","“Hehe, the North Heavenly Realm wants to step out? The so-called prodigy can only be short-lived.”","There were also some people around, and they all shook their heads. Naturally, they were not the slightest bit optimistic about Ling Han.","Shi Yuan had already calmed down. “Ling Han, you’re far too arrogant! You’ve only defeated a few weaklings, yet you still dare to treat everyone else with such disdain! Today, I’ll let you know that the prodigies of the West Heavenly Realm are people that you can only look up to!”","Ling Han scoffed, and said, “You’re at the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier, and I’m only at the early stage of the Core Formation Tier. Are you using your advantage in cultivation level to suppress me?”","“I’m the same age as you, so how could it be unfair?” Shi Yuan said. He lashed out with his right hand. Boom! Power condensed, transforming into a gigantic golden claw that slammed down at Ling Han.","Ling Han activated the Imminent Skyline and casually dodged, saying, “No, no, no. You’re at least over fifty. I’m still young!”","When Shi Yuan heard this, he instantly exploded in fury.","He was indeed in his fifties, but no matter where he was, a fifty-year-old Core Formation Tier consummate level martial artist would be incredibly young, a top grade prodigy. Now, he was actually being looked down on by Ling Han, so how could he not be furious?","Even though Ling Han was only in his twenties, the three barriers of the early stage of Core Formation Tier, the middle stage of Core Formation Tier, and the late stage of Core Formation Tier were like a block. When Ling Han reached the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier, he would at least be in his forties or fifties.","“Damn it!” he roared in fury. He pounced over, swinging his claws one after another. Innumerable golden threads streaked past, interweaving into a net.","He was indeed strong, with battle prowess as high as 23 Heavens. He was practically comparable to Fu Huoyang, who was burning Imperial Blood, which made Ling Han completely unqualified to match him. He could only use Imminent Skyline to dodge. However, Shi Yuan had also mastered a high-level movement technique. The moment he channeled it, he instantly followed closely behind Ling Han like a shadow.","In this way, Ling Han only had to make the slightest mistake, and he would be hit by Shi Yuan.","Everyone shook their heads. There was no one who would not make a mistake. Then, with the strength of Shi Yuan’s battle prowess, he would be able to kill Ling Han or severely injure him with a single strike.","However, they didn’t care. Firstly, because Ling Han was a human, and secondly, he was from the North Heavenly Realm, so who cares.","“You really have no end!” Ling Han said coldly. The other party didn’t know what was good for him, which angered him as well.","“Haha, you can only talk tough for a while.” Shi Yuan’s confidence had completely returned. It was fine even if he couldn’t win in a verbal battle with Ling Han. In martial arts, strength was what mattered, and not the ability to speak glibly.","“Die!” he roared loudly. Weng, his voice actually took form, turning into the head of a lion, which opened its mouth to bite at Ling Han.","Lion Roar!","Ling Han immediately felt a tremor in his mind, causing boundless waves to rise up, as if his mind was about to be shattered.","Realization dawned on him. Even though Shi Yuan had unleashed this attack with a roar, the lion’s head that he had taken form in was merely a pretense. The true killing move was the divine sense attack. With a roar, it had reached him, and was already wreaking havoc in his","mind.","If anyone believed that the lion’s head was the main force of attack, they would have already been hit.","Ling Han smiled faintly. Launch a divine sense attack on him? Hehe, didn’t he know that the strength of his divine sense had already advanced into the Spirit Transformation Tier?","He focused slightly, and his mind instantly calmed down.","“It’s impolite not to reciprocate. Take a strike from me as well!” Ling Han said. He then roared, unleashing a murderous aura attack.","Weng! Shi Yuan’s body instantly faltered, and then his expression became twisted. He suddenly grabbed his head and screamed in agony.","This!","Everyone was stunned, and even felt that this was unreal.","When it came to divine sense attacks, the Lion Roar of the Lion Race was definitely top-notch. It was said that the Buddhist Race’s Lion Roar Technique had been inspired by the Lion Race. Now, Shi Yuan clearly had the advantage in cultivation level, and was also skilled in divine sense attacks, but not only had he not been able to defeat Ling Han, he had instead been wounded by the latter’s divine sense attack. How could they accept this?","However, Shi Yuan was a prodigy, after all, so it wasn’t long before he dispelled the","murderous aura. However, tears of blood were already streaming from his eyes, and his","expression was terrifyingly twisted.","“Detestable brat!” he spat through gritted teeth. Being defeated by someone in his field of","expertise was truly a terrible feeling.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “You provoked me first, so you’ll have to suffer the consequences of failure!”","“I’m going to kill you!” Shi Yuan roared as he lunged at Ling Han. He unleashed all of his powerful attacks, and the image of a nine-headed lion materialized behind him. It was as if this lion had boosted his power, causing him to become even more ferocious. Ling Han was unafraid. The Primal Chaos Celestial Core was activated, and instantly, an ancient and vicissitude aura of Primal Chaos surged out, causing Shi Yuan’s battle prowess to drop directly by three Heavens.","However, even though he still had 20 Heavens of battle prowess remaining, Shi Yuan was still","able to crush Ling Han.","Ling Han exchanged a blow with the other, and a deep power surged over, instantly sending him flying. He was completely outmatched.","Hiss, he gritted his teeth, and felt a salty taste at the corner of his lips. When he wiped it away,","it was all blood.","Even if he had the Primal Chaos Celestial Core that could neutralize six Heavens of power, he","was still wounded.","It couldn’t be helped. The power gap was a little too wide.","While he was sighing with emotion, he didn’t know that the spectators had all turned green","with fear.","F***, the gap in battle prowess was at least ten Heavens, but Ling Han actually only spat out","a little blood after taking a blow head-on?","Was there anyone like you?","Shi Yuan also faltered upon hearing this.","At first, when he saw Ling Han exchange blows with him, he was filled with pleasant surprise, because he had not thought that Ling Han would “seek his own death” either, but he had","never imagined that the latter would actually be so durable.","How was this possible? This was absolutely impossible! Ling Han cracked a smile, “Nothing is impossible. Come, take this!”","He communicated with the ley lines, stimulating the Earth Qi. Instantly, an earthen-yellow great dragon shot out of the ground by Ling Han’s feet, baring its fangs and brandishing its claws."]},{"number":4038,"title":"Chapter 4038: Earth Dragon","paragraphs":["Chapter 4038: Earth Dragon","Formations Grandmaster, setting up formations with steps.","Ling Han wasn’t that powerful, and he couldn’t set up formations with steps. However, if he only had to stimulate Earth Qi attacks, it wouldn’t be too difficult for him.","What kind of celestial technique was this?","Everyone’s eyes widened, and just stared blankly at the great earthen-yellow dragon, guessing what celestial technique Ling Han had used.","“In front of the True Dragon, aren’t you going to kneel down obediently, kitten?” Ling Han said with a smile.","Shi Yuan roared, “You are only in the early stage of the Core Formation Tier. Even if you can summon the True Dragon, how could I be afraid of you!”","He charged over, and with a swipe of his palm, it turned into five golden threads that sliced towards Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and maneuvered the Earth Dragon to greet those five silken threads.","Shi Yuan chuckled coldly. His attacks were incredibly sharp, and they were indestructible. ‘Just you wait, Earth Dragon.’","Pu!","The Earth Dragon crashed into the silk thread, and without a doubt, the silk thread broke. The Earth Dragon was practically unhindered, and continued to rush forwards.","What!","Shi Yuan’s expression was extremely colourful. After a moment of shock, he hurriedly dodged. Peng!","The Earth Dragon missed its target, and crashed into the mountain rock. However, it actually did not cause any damage, and silently sank in.","This made everyone extremely confused. If it was to be said that the might of this Earth Dragon was strong, they had all witnessed it with their own eyes. When the attack landed on the ground, no matter what, it should have caused the earth to shake and mountains to quake.","It was so soundless, and so bizarre to the extreme.","What kind of technique was this?","Meanwhile, Ling Han shook his head.","After the Earth Qi had condensed, it could be used to attack. This was proven. However, he was only using it at the initial stage, after all. This Earth Dragon could not change at all, and could only go straight ahead. In other words, he could only use it in a head-on confrontation.","He mulled over it again. Strengthening his attainments in formations should be able to make the Earth Dragon become even more agile.","“I don’t believe this!” Shi Yuan roared. He charged over again.","He was at the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier, and his battle prowess was as high as 23 Heavens, ranked 27th in the Galaxy Network, and in a head-on confrontation, he was actually inferior to Ling Han?","Impossible, absolutely impossible!","Ling Han smiled faintly, and pointed a finger at Shi Yuan. The Earth Dragon appeared once more, roaring as it blasted towards Shi Yuan.","Shi Yuan didn’t dare to face this attack head-on. He hurriedly turned around to dodge, and then pounced again.","However, Ling Han only needed to extract more Earth Qi, and form another Earth Dragon. One, two, three... There were more and more Earth Dragons, and only when he summoned his 17th Earth Dragon did the first Earth Dragon dissipate due to the exhaustion of Earth Qi.","Which also meant that sixteen Earth Dragons could exist at the same time, and the battle prowess of each one of them could probably reach the True Self Tier. What kind of concept was that?","Shi Yuan was completely unqualified to oppose him, and could only dodge.","However, the Earth Dragon’s weakness was also very obvious. It had lost its agility, and its speed was not too fast either. There was nothing it could do against Shi Yuan.","It was also a sudden idea that had popped in Ling Han’s mind, and that was why he had thought of condensing Earth Qi to form an attack. He had not thought that this effect would actually be so extraordinarily good.","This was naturally all because the strength of his soul had reached the Spiritual Transformation Tier, which was why he could extract so much Earth Qi. Otherwise, at most, it would only be equivalent to him having an additional Imperial Technique.","He couldn’t help but think that Formation Grandmasters were truly terrifying, killing people with formations and killing people with Earth Qi, completely not inferior to cultivators of the same level.","He was sighing with emotion, yet Shi Yuan was on the verge of tears.","The dignified Dao Child of the Nine-Headed Lion Holy Land, ranked 27th on the Galaxy Network, and he was actually forced to flee in a panic by a cultivator at the early stage of the Core Formation Tier. What face would he have left?","“I get it!” Someone suddenly slapped his thigh, “This is not a celestial technique, but rather condensed from Earth Qi!”","“What!” Everyone exclaimed in shock.","“Formations Grandmaster, stimulating the ley lines and extracting Earth Qi, this can be called the Earth Dragon! Hence, when this attack landed on the ground, it was soundless, because the Earth Dragon originated from the ground.”","“Impossible, such a young Formations Grandmaster?”","“That’s right. Although the cultivation level of martial arts is not considered for Formation Grandmasters, and the only factor is formation mastery, without a strong enough soul, one wouldn’t be able to touch the threshold of Grandmaster.”","“Don’t you guys tell me that the strength of this guy’s soul has reached the level of at least Spiritual Transformation Tier!”","Everyone discussed among themselves. The Demon Race here were all top-notch. Even if they themselves did not cultivate formations, there was definitely no lack of understanding. It was just that they had not thought of formations at all previously.","Now that they were reminded, Ling Han’s “technique” was instantly pieced together.","Their mouths were spouting words of disbelief, but in truth, they were already certain of their own judgement.","This freakish guy with freakish natural talent in martial arts was actually a Formations Grandmaster!","Heavens, the heavens must have been blinded. Otherwise, how could it possibly cause a person to be so freakish?","Shi Yuan had also heard the conversation between the others. He finally knew what that earthen-yellow great dragon was, but knowing it was one matter, and how to resolve it was","another matter.","His only option was to flee.","Right now, Shi Yuan only had one thought on his mind, and that was Ling Han was only at the early stage of the Core Formation Tier, after all. The strength of his soul was definitely limited. Thus, his divine sense couldn’t withstand such expenditure, and it definitely wouldn’t be able to last long.","As a supreme prodigy, he had no lack of firm beliefs. Thus, after having this sliver of hope, he gritted his teeth and persisted, unwilling to give up.","However, reality was incredibly cruel.","Ling Han controlled the Earth Dragon, appearing to be extremely relaxed, and did not look","like he was about to collapse at all.","‘F*ck! You’re far too freakish!’","Everyone was complaining endlessly. Being able to become a Formations Grandmaster when he was only in the Core Formation Tier was already extremely inconceivable, breaking records. However, summoning so many Earth Dragons was obviously extremely exhausting on divine sense, and definitely couldn’t last for too long, but Ling Han’s spiritual power was","like a bottomless pit.","-Just like how battle prowess would be incredibly terrifying after combusting the Imperial Blood, right? But the Imperial Blood would soon be exhausted, and would not be able to last","for too long.","That should be the case as well.","And among them, the one who felt the greatest despair was Shi Yuan.","Ling Han looked completely at ease, and he was about to lose his patience. Willpower could take effect for a short period of time, allowing one to burst out with extraordinary power, but how could it last?","He was really dissatisfied. Ling Han’s cultivation level was far inferior to his, and in terms of battle prowess, it was indeed one-sided to his advantage, but just because the latter was also a Formations Grandmaster, casually summoning a few Earth Dragons, he was beaten to the point of having no temper at all.","However, what he didn’t know was that Ling Han still had many ultimate moves that he hadn’t used yet.","For example, what if the murderous aura attack was combined with the Earth Dragon? Under the effects of the murderous aura, he would fall into a temporary state of confusion. At this time, the Earth Dragon would pounce towards him, so what could he use to block it?","From this aspect, Ling Han had already been very merciful.","“Don’t say, Ling Han is really quite a good person. Even after being provoked by Shi Yuan like","this, he didn’t kill him.”","“That’s right. This kind of person is really hard to come by. He can be considered benevolent.”","“He would be a worthy friend.”","Everyone nodded, seeing Ling Han in a new light.","However, if the large black dog had been here, he would definitely have come to a completely","different conclusion.","-How was Ling Han benevolent? He was simply practicing his technique."]},{"number":4039,"title":"Chapter 4039: Another Version","paragraphs":["Chapter 4039: Another Version","This battle finally ended with Shi Yuan admitting defeat.","Ling Han was still unsatisfied. He had developed the amazing use of Earth Qi, and was just about to grasp it even more proficiently. He had not thought that Shi Yuan would be so decisive.","Sigh, it would have been better if you had persisted a few more times.","Shi Yuan could not bear to stay any longer, and left dejectedly. Meanwhile, the others began to chat with Ling Han. Their words were all very polite, expressing their desire to become friends with him.","Originally, Ling Han had come from the North Heavenly Realm. This was a label of","humiliation. People from the other Heavenly Realms would feel disdain towards him at first sight, but it was a different case now. Ling Han had already used his abilities to prove that he was extraordinary.","Furthermore, such a young Formation Grandmaster was really too awesome.","What did one need the most to explore an ancient site?","Formation Master!","With an extraordinary Formation Master in the team, it could at least double the chances of survival or finding the treasure trove.","Thus, no one would want to offend this kind of person.","Ling Han didn’t put on any airs. He chatted with the others, forming some connections. In the future, when he went to the West, East and South Heavenly Realms, he would at least have a foothold.","After chatting for a while, Ling Han excused himself to rest, and arrived at the stone house that the Demon Race had arranged for him.","Not long after, the large black dog ran over.","“Little Han, you definitely couldn’t expect what Grandpa Dog has found out,” it said mysteriously.","“Speak.”","“You guess.”","“F***, you already said that I wouldn’t think of it, and still want me to guess. Just how much are you asking for a beating?”","“Er!”","The large black dog stuck his tongue out and started to explain.","As it turned out, this Demon Race being actually had a very deep relationship with Divine Rain Venerate as well.","In the past, when Divine Rain Venerate traveled the world, he had also subdued a considerable number of powerful Demonic Beasts, and they becames his beast pets. For Demonic Beasts, being able to follow a Venerate Tier, who was also the descendant of an Ancestral King, this naturally wasn’t embarrassing....","Afterwards, Divine Rain Venerate unexpectedly fell in love when he passed by a place.","Of course, the woman that had moved Divine Rain Venerate was Bai Nanzhen. From then onwards, Divine Rain Venerate lost his lofty aspirations, and settled down here for a long time. In fact, he even established a small world, isolated from the rest of the world. Though those beast pets were unwilling to be mediocre, they still held onto some hope. Who knows, Divine Rain Venerate may have just lost his senses in a moment of love, and would soon come back to his senses. However, Divine Rain Venerate did not come back to his senses. Instead, he very quickly died.","This scared the crap out of those beast pets. A great and mighty Venerate Tier, and his lifespan was hundreds of thousands of years. Even if he couldn’t live to this limit, 80,000 or 90,000 years shouldn’t be a problem, right?","However, when Divine Rain Venerate passed away, he was only 40,000 years old.","This was clearly not right.","Those beast pets suspected that it was the Bai Clan’s doing, and their motive was to snatch the inheritance of Divine Rain Venerate-not only Venerate Tier-level, but also Emperor- level.","Thus, the beast pets worked together to attack, wanting to take down the Bai Clan.","However, they discovered that Divine Rain Venerate had placed restrictions on them, preventing them from attacking humans.","As a result, this battle ended noiselessly.","And before the death of Divine Rain Venerate, everyone had been sealed into this small world. Thus, those beast pets could only die of depression in the end.","Afterwards, the descendants of those beast pets took over the mission of their fathers, wanting to defeat the Bai Clan. Firstly, to seek justice for Divine Rain Venerate, and secondly, to obtain the inheritance of Divine Rain Venerate and leave this small world. Thus, war broke out.","However, the Regulations of this small world were incomplete, and ultimately, the second generation of the beasts could only reach True Self Tier ultimately, which was equivalent to the supreme elites of the Bai Clan. Though they had the advantage in numbers and physique, the Bai Clan was also protected by the precious tool left behind by Divine Rain Venerate, making them return empty-handed.","And just like that, time and time again, the endless war between the Human Race and the Demon Race began.","Yi?","Combined with this version, Divine Rain Venerate was definitely a man with deep feelings and affection. This was completely different from the version of the Bai Clan.","Which image was the real Divine Rain Venerate?","Furthermore, if the Demon Race’s version was true, then it was clearly illogical that Divine Rain Venerate would die at just around 40,000 years old. This kind of elite was close to touching the peak of martial arts, so how could he possibly die so young?","But according to the words of the Demon Race, it was the Bai Clan’s fault?","Was that possible?","The Bai Clan had never been a powerful force. At that time, even in fact, they were only at the level of the Core Formation Tier. It was all thanks to the help of Divine Rain Venerate, who had nurtured a few True Self Tier elites. Who would believe that this kind of force could kill a","Venerate Tier elite?","Hence, the matter was strange.","“Interesting, this is really going to be interesting,” Ling Han murmured.","“Interesting my a*s!” the large black dog shouted. “We need to hurry up and find the Sky Opening Axe. With Grandpa Dog’s freakishness, I’m sure I’ll definitely be able to raise that","axe.”","Ling Han nodded. They indeed had to hurry up. Otherwise, when True Self Tier elites and Spirit Transformation Tier elites came in, then whether there were treasures left behind by Divine Rain Venerate or not, it would have nothing to do with them.","“The problem is, how can we make the Bai Clan hand over the Sky Opening Axe?”","“The forces of the Demon Race are even more powerful. Thus, rather than satisfying the conditions of the Bai Clan and completely eliminating the Demon Race, why don’t we turn the tables and unite the Demon Race together, joining forces to attack the Bai Clan, forcing the Bai Clan to reveal the location of the Sky Opening Axe?”","“M-hm, that’s possible.”","The large black dog went to look for the Blue Demon Tiger King again. He wanted to convince this Demon King, and then join forces with the other Demon Kings to launch an attack","together.","The Demonic Beasts could not penetrate into the Imperial Capital. There were treasures left behind by Divine Rain Venerate there to guard it, but Ling Han thought that since the formations of Ziming Mountain were gradually losing their effectiveness, the Spirit Tool or formations that guarded the Imperial Capital should also be beginning to lose their effectiveness.","Thus, if they launched an attack now, they should be able to take down the Imperial Capital.","The Blue Demon Tiger King was very decisive, and immediately decided to invite the other Demon Kings. The Demon Race had an obsession that was close to madness when it came to conquering the Imperial Capital. Thus, after knowing that the trump card of the Imperial Capital could possibly be weakened, how could they still remain calm?","Not many days later, the various envoys that had been sent out returned with news. They","would join in battle!","The Blue Demon Tiger King immediately mobilized his troops. The great Demon Kings would meet up outside the Imperial Capital, and after completing the gathering of troops, they would then attack the Imperial Capital.","The outsiders naturally followed. For them, this was their last chance. If they still couldn’t conquer the Imperial Capital this time, then a large number of True Self Tier elites would soon come, so there naturally wouldn’t be anything left for them.","Outside the Imperial City, the great Demonic Beasts had all gathered, and added with the considerable number of outsider Demonic Beasts, their lineup was extremely shocking. “Bai Xiangming, immediately open the city gates and surrender!” A Demon King shouted loudly. He was the Horse King, and his lower body was still in the shape of a horse, digging out his four hooves loudly.","“Demonic Race, you have attacked the city time and time again, but when have you ever succeeded?” On top of the city wall, Sea City King, Qian Lang appeared. He stood with his hands clasped behind his back, looking down on all the demons.","“Don’t waste your breath on him, kill him!” the Bear King said. Each of his hands held a golden-purple hammer, and when they touched each other, kuang, a terrifying wave was instantly created.","“Boys, charge with me!”"]},{"number":4040,"title":"Chapter 4040: Platform","paragraphs":["Chapter 4040: Platform","The Bear King was the first to charge over.","On the city wall, the Sea City King smirked coldly. All the cities of the human race had defenses laid out by Divine Rain Venerate, especially the Imperial Capital, which was not something that a True Self Tier could break through at all.","As expected, when the Bear King approached, a flash of light slashed out from within the city.","Pu, even someone as strong as the Bear King was hit. His chest was struck, and blood spurted out madly.","“Hahaha!” Sea City King sneered, “Ignorance!”","This was practically courting death, and he still dared to think of fighting his way into the city?","When the Demon Kings saw this, they all frowned. The defenses of the humans had not weakened at all. This time, they would return empty-handed again.","At this time, the Bear King had also been saved. His face was pale like a piece of golden paper, which was very frightening.","“Don’t retreat!” Yet the Bear King spoke up, “I can feel that the might of that Spirit Tool has weakened considerably. Otherwise, my injuries would probably be a few times worse.”","“Really?” All the Demon Kings perked up.","“If anyone doesn’t believe me, then battle me for 300 rounds!” The Bear King stood up with great difficulty, brandishing its twin hammers, looking incredibly rough.","“All right, we will continue to besiege them!” All the Demon Kings nodded, and decided not to retreat.","Seeing the Demon Race encircle and not attack, the humans on the city wall were all slightly puzzled.","This was illogical.","Human prodigies such as Lu Qi and Feng Jixing also appeared on the city wall, wearing puzzled expressions.","The natives here had already battled countless times, and it could be said that they knew each other very well. However, the present battle situation was illogical. That must be because of the outsiders, which had led to a variable.","What on earth were these people trying to do?","After the Demonic Beasts surrounded the city for a while, they launched an attack from afar to test the might of the city defense.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Multiple attacks were launched, but the Spirit Tool in the city would channel on its own every time, slashing out fierce light, completely destroying all the attacks that assaulted it.","One day, two days, three days, and by the fourth day, everyone shockingly discovered that the light that was shot out was gradually becoming weaker. Some attacks had been intercepted, yet did not disintegrate. They still shot over, and blasted onto the city walls, causing considerable damage.","“Great!” The members of the Demon Race all cheered, and the expressions of the generals and soldiers of the Galewind Nation changed drastically.","After so many years, this was the first time that they discovered that the precious treasure that guarded the city would actually be useless one day.","“Boys, fight for me, make the barrage even fiercer!” All the Demon Kings roared loudly. Even the Bear King had returned. He had already recovered sixty to seventy percent, and was completely capable of fighting again.","It could be clearly seen that the city-guarding Spirit Tool was becoming weaker and weaker, and the power of the light it shot out was becoming weaker and weaker, causing even more attacks to land on the city walls, and also caused the city walls to sway slightly.","“Prepare to charge!” the great Demon Kings all shouted. The obsessions of their ancestors and fathers were finally about to be fulfilled in their hands.","In the end, the city-guarding treasure was completely useless, and no more streak of light slashed out.","“Charge!”","Instantly, the Demonic Race launched an assault. Thousands of Demonic Beasts charged towards the city wall. This was really a stampede of ten thousand beasts. Hong long long, the ground was wailing, raising clouds of dust that covered the skies.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! On the city wall, countless crossbow bolts shot down, turning into a rain of","arrows.","“Mere tricks!” The Horse King soared into the skies, turning into a massive pegasus. It opened its mouth and spat out a screen of light, which instantly blocked all the arrows that filled the skies.","“Horse King, let me fight you!” Sea City King also shot into the skies, and began a fierce battle with Horse King.","In the human race, more and more elites appeared. The Demon Race had already launched an all-out offensive. At this time, no one could just sit by and watch. Even the Emperor of the Galewind Nation, Bai Xiangming, had also stepped into battle. His battle prowess was incredibly powerful, and he actually managed to block two Demon Kings by himself.","It should be known that the individual battle prowess of the Demon Race was superior to the human race. Usually, only the Demon King would be able to fight one against two, or even in fact, against three, but this Bai Xiangming was actually capable of being so strong?","Ling Han looked at him for a while, and realization dawned on him.","It wasn’t that Bai Xiangming was powerful, but rather that the Battle Armor he was wearing was a high-grade precious tool that had boosted his astonishing power, allowing him to possess such awesome battle prowess.","Was this left behind by Divine Rain Venerate?","But even if Bai Xiangming was so strong, faced with this vast army of Demon Race, he was still unable to turn the situation around.","There were too many Demonic Beasts. He would have to block at least ten of them to be able to balance out the battle prowess of the True Self Tier elites on both sides. However, this was","obviously unrealistic.","Thus, the human race was slowly being defeated.","The outsiders all knew their limits. In this kind of situation, they naturally had to prioritize self-preservation. They had no reason or position to risk their lives.","After less than half a day, the human race was routed.","Bai Xiangming had no choice but to surrender.","“Hand over the Sky Opening Axe!” the Demonic Beasts shouted one after another. They naturally hoped to obtain the inheritance of Divine Rain Venerate, and they also thought that","they were the true heirs of Divine Rain Venerate.","The Bai Clan? Hehe, they were just the culprits.","Bai Xiangming shook his head, and said, “I only know where the Sky Opening Axe is, but I","can’t pick it up.”","True, if he could pick it up, he would have long since obtained the inheritance of Venerate Divine Rain Venerate. Could there still be so many things going on?","All the Demon Kings escorted Bai Xiangming to find the Sky Opening Axe. The outsiders","followed him, one after another. Whether it was the humans or the Demon Race, this was a battle that had nothing to do with them. Their only purpose was to obtain the inheritance of Divine Rain Venerate.","The Demon Kings knew that these outsiders had astonishing backgrounds, so they didn’t","press them.","It wasn’t long before they arrived at the foot of a tall mountain behind the Imperial Palace. Bai Xiangming activated several layers of formations, and finally, a platform with a radius of around 21 meters appeared before them. In the middle of the platform, a short-handled axe had struck the platform.","“That is the Sky Opening Axe?” All the Demon Kings’ eyes were burning, and the eyes of the outsiders lit up as well.","This was related to the inheritance of a Venerate Tier elite, and may even be related to the","Imperial Technique.","“That’s right.” Bai Xiangming nodded, “However, to say nothing of picking up the axe, there are not many that can even walk to the front of the Sky Opening Axe.”","“Ha, I don’t believe it!” The Bear King immediately jumped out. He was really an impatient person. Previously, he dared to charge even against the city-guarding Spirit Tool, what more","now.","However, he had just rushed onto the platform, when his figure immediately slowed down. His whole face was wrinkled, as if he was using all his might. Even so, after taking a few steps,","he could no longer move.","“Old Bear, what’s going on?” a Demon King asked.","The Bear King did not answer. Instead, Bai Xiangming spoke up, and said, “The gravity fields on this platform are incredibly terrifying. Furthermore, due to the change in cultivation level,","the higher the cultivation level, the greater the gravity fields.”","So that was the case.","At this moment, the outsiders were all rubbing their fists in anticipation. Under such conditions, the True Self Tier elites wouldn’t be able to gain any advantage at all, and they","would have a chance.","The Demonic Beasts refused to give up, and they all leaped onto the platform. They were much stronger than humans at the same cultivation level, so there was no reason that they couldn’t do the same.","However, these Demon Kings had only rushed forward a few steps, when they were defeated","just like the Bear King.","“Hahaha!”","The outsiders roared with laughter as they entered the arena."]},{"number":4041,"title":"Chapter 4041: Influencing Formations","paragraphs":["Chapter 4041: Influencing Formations","The platform’s design obviously was not to allow elites to win, but rather depended on natural talent.","The higher one’s natural talent, the stronger one would be at the same cultivation level. Only then would one be able to reach the end and pick up the Sky Opening Axe.","As expected, the Demonic Beasts couldn’t do it, but there was no shortage of top-notch prodigies among the outsiders. They were completely capable of resisting the weight of gravity, and walked steadily forwards.","“Get lost!”","“You’re the one who should get lost!”","“The Sky Opening Axe is mine!”","Everyone came to blows, stopping others from surpassing themselves.","Though prodigies like Feng Jixing and Lu Qi were also affected by the gravity fields, and could no longer use movement techniques, each step was extremely steady. They had only descended to walking like a normal person, and for them, how long would a distance of 21 meters take?","However, they weren’t the only prodigies. At present, top-notch prodigies from the North, South, East, and West Heavenly Realms had also arrived. At least a dozen over people were no weaker than Feng Jixing and the others, and the competition was extremely intense.","They attacked each other, each wanting to stop the others, so that they could take the initiative.","In this situation, Feng Jixing and the other former Cauldron Forging Tier prodigies were completely at a disadvantage. Though their natural talent was not inferior to others at all, their cultivation level was too low. They were merely in the early stage of Core Formation Tier, and their battle prowess could not possibly exceed Tenth Heaven, at most. How could they compete with the veteran prodigies of Core Formation Tier?","Right now, Sha Yang, Zhu Yixiu, and the others were the ones in the lead. They were all ranked in the top ten Core Formation Tiers on the Galaxy Network.","“Little Han, quick, we can’t allow others to snatch away the Sky Opening Axe!” the large black dog called out. He had instigated the Tiger King to join forces with the other Demonic Kings in this battle with all his might, so how could he allow others to take advantage of it?","Ling Han nodded in understanding. He leaped into the arena, and he instantly felt a burst of power pulling him toward the ground.","However, this kind of gravity field was completely no big deal for him. He didn’t need to use much power to completely disperse it.","Was this a gravity formation?","Ling Han was extremely interested in formations at this moment, so he immediately unleashed his divine sense to investigate this formation.","“Yi, Little Han, why aren’t you moving?” The large black dog asked in confusion. Even he","didn’t feel much pressure, so Ling Han was definitely having an easier time. Why was he not moving?","“You go first,” Ling Han said.","“But the Sky Opening Axe!” the large black dog exclaimed anxiously.","Ling Han smiled and said, “It’s fine. There are too many people competing now, so the result won’t be decided in the short term.”","The large black dog was rendered speechless upon hearing this.","Ling Han multitasked. As he conversed with the large black dog, he had already begun to study this formation.","Very quickly, a smile appeared at the corners of his lips.","If he wanted to set up such a formation again, merely learning the formation patterns would need a considerably long amount of time. However, if he only had to make slight changes, this was very simple.","‘Come, let’s play around.’","Ling Han stepped lightly on the ground, and his divine sense instantly surged, causing the Earth Qi to undergo a slight change.","All of a sudden, those prodigies that were battling stumbled, and almost fell.","“What’s going on?”","“The weight of gravity has suddenly increased tenfold!”","“Why did the formation suddenly change?”","Everyone exclaimed in shock. This was too inconceivable. Their cultivation levels had not changed, so the effects of the gravity formation on them should also be unchanging. Why was it suddenly different?","No one knew why, but after being stunned for a moment, everyone immediately began","fighting again.","Ling Han smiled, and with another stomp of his foot, a slight change once again took place in the formation.","Instantly, all the prodigies were thrown off their feet.","“F*ck! The gravity field has weakened now!”","Regardless of whether the gravity fields were strong or weak, they would have an effect as long as they existed, especially in an intense battle. The gravity fields fluctuating in strength would have too great an effect on them.","Everyone was cursing. What was going on here? Couldn’t they fight properly?","They were all baffled. However, the large black dog turned to look at Ling Han. Was this guy the one who had screwed them over?","That must be it. Looking at the sly smile on this guy’s face, there was definitely no mistake. Ling Han found this very interesting. With each step, he continuously affected the Earth Qi, causing subtle changes to take place in the formation, causing the gravity field that everyone endured to fluctuate in strength, causing everyone to complain endlessly.","“Ling Han, is this your doing?” a member of the Demon Race shouted.","“That’s right, was it you?” Another few Demon Race cultivators came to a sudden realization. They had seen the battle between Ling Han and Shi Yuan before. Shi Yuan clearly possessed an absolute advantage in terms of battle prowess, yet he had still been defeated by Ling Han with the help of Earth Qi.","This proved that Ling Han possessed the ability of a Formations Grandmaster.","The gravity fields on this platform differed from person to person. That was obviously a formation. Thus, when the gravity fields changed strangely, it must be Ling Han’s doing. “Hahaha!” The large black dog immediately laughed loudly. These idiots finally came to a realization. Sigh, they were so stupid, yet they still claimed that they were prodigies. Ling Han spread his hands, and asked with a smile, “What did I do?”","“It must be you!”","Seeing his expression, how could everyone not understand? They all charged over.","Ling Han smiled, and his divine sense once again affected the formation. Instantly, these prodigies all fell to the ground. Now, the gravity field that targeted them had suddenly reached the level of the True Self Tier. Even if their battle prowess reached over twenty Heavens, so what? They could only fall down solidly.","“Why are you so fierce? You make me so scared!” Ling Han shook his head, and looked","towards the large black dog, “Come, let’s get to work!”","“Work on what?” The large black dog was a little confused.","“What are you acting for? Just do your old job!” Ling Han said.","“Oh, Grandpa Dog understands now!” The large black dog snickered, and began to search","them one by one.","No matter what treasures you have on you, I’ll take them all.","“Damn dog, return my Spatial Spirit Tool!”","“Ah, my Ten Thousand Year Treasured Herb!”","“My Thousand Essence Gold!”","Everyone screamed in agony. They hadn’t obtained the inheritance of Divine Rain Venerate,","yet their treasures had been cleaned out. How could they endure this?","“Thank you, thank you, everyone!” The large black dog thanked them cheekily as he","ransacked them cleanly. His dog’s eyes were all smiles.","“Ling Han, you are too despicable!”","“If you can, fight me openly!”","“I look down on you!”","Everyone called out. Some were really furious, while others were just trying to spur him on.","Ling Han shrugged and said, “You speak as if I wasn’t the one who suppressed you guys with","my abilities.”","Everyone was furious. Indeed, it was Ling Han that had trapped them on the ground, but this formation was not laid out by Ling Han, so what was there to be so smug about?","“Little Han, it’s done.” The large black dog ran over, “Watch Grandpa Dog swing the axe and","open the sky!”","It walked to the side of the Sky Opening Axe, stretched out a paw, and assumed a very bold posture, but the awkward thing was that the axe did not move the slightest bit.","“This... that... this time doesn’t count. Let’s do it again!” Even with how thick-skinned the","large black dog was, he was still slightly unable to bear it. Hurriedly, he placed his other paw","on it as well, and exerted all his strength.","However, the axe still did not move in the slightest."]},{"number":4042,"title":"Chapter 4042: Opening the Heavens","paragraphs":["Chapter 4042: Opening the Heavens","“F***, get out for Grandpa Dog!”","“You’re teasing Grandpa Dog!”","“What kind of damn axe is this? Grandpa Dog will fight you to the death!”","The large black dog howled in pain as he desperately tried to pull out the axe. However, the axe remained unmoving, and this caused the large black dog to want to vomit blood.","This was too humiliating.","Ling Han was also surprised. The large black dog had fused the Nine Cauldrons into one, and even he did not have the right to pull out the Sky Opening Axe. Then even if Imperial Son and Imperial Daughter came, they would only be able to watch helplessly, right?","“Old Black, let me try.” He walked over.","The large black dog was still unwilling to give up, and called out ‘yi, yi, yi, yi’ for a long time, before finally letting go, “Pei, it must be that this axe does not match Grandpa Dog’s horoscope.”","Ling Han stretched out a hand and grabbed it. Then, he took a slight breath, and began to pull. Instantly, he discovered that an extremely weak power was transmitted from within the axe. It could also be called a wave, and it was flowing into his body.","Ling Han hurriedly let go. This was the instinctive reaction of a cultivator.","“Little Han, what’s wrong?” the large black dog asked.","“Did you feel a ripple from the axe just now?” Ling Han asked.","“Yes, but it doesn’t have much effect.” The large black dog looked especially bold and casual about it.","Fine then.","However, when everyone saw this, they all thought that Ling Han was clearly unable to pull out the axe, yet had found an excuse for himself.","“Ling Han, hurry up and let me up. I’ll pull out the Sky Opening Axe. If I obtain the inheritance of Divine Rain Venerate, I can let you benefit from it as well.”","“Let me do it. I’m the seventh strongest elite in Core Formation Tier of the South Heavenly Realm.”","“I’ll go!”","Everyone called out, and began to place bids, promising benefits. Even the large black dog’s eyes lit up in excitement.","Yet Ling Han smiled, and said to the large black dog, “Looks like you didn’t search thoroughly enough.”","“I fell for it!” The large black dog slapped his thigh, and said, “Good one, you people! You actually dare to keep this a secret! Hand it over to Grandpa Dog!”","It went to do another body search.","Ling Han once again gripped the Sky Opening Axe. That feeling came again. This time, Ling Han did not let go, and merely guarded his mind tightly. However, this wave of power had directly rushed into his mind.","This?","Ling Han sensed for a while, and discovered that this wave did not have much destructive power. Rather than calling it an attack wave, it would be better to call it a scanning wave, which was very similar to Wally’s scan.","With this in mind, he no longer resisted, and allowed this wave of power to surge into the mind.","Instantly, the Primal Chaos Celestial Core vibrated lightly.","This wave immediately subsided like the ebbing tide, and instantly retreated out of Ling Han’s mind.","Yi, going back and forth, what was it playing at?","Ling Han thought for a moment, and ignored this. He exerted some force in his hand, and discovered that the axe had loosened slightly.","He exerted some more force, and saw that the Sky Opening Axe had been pulled out.","Was it difficult?","Not even a little bit!","“F***, have you cheated, brat?” The large black dog saw this from the corner of his eye, and immediately jumped up. He was so shocked that his eyes were about to pop out of his head.","“What cheat? Speak reasonably!” Ling Han said with a smile.","Everyone was also stunned. They had not thought that the second person to attempt would be able to pull out the Sky Opening Axe. F***, you speak so mysteriously, and the result? There was no difficulty level at all, all right?","However, Bai Xiangming was shocked to the extreme. Generation after generation of the Bai Clan had attempted this before, from low to high cultivation level, but none of them had succeeded.","This brat was practically a freak.","Ling Han gave a powerful wave, and slashed the Sky Opening Axe at the skies. Instantly, a cold light slashed out from the axe, and a fissure actually appeared in the skies.","F***, could this thing really open the sky?","Ling Han was shocked. When he had been in the small world, he had opened the sky once, but the situation now was completely different.","The sky split apart, and a blue light surged out, enshrouding Ling Han. Instantly, Ling Han’s figure floated up out of thin air, flying towards the opening that had been created.","“Old Black!” Ling Han roared loudly. He spread open his right hand, and Earth Qi surged out, surging out of the ground like a fountain. The large black dog flew towards Ling Han with a swoosh.","If the large black dog stayed at the bottom, he would definitely be torn to shreds by the","masses.","“Holy motherf*cker!” the large black dog wailed in agony. He covered his behind with his front paws, tears streaming down his face.","F***, it hurt too much.","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and grabbed hold of the large black dog that was flying over. Xiu, with a flash of blue light, he and the large black dog were both sucked into that crack in the skies. Then, the crack closed, and everything returned to normal.","Yi?","What happened to opening the sky?","Once Ling Han left, the effects on the formation immediately disappeared. All the prodigies stood up. They raised their heads to look at the sky. The sky had indeed split open for a while, but it immediately closed back up again. What the hell was this?","Right at this moment, a great many figures flew over, exuding an incredibly powerful aura.","True Self Tier!","Everyone tensed up as realization dawned on them. The restriction of the formation had disappeared further, and now, elites of the True Self Tier could enter.","“What’s going on?” a True Self Tier elite asked.","After everyone explained, these True Self Tier elites were all stunned. What was going on? They had just arrived, and the sky had already opened, and the inheritance had also disappeared. Then what was the point of them working so hard?","“When Ling Han comes out, if he obtains the inheritance of the Great Emperor, he definitely","can’t enjoy it alone!”","These True Self Tier elites reached a consensus.","Meanwhile, Ling Han and the large black dog were sucked into that crack. Instantly, the blue light disappeared, and they both fell from the sky. Thankfully, with their strength, they naturally could not possibly land painfully. They both straightened their backs and stood","upright.","Where was this?","The surroundings were pitch-black, and there was not the slightest bit of light.","Ling Han activated his eye technique, and instantly, even the darkness couldn’t stop him. He","saw that this was a stone chamber. It wasn’t big, and there was a stone table in the corner with","something on it.","“Aiyo, Grandpa Dog’s a** is about to explode!” Meanwhile, the large black dog was still moaning. That Earth Qi just happened to hit his behind, and even with the protection of his","iron underwear, he still felt a deep pain.","“Little Hann, what kind of sky-opening act is this?” After groaning for a while, the large","black dog asked.","Ling Han smiled, “Opening the sky is only one way of putting it. Looks like this place was set","up by Divine Rain Venerate, and we will soon get the answer.”","He walked towards the wall, then stopped by the stone table.","The large black dog also approached, covering his behind as he did so. There was a personal","note on the stone table, as well as a jade pendant.","“This should have been left behind by Divine Rain Venerate.”","“Let’s take a look.”","They took the logbook and began to flip through it.","As expected, this had been left behind by Divine Rain Venerate. It could be considered a diary,","but it could also be considered a will.","In the notebook, Divine Rain Venerate started to talk about the events of who knew how many millenia ago from his point of view.","When Divine Rain Venerate met Bai Nanzhen, he fell in love with her at first sight, and thus stopped his travels. He was completely focused on accompanying the woman he loved, and after spending two years together, he asked the Bai Clan for her hand in marriage.","For the Bai Clan, being able to take in a Venerate Tier as a son-in-law, what kind of glory was","that?","Without any obstruction, Divine Rain Venerate married the woman he loved and lived a happy","life.","If it only ended here, then everyone should be happy. How could there possibly appear two completely different versions of the story in the Bai Clan and the Demon Race?","Ling Han and the large black dog continued to read. What led to the accident was precisely the identity of Divine Rain Venerate as the descendant of an Ancestral King."]},{"number":4043,"title":"Chapter 4043: Third Version","paragraphs":["Chapter 4043: Third Version","At first, the Bai Clan did not know that Divine Rain Venerate was a descendant of a Great Emperor, but in a coincidental conversation, they found out about this fact.","This caused the Bai Clan to have devious thoughts.","This was the Great Emperor’s inheritance. If they could obtain it, the Bai Clan would become the strongest force in the world in a single leap.","They immediately put their plans into action, and had Bai Nanzhen hold back Divine Rain Venerate. Otherwise, Divine Rain Venerate would have already planned to leave with Bai Nanzhen, and take a look at the various planets in the universe.","Sure enough, it was true that Divine Rain Venerate, who had fallen into a tender trap, decided to stay here for a while longer for the sake of his beloved wife. That was because his beloved wife had said that after she left, who knew how many years it would be before she would return. She would miss her parents and family, and wanted to spend more time with them","now.","In the end, the Bai Clan made use of the resources of Divine Rain Venerate to buy a slow- acting poison on the Galaxy Network, which Bai Nanzhen placed in the food of Divine Rain Venerate.","Of course, Bai Nanzhen did not know that she had poisoned her husband, and only thought that it was a tonic, so that they could quickly have a child. Thus, she was too embarrassed to tell Divine Rain Venerate about this.","When Divine Rain Venerate discovered that he had been poisoned, the poison had already seeped into his bones, and could no longer be treated.","That was because he would never have imagined that the woman he loved would actually poison him.","Then, he made a decision. He removed the Bai Clan and its subordinate regions from the great world, and used materials on the level of Great Emperor to construct a small world, imprisoning the Bai Clan in it eternally.","“F***, why don’t we kill those people from the Bai Clan?” The large black dog roared in anger, “If it was Grandpa Dog, Grandpa Dog would kill whoever dares to harm me!”","Ling Han was also confused. This Divine Rain Venerate was truly a big-hearted person. She had already poisoned you, yet you had only imprisoned her. In this Mystery Realm, the Bai Clan was still mighty and domineering, not receiving the punishment that they deserved at all.","He continued reading. As it turned out, Divine Rain Venerate loved Bai Nanzhen too much, and was actually afraid that she would find out the truth of the matter, and feel bitterly disappointed at her clan.","-In any case, he was about to die, so what need was there to make the woman he loved feel sad?","“Grandpa Dog is really speechless!” The large black dog supported its head with its paw, “How could there be such an idiot? Grandpa Dog is about to go crazy!”","Ling Han sighed, “Perhaps this is true love.”","“Che, Grandpa Dog isn’t that kind!” the large black dog humphed.","When they read further, this Divine Rain Venerate was practically the number one good person in the world. Part of the reason why he had trapped the Bai Clan in this Mystery Realm was to punish the Bai Clan, but the more important reason was actually because he wanted the Bai Clan to know that wealth would lead to ruin.","Without enough strength, even if you were given the inheritance of the Ancestral King, it would only cause you to die even faster.","Thus, Divine Rain Venerate had set up the test of the Sky Opening Axe. Only those who had formed Nine Cauldrons and completed the Fusion Cauldron with their own power would be qualified to receive his inheritance.","This was the lowest standard for becoming a Great Emperor. Otherwise, without the support of the corresponding background, obtaining the Imperial Technique would only attract covetous eyes, and cause death.","Unfortunately, after so many years, the Bai Clan had not produced a single person that met the criteria.","Nine Cauldrons was something that even the Imperial Son and Imperial Daughter could not accomplish, what more when it was the members of the Bai Clan.","“No wonder Grandpa Dog couldn’t hold up the Sky Opening Axe. As it turned out, this actually required one to use one’s own power to complete the Fusion Cauldron!” The large black dog finally knew why. He looked towards Ling Han, “Aside from a freak like you, even an Imperial Son and Imperial Daughter would not be able to do it, right?”","Ling Han nodded slowly. It was no wonder that the Imperial Clan couldn’t produce a second Ancestral King. That was because the lowest standard for becoming a Great Emperor was fusing the Nine Cauldrons, and one would have to rely on one’s own power to accomplish that. The Imperial Clan had completely relied on the Imperial Weapon to produce the Fusion Cauldron, which was equivalent to ending their own path.","But since Divine Rain Venerate knew about this, then the other Imperial Clan elites should also know. Why would they still use the Imperial Weapon to create the Fusion Cauldron?","Because it was too difficult to fuse the Nine Cauldrons into one. Without the help of the Imperial Weapon, these Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters could only watch helplessly. In that case, since they couldn’t become a Great Emperor, they would naturally use the Imperial Weapon to attain the Fusion Cauldron to make themselves as powerful as possible. This was equivalent to cultivating an additional cultivation level, and they would always be stronger than cultivators of the same cultivation level in the future.","From this, it could be seen how difficult it was to become a Great Emperor. Fusing the Nine Cauldrons was only the lowest requirement. In future, there would also be various freakish requirements, and only then would it be able to stump generation after generation of","prodigies.","Throughout history, those who could become Emperors could really be counted on one hand. Divine Rain Venerate could be considered to have put in a lot of effort. The elites of the Bai Clan were too weak, and had absolutely no ability to protect the Emperor-level inheritance, yet insisted on being greedy. Divine Rain Venerate could only imprison them, unless there was a prodigy that could fuse the Nine Cauldrons into one with his own power. Only then would he be qualified to walk out of the Mystery Realm.","“After talking for so long, where exactly is the Emperor’s inheritance?” The large black dog became anxious. He very much disagreed with Divine Rain Venerate’s actions, and thought that he was extremely idiotic. However, Divine Rain Venerate had been dead for who knew how many years, so he would not vent his anger on a dead person. Thus, he only paid attention to the whereabouts of the Emperor-level inheritance.","They continued reading, yet were surprised.","As it turned out, Ancestral King Lingtian hadn’t passed down the inheritance of the Imperial Weapon. Instead, in his old age, he took the Imperial Weapon to the edge of the universe. From then onwards, there was no news of him ever again.","People never wanted to die. Someone as powerful as the Ancestral King, who ruled over the world, naturally wanted even less to die. However, even though the Great Emperor was invincible, he was still no match for the passing of time. There would eventually come a day","when he died.","Thus, Ancestral King Lingtian rushed to the edge of the universe in search of immortality. “Yi, why is it the same as Brother Monkey’s ancestor?” Ling Han murmured. The Battle Saint Emperor had also gone to the edge of the universe to seek the method of immortality. The two Ancestral Kings had chosen the same path one after another. Did this mean that there really was a technique of immortality in this world?","But if there was, then why hadn’t the Battle Saint Emperor and Ancestral King Lingtian","returned?","Could it be that there was anywhere in this world that could trap an Ancestral King?","Moreover, why did the Great Emperor only go there in his old age? Was it because that place was extremely dangerous, and even the invincible Great Emperor didn’t have much confidence, so that was why he only went there at the end of his life?","All of a sudden, countless guesses surged through Ling Han’s mind. He also had an urge to immediately set out to the periphery of the universe to explore the truth of that place. However, without the means of the Great Emperor, he probably wouldn’t be able to reach anywhere even if he spent his entire lifespan on the Transfer Formation, because there was no Transfer Formation there at all. He could only go on foot. With his mere cultivation level of the Core Formation Tier, he wouldn’t be able to reach the edge of the universe even if he ran","for 10,000 years.","“I really want to immediately become a Great Emperor!” Ling Han mumbled to himself. He","was too curious.","“Don’t worry, you can definitely do it, brat.” The large black dog patted Ling Han’s shoulder, “At that time, Grandpa Dog will go with you.”","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, “All right. When the time comes, we’ll go and explore. What secrets are hidden there that can allow one to live forever?”","“However, let’s just see what Divine Rain Venerate left for us first!” The large black dog’s expression immediately changed, and it was filled with greed."]},{"number":4044,"title":"Chapter 4044: Ten Cultivation Technique","paragraphs":["Chapter 4044: Ten Cultivation Technique","Aside from a notebook, Divine Rain Venerate had also left behind a jade pendant.","Jade pendant?","“We’re done for. Just this jade pendant? Is it so that Grandpa Dog can pick up girls?” The large black dog screamed. The sky had been opened with great difficulty, and in the end, they had only found out the truth of the matter all those years ago, as well as a jade pendant.","Ling Han picked up the jade pendant and inserted his divine sense into it. Mysterious symbols instantly appeared in his mind.","Pa, the jade pendant instantly shattered.","“Say, Little Han, even if you’re angry, there’s no need to crush the jade pendant. Who knows, it might even be worth some money,” the large black dog said gloomily.","“The jade pendant contains a cultivation technique!” Ling Han said solemnly.","“Imperial Technique?” The large black dog immediately perked up.","Ling Han shook his head, “I don’t know yet. My mind is filled with extremely complicated seals, and I can’t analyze them at the moment. Wait for a while.”","“Go ahead! Go ahead!” The large black dog rubbed his paws together, looking very excited.","Ling Han began to analyze these seals, using his super strong comprehension ability to investigate the secrets within.","Bit by bit, a secret technique revealed its true appearance to him.","“Ten Cultivation Technique!”","Ling Han murmured. This was a secret technique that he had analyzed from these seals. It was not a cultivation technique that refined heaven and earth’s energy, nor was it a martial arts technique that attacked and killed enemies, but a healing technique.","No matter how serious his injuries were, he would be able to recover very quickly if he channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique. The time would depend on the extent of his injuries, and if he had cultivated the Ten Cultivation Technique to the highest cultivation level, as long as his lifespan was not exhausted, he would be able to reconstruct his body with a single thought.","However, to cultivate to the point of rebirth with a single thought, the prerequisite was the cultivation level of Great Emperor Tier.","Hehe.","To say the least, Saints could be reborn from a drop of blood, while Venerate Tiers could regrow their severed limbs, which was incredibly amazing.","Because this was an Imperial Technique!","“This is something good!” Even Ling Han was excited. After he explained the effects of the Ten Cultivation Technique to the large black dog, the large black dog also jumped up and down in excitement. This was too practical; this was a life-saving divine technique.","At present, Ling Han was still unable to teach the Ten Cultivation Technique to the large black dog, because though he had analyzed the secrets of these seals, he was unable to turn them into words to be heard by the large black dog.","That was too profound.","Thus, Ling Han had to master it first, and then reconstruct these seals. Then, he would teach these seals to the large black dog, so that it could comprehend on its own.","Then, if he could learn it, he could learn it. If he couldn’t learn it, there was nothing he could do.","Imperial Technique was naturally not something that anyone could learn just because they wanted to.","Ling Han began to practice the Ten Cultivation Technique, completely forgetting the passing of time. After who knew how long, he suddenly came to a realization.","The process of cultivating the Ten Cultivation Technique was a process of reconstructing these seals, and then combining them into a seal.","Combining the seals in different ways would have completely different effects. As for how to achieve the best effects, that could only be done as one’s cultivation level increased, and their cognition of the seals would also increase, continuously increasing the might of the seals. After these seals were combined, Ling Han channeled them, and these seals were extracting high-level energy. However, it was completely different from the high-level energy that Ling Han had previously come into contact with. This kind of energy was filled with vitality and flowed in his body, instantly healing a few hidden injuries.","Impressive!","Ling Han didn’t continue to cultivate. Instead, he opened his eyes, looked at the large black dog, and asked, “How long have I been in seclusion for?”","“Grandpa Dog is about to become a fossil. How long do you think it was?” The large black dog sighed.","Er, he could still speak so cheekily, which meant that not too much time had passed.","Sure enough, the large black dog soon revealed the time that Ling Han had actually spent. It was a month and a half.","One and a half months to master a secret technique. This was really slow.","Ling Han stretched out a finger and tapped the large black dog’s forehead. Instantly, countless seals surged towards him.","The large black dog humphed upon hearing this. He couldn’t endure receiving so many symbols at once, and it was as if his mind were about to explode.","However, the large black dog quickly adjusted his state of mind and started to cultivate.","Meanwhile, Ling Han walked around. This stone chamber wasn’t big, and he couldn’t see any mechanism at all. How could he open it?","A thought flashed in his mind. The inheritance here was the Ten Cultivation Technique, so if he stimulated this secret technique, would it resonate with the stone chamber and open it?","It was possible.","However, the large black dog was still cultivating, so he would give it some time first. At least, it could digest those seals first. As for combinations, he could take his time in the","future.","He couldn’t help but think that the members of the Bai Clan had gone to great lengths to obtain the inheritance of the Ancestral King, and though this Ten Cultivation Technique was a genuine Imperial Technique, if it was obtained by the members of the Bai Clan, it would only make them a target to be hunted down.","-The Ten Cultivation Technique could not help a clan become a Venerate Tier, Saint Tier, or even a Great Emperor-level force in a single leap.","At that time, Ancestral King Lingtian definitely created the Imperial Technique, which was not just limited to the Ten Cultivation Technique. However, it was unknown whether it had been lost, or it was the deliberate actions of Divine Rain Venerate. Now, there was only one Imperial Technique, which was passed down.","After feeling rueful for a while, Ling Han decided to break through to the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier.","Previously, he was still lacking a bit of experience, but in the past month or so, he had been studying the Imperial Technique, and had actually unknowingly gained enough experience. Thus, he now possessed the qualifications to attempt breaking through to the middle stage of","the Core Formation Tier.","‘Come then. I can’t waste any more time.’","Ling Han sat down cross-leggedly, and began to charge towards the next stage.","Breaking through to the next minor level wasn’t difficult for Ling Han. Since he had grasped","an opportunity, he naturally leaped over it.","Instantly, an earth-shattering and tsunami-like change took place in his body. Even if this place was in some unknown time and space, there was still endless energy that came from the heaven and earth, and was madly absorbed by Ling Han.","His power was skyrocketing!","This process continued for close to a day, and only then did it finally slow down from its violent state, turning into a trickle, and finally stop.","In Ling Han’s mind, the only Celestial Cauldron had completely disappeared. Now, there was only that Primal Chaos Celestial Core, floating, exuding a boundless primal, supreme aura. As long as one’s cultivation level was inferior to Ling Han, he could only prostrate in front of","him.","The middle stage of the Core Formation Tier!","Ling Han stimulated his power, and couldn’t help but look pleasantly surprised.","“Fifteenth Heaven!”","“Haha, once I break through to the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier, my original","power will directly soar to 15 Heavems. Going by that logic, if I reach the end of the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier, then how much power will I be able to reach? Twenty","Heavens?”","If he could reach 20 Heavens, then he could cast the celestial technique, and use the Primal Chaos Celestial Core to further weaken the opponent’s battle prowess. Then, he would completely be able to fight a guy with battle prowess of 25th or 26th Heaven.","Just ask the world, how many people could reach battle prowess above twenty-five Heavens?","Impressive, too impressive!","After Ling Han secretly delighted for a while, he decided to continue cultivating.","The second step of the Core Formation Tier was to nurture the Celestial Core.","He drew out the natural treasures that he had long since prepared, including the three precious treasures that the Ancient Sun Saint had left behind, and began to refine them. These natural treasures were refined one after another, and Ling Han’s Celestial Core was also slowly growing stronger. The speed at which he refined the mystical power was getting faster and faster, and the effects were getting better and better."]},{"number":4045,"title":"Chapter 4045: Coercion from the Venerate Tiers","paragraphs":["Chapter 4045: Coercion from the Venerate Tiers","When one had reached the Core Formation Tier, cultivation could be considered a two-step process.","The first step was changes to the Celestial Core. This determined the power of the cultivator, and the other was the accumulation of mystical power. This would determine the endurance of the cultivator in battle.","For Ling Han, his endurance had long since reached the level of Sect Master. Thus, what he had to do was very simple. He only had to focus on improving the Celestial Core.","One month, two months, three months. Time passed very quickly, and when Ling Han refined all the natural treasures he had prepared, the large black dog finally finished analyzing all those seals.","Analyzing it was one matter, and reconstructing it was another.","Thus, if the large black dog wanted to truly use the Ten Cultivation Technique, it would probably take at least a year.","However, it was fine as long as he had a preliminary grasp of it. That way, he would not forget it as time passed.","“Old Black, we should leave,” Ling Han said.","Now, he really couldn’t stay any longer. The cultivation resources he had prepared had already been used up, and it would only be a waste of time.","“All right.” The large black dog nodded, “However, how do we get out?”","“Let me give it a try.”","Ling Han pressed his hands on the wall, then channelled the Ten Cultivation Technique. A miraculous thing happened. The whole wall actually began to light up, then became transparent, and finally disappeared.","Yi?","When they appeared out of thin air, they saw that they were presently in a desolate plain, and there were people all around them. There were people of all cultivation levels.","They had come out!","Ling Han could grasp the things that had disappeared in the Mystery Realm. Those were the Regulations of heaven and earth. Only the true great world possessed them, and they were complete.","“He’s out!”","“Ling Han is out!”","“Finally!”","All around them, everyone was cheering loudly, appearing to be incredibly excited.","Ling Han chuckled. What did it have to do with these people whether he came out or not? Why were they so excited?","“Ling Han, you’ve obtained the inheritance of Divine Rain Venerate, haven’t you?” someone immediately asked. This was a True Self Tier elite, and he had a sense of superiority from a superior position.","-No matter how outstanding you are, if there is a gap of a major tier in cultivation level, you are trash in my eyes.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Whether I have obtained it or not, this is my personal matter. What business is it of yours?”","“Humph, what an arrogant brat. You haven’t even entered the True Self Tier yet!” the True Self Tier elite said in displeasure.","“Enough with the nonsense!” Another True Self Tier elite stepped out, “Hand over the inheritance of the Divine Rain Venerate. This is not yours alone!”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “You guys want to become robbers?”","As he spoke, he communicated with the ley lines. This was a great world, and there were naturally many ley lines on a real planet. The nearest ley line exit was only more than 15km away from him. It was completely usable.","In this way, he was naturally filled with confidence.","“What a stubborn guy. If we don’t make him suffer a little, it looks like he won’t listen!” someone sneered.","This was a Sect Master elite!","Now that such an elite had spoken, no matter how prodigious he was, he could only obediently shut his mouth.","“You want to pick on the weak?” Ling Han glared at the Sect Master, not backing down at all.","“Ha, you’re courting death!” The Sect Master moved, and grabbed out at Ling Han. He had absolutely no intention of interrogating Ling Han. He would directly search Ling Han’s soul, and only then would he be able to obtain all the secrets.","“Humph, you dare to touch the disciple of our Nine Suns Holy Land?” With a cold laugh, xiu, a figure had already stood in front of Ling Han. Then, he raised a palm, and delivered a slap at the Sect Master elite.","This person’s speed was too fast. He had stepped right in between Ling Han and the Sect Master, and then shot out a palm strike. Everything happened in one go, and even time seemed to have stopped.","Thus, the Sect Master couldn’t react in time at all. Pa! He was instantly struck head-on, and he was sent tumbling through the air. He then crashed to the ground, causing a cloud of dust and sand to billow into the air.","Hiss, the dignified Sect Master was actually sent flying with a single slap?","Everyone was stunned. F***, who was this person that had come? He was too awesome, wasn’t he?","This naturally was the Nine Mountains Venerate.","“Nine Mountains, isn’t it demeaning to show off your might to a junior?” A voice rang out.","The Nine Mountains Venerate looked towards a certain direction, and asked, “Dragon Seventh?”","“Hehe, it’s been a few thousand years since we parted, so you still remember me?” An old man walked out. He was tall and slender, and there was actually a pair of horns on his head. They looked a little like antlers, but were much longer.","The Dragon Seven Venerate was from the Dragon Race. Of course, this Dragon Race was self-proclaimed by them, and actually belonged to the Flood Dragon Race. It was completely unrelated to the True Dragon.","After the death of the first generation Divine Beast, there were no more pure-blooded Divine Beasts in the world.","The Nine Mountains Venerate humphed, and said, “Someone bullied my disciple, so can’t I","slap him?”","Dragon Seventh Venerate chuckled, “I can’t be bothered to interfere in this matter. However, your disciple has obtained the inheritance of Divine Rain Venerate. I am very interested, so allow me to search his soul. I can guarantee that I will not harm him in the slightest.” “What a joke!” The Nine Mountains Venerate instantly rebuked coldly, “Your divine sense is so powerful. If you search his soul once, would he still have any future prospects?” “Hehe, I didn’t take his life, am I not merciful enough?” the Dragon Seventh Venerate said with a smile.","In the eyes of a Venerate Tier elite, no matter how brilliant you were, you were only an ant.","Was it not enough to spare your life?","Ling Han looked over at Dragon Seventh Venerate, committing this old geezer’s appearance and soul fluctuations to memory. When he became a Venerate Tier in the future, he would definitely slap this old b@stard’s mouth.","The Nine Mountains Venerate shook his head, and said, “Step back. I’m bringing my disciple","back!”","“Nine Mountains, even if I agree not to make things difficult for you, there are still a great many people that would not agree.” Dragon Seventh Venerate smirked coldly.","“That’s right. I disagree.”","“I also disagree.”","“I too am very interested in the inheritance of Divine Rain Venerate.”","“...”","Multiple voices rang out, and one after another, elderly men and women walked out from the surroundings. However, there was also one that was very young. He looked to be thirty years old at most, and his true age was at most a few thousand years old. The flame of life was incredibly vigorous, and was boundlessly terrifying.","The Nine Mountains Venerate’s eyes focused on that person, and his pupils involuntarily contracted slightly. “Luo Wuding!”","Luo Wuding from the Imperial Clan, he had become a Venerate Tier elite after cultivating for 5000 years. Everyone said that he had hopes of becoming a Saint.","Luo Wuding smiled faintly, “Brother Nine Mountains.”","The Nine Mountains Venerate couldn’t help but feel rueful, saying, “The first time I saw you,","you were only at the Core Formation Tier. I never thought that after such a long time, you","would already become a Venerable Tier elite, capable of being my equal.”","“Nine Mountains, don’t talk about unrelated matters!” Dragon Seventh Venerate said impatiently, “Do you still want to protect your disciple now?”","The Nine Mountains Venerate, said proudly, “With me here, don’t even think of touching a","single hair on his head!”","“Nine Mountains, what need is there for this?” An old woman spoke up. Her appearance and height was no different from an ordinary person, but her skin was purple-gold in colour,","which was very bizarre.","She was called Purple Gold Venerate, but she liked others to call her Grandma ZijinR.","“Nine Mountains, though you are not weak, we have at least ten Venerate Tier elites here,” another skinny old man said. “Those that can cultivate to Venerate Tier are more or less standing at the peak of martial arts. All of them are prodigies among prodigies, and neither is weaker than the other.”","“In a battle of one against ten, you will definitely lose!”"]},{"number":4046,"title":"Chapter 4046: Queue for a Challenge","paragraphs":["Chapter 4046: Queue for a Challenge","The Nine Mountains Venerate grinned, and said, “Really?”","With a shake of his right hand, an ancient-looking umbrella appeared. It was definitely quite old.","“F***, Nine Suns Parasol!”","“Saint Tool!”","Seeing this umbrella, all the Venerate Tier elites took a few steps back. Even Luo Wuding revealed a shocked expression.","The Nine Suns Parasol was a Saint Tool that had been personally forged by the Nine Suns Saint. It had accompanied the Nine Suns Saint to his battles all over the world. In fact, it had even defeated the Ancestral King Lingtian before. Just how domineering was this?","A Venerate Tier wielding a Saint Tool was enough to allow the Saint Tool to unleash its full might for a short period of time. Killing a Venerate Tier would be as easy as harvesting weeds for him. How could these Venerate Tiers not be stunned?","However, everyone knew that the Nine Mountains Venerate wouldn’t really kill someone with a Saint Tool. This was because Venerate Tier elites all had powerful backgrounds. Some of them had even come from the Imperial Clan. If they were really killed, then there would be a great many Venerate Tiers carrying the Saint Tool or even the Imperial Weapon and charge into the Nine Suns Holy Land.","Thus, this was only a form of intimidation, and also a statement of stand. If anyone dared to touch Ling Han, then they would have to face the fury of the Saint Tool.","Who would have thought that the Nine Mountains Venerate would actually bring a Saint Tool with him when he went out this time? Naturally, everyone was stunned.","“Nine Mountains, you’re really ruthless!” the Dragon Seventh Venerate said. His tone was slightly strange. It was unknown whether he was sighing at the Nine Mountains Venerate’s resoluteness or venting his displeasure.","“Now, I can take my people and leave, right?” the Nine Mountains Venerate asked calmly. “Wait!” The Dragon Seventh Venerate spoke again, “Nine Mountains, you have the Saint Tool in your possession, and your present strength is indeed enough to suppress everyone. However, you can protect this boy once, but can you do the same twice, or thrice? Will you stay by this boy’s side for all eternity?”","“What do you mean by this?” The Nine Mountains Venerate said with a frown. There was already anger in his voice.","Yet the Dragon Seventh Venerate was unafraid, and said, “Previously, this boy obtained the inheritance of the Divine Rain Venerate, so it can only be considered luck, and not due to strength. Thus, now, let others challenge him. If it is proven that his strength is undisputed, and he is worthy of this inheritance, then I will approve of him.”","“That’s right,” Grandma Zijin also spoke up, “This brat is only slightly proficient with formation techniques, and just happened to seize this opportunity. He is not showing his strength at all.”","“Hehe, I too think that this is only fair, and give the others a chance.”","All the Venerate Tier elites expressed their stand, wanting Ling Han to accept everyone’s challenge, proving that he indeed had the ability to obtain this inheritance, and was not relying on luck, and the fact that he just happened to know some formation techniques. Ling Han smiled, and said, “Sure, in a battle of equals, who would I be afraid of?”","The Nine Mountains Venerate had already won him a chance for a fair battle. Next, it would be up to him.","Hearing these words, the Nine Mountains Venerate couldn’t help but turn to look at Ling Han.","Ling Han did not speak, and merely nodded, his face filled with confidence.","“All right, who will challenge this junior?” the Dragon Seventh Venerate asked.","“I’ll go!”","“I’ll go!”","“Let me!”","Everyone scrambled over each other. Ling Han was indeed freakish, but firstly, there was no formation for Ling Han to borrow the power of, and secondly, he was only in the early stage of the Core Formation Tier, so how strong could his battle prowess be?","“Don’t be anxious, don’t be anxious!” The large black dog immediately jumped out, “If you want to challenge my Little Han, that’s fine. Show me the stakes!”","Stakes?","Everyone was stunned. What was the meaning of this?","“Oh, if you win, you’ll be able to obtain Little Han’s treasure, but if you lose, you can leave without a second thought? How could there be such a good thing!” The large black dog shook his head, “Take out the stakes, and if you win, you can take it away along with your winnings, but if you lose, I’m sorry, but leave the stakes behind!”","This sounded very logical, but why did it exude an air of sordidness?","Ling Han didn’t say anything. With the large black dog around, the task of playing the bad guy was naturally up to him.","“All right, let me!” A Core Formation Tier cultivator jumped out. He was in the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, while his abilities were as high as Fifteenth Heaven. Naturally, he thought that he would definitely win, so he didn’t mind taking out the stakes. In any case, he could take it back.","He took out a treasured ginseng. This was a Celestial medicine that could revive one’s blood and Qi, and could save one’s life at critical moments.","“Come, come, come. Those who want to issue a challenge, come and register with Grandpa Dog. Those who do not register are not allowed to participate.” The large black dog was all smiles, as if he was manning a new shop that had opened. He was really very cordial.","This made people want to beat it up. They weren’t wealth-delivering boys, so why were you so happy?","“Ling Han, admit defeat obediently. Don’t waste both of our time,” the Core Formation Tier","said.","“Next,” Ling Han said.","“You!” The Core Formation Tier cultivator almost exploded in fury. ‘I’ve just stepped onto the stage, and you’re already saying ‘next’. Just how much are you looking down on me?’","Peng!","But he had not even finished this thought, when he saw an iron fist strike towards him, sending him flying.","Pa, he fell onto the ground, already unconscious.","Defeat.","“Come, come, come. Next.” The large black dog’s eyes swept over them, and pointed at a","person, “Brother, it’s your turn.”","The cultivator from the Core Formation Tier revealed a solemn expression. He was a consummate level cultivator from the Core Formation Tier, and his battle prowess had already surpassed 20 Heavens. However, Ling Han had won with a single punch. This battle prowess was a little shocking.","How could a mere early stage of the Core Formation Tier cultivator be so strong?","“Apologies, I’m not in the early stage of the Core Formation Tier. I advanced into the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier a few months ago,” Ling Han kindly explained.","‘Motherf*cker!’","This caused everyone to curse internally. With how freakish Ling Han was, taking this step was enough to increase his battle prowess by four to five Heavens. However, no matter how strong he was, he was only in the middle stage of the Core","Formation Tier.","The second Core Formation Tier cultivator stepped into the air. His battle prowess had reached the 21st Heaven, and he thought that he had a good chance of winning.","“I will defeat you!” he shouted loudly, and launched an attack from the skies. This person was quite cautious. First, he used long-distance attacks to test Ling Han’s","strength.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and also rose into the air, charging over against the other’s","firepower.","In the three months that the large black dog had been away, he had refined all the natural treasures on him. The Primal Chaos Celestial Core had become a whole lot stronger than before, and his base power was no longer Fifteenth Heaven, but Eighteenth Heaven!","Boom, Ling Han had already arrived, and shot out a punch. “Haha, I have to admit, you really are extraordinary. Not long after advancing into the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier, your battle prowess has already reached the 20th Heaven!” The second Core Formation Tier said coldly, “However, my battle prowess is 21 Heavens!”","After probing Ling Han several times, he also found out about Ling Han’s strength. Naturally,","he withdrew his cautiousness, and faced Ling Han head-on.","Ling Han smiled. The Primal Chaos Celestial Core activated, causing the other’s battle","prowess to instantly decrease by three Heavens.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and that Core Formation Tier elite was immediately sent","flying. He was completely no match for Ling Han.","There was a difference of two Heavens between their battle prowess, and he didn’t have the","Primal Chaos Celestial Core that could absorb the power of attacks. If he wasn’t sent flying,","who would?","However, in everyone’s eyes, this was filled with comical effects.","...Previously, the Core Formation Tier cultivator had been praising himself and looking down","on Ling Han. In the end, Ling Han sent him flying with a single punch. This was practically a","big joke.","However, this also surprised everyone. Ling Han’s battle prowess was too terrifying, wasn’t","it?"]},{"number":4047,"title":"Chapter 4047 Xu Luo","paragraphs":["4047 Xu Luo","“Next,” Ling Han said calmly.","The large black dog swept his eyes through the crowd, pointed at a person, and said, “You, you, you, it’s your turn.”","That person was slightly embarrassed, because his battle prowess was inferior to the previous person. Though he was also very strong, and had reached the 20th Heaven, but even a person at the 21st Heaven was sent flying with a single punch, so what was he worth?","He didn’t dare to step out. Instead, he turned around and pretended not to hear anything.","The large black dog snickered, and did not push him too far. Instead, he said, “Fine, even if you forfeit, the stakes cannot be refuted! Next.”","What a scam!","He forfeited and the stakes were still not refunded?","Previously, there were a great many people that had sought out the large black dog for registration, and they were all scrambling over one another, but now, they would rather forfeit the wager than step forward to battle.","—If they stepped forwards to accept the challenge, not only would they lose, they would also be humiliated in public. It would be best for them to cower.","In this moment, a great many people forfeited.","Those Venerate Tier elites all saw this, and they all looked shocked.","Of course, they had also come from the Core Formation Tier, and in the end, they had become Venerate Tier elites. It could be imagined that they had definitely been prodigies among prodigies in the past. However, if they were honest with themselves, when they were at the same cultivation level as Ling Han, just how far was the gap between them and Ling Han?","This was practically incomparable!","Only the Nine Mountains Venerate revealed a smile. He stroked his beard, feeling very pleased with himself.","Perhaps, in the future, the Nine Suns Holy Land would not only produce a Saint, but would even create the path of an Emperor!","Just the thought of it made him extremely excited. At the same time, an endless fighting spirit rose up in him. Whoever dared to touch Ling Han, he would kill them even if it meant sacrificing his life.","“Ling Han, right?” Finally, a young man did not cower from the battle. He walked out smilingly, his skin sparkling and translucent, as if he was a Divine Physique.","“I am Xu Luo,” he said.","Instantly, the whole area was filled with exclamations of shock.","“Xu Luo of the East Heavenly Realm?”","“Hiss, this guy is incredible. It is said that he came from a Holy Land, and in a mere half year’s time, he has rushed up to be ranked ranked nineteenth in the Core Formation Tier on the Galaxy Network!”","“Previously, this person kept a very low profile, yet suddenly rose up. He is overwhelmingly awesome.”","“If he is ranked 19th in the Galaxy Network, then his battle prowess is at least at the level of 23rd Heaven.”","“Wrong, it should be more than that. It’s only the hierarchical battle system on the Galaxy Network that limits his ranking.”","“I’m guessing that he should have battle prowess worthy of being in the top ten.”","“Hiss!”","Ling Han also heard the discussions of the masses, and couldn’t help but feel quite intrigued. He asked, “Your battle prowess has reached 24 Heavens?”","This was a barrier that only the top ten prodigies of the Galaxy Network were qualified to cross. However, at the same time, this was also the limit. Even Jing Hao, who was number one in the Galaxy Network, only had this kind of battle prowess.","...Unless it was the Imperial Clan, only would they be able to break this limit.","“You’ll naturally find out after experiencing it for yourself,” Xu Luo said calmly. There was a powerful confidence in his voice.","“Sure.” Ling Han nodded. Now, aside from the prodigies of the Imperial Clan, was there anyone else that could match him?","“Then let us battle in the skies!” Xu Luo soared into the skies, and stood at a height of three thousand meters. Boom, he released his aura without reservations, like tsunami waves.","Ling Han also ascended the sky step by step. When he arrived at about the same height as Xu Luo, he stopped, and stood with his hands clasped behind his back.","He had the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, which could disperse all power attacks within the range of six Heavens. Thus, in his heart, he had too much of an advantage, and did not take him to heart at all.","“Your mentality is not too bad,” Xu Luo remarked. “I hope that after this battle, you would not be traumatized by me.”","Ling Han cracked a smile, “I shall return these words exactly as they were!”","Xu Luo’s smile disappeared, and a sliver of anger rose up in him.","As a top-grade prodigy, the gap between them could be said to be in the sligthest of millimeters. Thus, to say nothing of the fact that he was superior to Ling Han by two minor levels, even if Ling Han had already advanced into the late stage of Core Formation Tier, he should still be overwhelmed by him.","“Humph, you really don’t know what’s good for you!” He charged out, his hands scissoring, and a pair of golden shears flew towards Ling Han. The shears were covered with seals, and continued to emit endless divine might.","Ling Han smiled, and greeted the incoming attack with a punch.","Peng!","The punch landed, and Ling Han’s body instantly trembled, sliding backwards.","As expected, this guy’s battle prowess had reached 24th heaven. Though this attack was a long-distance attack, it still had the might of 22nd heaven, surpassing Ling Han’s maximum battle prowess.","However, the Primal Chaos Celestial Core vibrated slightly, and the force that was attacking him was instantly dispersed completely. Ling Han merely slid backwards, completely unscathed.","After the attack, Xu Luo’s expression finally became solemn.","This opponent was no pushover. His battle prowess was far too terrifying.","Was this guy really in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier?","“Heaven Wolf Fist!” He charged out, and engaged in close-quarter combat with Ling Han.","Ling Han activated the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, and Xu Luo’s battle prowess instantly fell drastically, falling to the level of 21 Heavens.","That was enough.","Ling Han channelled the God Slaying Technique and clashed head-on with Xu Luo.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them clashed fiercely, neither losing to the other.","There was no harm done if there was no comparison. Everyone saw this, and they were all shocked speechless.","Xu Luo, who had battle prowess of twenty-fourth heaven, actually tied with Ling Han, who was only in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier!","Who could believe this?","What kind of freak was this?","Yet Xu Luo was furious. This opponent of his possessed a rare treasure that could actually allow his battle prowess to weaken by three Heavens. Otherwise, with the advantage of three Heavens, he was completely capable of crushing Ling Han.","‘Alright, since you’ve used a rare treasure, I naturally won’t be reserved either.’","Xu Luo humphed softly, and a ball of light surged over his body. It was so bright that no one could see it clearly. When this ball of light disappeared, everyone could see that a suit of armor had appeared on Xu Luo’s body.","This Battle Armor was extremely light, and was silvery white in colour. When worn, it looked more like a piece of clothing, though it was filled with a metallic feel.","But in the next instant, this Battle Armor was exuding a brilliant light, making Xu Luo look as if he was a god.","Xiu, he once again charged towards Ling Han, and his speed actually increased explosively.","Yi?","Ling Han was astonished. However, he didn’t give this much thought, and he immediately exchanged another blow with Xu Luo.","Peng, he was instantly sent flying. Thankfully, the Primal Chaos Celestial Core showed its might, and he was not injured.","—Xu Luo’s battle prowess had increased by around two Heavens.","Ling Han’s eyes fell upon that suit of armor. This was a Spirit Tool, a tool that could increase battle prowess, and the increase was as high as two Heavens.","“Ling Han, you have a rare treasure on you that can weaken battle prowess by three Heavens, and can also disperse power attacks,” Xu Luo said proudly, “But in terms of background, how could I possibly lose to you!”","With a shake of his right hand, a shining long sword appeared. There were silver veined patterns on the sword, interwoven into a complicated pattern.","“Die!” He charged over, sword in hand, a frightening aura surging. The might of this strike was incredibly shocking.","Ling Han couldn’t help but shake his head internally. This guy knew nothing, and actually said that his two Mystical Powers were the might of a Spirit Tool.","Fine then, do you think I only have two “Spirit Tools”?","The murderous aura charged forwards!"]},{"number":4048,"title":"Chapter 4048 Shameless","paragraphs":["4048 Shameless","“Ah!” Xu Luo instantly grabbed his head and screamed in agony.","No matter how prodigious you were, so what? In front of the barrage of murderous aura, you could only grab your head and groan, unless your cultivation level was a level higher than Ling Han.","Unfortunately, Xu Luo was only in the Core Formation Tier.","Ling Han took advantage of the opening to attack, and used the God Slaying Technique. Though this was created by a Saint, it could completely be called the Pseudo-Emperor Technique. Furthermore, at the level of the Core Formation Tier, neither of them could unleash the full might of the Saint Technique or the Imperial Technique, and it was completely up to who had the deeper grasp.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Ling Han seized this opportunity to attack Xu Luo madly, and Xu Luo was sent flying. However, the Battle Armor he was wearing was truly powerful. It had the effect of absorbing a portion of the power of the attack. Thus, he wasn’t defeated by Ling Han in a single wave.","“You really have a lot of rare treasures on you!” Xu Luo finally steadied himself. He looked coldly at Ling Han, his killing intent overflowing.","Originally, he had only wanted to defeat Ling Han and obtain the inheritance of Divine Rain Venerate. However, Ling Han had beaten him so horribly in public, causing him to lose all face. Naturally, his baleful killing intent was aroused.","Of course, unleashing killing intent was one matter, and being able to do it was another matter. Even if his battle prowess overwhelmed Ling Han’s, the Nine Mountains Venerate was standing right below him, so how could he possibly kill him?","Ling Han shook his head, “Frog at the bottom of a well.”","Xu Luo was enraged. This person actually dared to insult him?","“Die!”","He charged over, his hands scissoring, and that pair of golden shears shot towards him again.","This was made up of pure energy, but it was imbued with high-level energy. Furthermore, it was amplified by the Battle Armor, so its destructive power was extremely terrifying.","Ling Han was completely unafraid, and raised his fist to face it head-on.","Peng, peng, peng!","In terms of battle prowess, he was now two Heavens weaker than Xu Luo, but when he used his Eye Technique, he could completely see through the weak points in Xu Luo’s attacks. He could avoid the strong and aim for the weak points. Even if he only used his strongest attack occasionally, with the Primal Chaos Celestial Core’s ability to dispel attacks, what did he have to fear?","However, after battling for a long time, both their battle prowess dropped by a significant amount.","It could not be helped. Whether it was the Imperial Technique or the Saint Technique, how could they be channelled continuously?","But after only an instant, Ling Han’s battle prowess became stronger again. This God Slaying Technique could no longer be used. How could it be that he could not use the Heavenly Brilliance Technique? Could he not use the Demonic Monkey Fist?","He had mastered more than one Imperial Technique.","Everyone was watching in a daze, stunned by Ling Han’s battle prowess, and elites such as Nine Mountains Venerate knew what he was doing. They could clearly see that Ling Han had not used some rare treasure, and was clearly using his own might.","Thus, Xu Luo had already lost.","This was a being that possessed the battle prowess of one of the top 10 in Core Formation Tier on the Galaxy Network. Even he couldn’t do anything to Ling Han, so who else could?","Was it the Imperial Son or the Imperial Daughter?","Perhaps this was possible, but aside from Luo Wuding, was there still an Imperial Son and Imperial Daughter present?","Unfortunately, Luo Wuding had long since become a Venerate Tier elite. How could he bring himself to personally deal with Ling Han?","“Enough!” A Venerate Tier elite moved, and grabbed Xu Luo back. There was no point in continuing the stalemate like this. At least, they would have to fight for a few days and nights. When the mystical power of both sides were almost exhausted, the one with the stronger reserves would be able to win.","How could a mighty Venerate Tier cultivator have so much free time to watch two Core Formation Tier cultivators fight for a few days?","“Let go of me! I’m about to win!” Xu Luo roared. He was unwilling to give up.","The large black dog snickered, and shouted at the top of his lungs, “Next, is there anyone else?”","No one answered. Everyone understood. At present, aside from the Imperial Clan, who else could defeat Ling Han at the same cultivation level? Even those at the same cultivation level could not, what more those at the same minor cultivation level.","The large black dog called out again, and couldn’t help but look regretful. He hadn’t scammed too many people out of their bets.","The Nine Mountains Venerate smiled, and said, “Since no one is challenging, I’m going to bring Ling Han back.”","The Nine Mountains Venerate glared at him, “What is it? Does your Flood Dragon Race still have prodigies that want to make a move?”","“Dragon Race, it’s Dragon Race!” Dragon Seventh Venerate hurriedly corrected, then thought for a moment, “He Shun, you do it.”","“Me?” A middle-aged man replied, appearing very surprised.","The Nine Mountains Venerate was enraged, and said, “Dragon Seventh, do you still have any shame? This person is in the True Self Tier!”","“Hehe, at that time, the True Self Tier also entered into the Mystery Realm; they just had a narrow miss.” Dragon Seventh Venerate said smilingly, “Furthermore, He Shun is only in the early stage of the True Self Tier, and his age is similar to Ling Han’s, so it can be considered a fair battle.”","“Fair your sister!” Even the Nine Mountains Venerate couldn’t help but curse, “That clansman of yours is at least seventy to eighty years old, and how old is Ling Han?”","Shameless! He was really too shameless!","Yet the Dragon Seventh Venerate was completely unconcerned about this, and said calmly, “Fine, I won’t bully this brat either. As long as this brat can block a blow from He Shun, he’ll be considered to have passed!”","Nine Mountains scoffed. Who didn’t know that there was a gap of a major cultivation level? That was an absolute one-sided suppression. Furthermore, Ling Han was only in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier. Aside from the gap of a major cultivation level, there was still the gap of two minor cultivation levels.","Was this not bullying?","“All right.” Yet Ling Han suddenly interrupted. He descended, his hands clasped behind his back, an uncaring expression on his face, “One move is too little, so I’ll block three moves.”","Pu!","A great many people spluttered. You think one move is too little?","How could there be such an idiot?","Ling Han smiled, and turned to look at the Venerate Tier elites, “Seniors, this time, we have an agreement. If this junior can block three moves from that idiot, there won’t be any more trouble!”","All the Venerable Tier elites were slightly embarrassed. They were all people who cared about their pride, and they really couldn’t bring themselves to tell Ling Han to fight with a True Self Tier elite. Only the Dragon Seventh Venerate would be so shameless.","The Nine Mountains Venerate said, “If anyone has any more objections, I’ll beat them up with the Saint Tool.”","No one replied. These Venerate Tier elites all knew that the Nine Mountains Venerate had already reached his limit in tolerance.","In truth, if it was them, they would also be furious. They had really never seen someone as shameless as the Dragon Seventh Venerate.","The Dragon Seventh Venerate remained calm and collected, and merely said coldly, “He Shun, what are you standing around for?”","Long He Shun walked out. He was a little embarrassed. Being stared at by so many people, and every gaze was filled with disdain, he could not bear it.","‘Then I’ll end the battle as soon as possible!’","He gave a loud shout, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","After advancing into the True Self Tier, one would be qualified to come into contact with the Regulations of heaven and earth. As he delivered this palm strike, it turned into a fiery red giant hand, with several divine chains of order entwined around it. That aura was incredibly terrifying.","All the prodigies of Core Formation Tier held their breaths. If they advanced into the True Self Tier, they believed that none of them would lose to Long He Shun. However, now that there was a gap of a major tier between them and the True Self Tier, none of them dared to take this attack head-on.","He was definitely going to die.","However, Ling Han actually didn’t dodge!","Was this guy really courting death?","The Nine Mountains Venerate frowned, but did not make a move, because he knew that Ling Han was a Formations Grandmaster, and could instantly teleport to another corner of the planet with the help of ley lines.","However, this was a trump card to deal with the assassination of the Battle God Palace. Was it appropriate to expose it just like that?"]},{"number":4049,"title":"Chapter 4049 Blocking Three Moves","paragraphs":["4049 Blocking Three Moves","Right at this moment, Ling Han finally made his move.","He did not flee. Instead, he beckoned with his right hand, and instantly, the Earth Qi was drawn out by him. Boom, it turned into an Earth Dragon.","Peng!","Long He Shun’s attack landed on the Earth Dragon, instantly shattering it. However, the might of his attack was more or less destroyed.","“Yi!” “En?” “Ya?”","However, with this one move, all the Venerate Tier elites’ eyes widened, appearing to be in disbelief.","As they saw it, to say nothing of the fact that Ling Han was only at the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier, even if it were those freaks from the Imperial Clan who were at the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier, they still wouldn’t be able to take this attack from Long He Shun head-on. They would simply be seeking death.","Thus, the only strategy was to dodge.","However, Ling Han summoned an Earth Dragon, forcefully blocking this attack.","Was he a monster?","Core Formation Tier elites couldn’t unleash the might of True Self Tier even if they used Four Stars Spirit Tools.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “The first move.”","Long He Shun instantly felt his face burn. With this strike, not only did the Core Formation Tier not die, he was completely unwounded. He had probably made history. However, he was like a green leaf that was the background to Ling Han’s blooming brilliance, completely a negative example.","He flew into a rage out of humiliation, and delivered another attack towards Ling Han. This time, the might of the attack had increased slightly.","He was not willing to be remembered as a joke by history. Thus, even if he was mocked now, it would still be better than having his name stink for ten thousand years, right?","Ling Han raised a finger. Xiu, xiu! At this moment, two Earth Dragons appeared at the same time, greeting Long He Shun’s attack.","Peng, peng!","Long He Shun’s attack was still domineering, easily shattering the two Earth Dragons. However, this attack of his was no longer effective.","This!","Even the Venerate Tier elites couldn’t help but sigh in emotion. The information they had obtained was too inaccurate. Ling Han was not only slightly familiar with formations, he was practically a Formation Grandmaster, all right?","The Nine Mountains Venerate squinted his eyes and smiled. He naturally knew that Ling Han had already become a Formations Grandmaster. However, Ling Han had only been able to channel the Star Steps at that time, unlike now, when he could actually extract Earth Qi to target the enemy.","The more he looked at this young man, the more satisfied he was.","“Ah!” Long He Shun roared loudly. This time, he was really going all out. He channelled out the Saint Technique, which blasted towards Ling Han.","The True Self Tier could come into contact with heaven and earth’s Regulations, and similarly blast out Saint Techniques; it was too terrifying! Even if there was a Core Formation Tier that could reach the level of True Self Tier, the power from blasting out Saint Techniques was definitely inferior. It couldn’t be helped; there was still a gap of the Regulations of heaven and earth.","Hence, this attack was incredibly terrifying, and finally, only a little bit of Saint-level might was unleashed.","Only when one had reached the True Self Tier, only would the Imperial Technique, the Saint Technique, and the Venerate Technique have a clear difference. Once it involved the Regulations of heaven and earth, there would be a clear hierarchy.","This attack blasted over, and even the heaven and earth reacted. Energy manifested into multiple small flood dragons, filling the skies.","Long He Shun was seen pushing this attack over, his murderous aura cold.","This was very impressive, but!","Ling Han smiled, and flicked his index finger. Xiu, xiu, xiu! One after another, Earth Dragons appeared, totalling ten.","Peng, peng, peng! The Saint Technique unleashed its might, and these Earth Dragons crumbled upon contact, turning back into heaven and earth energy that dissipated. However, every Earth Dragon was equivalent to an early stage True Self Tier elite. After the Saint Technique broke through ten “people” in a row, its might naturally decreased by more or less.","Ling Han threw another punch, which erased the last bit of might of the Saint Technique.","Three moves passed.","Long Heshun still wanted to deliver another blow, but he immediately felt a throbbing in his heart, feeling like a mouse being targeted by a cat. He turned his head, and saw that the Nine Mountains Venerate was staring at him with an extremely stern gaze.","He was so scared that his legs almost went weak, and hurriedly stepped aside obediently.","“Haha, this little friend is really rare. He cultivates both martial arts and formations, and has reached an astonishing height in both,” Grandma Zijin said with a smile. “Little friend, are you married yet? I have a great-granddaughter who is extremely beautiful!”","When everyone heard this, they were all confused. What was going on here? She had just been overbearing just now, so why was she marrying off her great-granddaughter all of a sudden?","They naturally didn’t know how these Venerate Tier elites were feeling. Just how stunned were they!","For a freak like Ling Han, they could only either long since trample him to death, or in a few thousand years, this guy would be able to grow to the height of equals with them, just like Luo Wuding.","Furthermore, once Ling Han became a Venerate Tier, he would definitely be an overlord among Venerate Tiers.","Thus, they could either kill him as soon as possible, or express goodwill now, and form a good relationship with him.","—Did they really think that these Venerate Tier elites were just cultivating in seclusion? Which one of them was not an old fox?","Meanwhile, the Nine Mountains Venerate didn’t allow anyone to disturb Ling Han. He directly grabbed Ling Han and the large black dog, tore a rip into space, and left. As for Lu Qi? Hehe, just go back the way he came.","Seeing the space close up again, Lu Qi revealed a resentful expression, clenching his fists tightly.","“Didn’t the Battle God Palace claim that there was no one they dared not and couldn’t assassinate? Why is this damn guy still alive and kicking after such a long time?”","This should be the question of many people, but previously, Ling Han was either at the Nine Suns Holy Land or when he came out for the first time, he had also stayed in the Mystery Realm, so how could the Battle God Palace have any chance of assassination?","...","Meanwhile, the Nine Mountains Venerate tore open space continuously, and soon brought Ling Han and the large black dog back to the Nine Suns Holy Land.","“What you obtained in the Mystery Realm is your private property,” the Nine Mountains Venerate said. “There’s no need to tell anyone, nor is there any need to hand it over to anyone. Understand?”","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel warm in his heart. This Venerate Tier elite was truly considering for his sake.","“I understand.” He nodded.","“Go on.” The Nine Mountains Venerate waved his hand dismissively.","The large black dog hurriedly ran off with Ling Han, saying, “Little Han, we’re rich now!”","Previously, many people had issued challenges to Ling Han, but not one of them had succeeded. Naturally, there was a large pile of stakes left behind, and they were all natural treasures — the large black dog’s eyes were very sharp. He would not accept anything that was not good.","The man and dog shared the spoils, one for you and one for me. After dividing the spoils among themselves, they each went their own way.","Ling Han had already contacted the empress, Hu Niu, and the others through the Galaxy Network. After returning to the abode, the three of them naturally wanted to be intimate with each other.","After two days of languishing, Ling Han asked about the empress and Hu Niu’s cultivation progress. The two women had both cultivated to the Nine Cauldrons, but there was really no hope for the Ten Cauldrons.","It should be known that a great many Ancestral Kings were only Nine Cauldrons, and then completed Fusion Cauldrons with their own power. Ten Cauldrons was not the standard.","‘Then I’ll leave it at that.’","Ling Han helped the empress and Hu Niu create the Fusion Cauldron. Although he succeeded, it also caused great damage to his vitality and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Thankfully, he had won a lot of tonics and nourishing items this time, so he just had to eat like crazy.","Afterwards, Ling Han contacted Lin Luo, Zhou Heng and the others. Calculating the time, these ultimate elites should have reached the Nine Cauldrons by now, and could create the Fusion Cauldron.","However, Lin Luo, Zhou Heng, and Chu Hao had already created their Fusion Cauldron.","Yi, so awesome?"]},{"number":4050,"title":"Chapter 4050 Assassination Again","paragraphs":["4050 Assassination Again","After Ling Han asked around, he found out that Lin Luo and the others had obtained great fortune when they were exploring a dangerous place. With the help of the power of heaven and earth, they had completed the Fusion Cauldron.","Then could this be considered as creating the Fusion Cauldron with their own power, or borrowing the power of another?","Ling Han couldn’t figure it out either, but thinking about it, heaven and earth probably couldn’t be considered others. Thus, Lin Luo and the others should belong to the category of creating their Fusion Cauldron with their own power.","In other words, these three people possessed the qualifications to attempt breaking through to the Imperial Path.","Of course, the Imperial Path was long, and this was only one of the requirements. Who knew how difficult it would be in future.","Ling Han nodded. Becoming a Great Emperor not only required natural talent, but also great fortune.","There were many people who had come out of Genesis World, but there were not many that Ling Han was grateful to and missed. Lin Luo and the others had already created the Fusion Cauldron, and Karmic Life Heavenly Venerable was slightly inferior. Though he had also cultivated Nine Cauldrons, he had already broken through to the Core Formation Tier first before creating the Fusion Cauldron.","Any one of these once supreme elites was restless, and had long since fled to various corners of the galaxy. With how proud and arrogant they were, how could they be willing to be taken care of by Ling Han for a long time?","This was good too. Ling Han only needed to take care of himself and his family.","Ling Han began to concoct alchemical pills with all his might. He was out of money, and needed a large amount of Universe Coins to buy natural treasures to nourish the Celestial Core.","Moreover, the empress and Hu Niu weren’t far from reaching the Core Formation Tier. They were severely short of money.","Aside from concocting alchemical pills, Ling Han would also use Earth Qi to temper himself. In addition, the empress, Hu Niu and the large black dog would also benefit from this, and would similarly be tempered by the Earth Qi.","To put it bluntly, Earth Qi was actually the energy of heaven and earth. Tempering oneself could not increase one’s cultivation level, but it could strengthen one’s physique, which naturally had boundless benefits.","In these few months, the physiques of the three people and one dog had all improved greatly, which made Ling Han very pleased.","11:13","However, this was all he could do. After all, his energy was limited. Having to temper four beings at the same time was already his limit.","“Little Han, are you going to retrieve the goods again?”","On this day, after the four of them had finished tempering their bodies, the large black dog saw Ling Han walking out, and asked casually.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Where would I get so many natural treasures? I’m going to sell medicines.”","“I’m free anyway, so Grandpa Dog will accompany you.” The large black dog scuttled out.","The man and dog left the Holy Land and headed to the office of the Chang Clan. Basically, as long as the overall level of cultivation of the planet was slightly higher, there would definitely be an office established by the Chang Clan.","After Ling Han sent the alchemical pills to be delivered, he walked back with the large black dog.","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han suddenly felt a killing intent. Though this was very weak, how could it hide from his terrifying divine sense?","However, he remained calm and collected. Instead, he used the ley lines to gather everything in his surroundings into his mind.","One, two, three, four... A faint smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. There were a total of four assassins, and they were all in the True Self Tier.","Hehe, after being silent for so long, the Battle God Palace finally sent assassins again.","Actually, the Battle God Palace had always wanted to kill Ling Han, but Ling Han was either in the Holy Land or in the Mystery Realm, not giving them a chance at all.","And now, he had run out of the Holy Land by himself. That naturally was creating conditions for the assassins from the Battle God Palace.","“Little Han, looking at that lewd smile on your face, have you thought of something that can’t be revealed?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han shook his head, and said calmly, “Assassin!”","“What?!” The large black dog immediately jumped three feet into the air.","“Calm down, it’s not like they’re targeting you,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“Of course, Grandpa Dog will definitely become a target if I walk with you.” The large black dog was extremely depressed, “If I had known, I would not have come out with you, brat. You are practically a bringer of misfortune.”","Ling Han laughed loudly. He was just about to speak, when he saw xiu, xiu, xiu. Three flashes of sword light flashed, and three assassins had already launched a surprise attack on him.","The True Self Tiers deliberately hid their tracks, then launched a sneak attack on a Core Formation Tier cultivator out of the blue. What Core Formation Tier cultivator could withstand such an attack?","Ling Han could.","He had already discovered these three assassins in advance, so he was naturally able to deal with them with ease. With a thought, ten Earth Dragons shot out of thin air to greet the three assassins.","Peng, peng, peng! These assassins weren’t as strong as Long He Shun, and after being blocked by the Earth Dragon, they were immediately embroiled in a fierce battle.","Assassins were proficient in assassination, and they might not be all that strong in a head-on confrontation.","At least, they weren’t all that strong.","“Little Han, good job!” the large black dog said with a smile.","Yet Ling Han did not relax, because he knew that there were a total of four assassins.","Now that only three had appeared, it should be because they wanted him to relax his guard, and give the last assassin a chance to kill him.","Xiu, a flash of sword light slashed over from the distance. It was like a star that had pierced through the darkness, incredibly fast, and its might was also extraordinarily great.","‘Here it comes.’","Ling Han, on the other hand, revealed a smile. His right hand pressed forward, and another six Earth Dragons appeared at the same time, greeting the fourth assassin.","The assassin was also rendered useless. He could only tangle with the Earth Dragon, yet was completely unable to charge over.","The four assassins roared repeatedly, wanting to destroy the Earth Dragons and kill Ling Han. However, the 16 Earth Dragons protected Ling Han completely, and they were completely at their wit’s end.","—Putting aside the ability to assassinate, in a head-on battle, their strength was really only average.","“Haha, come over if you can!” the large black dog shouted.","A True Self Tier cultivator actually couldn’t do anything to a cultivator in the Core Formation Tier. This was indeed something that could be boasted about for a lifetime.","After failing time and time again, the four assassins all released a sharp cry. Then, they all retreated, and in an instant, had disappeared without a trace.","If he missed, he would immediately flee into the distance. This was an assassin. Otherwise, he would be a death warrior.","Ling Han sighed. This time, though he had successfully repelled the assassins from the Battle God Palace, from the Core Formation Tier to the True Self Tier, this assassin organization was already upgrading the assassins they mobilized.","Then what about the next time? Would it be the turn of the Spirit Transformation Tier assassins?","Faced with such an assassin, even the Earth Dragon was useless. Ling Han could only use the Star Steps and run.","He wasn’t used to being on the back foot like this, but in terms of taking the initiative to attack, firstly, he was only a mere Core Formation Tier cultivator, and secondly, he had absolutely no idea where the Battle God Palace was, so how could he take the initiative to attack?","The man and dog walked back. After walking for a while, Ling Han’s wrist suddenly lit up.","“Yi, what is this?” The large black dog, approached to take a look.","Ling Han was also taken aback. Why was his wrist glowing?","He pulled up his sleeves to take a look, and saw that a complicated seal was glowing, and before this, this had never manifested.","Ling Han thought for a moment. He had entered and exited too many ancient sites, and had also been “stamped” many times. Thus, for a moment, he did not know which ancient site the stamp had been stamped on had activated.","However, just how astonishing was his memory? He immediately came to his senses.","“F*ck! Not good!”","“What’s going on?” the large black dog hurriedly asked.","Ling Han didn’t have the time to reply, and he immediately channeled the Soul Forming Technique. A subtle change instantly took place in his spiritual fluctuation, and his appearance also changed accordingly.","“Yi, Ding Yi!” the large black dog exclaimed in surprise. Why had Ling Han suddenly turned back into Ding Yi? Hadn’t they agreed to bury this person forever?","Xiu! Right at this moment, a streak of light surged over and enveloped Ling Han. In the next instant, Ling Han had already disappeared from sight.","The large black dog’s expression was completely dumbfounded. What the hell was this?"]},{"number":4051,"title":"Chapter 4051: Battle God Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 4051: Battle God Palace","Planets flashed before his eyes, ten thousand miles in an instant.","Peng!","Ling Han fell heavily, and crashed onto solid rock. Instantly, he felt a strong urge to vomit. However, his physique was too shocking, and this feeling immediately disappeared.","“Yi, this newcomer actually didn’t throw up!” A voice rang out.","“Stunned silly?” someone asked with a laugh.","“I don’t think so.”","Ling Han crawled to his feet, and saw that he should be in a cave. Torches were lit all around him, illuminating the space.","Aside from him, there were also 34 young people here. There were men and women, and they were either standing or sitting. Every single one of them was exuding an extraordinary aura. They were definitely giants among men.","That was definite.","How had he come here?","Naturally, it was that “stamp” on his hand that had acted as a lighthouse, stimulating the Transfer Formation that spanned across galaxies, and where had that “stamp” been placed? The Young Dragon Trial!","Was there no memory of it?","The Three Styles of the God of War... the Battle God Palace!","This was too ironic. He had just been targeted by the Battle God Palace, and in the end, he had actually been teleported to the Battle God Palace. This was practically walking into a tiger’s den.","Why had he changed his appearance and soul at the first instant?","The reason was very simple. He did not want to be recognized by the Battle God Palace.","“Hey, brat, have you gone stupid?” A young man shouted at Ling Han with a hint of disdain, “We are talking to you!”","Ling Han’s eyes swept over them. Everyone here was at the level of the Core Formation Tier. At this level, did he need to fear anyone?","“Do you know what’s going on?” Ling Han asked.","“Brat, I’m the one asking you!” The young man stood up, raised his voice, and shouted at Ling Han.","Peng!","Right at this moment, another person was teleported over, and fell from midair, landing solidly on the ground.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Peng, peng, peng!","One after another, in these few short minutes, twelve people were actually teleported over, one after another.","“Newcomers, all of you listen up!” The young man who had previously shouted at Ling Han cleared his throat, “My name is Li Lei, and this is Han Yue, our Boss Han. From now onwards, everyone has to listen to Boss Han.”","“What Boss Han? Why do we have to obey his commands?” Immediately, someone was defiant.","Li Lei humphed coldly, and said, “Because Boss Han is ranked 2537th in the Galaxy Network. Which one of you can catch up to him?”","When these words fell, everyone was instantly speechless.","Ranked in the 2000s in the Galaxy Network. That was too awesome. In any galaxy, this could be considered a top prodigy.","Meanwhile, Han Yue finally spoke up, saying, “You’ve all been teleported here, so do you have any clues?”","Quite a number of people shook their heads, but there were also some that nodded.","Han Yue smiled, “I believe that you have all participated in the Young Dragon Trial before, right?”","“Oh!” Instantly, realization dawned on those who had been shaking their heads just now. After all, those who could pass the Young Dragon Trial could at least be called a prodigy. Of course, top-tier prodigies were rarer, and Han Yue could be counted as one of them, but there was really no one else as freakish as Ling Han.","Peng, peng, peng! Just as they were speaking, another person was teleported over.","Ling Han was astounded. Just how many places had this Battle God Palace set up the Young Dragon Trial?","It could be imagined that the reason why they had gone to so much effort was definitely not because they had teleported them over to kill them. After all, it was all too coincidental for Ling Han to be in such a situation.","So, was this the Battle God Palace’s method of recruiting disciples?","-The Young Dragon Trial was set up all over the galaxy, attracting people to enter. Then, the well-known among them would be chosen, and they would be left to grow for a few more years. Those who were still alive would be transmitted here to be taken in as disciples, directly saving them the hardship and resources of nurturing.","F***, how astute.","Ling Han didn’t step out, mainly because of his special identity. Who knew if elites from the Battle God Palace had arrived at the scene and would be able to see through his disguise?","Thus, he had to keep a low profile.","Every time a batch of people was transferred over, Li Lei would step out as a lackey, and establish Han Yue’s leadership position.","But very soon, this situation was resolved.","A new arrival had arrived. His name was Sima Dong, and his Galaxy Network ranking was also in the 2000s. This was slightly higher than even Han Yue.","Sima Dong was naturally defiant, and the two of them immediately began an intense battle.","Their rankings on the Galaxy Network were close, and the Galaxy Network battle couldn’t take into account factors such as the Spirit Tool. Thus, the two of them fought for a while, yet it","was a tie.","Sima Dong took advantage of the opening to call out loudly, and established his own faction.","Previously, some people had only submitted to Han Yue because they had been threatened and bribed. Now that they had other options, they naturally “betrayed”, and switched to becoming subordinates of Sima Dong.","As more and more people were teleported over, the camps on both sides also became stronger and stronger. However, there were still no prodigies that could match Sima Dong and Han Yue. Thus, it did not become three camps, or four camps.","After this day ended, no one else was teleported over. It was as if everyone had already been brought over.","However, the strange thing was that the people who were teleported here were all in the Core","Formation Tier.","So coincidental?","Ling Han didn’t believe it. He thought that when these people were teleported here, they had already been “categorized”. Whether it was the Foundation Building Tier, the Cauldron Forging Tier, the Core Formation Tier, or the True Self Tier, they were all placed in the areas according to their cultivation levels.","Thus, everyone’s cultivation level was the same here.","After a day, everyone’s initial fear had also calmed down. They were all prodigies, at least, so they naturally knew that the Battle God Palace hadn’t spent so much effort to get them here to","kill them.","However, everyone couldn’t help but feel anxious. This was the Battle God Palace, the most mysterious and powerful assassin organization in the universe. After entering here, would they still be able to retreat unscathed?","Of course, there were also some people who came from lowly backgrounds and had absolutely no understanding of the Divine Palace. At first, they were very expectant. After all, the Three Styles of the God of War was a Saint-level technique, which represented the strength of the Battle God Palace. If they could be taken in as disciples by this force, then wouldn’t they be able to get their big break?","Weng, a powerful aura assaulted them, filled with pressure, causing everyone to fall silent.","A middle-aged man walked out from who knows where, looking down on everyone with a","lofty attitude.","This was a Spirit Transformation True Lord. In fact, this might not even be his original body, but rather a manifestation of his spirit.","“My name is Wanhe. You have all passed the Young Dragon Trial, and that is why you have appeared here,” the middle-aged man said. He briefly explained why they had come here. Then, he continued, “After passing the Young Dragon Trial, you all can also be considered external disciples of our War God Palace.”","“And now, the further selections will begin. Those who perform better will be able to successfully advance, and become official disciples of our Battle God Palace.”","When his words fell, a commotion arose in the crowd.","Some people were indeed very interested in joining the Battle God Palace, viewing it as a","stepping stone, but even more people knew what kind of organization the Battle God Palace was. They had no wish to become assassins.","“Dare I ask, Lord, what if we fail?” someone asked."]},{"number":4052,"title":"Chapter 4052: Four Hundred","paragraphs":["Chapter 4052: Four Hundred","The victor could become an official disciple of the Battle God Palace, then what about the loser?","Wanhe didn’t answer immediately. Instead, he swept his gaze across everyone’s faces before saying, “The Battle God Palace doesn’t need weaklings. Losers are naturally disposed of.”","Disposed of?","Everyone’s hearts clenched. How should they deal with this?","There was no need to say anything else. They all understood, because the Battle God Palace would definitely not allow outsiders to leave alive, and reveal the secret of where the Battle God Palace was located.","-There was no Galaxy Network signal here. Even if everyone’s reaction was slightly slower, after they had calmed down, they would immediately connect to Galaxy Network.","All of a sudden, a strong fighting spirit rose up in everyone, and they felt that everyone around them was filled with malice.","These were all competitors!","“There are a total of... 739 of you now.” Wanhe’s expression was cold, without a trace of emotion, “I’ll give you three days’ time. No matter what method you use, there can only be 400 people alive. If this number is exceeded, I will move, and randomly choose a few people to kill, right until the number is reduced to 400.”","Hearing these words, everyone’s hearts constricted violently.","This kind of elimination battle was a little too cruel, wasn’t it? It actually had to be decided with life and death.","“Now, you guys can leave here.” Wan He said, “In these three days, you guys can hide, or join forces with others. You can do anything. However, let me make things clear first. If there are more than four hundred people alive in three days, I’ll start killing those who haven’t killed anyone.”","He turned around and left. In front of him, a stone door silently opened, and instantly, light was transmitted in. It was brightly lit.","Everyone hurriedly exited the stone chamber, only to see that this was a forest covered with greenery and red pines. It was like a utopia.","Unfortunately, the beautiful scenery couldn’t change the fact that this was the Battle God Palace, an organization of assassins.","“Now... the countdown begins!” Wanhe stated calmly. His figure floated in midair, exuding a faint brilliance, as if he was a god.","Instantly, the crowd was divided into two groups. One group was led by Sima Dong, and the other group was led by Han Yue. Of course, there were also lone warriors like Ling Han, but there were only three of them.","At this time, it was clearly an advantage of greater numbers.","“Retreat first!” Han Yue said. If an intense battle broke out with Sima Dong’s camp at this time, who knew what kind of massive losses would be caused. In fact, even he could possibly die here.","Since he only needed to get rid of over three hundred people, there seemed to be no need for such a fierce battle, right?","Sima Dong looked meaningfully at Han Yue, a smile appearing at the corners of his lips, and said, “Let’s retreat too.”","“Wait!” A person suddenly said. It was one of the three lone warriors, but it was not Ling Han. Ling Han was surprised, and looked towards that person. He saw that this was a young man that looked weathered and cold. Though he was only standing very casually, he exuded an incredibly fierce feeling, like a sharp sword that had been unsheathed.","“Who do you think you are? Just because you say to wait, we wait?” Someone jumped out, pointing at the young man.","That young man bared his teeth in a grin. It was clearly a grin, but it caused a chill to rise up from the bottom of one’s heart.","Shua, everyone felt their vision blur, and then saw that the person who had jumped out to rebuke him had already been split into two.","The aloof young man raised his hand, and with a light blow, a drop of blood fell.","He revealed a smile like a god of death, placed his sword on his shoulder, and said, “There is no need to go to so much trouble. I will begin to kill people now. Once I have killed enough, this boring game would naturally end.”","Pa, he had just finished saying these words, when the person that he had killed fell onto the ground, one half on the left and one half on the right, blood gushing all over the ground. “Hahaha, what a joke!” Another person jumped out, “You are only one person, so how could it be that you want to kill a hundred people?”","Sima Dong looked towards Han Yue, and Han Yue just happened to look over. The two of them nodded in an indiscernible manner.","“Let’s attack together and kill this person!”","“This person is far too vicious. He kills people at every turn, so let’s kill him together!”","The two of them spoke at the same time, instantly forming an alliance.","-This young man was clearly a troublemaker, and was not easily controlled at all. Furthermore, his abilities were incredibly powerful. Thus, it was best not to have any plans of forming an alliance with him, and just kill him first.","Instantly, several hundred people rushed out at the same time, charging towards that cold young man.","Hundreds of people against one, and everyone’s cultivation level was similar, so what did they have to fear?","Not only was the aloof young man unafraid, he even revealed a smile, as if he was anticipating","a feast of blood.","‘Die!’","His figure flashed, and took the initiative to greet the crowd.","Shua, shua, shua! Sword light flashed, and one after another, they were cut into two halves. Furthermore, they were all halved vertically, and not severed at the middle.","In just a few breaths’ time, thirteen people were killed by this cold-looking young man, and he himself was completely unharmed.","This did not seem like a battle of equal cultivation levels at all, but rather a one-sided slaughter like a tiger charging into a flock of sheep.","In the sky, Wanhe was indeed just watching coldly from the sidelines. He had no intention of interfering at all. Furthermore, he even revealed a cruel smile, as if he was enjoying this scene","of slaughter.","In the first place, they were a motley crowd, a team that had been temporarily put together. With such a massacre, their morale instantly dropped drastically. The majority of them did not have the heart to continue fighting. Faced with such a sharp sword, they did not want to die under the sword.","Sima Dong and Han Yue exchanged a glance, and the two of them nodded again. At this time, if the two of them did not step forward to stabilize the morale of the army, it would be easy to","lead the team.","Thus, in the next instant, the two of them rushed up at the same time, and joined forces to battle the cold young man.","Ding, ding, ding! This time, the cold young man’s sword was finally blocked.","“Long live!”","“Boss is mighty!”","When everyone saw this, their confidence instantly soared. As long as someone could block","the cold young man head-on, the advantage of having more people would be displayed. If they attacked together, it would somehow eventually kill the cold young man. “Haha, you think you can stand against so many people on your own? How naive!” Han Yue","said with a cold chuckle.","“How preposterous!” Sima Dong also said.","The aloof young man revealed a cold smile, “A few clowns dare to boast shamelessly!”","He slanted the blade of his sword slightly, and then delivered another slash. Instantly, the","sword light was as bright as thirty thousand meters.","Inconceivable, his battle prowess had actually increased greatly again.","Han Yue and Sima Dong did not dare to face this head-on, and hurriedly retreated. Otherwise,","it was possible that they would be severely injured.","The two of them had already retreated, so how could the others withstand it?","The cold-looking young man took advantage of the opening to commit a massacre. Blood splattered madly, and one after another, they were cut into two halves. There were also some traces of blood on his face, which made him look even more hideous and terrifying.","However, he did not stretch out his hand to wipe away the traces of blood. Instead, he licked them with his tongue, and even showed an expression of enjoyment.","What a freakish guy."]},{"number":4053,"title":"Chapter 4053: Second Selection","paragraphs":["Chapter 4053: Second Selection","The aloof young man went on a killing spree. His battle prowess was incredibly powerful, and even the combined forces of Sima Dong and Han Yue, who were ranked in the 2000s in the","Galaxy Network, were no match for him.","Shua, shua, shua! Blood rained down, and one after another, human bodies were cut in half. The scene could be said to be extremely shocking and cruel.","In the sky, a smile appeared on Wanhe’s face, and his eyes were filled with admiration as he looked at the aloof young man.","This kind of extravagant killing intent seemed to have been born for the Battle God Palace.","Everyone finally couldn’t hold on any longer, and dispersed quickly.","They were completely outmatched. This was simply courting death.","Meanwhile, the aloof young man mercilessly began his pursuit, killing until blood flowed all over the ground, and corpses lay all over the ground.","In the end, he was stopped by Wanhe, preventing him from continuing his attack.","-There were only 400 people left now, and he had already achieved his goal.","Wanhe looked at the cold young man, and asked, “What is your name?”","“Mo Yun,” the cold-looking young man said calmly. He didn’t even take even a Spirit Transformation True Lord seriously.","Wanhe, on the other hand, did not take offense. He looked at them, and said, “Aside from Mo Yun, the performance of all of you have disappointed me greatly. The core disciples of the Battle God Palace need to be strong, courageous, and view life and death as a kind of game.” Everyone was silent. F***, this Mo Yun was freakishly strong. Whoever dared to attack him would die. Why don’t you try lowering your cultivation level to the Core Formation Tier?","Wanhe waved his hand, “I’ll give you guys a night to rest. The second round of selections will begin tomorrow morning.”","After saying this, he stepped into the air and left.","Many people began to walk around, wanting to see if they could find an exit to leave this godforsaken place.","However, after a while, everyone returned, shaking their heads and sighing.","How could the Battle God Palace possibly leave behind such an obvious flaw?","Mo Yun had become famous with a single battle, and his limelight had completely surpassed Han Yue and Sima Dong. Thus, people approached, wanting to form a good relationship with him. If they could be on the same side as him in tomorrow’s selection, that naturally would greatly increase their hopes.","However, he directly drew his sword and killed the four people who had walked over first, not giving them the chance to speak at all, causing the faces of those behind them to turn green in fear, and they hurriedly stepped back.","Thankfully, Mo Yun did not start another massacre, which made everyone breathe a sigh of relief.","The night passed, and Wanhe came again.","Everyone was very afraid of meeting this person, because the moment he came, it meant that some of them were going to die, and it was not a small number either.","“Yi, another four have died?” Wan He swept an eye over them, and discovered the corpses that had been cut into eight halves. His eyes immediately fell on Mo Yun, but he had no intention of reprimanding him, which disappointed a great many people.","How they wished that Wanhe could move, and kill Mo Yun. This guy’s existence was practically destroying the balance, and the others had no way out.","“Next, the second round of selections will begin,” Wan He said. “In this wilderness, there are a total of a hundred targets that can be assassinated. Some targets are very simple. Their abilities are very weak, but though some targets are also very weak, they have the protection of elites.”","“You only need to kill one target, and you will have passed the test. And three days later, those who have not completed a single kill... will all be executed!”","When his words fell, everyone felt a chill in their hearts.","There were only 100 targets, but there were 400 of them. In other words, even if they could successfully assassinate these targets, at least 300 of them would die.","This was too cruel.","“The countdown begins now. Hurry up and hunt!” Wanhe waved his hand, and that cruel smile appeared on his face again.","Everyone hurriedly split up, and entered into the forest ahead of them.","They had to hurry up, because there were only a hundred targets. If they were all assassinated, the only fate for the remaining people would be death. Furthermore, mission targets were also divided into difficulty levels. If the simple targets were all killed, it would naturally increase the difficulty level endlessly.","Thus, they had to hurry.","Ling Han also strolled forward. He was naturally extremely displeased, but now that he was under someone else’s roof, he had no choice but to lower his head.","During this night, he had already studied the ley lines here. However, this planet had clearly been set up with a powerful formation long ago. He could sense the ley lines, but couldn’t mobilize the Earth Qi.","It couldn’t be helped. His Spiritual Power wasn’t strong enough, and couldn’t compete with the formation. All the Earth Qi had been extracted by the formation, and it was circulating","according to some kind of trajectory.","This caused him to lose a trump card.","“Now, I have to hide my identity. Otherwise, if the Battle God Palace discovers that I am Ling Han, I would really be deader than dead.”","“However, as long as I leave alive, I’ll know where the Battle God Palace is. Then, I’ll publicize it on the Galaxy Network. I’m sure that countless forces that have been assassinated","by the Battle God Palace will charge over.”","“So, for now, live on!”","Ling Han firmed his resolve, and his figure immediately sped up. He soared through the forest, searching for a target that he could assassinate.","Not long after, he stopped.","There was a wooden figure standing upright, but beside the wooden figure, there were two fierce beasts with metal chains wrapped around their necks, exuding a powerful aura.","The word “target” was written on this wooden figure, and it was very eye-catching.","Yi, the Battle God Palace didn’t make it too bloody this time, using wooden puppets as assassination targets.","Ling Han used his eye technique to scan the surroundings. These two fierce beasts were both at the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier, and judging by the wave of aura they exuded, they probably had battle prowess of around 15th Heaven.","For ordinary prodigies, the battle prowess of 15 Heavens was already terrifying enough. Ling Han naturally wouldn’t take it to heart. He casually walked over.","The two ferocious beasts immediately roared. They were trapped here, so they naturally became even more violent.","Ling Han humphed as he unleashed his murderous aura. Pa, pa, pa! The minds of the two ferocious beasts instantly exploded. They wailed in agony as they collapsed to the ground,","dead.","He walked in front of the wooden figure, and was just about to deliver a palm strike, when he saw that the wooden figure actually moved. Xiu, it leaped up, its speed extremely fast.","Yi?","Ling Han faltered upon seeing this. However, how quick was his reaction? He immediately","launched a palm strike.","Peng!","The wooden block was instantly shattered, turning into pieces that filled the air.","“Pass.” A voice rang out in Ling Han’s mind, “You can rest here.”","This was Wanhe.","Ling Han looked up at the sky, but did not see any sign of Wanhe.","The Spirit Transformation Tier far surpassed his cultivation level.","Ling Han sat down cross-legged as he was told. Right now, he had to maintain a low profile.","“Humph, I was too late!” A voice rang out behind Ling Han, and Han Yue walked out. His eyes swept over them, revealing a baleful expression, “You actually dare to snatch my prey!”","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh, “There’s such a thing as that?”","“I remember you,” Han Yue said. “You’re that arrogant rookie!”","Ling Han sighed, “Since you have so much time, why don’t you go find your next target? What","are you squabbling about with me?”","“It’s fine!” Han Yue said calmly. “Killing you is only a matter of raising my hand. It won’t","waste too much time.”","‘F*ck! Do you think I’m an easy target to bully?’"]},{"number":4054,"title":"Chapter 4054: Courting Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 4054: Courting Death","Ling Han reflected on himself for a moment. Had he been too low-key?","Otherwise, how could someone like Han Yue dare to make threatening gestures at him? Whatever.","Ling Han ignored him, and merely closed his eyes to rest.","“Very good. Now that you know you can’t resist, you might as well give up resisting!” Han Yue said coldly.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. This guy had such a high opinion of himself that he was about to soar into the skies.","“Die!” Han Yue leaped over, and delivered a palm strike at the top of Ling Han’s head, intending to shatter his mind with a single strike.","Ling Han sat as still as a boulder, and it was only when Han Yue’s palm was about to strike him that he suddenly lashed out.","“There’s no need to resist,” Han Yue said coldly. However, a look of astonishment spread across his face as soon as he finished speaking.","Even though Ling Han’s attack had come later, and his speed looked pitifully slow, in truth, his palm had not even landed on Ling Han’s head, when the latter’s hand had already grabbed onto his throat.","How was this possible?","He had not even finished the thought, when he felt his whole body go soft. Instantly, he lost all his power.","Too terrifying, too terrifying. This guy’s strength was even stronger than Mo Yun. At least, he could still block a few moves from Mo Yun, but faced with Ling Han, he couldn’t even survive a single move.","He actually took the initiative to trifle with this kind of freak!","He was really courting death.","At this moment, Han Yue really wanted to cry. For better or worse, he was a prodigy ranked in the 2000s in the Galaxy Network. No matter which galaxy he was in, he could only be considered one of the top prodigies. Why did he keep encountering freaks that were innumerable times more freakish than him?","“S-spare me!” he forced out.","“If you were stronger just now, would you have spared me?” Ling Han countered calmly.","However, before Han Yue could even answer, Ling Han suddenly clenched his fist. Pa! Han Yue’s neck was snapped, and a burst of power surged into his mind, obliterating his spirit as well.","He already understood that those who entered the Battle God Palace would either die in the selection process, or become assassins of the Battle God Palace after passing. Thus, it was best for Han Yue to die, to avoid harming others.","Ling Han swung his arm and tossed Han Yue aside. He then sat down in a cross-legged position again. It was as if he were disconnected from the rest of the world.","“Interesting.” In the sky, a faint smile appeared on Wanhe’s face. Nothing that happened in this area could escape his senses.","When Han Yue charged towards Ling Han, he had initially wanted to stop him, but he also wanted to see the strength of the two of them. Thus, he chose to sit by and watch. He had not thought that Ling Han would be so strong. With a single strike, he had insta-killed Han Yue. “I really didn’t expect that two promising saplings would actually be chosen this time.”","“Hehe, the seed of the king of assassins should be one of the two.”","The assassination was still continuing.","Some succeeded, while others failed. Instead, they were killed by the guards who protected the target. This was a life-or-death competition.","Three days later, the time expired.","Wanhe’s voice rang out, “A total of 71 people have completed the mission. As for the others, all of them will be executed!”","“No!”","“I don’t want to die!”","“Please, I’m willing to do anything. Don’t let me die!”","Instantly, a chorus of pleading voices rang out.","But very quickly, these voices stopped abruptly. Clearly, it was Wanhe who had moved, and executed these people.","“Rest for a night, and the final round of selections will begin tomorrow,” Wanhe said again, then disappeared.","Only 71 people remained.","These people did not return to the cave to reunite. Tomorrow, they would all become competitors, and they could no longer trust anyone else.","The night passed in silence.","In the early morning, Ling Han decided to cultivate for a while first. Although the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier was mainly dependent on natural treasures to strengthen the Celestial Core, absorbing the power of heaven and earth was also effective, though the effefct","was negligible.","However, no matter how small it was, it was still improvement, and could not be wasted.","Wanhe appeared, telling everyone to gather.","“This is the final selection,” Wan He said. “Next, I will choose seven people as my target, and then assign nine people each to assassinate them.”","“In that case, there would be a total of seven groups... and one group would have eleven","people.”","“For assassins, success in the assassination would mean rising above the rest, and for the assassination targets, they would need to eliminate all the assassins before they could pass the test. As for the others... they would all be executed!”","“Understood?”","Hearing such rules, everyone frowned. If they were assigned as assassination targets, they would have to kill nine or ten to be able pass, so the pressure was naturally great.","But if he became an assassin, the pressure was actually not small either. He had to be the one to kill the target first to survive.","To put it bluntly, only one person in a group could survive.","In the first round, there were only 400 people left out of the 700 plus people, and the survival rate was 50%. In the first round, there were only 100 people left out of the 400 people, and the survival rate was only 20%. Now, only one person in very ten would remain, and the survival","rate was only 10%.","This was too cruel, wasn’t it?","However, Wan He didn’t give them any time to discuss at all, and he immediately started to","group them into groups.","“Now, I will first select the seven assassination targets.”","“You, you, you, you... and you!”","Wanhe used his hand to point at them one by one, and finally stopped in front of Ling Han.","The seven targets of assassination were chosen, and those who had not been chosen breathed a sigh of relief. As assassins, no matter what, the pressure on them would be slightly lighter. “Now, it’s the first set of assassins.” Wanhe began to assign them again, assigning nine people to the first set, then the second set, and the third set.","Because Ling Han was in the seventh group, the assassins in his group weren’t nine people,","but rather ten.","Most importantly, one of the assassins in this group was... Mo Yun!","When they discovered that Mo Yun had not been divided up for a long time, all the way until","the seventh group, the nine assassins of the seventh group all had pale faces, including Sima","Dong.","What was the point of continuing the game?","Who was Mo Yun’s match?","No, there was still a chance, and that was to kill Ling Han first. In that way, no matter how strong Mo Yun was, he would only be killed according to the rules.","“Alright, let’s begin!” Wanhe smiled. He loved to say the word “begin”, making him feel like he was an omnipotent and in control of everything.","Instantly, the assassins from the seven groups all charged towards their respective targets","like wolves and tigers. Whoever could be the first to kill their target would be able to survive.","Living was the most primitive, most ordinary, most basic desire, but at the same time, it was also the strongest desire.","Everyone exploded with a fighting spirit and battle prowess that was far stronger than usual. Their eyes were bloodshot. At this time, no matter who stood in their way, they would","mercilessly eliminate them.","‘I want to live!’ Shua, shua, shua! Sword light flashed, incomparably fierce.","Mo Yun was already on a killing spree, but his target was not Ling Han, but rather the","members of the seventh group.","Tragic wails rang out. After nine strikes, eight had fallen, and only one person was still alive.","Sima Dong.","However, he was also having a hard time. He had been stabbed in the back, and the wound had penetrated deep into his internal organs. He could clearly see that there was still Sword Qi tyrannizing his body. If he could not expel the Sword Qi, he would still be unable to avoid","death.","Hiss, Mo Yun was actually extremely powerful!","When the others saw this scene, they all broke out in a cold sweat. Thankfully, they were not","in the same group as Mo Yun.","Mo Yun did not pursue any further. Instead, he looked towards Ling Han, and showed a cruel","smile."]},{"number":4055,"title":"Chapter 4055: Victory","paragraphs":["Chapter 4055: Victory","Ling Han stood with his hands clasped behind his back, as if he had not seen anything.","He had his own worries. The Battle God Palace should have a considerable understanding of him, so he could only use the methods of “Ding Yi”.","The God Slaying Technique could be cast. This was a celestial technique that practically no one knew about. The Heavenly Brilliance Technique could be cast. Previously, he had learnt it under the name of Ding Yi. However, the Demonic Monkey Fists could not cast, and the formation technique was also not usable. This was already deeply marked as Ling Han’s unique traits.","The Primal Chaos Celestial Core couldn’t be used, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower couldn’t be used either. Sigh, there were so many restrictions.","Just as Ling Han was vexed, Mo Yun also strode over, his sword lowered, blood dripping.","He did not like to speak. If it was anyone else, they would definitely say a few words at this time, and furiously show their feeling of superiority.","But Mo Yun’s eyes were only bloodshot, his killing intent blazing, as if it had solidified.","Shua, he moved. His sword slashed out, like a blood-coloured ribbon.","Ling Han snapped his fingers, and with a ‘ding’, this ribbon was instantly severed from the middle, and separated into two halves that swept past either side of Ling Han. Naturally, not even a single hair on Ling Han’s head was severed.","F***!","Seeing this scene, Sima Dong instantly gaped, then sank into deep despair.","Originally, he had wanted to muster up the last bit of his power, and kill Ling Han before Mo Yun did. Then, no matter how strong Mo Yun was, he could only wait helplessly for death.","However, he had never imagined that Ling Han would actually be so strong.","This time, he was done for. Whether it was Ling Han or Mo Yun that would emerge victorious, he would not be able to escape death.","And the battles of the other six groups had already begun. Everyone was fighting for their lives, so they naturally had no time to watch the battle between Ling Han and Mo Yun. Thus, no one got a scare.","Mo Yun showed a hint of surprise, as if he was wondering how Ling Han had managed to block his attack.","However, this was only an instant, and he immediately delivered another strike with his sword.","Ling Han casually snapped his fingers, and once again dispersed Mo Yun’s attack.","“You are very strong.” It was rare for Mo Yun to speak up.","Ling Han merely smiled faintly. Mo Yun’s killing nature was extremely cruel, and he could not appreciate it at all.","Thus, it would be better for him to die.","“I want to kill you even more!” Mo Yun continued. He raised his sword, and lightly licked the blade of the sword. Instantly, a bloody mark appeared on his lips. It was unknown whether it was the original blood on the sword, or the blood from a cut on his lip.","“If you have the ability, then bring it on,” Ling Han said calmly.","“Die!”","Mo Yun rushed over. Boom, an intense blood colour overflowed from his body. It was as if his whole person had turned into a blood demon. Even his hair had turned completely red, exuding a terrifying demonic aura.","Ling Han used the God Slaying Technique to exchange blows with Mo Yun.","Mo Yun was really very strong. His battle prowess was probably twenty Heavens, which was enough to advance into the top hundred of the Galaxy Network. It was no wonder that even when Han Yue and Sima Dong joined forces, they were still no match for him.","However, Ling Han’s raw power was already at the Eighteenth Heaven. After activating the God Slaying Technique, Ling Han’s battle prowess had even advanced to the 21st Heaven.","Even though it was only the suppression of a single Heaven, when elites exchanged blows, could they afford to have a disadvantage of even one Heaven?","Mo Yun had already fallen into a disadvantage. Being suppressed by Ling Han, his disadvantage was also continuously magnified.","This was naturally because Ling Han had held back. He hadn’t used the murderous aura attack, nor had he used the Primal Chaos Celestial Core. Otherwise, he would have killed Mo Yun several hundred times over.","Wanhe couldn’t help but look impressed. In truth, he was more optimistic about Mo Yun, because this kind of extravagant, murderous personality of Mo Yun was more suited to become an assassin, and Ling Han was the ultimate test that he had set for Mo Yun.","Unfortunately, Mo Yun had not passed the test.","Mo Yun roared loudly, his voice rolling out, solidifying.","However, this did not have the slightest effect on the battle situation.","However, Mo Yun turned his hand and grabbed onto his own spine. Then, with a powerful pull, pu, blood sprayed out violently. He had pulled out the whole spine, and holding it in his hand, it was like a bone whip, covered with blood.","Strangely, from the gaping wound, it could be seen that he actually still had a spine.","“Bone Nurturing Technique!” Wanhe couldn’t help but light up, revealing a hint of excitement.","The Bone Nurturing Technique was actually very simple. That was, an elite would forcibly pull out his own bones, and insert them into the body of another. In this way, his own martial arts experience could also be passed on.","Usually, this was only done by elites before they died, and it had to be someone close to them. Otherwise, the bloodline would reject them, and the bones implanted would only rot of","necrosis.","Moreover, the skull and spine were the best. They could most likely inherit one’s martial arts memories.","At crucial moments, this elite’s bone could still be used as a tool to wield like a Spirit Tool. After all, the Spirit Tool came from an elite, and their bloodlines were connected. After nurturing it for many years, it could naturally unleash astonishing power.","Was the tables about to turn?","Wanhe was filled with anticipation.","“Die!” Mo Yun brandished the bone whip and attacked. Hu, his blood was burning, causing the bone whip to turn into a fiery whip. When the attack was delivered, it was incredibly","terrifying.","His battle prowess had increased by at least three Heavens.","This was a little troublesome. Ling Han used his movement technique, focusing on dodging and evasion. He frowned slightly. If he could unleash his full battle prowess, he would naturally be unafraid. He would be able to suppress his opponent with a flip of his hand.","But now, he had too many abilities that he could not use. How was he supposed to defeat his opponent in this kind of situation?","Thus, he could only think as he dodged.","Mo Yun had suddenly regained the upper hand. Not only had his morale increased greatly, his killing intent had also soared explosively. His whole head of bloody hair was soaring into the skies. He really looked like he had completely become a god of death.","Ling Han used his eye technique, capturing the weaknesses in his attacks, and began to dodge.","However, Eye Techniques could not compensate for the difference of two Heavens in battle prowess. If it was not for the fact that Ling Han still had the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, that could disperse the power that impacted on him, his present situation would definitely be very","terrible.","Ling Han was also a little anxious. If this continued, Wanhe might become suspicious. Under the crushing pressure of battle prowess of two Heavens, how had you been able to take it","head-on?","Thus, he had to end the battle as soon as possible!","Good.","Ling Han deliberately planted a weak point, causing Mo Yun to charge over. With a thought,","the murderous aura surged out.","This was divine sense-level, and without a trace, it directly blasted into Mo Yun’s mind.","Instantly, Mo Yun showed an expression of pain, but before he could even call out, Ling Han’s fist had already shot out, and landed on Mo Yun’s forehead.","Pu!","Mo Yun did not have the slightest ability to resist, and his head was blasted apart with a single","punch from Ling Han.","This!","Even Wanhe was dumbfounded for a moment. Hadn’t Mo Yun completely gained the upper hand? Just when it looked like he had grasped Ling Han’s weak point, and was about to kill him with a single strike, why had the situation suddenly turned around? The one who had been killed with a single strike was not Ling Han, but rather Mo Yun.","But Mo Yun’s headless corpse was lying there, fresh blood still gushing out. This was a fact","that could not be more real.","He looked at Ling Han, his eyes filled with confusion. Even he couldn’t tell what method Ling","Han had used to achieve a reversal.","His palm pressed down. Pa, pa, pa, pa! The minds of the people below all exploded completely, and they were all dead. Even Sima Dong did not manage to escape. Pa, his head","drooped onto the ground, his eyes still filled with shock.","Right now, only Ling Han was still alive."]},{"number":4056,"title":"Chapter 4056: Blood Tower","paragraphs":["Chapter 4056: Blood Tower","“How did you kill Mo Yun?” Wanhe asked, filled with curiosity.","Ling Han swept an eye over the corpses all over the ground, and his heart clenched. However, his expression was calm, and he said, “I was stronger than him, so I naturally can kill him.”","Wanhe was naturally dissatisfied with this answer. He shook his head, “Mo Yun used the Celestial Bone of an elite at the end, and his battle prowess is at least two Heavens higher than yours. How could he possibly be killed by you?”","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Because I am Ding Yi.”","Ding Yi?","Wan He was stunned at first, and after searching for this name, he immediately revealed a shocked expression.","As it turned out, this brat was Ding Yi.","Who was Ding Yi?","He became famous in the Donglin Imperial Clan’s gathering of prodigies, and even Fu Huoyang, an Imperial Son, was defeated, becoming one of the most dazzling new stars in the West Heavenly Realm.","He had never thought that the Battle God Palace would cast a wide net and gather prodigies, and would actually be able to catch such a big fish.","This was really profitable. With such a good foundation, and with proper training, he may be able to become the king of assassins in future.","It was clear that Ling Han still did not answer, but Wanhe did not ask further about Mo Yun’s death.","Ding Yi-this name was enough.","“Very good. You have defeated everyone, and become the seed of the king of assassins,” Wan He said. “I hope you can continue to work hard and become the next king of assassins.”","Ling Han mocked internally. If you knew that I am Ling Han, then you wouldn’t be nurturing me to become the king of assassins at all. Instead, you would have the assassins come to kill","me.","“What is the king of assassins?” He took the chance to ask, wanting to know more about the Battle God Palace.","“The seed of the king of assassins is equivalent to the Dao Child of our Battle God Palace,” Wanhe said, “And in the case of the king of assassins, he is the master of our Battle God Palace!”","With these words, Ling Han finally understood. No wonder the competition was so cruel. Close to eight hundred people had entered, and it could be said that they were all prodigies. However, in the end, he was the only one who had survived.","This was because the Battle God Palace didn’t want to recruit ordinary disciples. Instead, they wanted to recruit the Dao Child!","Why didn’t they nurture those who were eliminated as ordinary disciples? Wasn’t it too wasteful to kill them directly?","Thinking about it, it was simple. That was because most of these people had their own masters, so it was inevitable that they would be disloyal. It was far inferior to raising them from an infant, and brainwashing them from a young age.","But why would they still choose the Dao Child like this?","That was because the Dao Child had to be outstanding enough, so they naturally had to choose from the wider universe, and if it was only one person, it would be considerably easier to brainwash him. Additionally, this was someone who would become the Dao Child of a Holy Land, which was enough to tempt a great many top-notch prodigies.","Thus, the Battle God Palace was still filled with confidence, thinking that even if they used this method, they would still be able to make others willingly join the Battle God Palace in the","end.","“Follow me,” Wanhe said, walking ahead with his hands clasped behind his back.","Ling Han followed behind him. He didn’t want to walk alongside him.","After walking for a while, a wall of air appeared ahead of them. There was clearly still a path ahead, but they could not walk through it.","Wanhe pressed down with his hand, and a seal instantly lit up in his palm. Then, he walked forward.","The wall of air disappeared.","Ling Han hurriedly followed, but he had already memorized the seal in Wanhe’s palm.","The other party would never have imagined that he was a Formations Grandmaster.","After walking for a while, structures appeared ahead of them. They were all very ordinary, as if they were the residences of ordinary people.","However, this was the territory of the Battle God Palace, an organization of assassins.","“What is it? You didn’t expect it, did you?” Wanhe asked with a smile.","Ling Han nodded, and said, “I really didn’t expect this. At first glance, it looks like an ordinary village.”","A smug expression appeared on Wanhe’s face, and he said, “As an outstanding assassin, before he makes a move, he should be like an ordinary person. He won’t attract anyone’s","attention.”","Ling Han didn’t agree with this at all. From the bottom of his heart, he hated assassination. In a battle, they should charge head-on and fight fiercely.","Of course, if one’s abilities were inferior, they definitely wouldn’t be able to charge. Delivering oneself to die and being brave were two completely different things.","“Old Wan, is this the seed of Core Formation Tier?” A person walked out of the village, glanced at Ling Han, and then asked Wan He.","Wan He nodded, then said mysteriously, “Guess who he is?”","“What nonsense; how am I supposed to guess!” That person immediately shook his head. With how big the universe was, how could he possibly know a junior in the Core Formation","Tier?","Wan He laughed loudly, “You must have heard of his name!”","That person was startled. Looking at Wan He, he seemed to be very confident. He thought for","a moment, then asked, “It can’t be Ling Han, right?”","Tsk, his guess was really accurate.","“How could that be!” Wan He shook his head, “How could there be such a coincidence!”","It was really so coincidental.","“Then who is it?” That person did not want to guess.","“Ding Yi,” Wan He replied.","Instantly, that person was shocked, and turned back to look at Ling Han, asking, “You are","Ding Yi?”","He still had to confirm.","Ling Han nodded, “I am Ding Yi.”","“Haha, we’ve really picked up a treasure this time!” That person laughed loudly, “Who knows, this may be the strongest seed, the future king of assassins.”","“M-hm.” Wan He nodded.","Ling Han finally understood why the Battle God Palace always had a Killing Saint on standby. That was because they had plundered prodigies from the universe for generation after generation. With the lifespan of a Saint as high as a million years, they would always be able to nurture out successor within the time limit of their lifespan.","“Have the other groups also chosen seeds?” Wan He asked.","“Not yet. Your group is the fastest,” that person shook his head.","“Alright, I’ll arrange for this brat’s accommodations first,” Wan He said.","He led Ling Han into the village to settle down. He was allocated a very ordinary house, but it also had a small garden. After telling Ling Han to temporarily stay here for a few days, he left","swiftly.","Wasn’t he afraid that Ling Han would flee?","He really wasn’t afraid.","Core Formation Tiers couldn’t travel through the universe with their physical bodies, and it","would be difficult for them to reach the nearest planet even if they were given 1000 years. As for the Transfer Formation... with the tight security of the Battle God Palace, the Transfer Formation would definitely be extremely strictly guarded.","Most importantly, Ling Han still didn’t want to leave.","Since he had accidentally entered into the Battle God Palace, he wanted to find out more.","-Didn’t you guys want to kill me? Then I’ll reveal all your information to the public, and unite the power of the entire universe to destroy you guys.","In the past few days, Ling Han had been cultivating with no intention of fleeing at all.","Seven days later, Wan He finally came again.","“Follow me.” He didn’t speak any nonsense.","Ling Han left with him. This time, they arrived at the foot of a tall tower.","This tower was completely blood-red, and had a total of 33 levels.","Ling Han wasn’t the only one. There were also three young people here, two men and one woman. The two men were Foundation Building Tier and Cauldron Forging Tier, while the woman was True Self Tier. She was extremely beautiful, and her figure was even more graceful, with astonishing curves.","“Congratulations on becoming seeds this time,” Wan He said. “Next, what you guys will be competing for is the title of king of assassins. There is only one king of assassins. Every generation can only have one king of assassins.”","“Before you, there were 27 seeds... Oh, there should be 26 now. One just died.”","Wan He paused, then pointed at the Blood Tower behind him, “This is the tower of inheritance of our Battle God Palace. Which one of you seeds can reach the thirty-third level? You will be the next king of assassins, and as for the others... they will all be executed!”"]},{"number":4057,"title":"Chapter 4057: The True Three Styles of the God of War","paragraphs":["Chapter 4057: The True Three Styles of the God of War","What great pressure, and what an intense competition.","One person became the Killing Saint, while the others were all executed.","The woman opened her mouth, and asked, “Senior, may I know which level the person with the fastest progress has reached?”","This was very crucial.","Including Ling Han, everyone looked towards Wan He.","Wan He paused, and said, “The fastest person has already reached the thirtieth level.”","F***","Ling Han and the others all frowned. Then they would have lost out too, wouldn’t they? The gap was too wide.","“Senior, this is far too unfair,” the Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator said.","Wan He sneered, “This world is unjust in the first place. It can only be changed with one’s own efforts.”","“Senior, can we enter the inheritance tower now?” the True Self Tier woman asked.","Wan He broke into a smile, “This is the correct attitude! Of course, you can come to the Blood Tower at any time to challenge and comprehend.”","“In this place, it is strictly forbidden for you to kill each other. Otherwise, you will all be executed!”","“En, you all introduce yourselves first. In the future, for a very long time, not only will you all be competitors, you will also be like-minded companions, and will be going on missions together.”","The four of them introduced themselves. The Foundation Building Tier cultivator was called Chen Bing, the Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator was called Zhao Biao, and the True Self Tier cultivator was called Zhu Yan.","Wan He soon left elegantly, leaving the four of them to do whatever they had to do.","From the looks of it, there didn’t seem to be any traps here. There was only cruel competition.","However, if it was just that, how could it make people completely devoted to the Battle God Palace?","Ling Han looked at the Blood Tower in front of him. Could it be that all its mysteries were here?","Zhu Yan was the first to move, and she had already walked into the Blood Tower.","After hesitating for a moment, Chen Bing and Zhao Biao hurriedly followed after her.","Ling Han, on the other hand, was not in a rush. He circled around the tower once. He discovered that this tower was not ordinary. Not only was it a powerful Spirit Tool, it was also the core of a great formation.","Without batting an eyelid, he walked towards the great doors at the foot of the tower.","In the end, he would still have to face this.","After entering the tower, Ling Han felt as if he had stepped into another world. There were powerful warriors, and there was endless slaughter.","Pu, pu, pu! Innumerable drops of blood bloomed in front of him, and heads fell one after another. Not only were there adults, there were also children. In fact, there were even infants. Their stomachs were cut open, and the scene was incredibly bloody.","This kind of massacre would drive normal people crazy.","Ling Han was extremely resolute. He had walked all the way from the Genesis World, and had even witnessed the destruction of a whole realm, so how could he be distracted by this kind of scene?","He watched calmly, capturing every single detail.","Soon, he discovered that there were multiple seals hidden in the blood that had splattered.","These seals were all dark red in colour, and was akin to blood. Thus, if one did not carefully observe them, it would be impossible to discover them.","Ling Han was grasping these seals, and at the same time, it was inevitable that he would also be absorbing the images of slaughter.","Realization dawned on him. So this was how the Battle God Palace brainwashed people.","If he wanted to grasp these seals, he had to carefully look at these images of slaughter. The longer it took, the more likely it was that it would affect his mind, or even influence his personality.","Of course, that would definitely need a very long time. However, this Blood Tower had 33 levels.","What else was there?","Seeds like them were all competitors, so everyone would definitely feel extremely pressured, because once someone reached the top, the others would all die.","This meant that everyone would spend a lot of their time here. Then, with this influence, it would not be strange for their temperament to slowly be influenced, and their personalities to gradually become distorted.","Moreover, the images in the first level might only be a piece of cake, and would be multiplied with every successive level afterwards. In short, it was certain to turn a normal person into a mass murderer.","Ling Han took a deep breath. If that was all, he believed that with his self-control, he would definitely remain unchanged.","“All right, then let’s have a competition!”","Ling Han extracted all the seals, then analyzed them in his mind.","After a while, he revealed an expression of surprise.","This was the first style of the Three Styles of the God of War. However, it was much more complicated than the first style that he had learnt.","The real Three Styles of the God of War.","Not bad, not bad. The Battle God Palace was really generous. From the very beginning, they were gifting the Saint Technique to him.","Ling Han quickly smiled. In any case, they could not leave the Battle God Palace. Furthermore, in the end, only one of them would be able to become the king of assassins. The others would all die, so what if the Battle God Palace passed this technique on to them?","He began to practice, over and over again. When he had completely mastered this style, a door silently opened, revealing a set of stairs that led to the second floor.","This first level, it would be considered as him having passed.","Ling Han smiled. He did not see Zhu Yan and the others who had entered before him. Thus,","they must have entered into separate spaces.","-Previously, he had already discovered that this Blood Tower itself was a precious tool.","Ling Han walked up the stairs, and soon arrived at the second floor.","Shua, a fierce Sword Qi slashed over, incredibly terrifying.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel shocked. He hurriedly dodged to the side. Then, he discovered that the person who had attacked was actually a child. He looked extremely innocent, but after his attack had missed, he immediately attacked again and again, every move fierce.","It was really hard to imagine that a child would actually have such a high cultivation level, that even Ling Han would feel some pressure. This had to be battle prowess above twenty","Heavens, at least.","But how could a mere five- or six-year-old child be so strong?","He immediately realized that this should not be a real person, but rather a manifestation created by the formation.","Ling Han activated his Eye Technique, and sure enough, he didn’t find any majestic life","essence. It was just a blur.","Since it wasn’t a real person, Ling Han naturally didn’t need to have any more reservations. He aggressively attacked and killed this child.","Strangely, though this child had died, it had not dispersed. Instead, he was lying there like a real person. There was blood flowing, and one could even smell the strong stench of blood.","This blood was real!","The Battle God Palace was truly a freak. For the sake of twisting one’s mind, they would do","anything.","Ling Han circled the surroundings, but did not find any doors that led to the third floor open.","What was going on? He had not passed the test?","That’s right. He had learnt the First Style of the God of War from the first level, so going by that trend, he should be able to learn the true Second Style of the God of War here.","He observed carefully, yet could not make heads or tails of the situation at all.","Could it be?","Ling Han’s eyes turned to the corpse on the ground. This was clearly an illusion, but it still hadn’t dissipated after being defeated. It should have been deliberately designed like this. ‘F*ck! It can’t be that freakish, right?’","Ling Han faltered for a moment. Forming the appearance of a child to attack him, and having him personally kill a “child” was already cruel enough, but now, the key to the Second Style of","the God of War was probably on this corpse.","He was required to dismember someone’s corpse?","Although this was fake, Ling Han still felt a strong feeling of nausea. It was too","uncomfortable.","However, Ling Han still guarded his heart. He began to dissect the corpse."]},{"number":4058,"title":"Chapter 4058: Strange Shadow Steps","paragraphs":["Chapter 4058: Strange Shadow Steps","Ling Han felt that this was cruel, but he had no choice but to do so.","If he couldn’t learn the Second Style of the God of War, it was clear that he couldn’t go to the third level.","Thus, he suppressed all his emotions, and told himself that this was not a real corpse, but rather a formation manifestation.","However, this corpse was too real, and there was no difference between it and a real person.","Ling Han silently recited the Six Characters Bright King Curse in his mind. His mind was clear, transcendent above all else.","After cutting open this corpse, Ling Han finally discovered seals again.","Some were on the bones, some were on the organs, and some were on the veins. In short, Ling Han definitely had to dissect this corpse carefully to obtain the complete seal.","It could be said that this stage was not difficult to pass. As long as one had the slightest bit of strength, and was ruthless enough, that was enough.","Thus, the first few stages were not used to impede seeds like them, but rather to “temper” their temperament, falling slowly in the direction of cold-bloodedness and cruelty.","Ling Han channelled the Heavenly Dao Flames, and boom, this corpse was instantly turned into ash.","He began to combine these seals. With his outstanding comprehension ability, in less than half a day, he had already grasped the profound mysteries.","Ling Han began to practice. This was indeed the Second Style of the God of War. It was similarly much more complicated, and could be considered “authentic”.","As he cultivated, a door silently opened. He could now go to the third floor.","Ling Han stepped out, but this time, no one attacked him. He saw that there were ten elders lying or sitting on the ground, and they were all skin and bones. Aside from them, there was no one else.","This!","To make a move on these defenseless old people that had no cultivation level at all?","The Battle God Palace, oh, the Battle God Palace. He already knew that this was a cruel organization of assassins, but he still hadn’t imagined that such a method with no bottom line at all would be used to train new disciples.","Obviously, the seal of the Third Style of the God of War was on these old people, but it was definitely not their skin, but rather the same as the second floor.","It was too cruel, and too freakish.","Ling Han frowned deeply. Even if he knew that this was a formation manifestation, he still felt extremely uncomfortable.","Furthermore, what if there was a real person for him to kill later?","“How exactly does the Battle God Palace judge whether seeds are affected or not?”","“If I forcefully suppress my negative emotions and maintain a clear mind, they might discover me. After all, they’ve been doing this all their lives. I’m the newbie here.”","“Thus, if I want to deceive everyone, I have to think of another way.”","“Yi, why don’t I create a second consciousness, and let this consciousness become a demon? After I pass the test, I will then sever this consciousness.”","Ling Han’s eyes lit up. In the Buddhist Race, this was actually a cultivation technique called Slaying Evil Thoughts or Slashing Heart Demons. However, they would only slay demons and evil thoughts after they had developed them in their hearts, and as for Ling Han, he originally didn’t have any internal demons, but rather wanted to create one first.","“This can also be seen as a tempering. After severing the internal demon in my heart, my willpower will definitely be able to become slightly stronger.”","“All right!”","Ling Han retracted his intent into the depths of his mind and adhered it to the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, using the power of this Celestial Core to cut off the connection with his physical body. At the same time, he left behind a sliver of divine sense, leaving behind all the images that he had seen on the first and second levels.","When this sliver of divine sense entered Ling Han’s mind, he suddenly opened his eyes, instantly exuding an incredibly terrifying aura.","He was a completely different person. There was no expression on his face, only coldness and slaughter.","Ling Han moved without hesitation. Pa, pa, pa! The ten old people were all killed. He skinned them, searched for the seals, and then began to cultivate.","He had obtained the Third Style of the God of War.","The fourth level opened.","Ling Han had lost all emotion. Like a demon, a god of death, he began a massacre, without the slightest hesitation.","The Fourth Style of the God of War, the Fifth Style... When Ling Han charged to the ninth level, he had also learnt the Nine Styles of the Saint Technique.","However, after entering into the tenth level, though slaughter was still inevitable, he had not learnt the Tenth Style of the God of War. Instead, he had learnt a secret technique that concealed his tracks.","This was called the Strange Shadow Step.","After channeling this secret technique, it was as if his whole person had entered into a shadow. Even if they were face to face, you would not be able to discover that there was another person in front of you. If you were suddenly attacked, your only fate would be death.","If it had been a seed-level assassin that had attempted to assassinate Ling Han, then merely this Strange Shadow Steps would be enough to cause Ling Han a lot of trouble.","However, the Strange Shadow Steps of the tenth level weren’t complete. After Ling Han ascended to the eleventh level, he learned another part, and another part on the twelfth level. It wasn’t until the sixteenth level that he finally mastered all of the Strange Shadow Steps.","Calculating the time, more than a month had already passed.","Though Ling Han felt a little hungry, as long as he had stepped into Celestial Path, he only had to absorb the energy of heaven and earth, and he would not die of hunger and thirst. In his present consciousness, he was not a glutton at all. Thus, he charged all the way to the","seventeenth level without the slightest hesitation.","A white-haired elder was presently sitting in a cross-legged position. He was like a stone statue, without the slightest sign of life.","Ling Han wasn’t reserved at all. He used the Strange Shadow Steps, and quietly arrived behind the old man. Then, he shot out the Nine Styles of God of War, striking out at the old man.","“Good one, brat!” The old man humphed lightly, and without even turning his head, delivered a palm strike.","Peng!","Ling Han instantly turned into a rolling gourd, crashing into the wall before finally stopping. However, he immediately used the Strange Shadow Steps and once again entered into the","shadows.","“Haha, showing off your Strange Shadow Steps in front of me, what a joke!” The white-haired old man laughed. He stood up. Boom, his whole person exuded a powerful life essence. It was too terrifying, as if a furnace was burning fiercely.","“However, to be able to reach this kind of level in a short month’s time, and furthermore, you are only in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier. It is really not easy.”","“I have a high opinion of you!”","Xiu, right at this moment, Ling Han had already escaped from the shadows, and shot out a punch at the white-haired elder.","The white-haired elder moved, and very easily grabbed onto Ling Han’s wrist, preventing him from advancing an inch further.","However, in his current state, Ling Han’s only thought was to kill. He swung his other fist at","the old man again.","The elder also reached over with his other hand and grabbed Ling Han’s wrist.","Ling Han straightened his back and launched a series of kicks.","“Hiss!” The old man was slightly shocked. This desire for battle was too strong.","However, he was really too strong. With a toss of his head, a few strands of grey hair flew out,","easily wrapping around Ling Han’s hands.","Ling Han opened his mouth, and the Heptagold Sword Qi slashed out.","“Yi?”","The old man hadn’t expected Ling Han to have such a move, but his strength was too extraordinary. With a thought, a mystical power barrier appeared in front of him, easily blocking Ling Han’s attack.","“What a good brat! You are practically a born assassin!” The old man was very impressed, “You should be Ding Yi, right? A cultivator in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier already has the power of 18 Heavens. Looking at the whole world, even an Imperial Son is no","match for you!”","“Good! Good! Good!”","Ling Han became slightly more alert, but his killing intent was still very strong. Now, under","the control of this consciousness, he was like an bloodthirsty demon god.","“Who are you?” he asked in a raspy voice."]},{"number":4059,"title":"Chapter 4059: Breaking the rules","paragraphs":["Chapter 4059: Breaking the rules","The white-haired elder smiled faintly, “I am Fu Tianyi, and I am your Teacher.”","After saying this, he released his hold on Ling Han.","Ling Han clasped his hands respectfully, “Lord Fu.”","Fu Tianyi nodded, “From this stage onwards, you would have to face me. On this level, I have the battle prowess of the early stage of the True Self Tier, which I will then increase with every consecutive level.”","Though Ling Han was freakish, it was obviously impossible for him to match a True Self Tier cultivator now.","“You are not too bad. Merely in terms of natural talent, you are not just the strongest among these seeds now, but also the strongest in all the generations of Battle God Palace!” Fu Tianyi was all smiles, “Though this is practically impossible, but if a Killing Emperor could emerge from our Battle God Palace... hahaha!”","He was filled with anticipation. Though the Battle God Palace had never lacked Saint-level elites, it had also never produced an Ancestral King. If a Assassin Emperor could emerge, then the Battle God Palace would be able to cast off their fate of being unable to see the light of day, and walk to the front lines in a dignified manner.","With their Imperial Might, who dared to oppose it?","In the future, even if they killed Emperors, the Battle God Palace would be the Imperial Clan. With the Imperial Weapon keeping watch, they would be able to stand on equal footing with any Imperial Clan.","That’s right. At present, they even dared to trifle with the Imperial Clan, but that couldn’t be seen in public at all. They were only at a mental disadvantage because no one knew where the Battle God Palace was.","Just ask the world, what force did not want to become an Imperial Clan?","Of course, becoming an Emperor was much, much too difficult. Not only was it a matter of natural talent, it also depended on luck. This thing could not be seen or touched, and completely depended on whether one had the favour of the heaven and earth.","“Very good. You have reached the seventeenth level so quickly, so you can be considered to have passed the test.” Fu Tianyi patted Ling Han’s shoulder, incredibly satisfied with him. Every level of the Blood Tower was tempering his heart. After passing through so many levels, his temperament must have been refined to an incredibly bloodthirsty state. Furthermore, he could also clearly see that Ling Han had indeed completely fallen into the path of death, and could no longer return.","“Go and rest for a while. It’s time to strike a balance between work and rest,” he said.","“Understood,” Ling Han replied with a nod. He then turned around and descended, level by level. He then exited the Blood Tower.","He had just stepped out, when he saw that there were a few people standing outside. Meanwhile, Chen Bing and Zhao Biao, who had entered earlier, were lying on the ground, moaning, but there was no sign of Zhu Yan.","“Finally, another one has come out.” Among the five people standing, one of them spotted Ling Han and said with a smile.","“Brat, come here and kneel!” another person said.","The current person in charge of Ling Han was a demon king of slaughter!","A baleful killing intent instantly appeared on Ling Han’s face, and he said, “If I don’t kneel? Would I lie on the ground like these two weaklings?”","“That’s right,” the first person said.","Xiu, Ling Han charged out, and shot out a punch.","“F***, this maniac!” That person had not thought that Ling Han would move so decisively, and hurriedly launched a counterattack.","He was a consummate level cultivator of the Core Formation Tier, and his raw power was as high as 22 Heavens, which was considerably stronger than Ling Han.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow. Ling Han was outmatched, and was immediately sent flying. However, his figure had not even landed on the ground, when he had already used the Strange Shadow Steps. His figure instantly slipped into darkness, and could not be seen clearly at all.","“Heavens!” Those who were standing all exclaimed in shock, appearing to be incredibly stunned.","They naturally knew that Ling Han had used the Strange Shadow Steps. However, this guy had only entered the Blood Tower for over a month, and he had already reached above the tenth floor? Furthermore, not only had he mastered the Strange Shadow Steps, he could even -channel them nimbly.","What kind of prodigy was this?","It should be known that they were also seeds. Thus, even though they were now fellow disciples, in truth, they were competitors that would fight to the death. In the end, only one of them would be able to survive, and become the king of assassins.","Ling Han’s comprehension ability was too terrifying, causing them to feel a strong killing intent.","“Humph, don’t think that you’re the only one who has mastered the Strange Shadow Steps!” Ling Han’s opponent humphed coldly, and he too entered into the darkness.","The two of them disappeared without a trace. Now, it was up to who would be the first to find who, and take the initiative.","No matter how one looked at it, it was Ling Han’s opponent that had a greater advantage, because his cultivation level was higher, his battle prowess was stronger, and he had also cultivated the Strange Shadow Steps for a longer time.","Peng!","Right at this moment, a figure appeared. He had been beaten out, and his feet were stumbling. Immediately after, another figure also appeared, immediately beginning the","pursuit.","F***!","Seeing this scene, everyone was dumbfounded, because the person that had been blasted out was actually not Ling Han, but rather he had caught hold of his opponent, and succeeded with","a single strike.","Heavens!","“Huai Rong is a Core Formation Tier consummate level cultivator, and he climbed to the fifteenth floor. His grasp of the Strange Shadow Steps is already close to perfection, so how could he be inferior to this rookie?”","“Ding Yi! Ding Yi! How could it be that this guy is really so terrifying?”","“Not good, Huai Rong has completely fallen into a passive position!”","“Senior Brother Zhang and the others didn’t come. They’re all only at the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier, and their battle prowess is not much different from Huai Rong. I’m afraid the result would be the same even if they came.”","These people exchanged looks, completely stupefied.","They were also seeds of the king of assassins, but had entered the Battle God Palace several hundred years earlier than Ling Han and the others. This time, when they heard that new disciples had come, they deliberately wanted to take the new disciples down a notch. Because they were competitors, there was naturally no need for them to be reserved.","And as long as no one was killed or crippled, the Battle God Palace would also turn a blind eye to this. After all, all the people who had risen above the masses were the true kings of","assassins.","They had never thought that Ling Han would be so awesome, being able to suppress Huai Rong with his cultivation level of the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier-completely unreasonable.","Ling Han’s figure appeared and disappeared. His grasp of the Strange Shadow Steps surpassed Huai Rong’s. Furthermore, he also had an eye technique that could see through falsehoods. With the two combined, Huai Rong’s Strange Shadow Steps was simply a joke in front of him. Huai Rong was completely thrashed. It was clear that he had the absolute upper hand in terms of battle prowess, yet he did not even have the chance to exchange a head-on blow with Ling Han. He only had power, yet was unable to use it, which made him extremely depressed.","At present, he could only tire himself out in parrying. If he was the slightest bit careless, he would be severely injured.","It should be known that he was a seed of the king of assassins. He was clearly one of the most skilled assassins in the world, yet now, Ling Han was ambushing him time and time again from the shadows. How could he endure this?","However, he was the one who had provoked him, so he couldn’t run. This was awkward, and","he could only be continuously attacked by Ling Han.","Everyone was speechless, and could only feel a deep sense of shock.","Peng!","Ling Han seized this opportunity to punch Huai Rong’s left leg, forcefully breaking it.","“Ah-” Huai Rong screamed, falling onto the ground, his expression extremely pained.","At present, Ling Han only had the thought of slaughter, and had absolutely no intention of stopping. He charged over again.","“You dare!” Immediately, someone was about to rush up, but was stopped by the others.","Why were they stopping him?","Just let Ling Han kill Huai Rong. Killing each other was strictly forbidden here, so if Ling Han","killed anyone, he would also be executed.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Under Ling Han’s close pursuit, Huai Rong was forced to stand on one foot, continuing to","fight fiercely with Ling Han.","However, Ling Han had the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, which could disperse power attacks,","and and he wanted to fight him head-on?","After several hundred moves, Huai Rong was killed by Ling Han."]},{"number":4060,"title":"Chapter 4060: Easily Resolved","paragraphs":["Chapter 4060: Easily Resolved","Good!","Seeing this scene, the remaining four all cheered in their hearts. In any case, they were all competitors among themselves, and now, there were two of them that would be eliminated all at once. Furthermore, one of them was a freak like Ling Han. This was really too good.","Ling Han’s killing intent was completely ignited. He looked at the four people again, his eyes cold.","“Haha, don’t look at others with such a fierce gaze.”","“Killing each other is strictly forbidden here. You have already broken the rules, and the result is... death!”","“What a pity, such a prodigy!”","The four of them shook their heads, pretending to feel pity.","Xiu, a figure flew over. It was Wan He.","“What’s going on?” His eyes swept over Huai Rong, who was lying on the ground, and he frowned.","The four of them hurriedly began to talk at once. They did not distort the truth. There was absolutely no need for that. There was only one thing that was important, and that was Ling Han had killed Huai Rong.","“Ding Yi, were you the one who killed Huai Rong?” Wan He looked at Ling Han with a baleful expression.","“That’s right.” Ling Han nodded, “I will kill whoever wants to kill me.”","That was the only explanation.","“Humph, have you forgotten that I told you that it is strictly forbidden to kill each other here?” Wan He said in disappointment, “Since you have broken the rules, don’t blame me!” He raised his hand, about to execute the rules, and kill Ling Han.","“Little Yi, what are you doing?” Fu Tianyi’s voice rang out, and a figure appeared, his white hair fluttering.","When Wan He saw this, he hurriedly bowed and said, “Greetings, Lord Fu!”","Fu Tianyi was a Sect Master, and was a major tier higher than him. In the cultivation world, if there was a gap of a level between cultivation levels, that was an insurmountable gulf.","Even if this was only a manifestation of Fu Tianyi’s spirit.","“Hoho, I am here, so what need is there for you to enforce the rules?” Fu Tianyi stated calmly, “I am completely capable of moving, and stopping their battle. Why would I not?”","‘F*ck! He’s blatantly shielding him!’","When the four seeds saw this, they all had sense of foreboding.","“But-“Wan He wanted to argue.","“There are no buts.” Fu Tianyi immediately stopped him, “Inside the Divine Palace, it is indeed forbidden to kill each other, but that is to protect those with lower cultivation level. If that was not the case, what would be called a contest?”","“However, if someone with a higher cultivation level can’t defeat someone with a lower cultivation level, what right does he have to live?”","“So, this Huai Rong sought his own death.”","Yi, there was such an explanation?","Wan He’s mouth gaped open. He wanted to say something, but in the end, he did not say anything.","You’re awesome, so whatever you say.","“Go on, rest well.” Meanwhile, Fu Tianyi waved a hand at Ling Han.","Ling Han bowed respectfully to Fu Tianyi, then left.","Looking at Ling Han’s disappearing back, everyone was extremely speechless.","After killing a seed, he could still leave without a second thought. This was the first time.","Meanwhile, Fu Tianyi was stroking his white beard, his face full of smiles.","This seed was really too much to his liking. He was resolute and decisive, and was also inconceivably strong. The chances of him becoming a Saint was as high as 99%. In fact, he even had a chance of breaking through to Emperor Tier!","-If he knew that this seed was Ling Han, whom the Battle God Palace was determined to get rid of, how would he feel?","He had barged into the Battle God Palace and killed a seed?","Haha, they would definitely be laughed to death.","Ling Han returned to his residence. His main consciousness immediately began to fully take over. However, that sliver of divine sense was naturally unwilling to die, and began a counterattack.","As expected, the gap was too wide.","This was only a sliver of divine sense, so how could it possibly rival the main consciousness?","The battle only continued for a few seconds, and Ling Han’s main consciousness returned to him.","“Now, I can be considered to have gotten over the issue of identity,” Ling Han mumbled to himself. “The inheritance of the Blood Tower is too strange, and seriously affects one’s temperament. Even if it is only a month, this sliver of divine sense that I have split out has become incredibly bloodthirsty. If it was a little longer, it is really possible that it would grow to the extent that it can contend with the main consciousness.”","“This is playing with fire and self-immolating. It’s too dangerous.”","“Now all I have to do is wait for a chance so I can leave.”","“Previously, I heard from Wan He that the seeds still have to go out on missions, which gives me a chance to escape.”","Ling Han focused his attention on his own wrist. There had once been a mark on it, and it was like a lighthouse in the darkness, guiding the Transfer Formation of the Battle God Palace. Thus, he had to erase this mark. Otherwise, no matter how far he ran, he would still be easily","captured and brought back.","“Yi, this is a one-use item!”","After Ling Han examined it for a while, he came to a conclusion.","“That’s true. After coming here, if you don’t die, you’ll become a seed. And if the seed hadn’t been successfully brainwashed, why would he be sent out on a mission? Thus, there’s no need","for this mark.”","“Of course, it’s also possible that he will be stamped with another mark when they leave.”","“I can only take things one step at a time.”","Ling Han cultivated diligently. He was a seed, which was equivalent to having status as a Dao Child. Thus, he did not lack cultivation resources at all.","Though the Battle God Palace was a force that hid in the shadows and could not see the light","of day at all, in terms of wealth, this force was really extremely wealthy. After all, killing people was a very profitable job.","Ling Han was also the most favoured seed, so an endless stream of natural treasures was sent","to Ling Han for him to cultivate.","This was really not too bad.","Even Ling Han felt an urge to stay here forever and cultivate until he became a Saint before leaving. The Battle God Palace was indeed rich and imposing.","In the blink of an eye, half a year had passed.","“Come with me,” Fu Tianyi appeared, and said to Ling Han.","Ling Han didn’t ask any questions, and simply followed after him.","They arrived at an empty space, and saw that there was actually another Fu Tianyi seated","there.","Ling Han didn’t find this strange. He knew that the seated Fu Tianyi was the real one, and the one who had come to call him should only be a spiritual body.","One after another, more and more Fu Tianyi appeared. They all had a seed with them, including Zhu Yan and Chen Bing.","“Today, I will bring everyone to carry out a mission,” Fu Tianyi said, “Hehe, don’t think that","this is a game. Everyone will be assigned a target according to their abilities, and it is guaranteed that the difficulty level would be about the same.”","“Those who fail the mission will be executed! The last person to complete the mission will be","executed!”","“Understood?”","This was brutal!","Everyone was expressionless, and merely nodded solemnly.","After such a long time, the seeds of slaughter had been planted in everyone’s hearts, and their personalities had long since been twisted.","Ling Han naturally remained calm and collected. His heart was filled with anticipation. He","could finally leave.","Fu Tianyi tore a rip into space. He was a Sect Master elite, and had already gained preliminary","grasp of the ability to tear a rip into space and teleport.","“Let’s go!” Everyone walked in, one after another. Fu Tianyi was the last to walk in. With a curl of his","large hand, he brought everyone through the Void.","He was much weaker than the Nine Mountains Venerate. He would often be affected by the chaotic flow of space, but in the end, they would still arrive safely.","Fu Tianyi tore open space again, and everyone had already appeared on a different planet."]},{"number":4061,"title":"Chapter 4061: Escape","paragraphs":["Chapter 4061: Escape","“We’ll now assign the targets of assassination,” Fu Tianyi said. With a flick of his index finger, he sent the target information into everyone’s minds, including age, cultivation level, abilities, and clan background.","Of course, appearance was important. It would appear in the form of a three-dimensional image.","“All right, let’s set out!”","One after another, spiritual bodies walked out from the main body. This was firstly, for protection, and secondly, for surveillance, to ensure that there would be no accidents.","Ling Han looked at the target of his mission. This was the Young Master of a clan. The employer was probably one of his clansmen, and one who was able to compete for the position of heir to the clan leader’s position. As long as he killed this Young Master who was first in line, those who were ranked later would naturally be able to replace him.","There was no animosity between them, so it was naturally impossible for Ling Han to kill innocent people.","But Fu Tianyi’s spiritual body was watching from the sidelines. How could it be that he could cheat?","Furthermore, the last person to complete the mission would be executed.","There was no time to waste, so he would stop here.","Though Ling Han still did not know exactly where the Battle God Palace was, and was also slightly reluctant to part with the cultivation resources inside the Battle God Palace, since he was unwilling to go against his principles and kill someone who had no animosity with him, there was only one option left for him.","Xiu, he suddenly disappeared.","Fu Tianyi was a little dumbfounded. What was going on here? In front of him, a mighty Sect Master, there was actually someone that could kidnap Ling Han?","That’s not right!","Realization immediately dawned on him. It was definitely not some inconceivably powerful person that had kidnapped Ling Han, but rather Ling Han had channeled some kind of movement technique and suddenly teleported away.","However, how could a mere Core Formation Tier cultivator teleport?","Moreover, even Venerate Tier elites needed to tear open space before they could teleport. So, what was Ling Han relying on?","Had he been teleported away by some kind of formation?","No, there was no sign that a formation had activated.","Just as Fu Tianyi was feeling puzzled, another Fu Tianyi appeared. This was his true self.","The spirit body immediately fused into the main body. In terms of ability of deduction and thought, the spirit body was naturally inferior to the main body. This was definite.","Fu Tianyi thought about this process again, and couldn’t help but raise a brow. Star Steps!","Only Formations Grandmasters could make use of ley lines and instantly flee.","This seed was actually a Formations Grandmaster?","At first, Fu Tianyi was pleasantly surprised, but immediately, he frowned again.","He clearly possessed this kind of ability, so why did he not say it out loud? Then, the level of notice that he would receive would definitely rise to another level.","Unless!","This seed had never thought of submitting to the Battle God Palace in the first place, and that was why he had concealed this ability – not good!","He immediately tore a rip into space and arrived at the Transfer Formation of this planet. Ling Han definitely wanted to flee!","However, even if he was a Formations Grandmaster, Ling Han’s cultivation level was only at the Core Formation Tier. Thus, if he wanted to leave this planet, he would need the Transfer Formation.","Thus, if he waited here, he would definitely be able to catch Ling Han.","Hehe, after capturing him, this time, he would personally brainwash Ling Han.","Strange, he had already climbed to the seventeenth floor of the Blood Tower, so why would he still think of fleeing?","He smirked coldly. With his Sect Master-level strength, Ling Han would never be able to escape.","Right at this moment, a young man walked past him.","Fu Tianyi swept his divine sense over him, and immediately withdrew it.","Ling Han broke into a smile. He had changed his appearance and soul fluctuation, and even Fu Tianyi was unable to recognize him.","He was leaving.","He entered the Transfer Formation and activated it. Weng! A white light flashed, and he instantly disappeared without a trace.","When Ling Han reappeared, he had already arrived at another planet.","He changed his appearance again, and returned to his original appearance.","Ling Han connected to the Galaxy Network and contacted the empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog, and the others.","“Ling Han!” Hu Niu and the empress both exclaimed in shock, their voices filled with extreme","concern.","“F***, you’ve finally made contact. Grandpa Dog thought you were dead.” The large black dog didn’t say anything nice, “Brat, why did you disappear as you walked? Could it be that you were seduced by some vixen?”","This was very much like the large black dog, extremely despicable.","Ling Han shook his head, saying, “I was captured by the Battle God Palace.”","Instantly, the empress, Hu Niu, and the large black dog all fell silent. Then, they became anxious, and rushed to ask Ling Han about his present situation.","Ling Han recounted his recent experiences, and only then did the empress and the others","relax.","“No wonder you immediately transformed into Ding Yi. As it turned out, you’ve already guessed it.” The large black dog breathed a sigh of relief, and said, “Brat, you suddenly disappeared, and you didn’t appear even after so long. Now, everyone’s saying that you were killed by the Battle God Palace, and they’re trying to erase you from the prodigy list.”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “All right. When I return, I will slap their faces.” “Alright, hurry up. It’s been a long time since I’ve gone with you to swindle people. Grandpa Dog is a little unused to it,” the large black dog said.","“Ling Han, Niu misses you!” Hu Niu also said.","Meanwhile, the empress was still as domineering as before. She simply said, “Hurry up and","come home!”","Ling Han nodded. He boarded the Transfer Formation and headed home.","However, he wasn’t in the North Heavenly Realm right now. Instead, he was in the West Heavenly Realm!","Was the Battle God Palace in the West Heavenly Realm?","Ling Han nodded. Though he did not know the exact location of the Battle God Palace, Fu Tianyi was only Sect Master Tier-level. After tearing a rip into space, they had not travelled for too long either. Thus, the Battle God Palace should be in the West Heavenly Realm. Putting aside the Battle God Palace for now, when his abilities improved, he would naturally be able to sweep aside all opposition in this organization.","Moreover, he had also learnt the true Nine Styles of the God of War, as well as the Strange Shadow Steps, which increased his strength slightly.","This trip was not a loss.","After travelling for a few days, Ling Han finally stopped.","Transfer Formations couldn’t be used continuously, because every time it was used, it would cause a huge burden on the body. If it was used too many times, one would die.","He found an inn to stay in. He had not had a good meal for so many days, and now that he had returned to being Ling Han, he naturally had to eat without restraint.","After eating and drinking to his heart’s content, Ling Han stayed here for a few more days, planning to set out again. However, when he was eating this last meal at the inn, he heard","some customers discussing.","They mentioned a term-Soul Nurturing Stone.","This was a type of Divine Stone that could strengthen one’s divine sense. It was greatly beneficial even for Spirit Transformation True Lords, and for the Core Formation Tier, it was also an excellent ingredient for nourishing the Celestial Core.","At present, a massive Soul Nurturing Stone had been discovered, but there were really too many forces participating in the competition. Thus, an elite had spoken, and that was for the youngsters to compete. Thus, a great number of young prodigies were presently rushing over.","Ling Han was instantly moved. Now that he had temporarily gotten rid of the Battle God Palace, he no longer had a sharp sword hanging by his neck.","He would first go and take this Soul Nurturing Stone, then return to Nine Suns Holy Land.","Ling Han listened for a while longer, and already knew clearly where this Soul Nurturing","Stone was.","Black Rock Mountain.","Let’s go.","Ling Han set out, heading towards the Black Rock Mountain. After travelling for a few hours,","he arrived at his destination.","The Black Rock Mountain was pitch-black and towered into the clouds like a sharp sword that","pierced into the clouds."]},{"number":4062,"title":"Chapter 4062: Mocking Frankly","paragraphs":["Chapter 4062: Mocking Frankly","Editor: Henyee Translations","The Black Rock Mountain belonged to the Black Rock Sect.","However, the Black Rock Sect was not very powerful, and even the strongest among them was only at the Cauldron Forging Tier. Thus, when a Soul Nurturing Stone was discovered here, the Sect Master made a prompt decision. He did not think of hiding this treasure, or selling it for a high price. Instead, he contacted a great force, wanting to offer it up as a gift.","This was a wise move. Otherwise, this kind of precious treasure would definitely cause a great massacre, causing the Black Rock Sect to disappear overnight.","However, for some reason, the information about the Soul Nurturing Stone leaked out, attracting the attention of a great many powerful forces. Just when they were about to engage in a great battle for it, a super elite passed by and stopped this battle.","Thus, under the guidance of this elite, the Black Rock Sect took out the Soul Nurturing Stone and had the young prodigies contend for it.","Promoting martial arts was the true way to go.","Thus, countless young prodigies rushed over from all corners of the West Heavenly Realm. As for the other Heavenly Realms, because they were too far away, they probably wouldn’t make it in time. Of course, if Venerate Tier elites were willing to make a move, they would still make it in time.","Now, the Black Rock Sect had opened their doors widely, and anyone could ascend the mountain. Of course, those whose abilities were too weak would not need to ascend, as they were completely unqualified to participate.","“Sir, please identify yourself.” Just as Ling Han was about to ascend the mountain, he was stopped by the two disciples on duty from the Black Rock Sect.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then said, “My name is Ling Han.”","“Ling Han?” The two of them looked at each other, both wearing blank expressions.","Ling Han’s name was already renowned throughout the entire North Heavenly Realm. However, in the West Heavenly Realm, his name was limited to the knowledge of those supreme prodigies. Ordinary people didn’t know who he was.","“What cultivation level do you have?” a disciple asked.","This question was still the most practical.","Ling Han smiled and replied, “Core Formation Tier.”","“This way please, sir.” The two disciples immediately looked reverent. Their Sect Master was only a Cauldron Forging Tier, and this was a supreme elite in their eyes.","Ling Han nodded, and walked up the mountain.","The Black Rock Mountain was extraordinarily tall, but for Ling Han, it would only need about ten minutes, and he would be able to reach the summit.","There were quite a lot of people.","Ling Han saw a few familiar faces, such as Yi Yuanrong, the number one Core Formation Tier of the West Heavenly Realm, such as Shi Yongming, the Buddha Son of the West Heavenly Realm, as well as some other prodigies that he had seen at the Donglin Imperial Clan.","In terms of specifications, the lineup of competitors this time was really strong. Those who came were all the top prodigies of the West Heavenly Realm, and even a Buddha Son like Shi Yongming had come.","However, the competition had not begun yet. Thus, since they had nothing else to do, everyone began to discuss cultivation here.","Ling Han remained calm and collected. He simply watched and listened from the sidelines, treating himself as a spectator.","“I heard that the North Heavenly Realm has produced a so-called prodigy called Ling Han or something.” Someone suddenly changed the topic to Ling Han.","Yi?","Was he getting shot while lying down?","Ling Han reflected on himself. He seemed to have been keeping a very low profile recently.","“Haha, don’t mention this person anymore.” Someone continued, “That Ling Han has already been assassinated by the Battle God Palace.”","“Really?”","“That’s for sure. Who can survive being targeted by the Battle God Palace?”","“That may not be the case. In history, there have also been people who have been placed on the must-kill list by the Battle God Palace. As a result, the more they were assassinated, the stronger they became. In the end, they became Saints, and hunted down the assassins of the Battle God Palace all over the world, forcing this organization to disappear for hundreds of thousands of years, right until this Saint died and only then did the Battle God Palace reappear in the world.”","“It’s too late to say this now. Ling Han is already dead.”","“Sigh, he’s a prodigy of his generation, after all. What a pity.”","“His reputation is overblown, isn’t it? After all, he’s from the North Heavenly Realm. How powerful can he be?”","“Haha, that’s right.”","Everyone nodded. Even if Ling Han had defeated an Imperial Son, with their long-standing perception, they still thought that the rumors were exaggerated. How could Ling Han be as strong as this?","You see, now that he had been killed by the Battle God Palace, it was clear proof of this. Unlike the elites in history, the more they were hunted, the stronger they became. In the end, they forced the Battle God Palace to cower and not dare to come out.","Ling Han couldn’t help but chuckle. He had been in the North Heavenly Realm all this while, and he hadn’t really been wreaking havoc in the West Heavenly Realm. Was it time for him to render despair on these prodigies of the West Heavenly Realm?","There was someone beside him, and he saw Ling Han smiling from the corner of his eye. He couldn’t help but look over, and was just about to question Ling Han about what he was smiling about. However, before he could speak, he was startled, feeling that Ling Han looked very familiar.","He felt like he had seen him somewhere before.","‘Oh!’","“Ling Han!” he called out in spite of himself. After all, Ling Han was quite well-known among all the top prodigies.","“What!”","Instantly, a great many people looked over, and when they saw Ling Han, their expressions immediately became colourful.","Ling Han, it was actually Ling Han!","F***, hadn’t this guy been assassinated by the Battle God Palace? Why had he suddenly appeared here?","“Ling Han? You’re that Ling Han from the North Heavenly Realm?” A young man said to Ling Han. There was a cold smirk at the corners of his lips, as if he did not take Ling Han seriously at all.","Ling Han smiled calmly, “What is it? Are you dissatisfied?”","“Haha!” The young man laughed loudly, “It is also a good thing that you did not die. After all, if you had died, I would not be able to defeat you with my own hands!”","He paused, then continued, “What prodigy from the North Heavenly Realm? In front of me, you are nothing but a stupid dog.”","“Hahaha!” Everyone from the West Heavenly Realm laughed loudly. For a long time, they felt a great sense of superiority towards the cultivators from the North Heavenly Realm.","Though Ling Han had defeated an Imperial Son, to them, it was more like a legend, exaggerated many times over.","Moreover, Ling Han had been a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator at that time, and now that he had advanced into the Core Formation Tier, his battle prowess at the same cultivation level may have declined greatly. After all, it was incredibly difficult to maintain top-notch battle prowess at every cultivation level.","Ling Han shook his head, “Fortunately, Old Black isn’t here. Otherwise, you would have had a few claw marks on your face.”","“Ling Han, come fight me!” The young man stepped into the air, his fighting spirit beginning to burn.","“Just because of the word ‘stupid dog’, I want to give you a beating!” Ling Han also stepped into the air, facing the young man directly.","“Oh, that’s right. I’m Ma Wanlong!” the young man said proudly.","Meanwhile, Ling Han shook his head, “You don’t have to tell me your name. There are too many defeated opponents. I can’t remember them at all.”","How arrogant.","The prodigies of the West Heavenly Realm looked furious. Even if the Buddhist Race was transcendent above mortal matters, Shi Yongming still humphed, filled with disgust towards Ling Han.","Because this reminded him of a person, an extremely detestable person.","Of course, he didn’t know that Ling Han and Ding Yi were actually the same person.","“You’re truly arrogant to the extreme!” Ma Wanlong charged over, his power boiling. He was truly angered now, and wanted to defeat Ling Han as quickly as possible.","His speed was extremely fast, and in just an instant, he had already arrived in front of Ling Han. He shot out a punch, which shot towards Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled and raised his fist as well, returning Ma Wanlong’s attack.","Peng!","Their fists collided, and Ma Wanlong was instantly sent flying."]},{"number":4063,"title":"Chapter 4063: Duel with the West Heavenly Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 4063: Duel with the West Heavenly Realm","Xiu, Ma Wanlong was sent flying with a single punch.","A great many people showed expressions of shock. As expected, no one’s fame was in vain. This number one prodigy of the North Heavenly Realm was really awesome. No wonder he could defeat even an Imperial Son. However, prodigies like Yi Yuanrong and Shi Yongming showed no expression of shock at all. That was because they could do the same thing, and could do so easier.","No matter what, a few years ago, Ling Han was only in the Cauldron Forging Tier. How far could he reach now?","Early stage of Core Formation Tier? Middle stage?","“Hmph, no matter how strong he is, he’s only in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier!” Yi Yuanrong walked out with a murderous expression.","For some reason, she felt an indescribable resentment when she looked at Ling Han.","It had to be said that women’s instincts were quite sharp. Even if she didn’t know that Ling Han and Ding Yi were the same person, she still subconsciously felt that Ling Han was detestable.","“Yi Yuanrong is about to make a move.”","“It can’t be, right? He just defeated Ma Wanlong, and the number one person of our West Heavenly Realm is making a move?”","“This is called a lion would fight a rabbit with its full strength. How could it be that Ling Han would have to defeat a few more of our people before we defeat him?”","“That’s true. In any case, he’s going to be defeated, so there’s no need for him to be arrogant a few times.”","Everyone nodded, thinking that Yi Yuanrong was very decisive. Otherwise, if Ling Han defeated a few more prodigies of the West Heavenly Realm, Ling Han would really have something to boast about.","Ling Han’s fighting spirit soared. In the Battle God Palace, he had obtained innumerable cultivation resources. Though only half a year had passed, with how freakish he was, he had already cultivated more than half of the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier, and now his power had reached the 19 Heavens.","This was definitely still inferior to those top-notch prodigies, especially for someone like Yi Yuanrong, the top Core Formation Tier of the West Heavenly Realm. Her power was probably at 22 Heavens, but in terms of power, there were definitely not many in the world that could suppress him in terms of power.","“Make your move,” Ling Han said calmly.","“How arrogant!” Yi Yuanrong humphed, and charged towards Ling Han.","As expected of the top Core Formation Tier of the West Heavenly Realm. She only casually sent out a palm strike, but a brilliance that filled the skies blazed, and even the sun in the skies paled in comparison.","Boom, a palm struck out, its might soaring to the heavens.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and greeted the incoming attack with a raised fist.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and Ling Han was instantly sent flying.","This was within Ling Han’s expectations. After all, there was a gap of three Heavens in power between them, so it was normal for him to be outmatched. However, he had the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, so it was completely a piece of cake for him to disperse the attack power.","In an instant, Ling Han charged back.","This caused everyone to be dumbfounded. It was clear that there was such a wide gap in power, but why was Ling Han completely unscathed after a head-on clash?","He was really a monster!","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them continued to exchange blows. At this time, it was naturally the elite in power that had the absolute upper hand, and Ling Han was continuously sent flying. However, every time he was sent flying, Ling Han would immediately charge back, as if he had an undying and indestructible body.","Even if Ling Han didn’t have the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, he would still be able to withstand this kind of bombardment.","Ling Han didn’t use the Primal Chaos Celestial Core to suppress Yi Yuanrong’s battle prowess, nor did he use the murderous aura to attack Yi Yuanrong. Nor did he summon the Earth Dragon, and merely attacked her with the traditional celestial techniques.","This was enough to make Yi Yuanrong suffer.","Her battle prowess was indeed stronger, but she was unable to take down her opponent even after a long time. Her mystical power had been expended too much, and in such a high- intensity battle, how long could she last?","Those with discerning eyes could all see clearly, and they all frowned.","If the battle continued like this, Yi Yuanrong would flourish first and rapidly decline.","Others could see clearly, and Yi Yuanrong was naturally aware as well. She gave a soft exclamation, and her attack became even fiercer.","Unfortunately, unless her battle prowess surpassed Ling Han by six Heavens, no matter what she did, she would not be able to cause the slightest bit of effect on Ling Han. It would only speed up the expenditure of her mystical power.","On the surface, Yi Yuanrong’s advantage was further increased, but in truth, she was speeding up the scales of victory to tilt towards Ling Han’s side.","After battling for over an hour, Yi Yuanrong had no choice but to withdraw from the battle.","She did not say anything, but everyone knew that she had already lost.","This dealt a serious blow to the morale of the people from the West Heavenly Realm. Even the strongest elite of the Core Formation Tier couldn’t take down Ling Han, so who else could do","anything to this guy?","“Humph, a piece of trash from the North Heavenly Realm came to our West Heavenly Realm and still dares to strut around like this?” A man whose whole body was enshrouded in black mist walked out, and his face could not be seen at all.","“Yi, who is this guy?”","Not only did Ling Han not recognize this person, but even the people from the West Heavenly Realm didn’t recognize him. They all looked at each other in confusion.","“That’s Cold Mist Holy Land’s Zhong Tian.”","“Hiss, the Cold Mist Holy Land!”","When it came to Zhong Tian, no one knew who he was, but it was a different story for the Cold Mist Holy Land. The words ‘Holy Land’ were enough to explain everything. There had once been a Saint, and he was practically standing at the pinnacle of martial arts.","Those from the Holy Lands could not be underestimated, because the Imperial Clans had not managed to produce another Ancestral King. However, the Holy Lands were different. A great many Holy Lands had produced a second Saint, or even a third. The best example was the Battle God Palace. They had never lost their inheritance from a lack of Killing Saints. However, even Yi Yuanrong was unable to defeat Ling Han, so what right did Zhong Tian have","to step out?","“Don’t blindly believe in the Galaxy Network’s ranking!” someone said. “Look at those Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters. Which one of them appeared on the Galaxy Network’s ranking? However, what about their strength?”","“However, those are Imperial Daughters and Imperial Sons!” Immediately, someone","retorted.","“Hehe, then you should also know that some Holy Lands have Saints keeping watch. In terms","of nurturing disciples, they may not be much inferior to the Imperial Clans.”","“True.”","Everyone nodded one after another, then focused their gazes on Zhong Tian. Could this guy really be even more powerful than Yi Yuanrong?","Ling Han crooked a finger at him, “Come.”","Zhong Tian sneered, “You are really arrogant!”","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Wrong, this is not called arrogance, but strength!”","“Zhong Tian, teach him a lesson!” someone shouted coldly. This was a white-haired man, but","his face was very young, forming a strong contrast.","“All right.” Zhong Tian nodded.","“Yi, who is this white-haired man?” someone beside him asked.","“Shh! This is the Great Mountain Holy Land’s Luo Mingdong, the current Dao Child!” Immediately, someone reprimanded, telling him to watch his words.","“I don’t think I’ve seen him on the Galaxy Network either?”","“Indeed.”","“From this, it can be seen that the whole world is really filled with crouching tigers and","hidden dragons. There are a great many supreme prodigies that keep too low a profile.”","Just as everyone was conversing, Zhong Tian had already risen into the skies, looking down on","Ling Han.","Boom!","When Ling Han also rose into the air, Zhong Tian suddenly delivered a palm strike.","This was not considered a sneak attack on Ling Han, because this palm strike was very casual,","and definitely would not be able to wound Ling Han.","However, there was a strong sense of disdain in this.","I, look, down, on, you!"]},{"number":4064,"title":"Chapter 4064: All Trash","paragraphs":["Chapter 4064: All Trash","Ling Han was instantly angered.","‘You want to humiliate me?’","He immediately shot out a murderous aura attack. This could ignore distance, and instantly blasted into Zhong Tian’s mind.","“Wu!” Even if Zhong Tian’s willpower was as strong as iron, he still revealed a pained expression after being struck by the murderous aura. However, he did not grab his head and moan. Merely this fact was enough to prove that he was extraordinary.","However, affected by this, the palm strike he delivered naturally slanted, and who knew where it had hit.","Seeing this scene, everyone shook their heads, feeling that Zhong Tian was too weak.","They didn’t know how terrifying the murderous aura was. They only saw that Ling Han hadn’t even launched a single attack, and Zhong Tian was already thrown into disarray. His palm strike had completely missed its target, and he even showed a pained expression. With such measly abilities, why did he still have to come out and embarrass himself?","“Damn it!” Zhong Tian had already gotten his breath back. He roared loudly, and launched a mad barrage of attacks at Ling Han.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","He was truly powerful. With a single strike, fog swirled back, like the air of Primal Chaos from when the universe was first created. It was incredibly ancient and powerful, and anyone who saw it would feel a chill in their hearts.","As it turned out, this guy’s strength was so terrifying!","“I’ve misjudged him. He’s actually this powerful!”","“Not inferior to Yi Yuanrong!”","“No, he should be stronger than Yi Yuanrong.”","“That’s right. If he was only as strong as Yi Yuanrong, then why did he step out?”","Everyone nodded one after another. Then, they all looked shocked, because this proved that Ling Han was even more terrifying.","-Just now, Zhong Tian’s palm strike had missed for no reason. It must be Ling Han’s doing. In truth, Zhong Tian’s battle prowess was indeed superior to Yi Yuanrong.","Ling Han exchanged blows with Zhong Tian. Naturally, he was the clearest about Zhong Tian’s strength. This guy’s raw power was as high as 23 Heavens, and added with the Saint Technique, his battle prowess had reached 25 Heavens!","It should be known that even the strongest cultivator of the Core Formation Tier in the entire Galaxy Network had not broken through to battle prowess of 24 Heavens!","Sure enough, the ranking of the Galaxy Network didn’t represent everything.","Zhong Tian was very aggressive, and every move was bold and powerful, wanting to crush Ling Han into dust in the most violent state.","But he also had the same problem as Yi Yuanrong, and that was his battle prowess was unable to surpass Ling Han by six Heavens.","If he didn’t break through this barrier, how could he hurt Ling Han?","However, this time, Ling Han wasn’t as patient as before. He wanted to end the battle as quickly as possible.","The Primal Chaos Celestial Core was activated. A supreme aura spread out, causing Zhong Tian’s battle prowess to drop drastically by three Heavens.","“What!” Even with Zhong Tian’s strong willpower, he couldn’t help but exclaim in shock. All of a sudden, his battle prowess was weakened by three Heavens. To him, this was an inconceivable matter, and he could not accept it at all.","Ling Han activated the God Slaying Technique and launched an attack at Zhong Tian.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and this time, Ling Han did not retreat in the slightest.","They had come to a tie.","F***!","Everyone was dumbfounded. What was going on?","“I don’t believe it!” Zhong Tian roared. He continued to launch attacks at Ling Han.","However, this did not change the reality at all.","Ling Han responded with a tit for tat exchange. Every move was a head-on clash, and he was not the slightest bit inferior.","Furthermore, Zhong Tian did not have the Primal Chaos Celestial Core that could disperse the rebound force that he had sustained. In this kind of high-intensity exchange of blows, all the blood and Qi in his body was churning, his bones were groaning, and the mist on his body had dispersed, revealing a flushed face.","This!","Everyone was speechless. Previously, it was clearly Zhong Tian that was stronger, and the previous battle had also proven that Ling Han’s battle prowess was inferior to Yi Yuanrong. It was just that his physique was too tough, and he could take all attacks head-on. Now, it was clearly Zhong Tian that was stronger, so why did it seem like he had suffered a loss instead? Peng, peng, peng! In a single breath, after several dozen moves, Zhong Tian finally could no longer bear it, and spat out a mouthful of blood.","His battle prowess was not inferior to Ling Han’s, but his physique was unable to withstand such a high-intensity clash.","Zhong Tian, defeated!","This time, everyone in the West Heavenly Realm had no choice but to accept it.","If it had to be said that Yi Yuanrong had lost, that was because Ling Han was a freak. Not only did he have endless mystical power, his physique was also unbelievably tough. It was not that Ling Han was really capable of suppressing Yi Yuanrong in terms of battle prowess. However, Zhong Tian’s loss rendered everyone speechless.","Defeated head-on, fair and square.","Seeing Ling Han’s nonchalant expression, these prodigies from the West Heavenly Realm were truly enraged. They wanted nothing more than to charge over and gang up on him. Right now, Ling Han had already defeated the prodigies from the West Heavenly Realm. Ling Han was the number one prodigy of the two generations of the Cauldron Forging Tier and the Core Formation Tier. He had practically become a nightmare to the West Heavenly Realm!","This guy couldn’t possibly continue to suppress West Heavenly Realm in the True Self Tier","and Spirit Transformation Tier, right?","He alone had suppressed a whole Heavenly Realm.","Hiss, would this guy become an Ancestral King, and suppress an era?","“Ling Han, you’ve forgotten yourself in your conceit!” His monk robes fluttered in the wind,","without the slightest bit of dust.","Buddha Son, Shi Yongming!","Seeing Shi Yongming speak up, everyone erupted in excitement.","An Imperial Son was finally going to make his move!","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “I’ve always been a modest person. I’m humble and generous, and I accept...” He was simply blowing his own trumpet.","This caused everyone to grit their teeth. They really wanted to rush up and beat him up. “You’re all alone, and you actually dare to come to the West Heavenly Realm and issue a challenge. Isn’t this called forgetting one’s own worth in his arrogance?” Shi Yongming said balefully. “Although I don’t want to pick on the weak, I can’t allow you to do as you please. Do you really think that there’s no one in the West Heavenly Realm that can stop you!” Ling Han shook his head, and said, “You’re clearly using your superior strength to bully the weak. Where do you get all these excuses from? However, it’s true that your cultivation level","is higher, but who can defeat whom? Heh, that is not certain.”","Hiss, this guy really dared to say it.","Everyone shook their heads. Ling Han was indeed extraordinary, but Shi Yongming was an","Imperial Son.","What was an Imperial Son?","Only those who were invincible among their peers would be qualified to be called Imperial","Son. Furthermore, Shi Yongming was superior to Ling Han by two minor levels of cultivation level. This was an absolutely one-sided suppression.","What chance did Ling Han have of winning?","Meanwhile, Shi Yongming raised a brow. Even if he cultivated the dharma of Buddha, which meant that he would not be moved by wordly temptations, there was still a nameless anger","surging.","“Buddha Son, don’t waste your breath on this kind of person. Just suppress him.”","“That’s right. This kind of madman has completely no idea of the immensity of heaven and","earth, and doesn’t know his own worth.”","“Beat him into submission!”","“You’re wrong, you’re wrong. Buddha Son cultivates dharma, so of course he’s using virtue to","convince others and reform them with virtue.”","“Haha, yes, yes, yes. Please expiate this freakish being, Buddha Son!”","Everyone said one after another. Though the Imperial Clan was transcendent, and did not","belong to any Heavenly Realm, the Buddhist Race was special. There were Buddha Sons and Holy Daughters in the four Heavenly Realms, and they were all competing among themselves. Thus, it was logical that Shi Yongming would be considered a part of the West Heavenly","Realm.","Shi Yongming smiled faintly, and with a step, he had already risen into the air.","Ling Han was naturally unafraid. He also rose into the air step by step, standing at the same","height as Shi Yongming.","“If you adjust your attitude now, I can also let you go,” Shi Yongming said calmly.","“All right!” Ling Han nodded.","Yi?","The people below were all stunned. Ling Han actually admitted defeat? True, Shi Yongming","had already made his move. This was a Buddha Son, invincible among his peers. How could Ling Han, who was two minor levels below him, block him?","Ling Han cracked a smile, “It is not that I look down on all of you, but everyone here is trash!”"]},{"number":4065,"title":"Chapter 4065: Fighting Buddha Son","paragraphs":["Chapter 4065: Fighting Buddha Son","The moment these words left his mouth, everyone’s mouths were twisted in anger.","Just now, who had said that this guy was a coward?","To hell with cowering!","Hehe, let him make some adjustments to his attitude. He had indeed made some adjustments, but it was not cowardice. Instead, he had become even more arrogant.","Damn it, he was really too detestable.","Even Shi Yongming’s expression darkened, “Ling Han, you are really stubborn.”","Ling Han chuckled, and said, “You people are all targeting me. One moment, you say you want to suppress me, and the next, you want to expiate me. Do I still have to be polite to you? Am I stupid, or are you people despicable?”","This enraged everyone again, and the people below all glared at him in disdain.","“Since that is the case, you should bear the consequences for what you have said!” Shi Yongming Yongming humphed coldly, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han.","The Buddha Son’s attack was completely different!","Boom!","This palm strike enlarged endlessly, and had even turned bronze in colour, as it descended down on Ling Han like a great mountain.","Ling Han could see very clearly. This palm was not formed by mystical power, but rather Shi Yongming’s own hand. Who knew what tricks he had used to actually be able to enlarge it to this extent.","Direct attacks were naturally far more powerful than long-distance attacks.","Ling Han didn’t back down. He clenched his fist and punched at the large hand.","Peng!","But this was like a mantis trying to stop a chariot. The giant bronze hand descended, and was completely unaffected. It directly swatted Ling Han down from the skies, as if it was swatting at a mosquito.","Boom, the earth shook and the mountains swayed. The whole Black Rock Mountain was trembling, as if it was about to shatter under the force of this palm strike.","“Done!”","“It’s Buddha Son that’s more awesome!”","It was only one move.","“Haha, just now, you were just blowing your own trumpet, and saying that we were all trash, but what happened?”","“Thus, one must be more modest.”","Everyone was laughing and joking, making cynical remarks. Previously, they had been mocked by Ling Han, and now, they naturally had to hit him when he was down.","Shi Yongming retracted his palm and stood up. However, he saw a figure soar into the sky, and only stopped when he reached the same height as Shi Yongming.","It was Ling Han.","There was a trace of blood at the corner of his lips. The Primal Chaos Celestial Core had not been able to completely disperse this attack from Shi Yongming. Thankfully, his physique was strong enough, so he had only bled a little, and it had not caused any internal injuries.","This Shi Yongming was really very strong. His raw power was as high as 28 Heavens, and with a casual attack, his battle prowess was as high as 29 Heavens, completely crushing Ling Han.","As expected of the Buddha Son.","Ling Han knew that he had underestimated his opponent. This was because Shi Yongming had only reached a level close to six stars in the test for the Donglin Imperial Clan. As a result, Ling Han had underestimated him. However, the Buddha Son was still the Buddha Son, after all. If he didn’t have absolute strength, how could he be qualified to sit in this position?","He needed to be more serious.","“I have to admit, the strength of your physique is truly amazing.” Shi Yongming nodded, “However, the gap in battle prowess between you and me is too wide. No matter what, you would not be able to withstand a single blow from me!”","“Haha, don’t be so sure. Otherwise, if you slap yourself in the face later, it will be very painful!” Ling Han said with a smile, and immediately charged towards Shi Yongming.","“You don’t know what’s good for you!” Shi Yongming humphed, and sent out another palm strike, which similarly turned into an azure mountain.","The barrage of murderous aura, and the Primal Chaos Celestial Core!","Ling Han used two powerful moves at the same time. The Primal Chaos Celestial Core directly decreased Shi Yongming’s battle prowess by three Heavens, and under the barrage of the murderous aura, Shi Yongming gave a muffled groan, a pained expression appearing on his face.","Boom, the palm strike that he had struck out was sent flying somewhere.","“Here it is again!”","“It was the same for Zhong Tian just now. All of a sudden, he missed.”","“That guy must have used some rare treasure. Otherwise, how could he possibly have such might?”","Everyone was in an uproar. Previously, Zhong Tian’s attack had inexplicably missed, and they already felt that something was off. However, at the time, they did not know how strong Zhong Tian was, so they did not take it to heart too much. However, the same thing had happened to even Shi Yongming, so this was not right.","Yet Ling Han took advantage of the opening to charge over. The God Slaying Technique was used, and blasted madly at Shi Yongming.","“An, Ma, Ne!” Shi Yongming shouted three consecutive words of the Six Characters Bright King Curse, and finally managed to expel the murderous aura barrage.","The Buddhist Race had always been skilled in mental control, and the Six Characters Bright King Curse was more so capable of expiating the dead and purifying the mind. Thus, this murderous aura was quickly dispersed by Shi Yongming.","“Detestable guy, you actually dare to sneak attack me!” Shi Yongming was furious. The Buddhist Race being was the true master of divine sense attacks!","He charged towards Ling Han, but even if he dispersed the barrage of murderous aura, he was still affected. On top of weakening his battle prowess by three Heavens, it was weakened","further by another three Heavens.","Boom!","In this exchange of blows, Ling Han was still slightly inferior, and was sent flying. However, the gap in battle prowess between the two sides was already within six Heavens. Ling Han’s Primal Chaos Celestial Core shook lightly, and dispersed the force that was attacking him","completely.","“Again!” Ling Han activated his Eye Technique, capturing the weak point in Shi Yongming’s attack, and then targeting it.","Peng, peng, peng! The two of them battled fiercely.","Below them, everyone was watching dumbfounded.","Ling Han was actually exchanging blows with Shi Yongming!","This was too terrifying.","It should be known that Shi Yongming was a Buddha Son, and furthermore, he had the advantage of two minor levels of cultivation. Yet, he was actually unable to suppress Ling Han. In fact, he only had a slight advantage in the situation.","This... how could they accept this?","“In comparison, we are indeed trash,” someone muttered softly.","No one refuted, and there was complete silence.","They didn’t have any confidence at all. Compared to Ling Han and his freakishness, what else","could they be but trash?","Shi Yongming instantly felt a mountain of pressure.","Although he had the upper hand, he also knew that he had the advantage in terms of cultivation level. With his status as Buddha Son, he should have been able to defeat Ling Han easily. Now, the situation was in a stalemate. With every second that passed, his face would","become hotter.","How embarrassing!","He roared furiously. Boom! A Buddha Halo formed behind his head, and his entire body also emitted endless light. It was as if he had transformed into an enlightened monk.","“The sea of suffering is boundless, turn back to shore!” he shouted. Weng, Buddhist chants reverberated, as if the heaven and earth itself was also chanting.","Ling Han instantly felt his spirit being affected. It was as if he wanted to let go of everything","in search of release.","However, his willpower was extremely firm in the first place, especially after severing the consciousness that desired slaughter once, it had increased to another level.","He immediately focused, and charged back with the murderous aura. “Wu!” Even if Shi Yongming was already on guard, he still released a muffled humph, and his","battle prowess uncontrollably dropped drastically.","Ling Han took advantage of the opening to attack aggressively, and looked like he was about","to turn around to suppress Shi Yongming.","“Golden Arhat!” Shi Yongming clasped his hands together. The Buddha Halo behind his head","released streaks of golden light, and his skin also became golden, exuding a metallic luster, as","if it had been forged from Buddha Metal.","Peng!","Ling Han exchanged a blow with him, and instantly felt a frightening destructive power","spread out from his fist.","This was not just domineering in terms of power, but was also like a supreme Divine Sword,","indestructible."]},{"number":4066,"title":"Chapter 4066: Golden Arhat","paragraphs":["Chapter 4066: Golden Arhat","This was high-level energy!","Only high-level energy would have an extremely strong restraining effect on mystical power. Even in a situation when power was inferior, it could still have the effect of defeating the strong even with weakness.","The Primal Chaos Celestial Core shook slightly, dispersing more than half of the force that was attacking. However, it seemed to be a little rushed in dispersing high-level energy, and a certain amount of impact was still inflicted on Ling Han.","Ling Han frowned upon seeing this. A bloody wound had appeared on his fist, and the high- level energy was spreading all the way to his shoulder, causing the meridians in his entire arm to be damaged.","He waved his hand. This should be a high-level energy of Metal Element. Furthermore, it could be ranked very high among high-level energy, so its destructive power was extremely shocking. Otherwise, it would not be enough to pierce through his physique, and cause damage to even his meridians.","“Hahaha!” Shi Yongming laughed loudly, “A mere cultivator from the North Heavenly Realm, how would know what true strength is!”","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He struck continuously, and golden energy surged, as if an enraged Arhat was presently subduing demons.","Ling Han shot out a murderous aura attack. However, in the state of the Golden Arhat, Shi Yongming’s mind was also incredibly sturdy. Though the small black figure was just barely able to penetrate into the mind, its own energy had already been expended, and instantly disappeared completely.","“Humph, don’t you know that Buddhist Race elites like us are most skilled in exorcism?” Shi Yongming sneered. He delivered palm strikes, heavy, vicious, fast, and incredibly fierce.","Ling Han channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique, extracting high-level energy. However, this was Wood Element, and was filled with exuberant vitality. Instantly, Ling Han’s right arm recovered.","Sure enough, even though Shi Yongming, a Buddha Son, couldn’t compare to a real Imperial Son, a Buddha Son was still a Buddha Son, after all. He was far, far superior to a prodigy like Yi Yuanrong.","It seemed like he couldn’t deal with him with ordinary means. After all, the gap in battle prowess was too wide.","Ling Han had no intention of admitting defeat. To say nothing of the fact that this was a battle of honour between two Heavenly Realms, merely for the sake of the Soul Nurturing Stone, there was no reason for him to back down.","He raised his hand, and the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning was shot out.","“Wu!” Shi Yongming gave a muffled humph, and he immediately fell into an illusion.","However, he was a Buddha Son, and was most skilled in spiritual attacks. In only an instant, he let out a loud roar and recovered. At this moment, a bolt of lightning had already arrived in front of him.","He hurriedly stretched out a hand to parry, and with a zi, lightning blazed.","This attack didn’t hurt him, but it still gave him a scare, because Ling Han’s battle prowess had inconceivably increased by another two Heavens.","What kind of monster was this?","He was clearly only in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier, but his battle prowess already surpassed the number one on the Galaxy Network. If this guy cultivated to the consummate stage of Core Formation Tier, just how powerful would he be?","A blazing killing intent rose up in his heart. This guy could not be left alive. Otherwise, he would become the greatest opponent on his own Imperial Path.","“Die!”","Boom, boom, boom! His strikes became even more rapid.","Ling Han activated Starlight Screen, and with a shake of his fists, he wrapped Destructive Energy around them.","Competing in high level energy? Who was afraid of whom?","He roared loudly and charged towards Shi Yongming.","Seeing that indescribably dark energy, an indescribable chill suddenly rose up in Shi Yongming’s heart, and he instinctively wanted to dodge. However, reason told him not to!","The mighty Buddha Son actually didn’t dare to face his opponent head-on when his cultivation level was at an advantage?","Hehe, would he still have the face to travel the world in future?","‘Fine, if you want to face me head-on, I’ll obliterate you!’","Shi Yongming was cold, and he raised the high-level energy of the Metal Element to the maximum before launching an attack at Ling Han.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and endless energy surged. Some energy soared into the sky, while energy slid towards the ground like meteors, causing the people below to panic and hurriedly dodge.","Even though this was only a shockwave, for most people, this was equivalent to a calamity, and they had to dodge it.","Prodigies like Zhong Tian and Yi Yuanrong naturally didn’t need to dodge. With a wave of their hand, they could extinguish the aftermath. They all focused their gazes on the sky; how was the battle progressing?","Ling Han only felt that terrifying Metal Element energy had come again, bringing with it an indestructible murderous aura. It easily tore through the Starlight Screen, shattering his physique, and continuing onwards, destroying his meridians.","Thankfully, it still stopped at the shoulder.","On the other side, Shi Yongming wasn’t much better off either. Under the barrage of Destructive Energy, his protective shield was like ice and snow that had encountered boiling water, immediately melting completely.","Then, the Destructive Energy invaded, and his golden body immediately dimmed.","Shi Yongming was astounded. The golden body was a kind of use of energy, allowing him to transform into the Subduing Demon Arhat. His body was as tough as Buddha Metal, and indestructible. But now? Under this mysterious energy, the golden body’s energy was devoured madly, making him actually unable to maintain the body of the Arhat.","F***, what kind of high-level energy was this?","Peng!","After a short contact, Ling Han was immediately sent flying. In terms of power, he was still far inferior to Shi Yongming.","The brilliance that filled the skies completely dispersed, and everyone could see that Ling Han and Shi Yongming were standing about three hundred meters away from each other. Ling Han’s right arm was drooping, while Shi Yongming had returned to his original appearance,","no longer the Golden Arhat.","“Shi Yongming won!”","“En, there is already no need to use his golden body. It is clear that he has won.”","“Haha, he’s a Buddha Son, after all!”","“It’s still our West Heavenly Realm that’s awesome, finally suppressing this demon!”","“Er, could it be that you guys have never thought that Ling Han is only in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier at present?”","The people below were discussing spiritedly, but one word silenced all of them.","That’s right, Ling Han was only at the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier! F***, how could there be such a freakish Core Formation Tier middle stage martial artist?","Ling Han shook his right arm, and channeled the Ten Cultivation Technique. His right arm immediately recovered, but he discovered that this process was slightly longer than the first","time.","Obviously, the recovery ability of the Ten Cultivation Technique was not omnipotent. For a short period of time, continuously healing the same body part would cause the effects to continuously decline.","Since that was the case, Ling Han once again charged towards Shi Yongming, throwing a left","punch.","Shi Yongming gritted his teeth, but still sent out his right palm to parry Ling Han’s attack. This time, only his palm was wrapped in a golden light, because he was unable to use the","Golden Arhat.","“Haha, this is the final resistance. You see, the Buddha Son is already disdainful of using the Golden Arhat. He only needs a casual palm strike to suppress him,” someone commented with","a smile. This drew the agreement of a great many people.","Boom!","Ling Han exchanged another blow with Shi Yongming. Without the support of the Golden Arhat, Shi Yongming’s battle prowess instantly dropped by a notch. Though Ling Han was once again sent flying, under the protection of the Starlight Screen, his extremely strong physique, and the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, Ling Han’s internal organs only suffered some","shocks.","On the other hand, the metallic energy on Shi Yongming’s palm was completely engulfed by the Destructive Energy, and was still spreading towards Shi Yongming’s palm, scaring him so much that he hurriedly used several secret techniques. He was flustered, and finally blasted","the Destructive Energy into oblivion. Ling Han laughed loudly, and began a powerful counterattack."]},{"number":4067,"title":"Chapter 4067: Ancient Well","paragraphs":["Chapter 4067: Ancient Well","Ling Han launched a powerful counterattack, while Shi Yongming was extremely wary of Destructive Energy. He didn’t dare to face it head-on anymore, and had no choice but to avoid a confrontation and adopt a roaming battle strategy. He endlessly launched counterattacks from the side.","This?","Why had the tables suddenly turned?","“Er... Buddha Son disdains to fight head-on with this brat from the North Heavenly Realm.” The person who had previously been flattering Shi Yongming said.","This was really forced flattery.","Only a few people nodded reluctantly, while the others remained silent.","How were they supposed to respond?","Wasn’t it clear that Shi Yongming had been beaten to the point that he was running around in circles?","Hong! Hong! Hong!","After attacking a few more times, Shi Yongming finally launched a fierce counterattack. Boom, his whole body was once again covered in a layer of gold. The Buddha Halo was flickering, as if an Arhat had descended into the world.","“Monster, take this!” Shi Yongming approached with this attack. He knew that this attack could cause serious injury to Ling Han.","-After such a long time of recovery, he had accumulated a certain amount of Metal Element energy, which could allow him a burst of power.","“Do you think I’m afraid of you?!” Ling Han threw a punch with his left hand.","Peng!","The two of them exchanged blows again. A terrifying power surged over, and Ling Han was instantly sent flying. His left arm was completely drooping. From his meridians to his bones, he had suffered a serious blow.","However, Shi Yongming wasn’t much better. His golden body flickered, and he was about to exit this state again.","“Er... the Buddha Son used his golden body again. What’s going on?” someone asked.","The person who had previously boasted stuttered, as if he was searching for words. Then, he said, “That demon stubbornly resisted, causing the Buddha Son to become impatient. That’s why he wants to settle it once and for all.”","Alright, that was fine too.","Ling Han channelled the Ten Cultivation Technique, and his left arm immediately returned to normal. He charged towards Shi Yongming and kicked out with his right leg, which was similarly entwined with Destructive Energy.","‘Come, take this!’","Shi Yongming was enraged. So be it if Ling Han attacked him left and right with his fists, but what was the meaning of kicking out with a foot?","Just how much are you looking down on me?","He forcibly extracted the Metal Element energy, stabilized his golden body, and returned Ling Han’s attack.","Peng!","After this blow, Ling Han was indeed sent flying, but Shi Yongming also exited the Golden Arhat state once more.","Ling Han laughed loudly. The Ten Cultivation Technique instantly healed his right leg, and he shot out a kick. This time, it was his left leg.","Shi Yongming shouted in anger. In his eyes, this was a great humiliation.","However, without the support of his golden body, he would be affected by the barrage of murderous aura. His battle prowess would not be able to surpass Ling Han by six Heavens, and he did not have the sharpness of Metal Element energy either, so how could he pose a threat to Ling Han?","After exchanging a few blows, Ling Han was unscathed, while Shi Yongming felt extremely troubled. The Destructive Energy posed too much of a threat to him, and he didn’t dare to face it head-on at all. He could only avoid facing it head-on, which made him both anxious and angry.","The mighty Buddha Son was actually in such a passive position when he had the advantage in cultivation level?","How could he accept this!","However, there was nothing he could do. Not only did Ling Han possess astonishing defenses, but his recovery ability was also freakish. More importantly, this guy’s attack power was incredibly terrifying. How could there be such a freak in this world?","He was still fighting now, and had not retreated because he could not bring himself to do so. How could the Buddha Son cower from battle?","“Hey, can you explain the situation now?” someone asked the person who had previously praised Shi Yongming.","“Uh!” That person opened his mouth wide, wanting to say something nice about Shi Yongming, but didn’t know where to start. In the end, he still shut his mouth.","“Hehe, the two young prodigies, please stop for a moment.” A voice rang out from below. Everyone looked over, and saw that this was an old man whose hair was slightly grey. However, his cultivation level was only at the Cauldron Forging Tier.","“I am the Sect Leader of the Black Rock Sect,” the old man introduced himself.","‘Oh!’","Hearing his words, everyone came to a sudden realization. No wonder this old geezer would appear here. As it turned out, he was the owner of this place.","“It’s about time. According to Ancient Prosperity Saint’s instructions, this old man plans to start this battle of prodigies.” The old man didn’t even announce his name. In truth, no one would care even if he did. A weakling that could only be a Cauldron Forging Tier till death, how could he possibly gain the attention of these prodigies?","However, the competition for the Soul Nurturing Stone was about to begin, and this made everyone excited. However, there was still Ling Han and Shi Yongming, two indescribably powerful guys here, which made everyone extremely discouraged.","“I have tossed the Soul Nurturing Stone into an ancient well,” the old man said, “Whoever is the first to obtain the Soul Nurturing Stone will possess the Soul Nurturing Stone.”","He paused for a moment, then continued, “However, this ancient well is very strange. None of the people who went down have come out alive, and occasionally, there would be wails of grief, which is very terrifying.”","“Thus, without enough strength, please do not risk your life.”","Hearing his words, everyone was unconcerned.","-You are only a mere Cauldron Forging Tier, so how many elites could there be in the sect?","“Where’s the ancient well?” someone asked.","“Please follow me.” The old man turned around, and began to lead the way.","Shi Yongming humphed and said, “I’ll spare you this time!” After saying this, he turned","around and left.","He knew that he couldn’t defeat Ling Han, so this was naturally the best excuse for him to","stop the battle.","Ling Han smiled faintly, but did not pursue any further. Instead, he crossed his arms behind his back, and followed the old man.","As long as he obtained the Soul Nurturing Stone, he would definitely be able to cultivate the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier to the end, and enter the third stage of the Core Formation Tier. Furthermore, his battle prowess would definitely increase greatly as well. At that time, if he battled Shi Yongming again, he would not need to exert so much effort to be able to maintain a tie. Shi Yongming would be completely thrashed.","The old man led the way ahead, and soon stopped. It was seen that there was a house not far ahead of them, but where was the ancient well?","“The ancient well is in the house ahead,” the old man said. “Because that wail was too shrill,","a house was built to prevent the sound from spreading out.”","“Everyone, let me give you a warning again. The ancient well is extremely strange and","dangerous.”","After saying this, the old man turned around and left.","No one noticed that there was a sliver of anticipation in the old man’s eyes.","This ancient well had existed for who knew how many years, and had caused a great problem","for the Black Rock Sect. Thus, an idea came to him, and he threw the Soul Nurturing Stone into the ancient well. He was going to use these prodigies to solve this problem for the Black Rock","Sect.","-What if all these prodigies failed and died?","Then there would definitely be elites that would come. Furthermore, he was only acting under the command of the Saint. Who would dare to blame him? Wasn’t that a slap to that Saint’s","face?","“Haha, everyone, I’ll take my leave first!” Someone immediately rushed out, throwing a punch. Peng, the building in front of them was blasted into pieces, and as expected, there was","an ancient well inside.","“Move aside, I’ll go first!” Immediately, someone rushed out to intercept him.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","The two of them immediately began an intense battle. The matter was very simple. Whoever","entered the ancient well first would be able to obtain the Soul Nurturing Stone first.","All of a sudden, everyone scrambled over one another."]},{"number":4068,"title":"Chapter 4068: Armored Man","paragraphs":["Chapter 4068: Armored Man","The Soul Nurturing Stone could not only help the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier to nurture the Celestial Core, it also had the effect of nurturing the soul for every cultivator at the cultivation level of the Core Formation Tier. If it was not for the fact that a Saint had spoken up and said that this great opportunity would be passed on to the youngsters, there would definitely be old monsters of the True Self Tier and Spirit Transformation Tier running","over.","Now, everyone had a chance to search for the treasure in the ancient well, so the competition was naturally intense.","Xiu, xiu, xiu, everyone leaped into the ancient well.","Ling Han, on the other hand, was not in a rush. This ancient well should be a one-way entrance. Thus, no matter who managed to snatch the Soul Nurturing Stone, he would be able to snatch it from him.","Even if Shi Yongming obtained it, Ling Han was still unafraid.","That was because when he had been fighting with Shi Yongming, he had not revealed all his trump cards.","-The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and Earth Dragon were his two biggest cards. Ling Han also leaped into the ancient well. He had only descended a few meters, when he discovered that the temperature had suddenly dropped, causing him to get goosebumps. This was not just the coldness of the body, but also a kind of terrible chill that assaulted the soul.","It was extremely strange. No wonder that old geezer from the Black Rock Sect had warned them repeatedly. It was not because the overall strength of the Black Rock Sect was too weak.","Ling Han controlled his speed, not falling too fast. On the other side, his divine sense spread out, communicating with the ley lines.","There were ley lines here, but he shockingly discovered that this ley line was actually independent, and was not connected to any other ley lines.","This was very strange.","The ley lines were equivalent to the veins of a plain. Every vein was connected, so how could there be a solitary vein?","Hence, this must be man-made.","However, who could be strong enough to change the ley lines like this?","It was either a supreme elite, at least Saint-level, or... a Saint-level Formation Master!","Ling Han could use ley lines, and this could only be considered Grandmaster-level, and in the case of Formation Saints, they could change the ley lines. In fact, they could even use the planets in the universe as their formation foundations, and lay out a supreme great formation, capable of killing Saints!","Hiss!","He inhaled sharply. Whether it was a Saint Tier elite or a Formation Saint that had participated, this was proof of the extraordinary nature of this ancient well.","Retreat now?","Ling Han quickly shook his head. This could be incredibly dangerous, but it could also be an opportunity.","Let’s take a look first.","Although there was only one ley line, Ling Han could still make use of it. At the very least, it was completely no problem for him to teleport to the ground. However, he could only appear near the Black Rock Mountain.","This well was extraordinarily deep. Ling Han had already fallen for at least five minutes, but there was no sign that he could see the bottom at all. He was still falling endlessly. Furthermore, there was a powerful gravity field in the well that was making him accelerate.","Ling Han hurriedly exerted force to resist, maintaining his original speed. Otherwise, if there was a Celestial Weapon stabbed upside down, and he crashed into it at an extremely fast speed... he might die.","After a few more minutes, Ling Han finally sensed that the ground was rapidly approaching. He hurriedly stopped in his tracks.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","However, he wasn’t the only one who landed. Many people couldn’t stop in time, and there were even some people who didn’t know that they were about to touch the ground. They instantly crashed into each other.","Blood sprayed, and it was a tragic sight.","Some people’s feet landed on the ground, and with the massive impact, the bones in their legs were all broken. This was still considered good. Some people’s heads instantly exploded, and they directly died.","If word of this got out, it would even be a little funny. A dignified elite of the Core Formation Tier actually fell to his death?","But in truth, this had happened, and it was still continuing to happen.","-This ground was really too hard.","Of course, elites like Shi Yongming and Yi Yuanrong could naturally control their bodies very well, and there was no “crash”.","It was no wonder that the members of the Black Rock Sect could only enter and not exit. Indeed, Cauldron Forging Tiers that came here would be seeking death.","But the problem was... where was the Soul Nurturing Stone?","The Black Rock Sect tossed the precious stone down. The stone didn’t have legs, so how could","it have run off on its own?","Everyone searched for a while, but did not find the Soul Nurturing Stone. Instead, they discovered a hole that led to who knew where.","This?","Could it be that there was some creature in this cave that had taken away the Soul Nurturing Stone?","“What do we do?” someone asked, appearing to have no idea what to do.","“We haven’t lost contact with the Galaxy Network yet. Contact the clan first and report the","situation!”","“That’s right!”","Everyone first connected with their clans or sects. The present situation was a little unexpected. It was very possible that there was an even greater secret hidden in the ancient","well.","Meanwhile, Ling Han strode into the cave. He was a Formations Grandmaster, and could make use of ley lines. He could fight or retreat, so he was unafraid.","Seeing that Ling Han had already set out first, the others hurriedly followed. With how tough Ling Han’s defenses were, if the Soul Nurturing Stone fell into his pocket, who would be able","to snatch it from him?","Furthermore, it was also good for this brat to walk in front, so that he could scout out the way. If there was any danger, Ling Han would naturally bear it first.","Ling Han naturally discovered the people following behind him, and guessed their thoughts. He smiled faintly. They wanted to make use of him?","As he walked, he observed everything through the ley lines.","However, the situation here was very special, as if there was an invisible force suppressing the ley lines. Thus, even if Ling Han was a Formations Grandmaster, the range of his observation was still considerably limited.","All of a sudden, he heard an ear-piercing sound. It was very much like a sharp object dragging","on the ground.","It was transmitted from ahead!","Ling Han shuddered, and immediately stopped.","Not only him, but the others also heard it. They all stopped in their tracks.","Everyone was waiting, waiting for the person or whatever it was that had made the sound to","appear.","However, that existence was advancing too slowly. Everyone waited for a long while, but they still did not see that existence appear. There was still only that sound echoing.","Ling Han took another step forwards.","Everyone exchanged looks, and hurriedly followed.","After walking for a short while, Ling Han stopped again. That was because that sound was","already very close, but because it was too dark ahead of them, only the sound could be heard, and their face could not be seen.","Xiu, someone shot out a fist of fire ahead of them. Flames burned fiercely, illuminating the","surroundings.","Yi!","At this moment, everyone could clearly see that the person who was approaching them was a man in iron armor. He held an iron spear in his right hand, and it was precisely because the tip of the spear was dragging on the ground that it released that sharp and ear-piercing sound.","There was indeed someone here!","“Hurry up and hand over the Soul Nurturing Stone!” someone shouted. He was an impatient person, and he immediately dashed forward with a saber in his hand. A brilliant light burst from his saber as he slashed at the armored person.","If the Sect Master of the Black Rock Sect had not lied, then the Soul Nurturing Stone must have","been picked up by him.","Just think, a mere Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator wouldn’t dare to disobey the Saint’s will,","right?","Now, the saber light was blazing, and everyone could naturally see clearly. When that person neared the armored man, the armored man that had been maintaining a slow pace suddenly launched a counterattack. With a wave of his right hand, the battle spear stabbed towards that","person.","Pu!","The battle spear was indestructible, easily piercing through the saber light. Then, the tip of the spear pierced into that person’s chest, nailing that person to the cave wall. That person struggled repeatedly, but the extent of his movements became smaller and smaller, and very soon, he was completely drooping, his life force completely gone. Strangely, that person’s corpse appeared to have been dead for several hundred years, and had completely turned into a dried corpse."]},{"number":4069,"title":"Chapter 4069: Yin Soul Again","paragraphs":["Chapter 4069: Yin Soul Again","Killing an enemy with a single spear strike was not an amazing feat, but with a single strike, one would be turned into a dried corpse. This was extremely bizarre.","“How dare you!” Everyone shouted loudly.","The armored man held a spear in hand, and looked coldly at everyone.","His entire body was covered in armor, and not even his eyes or hair could be seen. His figure was extremely tall, and wherever he stood, there would be an extremely strong pressure.","Just when everyone thought that he didn’t dare to take the initiative to attack, the armored man unexpectedly took a step with his right leg, and rushed towards them. His speed was astonishingly fast, and the tip of the spear stabbed towards Ling Han.","It could not be helped. He was standing at the very front.","Ling Han was naturally unafraid. As he threw a punch, the Starlight Screen wrapped around his fist and faced the battle spear head-on.","Peng!","In the exchange of blows, astonishing sparks instantly exploded from the tip of the spear, as well as high-level energy boiling.","Ling Han stumbled slightly, and couldn’t help but take a few steps back. This armored person’s power was superior to his.","“He’s nothing more than this!” Shi Yongming, Zhong Tian, and the others all thought to themselves. With this test, their wariness was halved. The strength of this armored figure lay in the battle spear in his hand. This was a strange Spirit Tool, capable of instantly absorbing all the blood essence of others.","“Hand over the Soul Nurturing Stone!” Several people rushed forwards, launching attacks at the armored man.","The armored man did not speak, and merely brandished his battle spear in a counterattack.","However, his strength was only around 24 Heavens, so he was indeed very strong. However, there were more than one or two such powerful prodigies, so how could he withstand their combined attacks? He took a few heavy blows consecutively, and even his armor caved in a few places.","Weng!","But just when everyone thought that they were going to defeat this armored man, a great many veined patterns appeared on his Battle Armor, and they were all exuding blazing light. In an instant, the battle prowess of the armored man increased greatly.","He brandished his spear, and no one dared to face it head-on. They all stepped back.","This might was too strong. Probably, only Shi Yongming’s power could suppress him. Otherwise, even Zhong Tian was no match.","Everyone was stunned. At the bottom of an ancient well, an armored figure that had randomly popped out would have battle prowess that surpassed the number one person on the Galaxy Network. This was too inconceivable.","It should be known that the Black Rock Sect was merely a small Cauldron Forging Tier force. Could it be that this was a trap that was deliberately laid out?","No, no, Ancient Prosperity Saint’s interference in this matter was known to the whole world. Who would dare make a move right in front of the eyes of a Saint?","In other words, this armored person had been hiding at the bottom of the ancient well all this while. It was only because of the Soul Nurturing Stone that he had been discovered by everyone.","Strange, why would someone with such powerful battle prowess like him hide in such a place?","Really, no matter which Holy Land he entered, this kind of battle prowess would be worthy of being taken in as a disciple, or even nurtured as a Dao Child.","“Who exactly are you?” Zhong Tian shouted loudly.","The armored man had no intention of replying, but he had indeed heard him, because the next spear strike was aimed at Zhong Tian.","Boom! The might of this strike was at least at 28 Heavens. Zhong Tian didn’t dare to face it head-on, and he could only dodge to the side.","Ling Han activated his eye technique and looked over, his expression becoming extremely solemn.","No way!","He unleashed a barrage of murderous aura attacks, but this was completely useless. The armored person was still killing in all directions, completely unaffected.","As expected.","Ling Han activated the Primal Chaos Celestial Core again, targeting the armored figure. However, this was still ineffective. The armored figure’s battle prowess wasn’t weakened in the slightest.","“I will do it!” Shi Yongming walked out. Weng, a Buddha Halo formed behind his head, his whole body exuding golden light. Then, he delivered a palm strike at the armored man.","At first, the armored man was chasing after them, but when Shi Yongming raised the golden light, he immediately turned around and stared at Shi Yongming. Although his face couldn’t be seen, everyone could feel a powerful hatred.","Xiu, the armored figure immediately moved as well, blasting towards Shi Yongming.","Peng!","In the exchange of blows, the armored man was instantly sent flying, and crashed heavily into the cave wall. However, this cave wall was really sturdy. With such a collision, there was actually no hole created. Instead, the armored man was bounced back.","Strangely, the armored man immediately stepped out again, launching a counterattack at Shi Yongming.","Ten thousand curse words instantly streaked through Shi Yongming’s mind.","Why was there another one?","First, it was Ling Han. It was clear that Ling Han’s battle prowess was weaker than him by about ten Heavens, yet he could not be killed. Even if he was injured, he could immediately recover. Now, it was the same for this armored person. It was clear that his battle prowess was far inferior to him, and he had sent him flying with a single strike, but he was actually completely unscathed.","‘Holy f*ck! Are you two family?’","Shi Yongming let out a loud roar. He naturally wouldn’t back down. He delivered palm strikes,","and golden light shot in all directions, making everyone feel refreshed.","He was indeed powerful, and the armored man was no match for him at all. However, this person seemed to be a simple-minded person. He was clearly no match for Shi Yongming, yet continued to oppose him head-on.","The armored person wasn’t Ling Han. He didn’t have the Primal Chaos Celestial Core to dissipate the power that was inflicted on him. After being struck several hundred times, peng,","his helmet was finally sent flying.","“What!”","Everyone exclaimed in shock. It was not that they had seen an incredibly ugly face, but rather that there was actually nothing behind the helmet!","That’s right, it was just a lump of empty air.","What was going on here?","Could it be that this armored person was actually extraordinarily small, and he was only as tall","as the chest-level? Was that why he couldn’t be seen?","Yet Shi Yongming’s expression changed drastically, and he exclaimed, “Yin soul!”","He originated from the Buddhist Race, so he naturally had extraordinary senses towards Yin souls. Thus, he immediately saw that this was not an encounter with a dwarf, but rather a Yin soul that was controlling this Battle Armor.","No wonder no matter how many times he attacked previously, it was useless. As it turned out, it was a Yin soul controlling it, so it naturally did not have any so-called vital points, and was","not afraid of heavy blows either.","“Yin soul!” Everyone called out as well, all extremely solemn.","They had heard a lot about Yin souls. Years ago, a connection point with the Netherworld had appeared on a certain planet, and a large number of Yin souls had appeared. As a result, even a","Saint had died.","This was too terrifying.","Thus, what if this was also a connecting point?","Only Ling Han was very calm. He had observed this place through the ley lines. Though they were not detailed enough, there was one thing that he was sure of. This was definitely not a connecting point to the Netherworld.","Shi Yongming humphed, and attacked again. This time, he used the Six Characters Bright King Curse. This had an incredibly strong restraining effect on Yin souls.","As expected, the Six Characters Bright King Curse combined with Shi Yongming’s Buddhist","Race Mystical Power finally caused the armored figure to collapse. A wisp of almost transparent black Qi floated out of the Battle Armor, then turned into nothing.","Pa, that Battle Armor immediately fell onto the ground like scrap metal.","However, no matter how hard they searched, there was no Soul Nurturing Stone.","“Is the Soul Nurturing Stone hidden even deeper by this Yin soul?”","“Or... is there more than one Yin soul here?”","Everyone frowned. If there were more yin souls here, then it really could be a connecting point","to the Netherworld."]},{"number":4070,"title":"Chapter 4070: Giant Doors","paragraphs":["Chapter 4070: Giant Doors","A great many people began to hesitate, wondering if they should continue onwards.","However, people like Shi Yongming and Zhong Tian wouldn’t give them time to think. They already started to advance.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t retreat either. Instead, he was slightly expectant. If he could enter the Netherworld again, he would have a chance to continue increasing the strength of his spirit.","They had not walked too far, when they heard the same sound again.","Sure enough, it wasn’t long before an armored figure appeared before them. This was identical to the one before.","Shi Yongming didn’t shirk his responsibilities and immediately delivered a palm strike. However, this armored person was overwhelmingly weak. With a single palm strike, it was directly destroyed. The Yin soul turned into nothing, and the Battle Armor fell onto the ground.","“It’s only at the level of the Cauldron Forging Tier,” everyone said.","As it turned out, the Yin souls here weren’t all of the Core Formation Tier.","This did not reassure them. On the contrary, they became even more worried.","The more varied the Yin soul’s abilities were, the more likely it was that this was a connecting point to the Netherworld. Otherwise, how could there be such a clear hierarchy?","“Let’s go!”","There would always be those who were courageous and strong. They were completely unafraid, and continued onwards.","As they walked, there were a great many Yin souls that were attached to the Battle Armor, and the gap in strength was very wide. The weakest was only Foundation Building Tier, while the highest could reach Core Formation Tier. So far, they had not seen a Yin soul of True Self Tier or above.","This path was really long. They had already walked for more than an hour. Even if they were on guard and did not dare to walk too fast, after such a long time, the distance they had walked should not be less than 500km.","Where did this lead to?","However, Ling Han knew that they were almost at the end. He could communicate with the ley lines, and the range of his senses far surpassed the others.","As expected, after walking for a while, they finally reached the end ahead of them. Originally, this was a tunnel. Though it was still quite spacious, it only looked like it could accommodate a single carriage, but now that they were here, it suddenly widened, and was incredibly shocking.","A massive space appeared in front of them. It was as tall as three thousand meters, and its width was also several hundred meters, and what was even more astonishing was that there were actually two tightly shut stone doors in front of them, which were the same height and width as this space.","Hiss, so grand, so majestic.","At this moment, everyone was transfixed with shock. They were so stunned that they couldn’t speak.","Ling Han was also slightly surprised, because he only knew that they had reached the end, but did not know that there was another door at the end.","What lay behind this door? Was it connected to the Netherworld?","This time, even he was completely unsure.","“Look!” Someone pointed ahead.","At the foot of the great doors, there was presently a rock that was faintly exuding light. Even if it was still very far away, everyone still felt at ease.","Soul Nurturing Stone!","Everyone could confirm that it was the Soul Nurturing Stone.","As expected, this gem had been moved here by the yin souls.","“Haha, I’m coming!” Someone immediately flew out, rushing towards the Soul Nurturing","Stone.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! With his movement, it instantly caused a considerable number of people to fly as well, rushing towards the Soul Nurturing Stone.","Meanwhile, Ling Han didn’t move. This was because he could sense danger. This caused his hair to stand on end.","Shua, a cold light flashed past, and then those who had rushed out were all cut in half, blood and internal organs flying in unison.","What!","A great many people had not managed to catch sight of that ray of light, and could only see that those people had suddenly been sliced into two. However, Ling Han could see very clearly. That was a stone statue at the foot of the giant doors had suddenly moved.","It was clearly just a stone statue, yet it was able to shoot out a fierce saber light, slicing at least ten prodigies of the Core Formation Tier into two.","What kind of abilities was this?","This shocked everyone. Those who had not reached there yet all stepped back.","Thankfully, the stone statue didn’t charge out again after completing its attack. Instead, it retreated to its original position, motionless.","“What’s going on?” Many people exclaimed in shock.","After a while, Shi Yongming said in a deep voice, “The stone statues at the entrance are guards, and it was one of them that attacked just now.”","“What?”","“We didn’t even see what kind of attack it was, and those people were already dead. How wide","is the gap in strength?”","“Hiss, even True Self Tier elites aren’t this strong, right?”","“Spiritual Transformation Tier!”","Everyone was speechless. If it was only the True Self Tier, then if they used their trump card, it was indeed impossible for them to defeat the stone statue. However, it was still possible that they could steal the Soul Nurturing Stone.","However, in the case of Spiritual Transformation Tier elites... there was absolutely no chance. No matter what trump card they used, charging forward would only result in death. Treasures were indeed good, but if one lost his life, how was he supposed to use them? “Contact the clan again. The situation here is far more important than we can imagine.” “Perhaps, there is a world-shaking treasure hidden behind these stone doors!” Many people’s hearts were stirred, and they became excited. They all opened their connection devices, wanting to communicate with their clans or sects. However, they soon discovered that this place was actually unable to connect to the Galaxy Network.","“We have to go back.”","There was nothing to hesitate about. With the Spirit Transformation Tier-level stone statues standing guard, who would be able to obtain the Soul Nurturing Stone?","Moreover, there wasn’t just one stone statue. Instead, there was a whole row of them.","Everyone turned around and walked back. Ling Han also followed the main troops, but while","he was walking, his divine sense communicated with the ley lines, channeling Earth Qi into tentacles that grabbed out at the Soul Nurturing Stone.","No one saw that the Earth Qi had already grabbed the Soul Nurturing Stone and entered into","the ley lines. Then, it instantly arrived at Ling Han’s feet.","He lowered his body slightly, and with a stretch of his hand, the Soul Nurturing Stone appeared, which he stowed into his Spatial Spirit Tool.","Success!","A smile spread across Ling Han’s face. No one knew about this.","He followed the masses, and without leaving the passage and about one third of the way, the connection to the Galaxy Network was recovered. Everyone hurriedly reported the situation. Ling Han also managed to contact the Nine Mountains Venerate, relating that there may be","something incredible hidden here.","When the Nine Mountains Venerate heard this, he told Ling Han not to move for the moment. He would immediately rush over with the Saint Tool.","He would rush over with a Saint Tool. Tsk, these words sounded very domineering.","After making the contact, everyone returned one after another.","However, when they arrived in front of those massive stone doors, they were all","dumbfounded.","Yi, where was the Soul Nurturing Stone?","It was clearly there just now. Could a dog have eaten it or something?","Everyone was about to go crazy. How could the Soul Nurturing Stone possibly disappear?","There should be no one here that could snatch it.","“Could it be that there is a True Self Tier cultivator here?” someone asked.","Unless a True Self Tier cultivator came, only then would he be qualified to obtain the Soul","Nurturing Stone and escape alive. Of course, he would definitely have to use his trump card, or he would still be insta-killed by a Spirit Transformation Tier.","Everyone looked at each other, searching through the crowd. However, there would always be people who knew each other. After eliminating them one by one, it could be confirmed that there was no one in the True Self Tier here, nor was there anyone in the Spiritual","Transformation Tier.","Then what was going on?","Ling Han merely smiled, secretly pleased."]},{"number":4071,"title":"Chapter 4071: Arrival of the Saint","paragraphs":["Chapter 4071: Arrival of the Saint","Unfortunately, there was no place for Ling Han to refine the Soul Nurturing Stone.","Sigh.","Ling Han didn’t take it to heart. Since he had already obtained it, it was equivalent to him already advanced into the late stage of the Core Formation Tier.","A few days would make no difference.","Ling Han waited quietly. Two days later, the first batch of people arrived.","This was a Sect Master elite. It wasn’t that he was more impressive than the Venerate Tiers or Saints, but rather that he was the closest, and that was why he was the first to arrive.","The moment he arrived, he immediately walked to the main doors. His eyes swept over the surroundings, and an expression of shock appeared on his face.","Ling Han knew that his shock was due to the great doors themselves.","He had not been idle these few days, and had been observing these great doors. Though they were simple, and there were no designs or patterns on them, the stone doors themselves were not ordinary. They had an indescribably ancient air to them.","However, the Sect Master glanced at them for a moment before immediately charging toward the main doors.","A stone statue revived, and moved to block the Sect Master. However, Spirit Transformation Tier-level battle prowess was completely insufficient in front of the Sect Master. That elite very easily shattered the row of stone statues.","He tried to push the stone doors open, yet no matter how red his face became, the stone doors still wouldn’t budge.","F***, this was too shocking, wasn’t it?","The Sect Master was a supreme elite, yet he was actually unable to open the doors?","That elite refused to give up, and used great power to bombard the stone doors repeatedly,","but no matter what kind of attack he launched, it was useless. These stone doors were incredibly plain, without a sliver of light flickering, yet could not be broken through no matter how hard he tried.","This was very strange, because these stone doors were clearly made of very ordinary stone, so how could they possess such a terrifying defense?","“Regulations!” that elite exclaimed in excitement. He stroked the great doors, as if he was treating a gentle lover.","Ling Han nodded internally. Only with the blessing of the Regulations of heaven and earth, could ordinary stone possess heaven-defying defense. Even a Sect Master elite would not be able to penetrate through them.","Hearing the words of this Sect Master elite, everyone rushed over. They all rubbed the stone doors, hoping to catch a sliver of Regulations.","It could be imagined that the elite that had set up these stone doors must have surpassed the level of Sect Master. Thus, if one could grasp a sliver of the Regulations of heaven and earth, they would be able to greatly increase their own strength.","Unfortunately, without reaching the True Self Tier, one would not be able to touch Regulations. No matter how talented and intelligent you were, it was useless.","After a while, more and more elites arrived.","This time, there was a Venerate Tier elite.","The Venerate Tier elite moved, but it was useless. The stone doors were still completely unharmed, and did not open a single crack.","This caused everyone to be both stunned and excited. Could it be that there was a Saint-level treasure trove sealed inside?","“It’s definitely not connected to the Netherworld. There are no records of it in history,” someone said resolutely.","This won the agreement of a great many people. They had all investigated, and there had never been any legend of a battle with yin souls on this planet. Thus, what was sealed behind these great doors was definitely not the connecting point with the Yin souls.","Originally, it would have been impossible for Saints to appear. However, this could possibly involve a Saint-level secret trove. Thus, the news spread wider and wider, and finally, a Saint replied, saying that he wanted to come and take a look.","Before the Saint arrived, the Nine Mountains Venerate arrived first.","“You’re really lucky, brat!” the Nine Mountains Venerate exclaimed ruefully. He had already contacted Ling Han on the Galaxy Network previously, and found out the reason for his “disappearance”. Ling Han was probably the only person who had managed to come back out alive after entering the Battle God Palace.","Ling Han merely chuckled, then asked, “Senior, do you know what this place is?”","The Nine Mountains Venerate stepped forwards to observe for a while, then walked back, and said, “Extraordinary, truly extraordinary!”","Why are you still keeping me in suspense at this time!","The Nine Mountains Venerate sighed with emotion before explaining, “I estimate that these stone doors were at least forged by a Saint, or even forged by an Ancestral King.”","This was actually... nonsense.","Even Venerate Tier elites like you couldn’t do anything about it. That was either the doing of a Saint or an Ancestral King. It was obvious.","Ling Han mocked internally, but also became even more expectant. What exactly was hidden behind these stone doors?","“Why don’t we use the Saint Tool to blast it?” he suggested.","The Nine Mountains Venerate rolled his eyes at him. At present, all the Venerable Tier elites had gathered here, and in fact, not long after, even the Saints would arrive. He, a Venerate Tier from the Nine Mountains Venerate, would be beaten to death if he was too high-profile. “Yi!” Ling Han looked behind him. He sensed an incredibly powerful aura.","“The Saint is here!” the Nine Mountains Venerate said softly. There was an indescribable glow on his face.","Becoming an Emperor was too difficult. Furthermore, only one would appear in each era. Thus, this was an unrealistic fantasy. Those who were knowledgeable would set their eyes on the position of Saint. Only after becoming a Saint would they think about becoming an","Emperor.","And in the whole world, just how many Saints were there?","To the Nine Mountains Venerate, becoming a Saint was now his greatest extravagant hope. He","had thought about this for too many years.","And now, seeing Saints standing in front of him, he was naturally excited.","There were a total of three people who had entered in this group.","One person was completely enshrouded in Regulations, and they could not see clearly whether they were tall or short, fat or thin, or even male or female. However, wherever he stood, it was as if he was the centre of heaven and earth, attracting everyone’s attention. Furthermore, their hearts and spirits trembled, and they wanted to kneel down in worship.","Needless to say, this was definitely a Saint.","A man and woman followed behind him. The man was very young, but also very strong, exuding a sharp aura. The woman was dressed in a white dress, and a white veil covered her face, concealing her beauty.","However, her slightly loose dress couldn’t hide her exquisite figure, instantly attracting the gazes of many young men.","“Wu!” It was only an instant, and these people were all covering their eyes and screaming in","pain.","Without a doubt, it was definitely that Saint that had moved.","No, no, no. This wasn’t called making a move. It was just a thought, and a light punishment. Otherwise, if the Saint really made a move, at least 90% of the people here would be instantly","killed.","Ling Han was also looking at the veiled woman, but he didn’t have any strange thoughts. He only felt that she looked a little familiar.","Oh, that’s right. Chi Menghan, Imperial Daughter!","That’s right. The Imperial Clan basically wouldn’t have a lapse in generations for Saints. Thus, it was reasonable that the Donglin Imperial Clan had sent a Saint.","However, this actually alerted the Imperial Clan... hiss!","“Greetings, Saint!” At this moment, everyone bowed in respect, including Venerate Tier.","The Saint from the Donglin Imperial Clan raised his hand, signaling for everyone to stand up.","However, he didn’t say a word.","He walked forwards, and began to study the two stone doors.","Chi Menghan’s eyes swept over them, and actually stopped on Ling Han.","‘F*ck! This woman didn’t recognize me, did she?’","Scary things came true. Chi Menghan actually walked over gracefully towards him.","“Hmm?” The other man was slightly surprised. He hadn’t expected Chi Menghan to do such a","thing, but he didn’t stop her. Instead, a smile tugged at the corners of his lips, and he crossed his arms over his chest as he watched.","After a few steps, Chi Menghan stopped in front of Ling Han."]},{"number":4072,"title":"Chapter 4072: Might of the Imperial Weapon","paragraphs":["Chapter 4072: Might of the Imperial Weapon","Ling Han remained calm and collected. Right now, he was Ling Han, not Ding Yi. Thus, he naturally wouldn’t recognize this Imperial Daughter.","Chi Menghan didn’t speak either. She simply continued to stare at Ling Han.","Ling Han sighed, “I have sinned!”","What crime have you committed?","The Nine Mountains Venerate glanced over in surprise. How could it be that Ling Han had come into contact with this woman from the Donglin Imperial Clan? He naturally knew that Ling Han had gone to the Donglin Imperial Clan under an alias, but how could he have left behind evidence that would lead back to him?","Ling Han continued, “It’s all my fault. I’m too handsome, and everyone loves me!”","F***.","The Nine Mountains Venerate almost spluttered in shock. This brat was truly outrageously bold. He even dared to tease a member of the Imperial Clan.","Chi Menghan was also astonished. She hadn’t imagined that Ling Han would actually say something so narcissistic. She simply nodded slightly before turning around to leave. She didn’t say a single word throughout the entire process.","Had this woman really seen through to his true identity?","Ling Han thought internally. If she didn’t, then it would be too baffling for her to walk straight over like this, but if she had seen through him, why didn’t she say anything?","“Hiss, could it be that this is really the doing of the Ancestral King?” The Nine Mountains Venerate inhaled sharply, and looked ahead.","After such a long time, the Saint from the Donglin Imperial Clan was still rubbing the main doors. He actually hadn’t opened the doors yet.","That was a Saint!","To be able to stop a Saint in their tracks, what else could it be but the means of a Great Emperor?","“Haha, Old Geezer Chi, you’re here so early!” Amidst a loud laugh, a figure suddenly appeared.","This was a white-haired old man, but his spirit was hale and hearty. Regulations would appear and disappear on his body, and there was also the phenomenon of stars shattering in his eyes, which was boundlessly terrifying.","“Greetings, Saint!” At this moment, the Venerate Tier elites led the others again, paying their respects to the white-haired elder.","This was another Saint!","This was extremely astounding. Originally, it would have been extremely difficult to even meet one Saint. Now, however, two Saints had suddenly popped up.","The first Saint turned around, glanced at the white-haired Saint, and said, “Liu Fang, hurry up and come over to help!”","“Yi, there’s something that you, Old Geezer Chi, can’t settle?” The white-haired Saint exclaimed in surprise. However, he did not hesitate, and immediately walked forwards. The conversation between the two of them instantly caused the others to explode.","“Liu Fang... That’s the Shattering Stars Saint!”","“Old Geezer Chi, Old Geezer Chi, hiss, Dong Lin Imperial Clan’s Crystal Saint, Chi Feihong!” “Heavens!”","Everyone had pieced together the identities of these two Saints, and they all exclaimed in shock. These were mighty figures that could not possibly be seen under normal circumstances.","The two Saints were studying the stone doors, while the others didn’t even dare to breathe too loudly. In front of a Saint, even Venerate Tier elites were ants. The gap between them was like a gulf between heaven and earth.","However, what was even more astonishing was the fact that even though the two Saints had joined forces, they were still unable to open the stone doors for a long time.","This caused more and more people to believe that this was definitely the doing of the Ancestral King.","The moment they thought that the inheritance of an Ancestral King might be hidden here, everyone’s blood boiled, and they were incredibly excited.","This was a Great Emperor Tier-level treasure. As long as one could obtain even one, they would be able to stand firmly in the universe, and if one could obtain the Imperial Weapon, that would directly become the strongest force in the universe, and join the ranks of the Imperial Clans.","Not long after, a third Saint arrived.","Ancient Prosperity Saint, who was also the elite that had started the prodigy battle this time round, had never imagined that he would actually discover the tomb of what he suspected to be a Great Emperor because of a mere thought.","The three Saints joined forces, and finally opened the stone doors.","They had not deciphered it, but rather the three Saints had all returned to the Imperial Clans respectively, and used the Imperial Weapons to work together to blast open the stone doors.","Ling Han finally witnessed the might of the Imperial Weapon. That scene of its might was really too terrifying. With a light strike, even planets would not be able to withstand it, and would directly shatter.","The Chi Clan’s Imperial Weapon was a flag, and with a wave, it shot out endless swords of ice that could easily kill even Saints. The Shattering Stars Saint came from the Seven Luminaries Imperial Clan, and the Imperial Weapon he summoned was a golden bell. With a shake, a golden dragon appeared, as if it was a True Dragon!","Meanwhile, Ancient Prosperity Saint had come from the Ten Thousand Thunder Imperial Clan. The Imperial Weapon in his hand was a saber, and as it slashed out, lightning flashed.","The three Imperial Weapons didn’t need to be activated by the Saints at all. When they were close enough to each other, they would automatically awaken and float above the heads of the three Saints. An aura of eternal destruction circulated around them, and it was as if three","living Great Emperors had walked out.","Instantly, everyone knelt down, incredibly respectful.","Previously, even if a Saint had arrived, everyone could still suppress the reverence in their hearts, and would not bow down at all. But now, with the might of the Imperial Weapon, even Venerate Tier elites could not help but bow down, completely unable to resist this kind of","intimidating pressure.","The Imperial Weapon awakened, and it was as if the Great Emperor himself had arrived!","There was only one exception, and that was Ling Han.","The Celestial Foundation he cultivated was a replica of the Primitive Celestial Gate, which allowed him to be unafraid of any kind of intimidation. He was unafraid of even Great","Emperors.","Everyone bowed. Ling Han was an exception and this made him the focus of everyone’s","attention.","This young man was far too astonishing. He had actually withstood Imperial Might!","In truth, Ling Han had initially wanted to keep a low profile. After all, only if he kept a low profile would he be able to screw others over and trick them. Everyone knew that he was very awesome, so he wouldn’t be able to do things like lying and making bets.","The problem was that the moment the three Imperial Weapons appeared, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower in his mind seemed to be affected as well. It was moving around, as if it was about to jump out and compete with the other three Imperial Weapons.","In terms of quality, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was not the slightest bit inferior to the Imperial Weapon. In fact, because it was formed from two types of utmost grade materials, it was even slightly superior. However, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was not the real Imperial Weapon, after all, and had not been refined by an Ancestral King. If it really clashed with the Imperial Weapon, it would definitely lose. Thus, Ling Han forcefully controlled the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, not allowing it to come out and compete with the other Imperial Weapons. Otherwise, it would be exposed that he possessed the embryonic form of an Imperial Weapon. In fact, it would even draw the attention of the Imperial Clans to attack him.","Even the three Saints glanced at Ling Han in surprise. However, they didn’t want to waste their time on a measly Core Formation Tier cultivator at this moment. They immediately controlled their Imperial Weapon to attack the stone doors.","Peng, the ice swords, fire dragon, and sea of lightning blasted out, and the two stone doors immediately crumbled, completely incapable of standing against these attacks.","The great doors had finally opened.","However, the Imperial Weapons were still floating there, and there were still three Saints","standing. Who would dare to snatch the opportunity to enter now? Thus, everyone was watching from the surroundings, all of them stretching out their necks.","Ling Han was also watching, and saw that there was a blood-coloured world behind the great doors. The ground was blood-coloured, and even the skies were enshrouded by a blood-","coloured mist.","Could there be... a rare treasure of a Great Emperor hidden inside?","“Let’s go!” Ancient Prosperity Saint said. The Ten Thousand Thunder Saber hovered above his head, spitting out supreme lightning and intertwining with the Regulations of heaven and earth. It was untouchable, and even if a Great Emperor came, the Imperial Weapon would still be able to go a few rounds with him.","Moreover, in this era, there was no monarch tier in the world.","The Shattering Stars Saint and the Crystal Saint both nodded in agreement. The three Saints","then set off at the same time, stepping through the large doors and entering the blood-red","world."]},{"number":4073,"title":"Chapter 4073: Blood Palace","paragraphs":["Chapter 4073: Blood Palace","With the three Saints leading the way, what did the others have to fear?","Everyone followed behind them.","A few youngsters caught up with them. They were the clansmen of the Donglin Imperial Clan, the Seven Luminaries Imperial Clan and the Ten Thousand Thunder Imperial Clan respectively. Naturally, they followed closely behind their respective Saints.","Meanwhile, Ling Han stayed by the Nine Mountains Venerate’s side. This Venerate Tier elite also had a deadly weapon, and as long as it wasn’t Emperor-level power, he could withstand it.","Because they all came from the Imperial Clans, the few young people in front naturally came together, and as the only woman, Chi Menghan was naturally surrounded by men. Though her appearance was not obvious, her exquisite beauty had long since been circulated on the Galaxy Network. Being able to be called the third most exquisite beauty in the galaxy, what need was there for doubt?","The Imperial Daughter was both graceful and exquisite. This kind of identity naturally caused the males from the other Imperial Clans to scramble madly for her.","However, Chi Menghan only responded calmly, neither too distant nor too cordial to everyone, appearing both polite and aloof.","Ling Han glanced at her for a moment before withdrawing his gaze. This had nothing to do with him, and he didn’t care about any Imperial Son or Imperial Daughter.","“What is it? Do you like her?” The Nine Mountains Venerate communicated through divine","sense.","‘Pfft, what’s wrong with your eyes?’","Ling Han laughed loudly, “A wise and mighty person like me can only be the target of crushes from others.”","This time, it was the Nine Mountains Venerate who couldn’t bear it any longer. He felt that this disciple of his was truly shameless.","“Yi, the fog here is really thick!” Ling Han said. His divine sense could not extend out at all in this place.","The Nine Mountains Venerate nodded, “Indeed.” To say nothing of Ling Han, even his divine sense could not extend very far.","Ling Han attempted to communicate with the ley lines, but he shockingly discovered that the ley lines here had been suppressed.","F***, even ley lines could be suppressed?","Ling Han did not doubt in the slightest that this must be a technique of the Ancestral King, because even a Saint Master could only change the ley lines, but could not suppress the ley lines.","Then was this the temporary residence of a Great Emperor, or... a tomb?","If it was the latter, hehe, they had barged into the tomb of the Great Emperor, so how could they leave alive?","Ling Han naturally thought of Buddha Doga. This was only a Pseudo-Emperor, and he had practically conquered all the Saints in the world. What if it was a real Great Emperor?","Fortunately, the Saints had brought three Imperial Weapons with them this time, so they should be able to block that.","As they walked, a palace appeared ahead of them. It matched this place very well. The walls were also blood red, exuding a harsh smell.","“Come, let’s go in and take a look.”","The three Saints were the first to enter. With the Imperial Weapon in hand, they were naturally unafraid.","After entering the palace, Ling Han saw that there were twelve massive pillars supporting this blood-red palace, and the pillars were engraved with incredibly complex veined patterns. Ling Han felt like he was about to pass out with a single glance.","This veined pattern was filled with attraction, yet it was also incredibly complex, and could not be analyzed. It was extremely exhausting, and could exhaust one’s spirit in an instant, which was why one would feel the discomfort of passing out.","Ling Han hurriedly composed himself, not daring to look any further. However, when he looked around, there were already people collapsed all over the ground, and elites such as the Nine Mountains Venerate, Ancient Prosperity Saint and other elites were all staring fixedly at those veined patterns.","“Senior, Senior!” Ling Han called out.","After calling out a few times, the Nine Mountains Venerate finally came back to his senses. He took a deep breath, and said, “These veined patterns represent supreme true meaning. They’re precious treasures among precious treasures. Unfortunately, you don’t cultivate the Regulations now, so this is detrimental to you.”","“You go out first. I want to comprehend Dao properly here. Who knows, I may be able to advance to another level.”","Ling Han nodded, “All right.”","He turned around and walked out. There were still many other young people who had come out with him, such as... Chi Menghan.","These people were all prodigies among prodigies. They weren’t immersed in the Regulations that they couldn’t touch at this moment, nor were they completely drained of their spiritual power, and directly passed out on the ground.","“There were so many people just now, and now there are only forty or so of us left.”","“Let’s set out together!”","It was unknown how many of them were Imperial Sons.","“Sure.”","Everyone continued forward, and soon, they heard the sound of waves.","Yi, there was actually a great ocean here?","Everyone felt that this was inconceivable. That was because this planet was not all that big, and they were further underground now. Where would they get such a large space to","accommodate a great ocean?","They continued onwards, and saw that a great ocean had indeed appeared ahead of them. There were huge waves rolling around, creating a very loud sound.","“Do we cross the sea?” someone asked.","“Let’s not cross the sea first. After all, we don’t know what dangers lie in the sea. We’ll wait","until the three Saints come out.”","“That’s right. Let’s walk around in the vicinity first.”","Everyone reached a concensus, and began to search the surroundings. Whether there were any clues or not, they could at least deduce that this was the doing of an Ancestral King.","“Yi!” Someone cried out, “Something’s going on!”","Everyone looked over, and saw that not too far away, there were three ghostly shadows floating on the ground, and behind them was a blood-coloured stone.","“That’s a Dao Stone,” someone immediately said.","Immediately, a great many people lost interest. This was a Dao Stone. Though it was the universal currency of the universe, it was naturally not the slightest bit precious to them.","Chi Menghan stared at it for a while, then said, “This isn’t an ordinary Dao Stone. It was personally refined by a Great Emperor.”","She was an Imperial Daughter, so her words naturally carried a lot of weight.","“What’s the difference?” someone asked.","An heir of the Ten Thousand Thunder Imperial Clan took over the conversation, and said,","“The Dao Stone that the Great Emperor has refined naturally contains a sliver of the Regulations that the Great Emperor has grasped. For Saints, it is also a rare precious","treasure!”","It was clear that he had the intention to show off in front of Chi Menghan, and that was why he was fighting to answer. After he finished speaking, he deliberately cast a look at Chi Menghan.","Everyone was slightly excited. This was a treasure that even Saints would be tempted by. How many cultivation resources could it be exchanged for?","“Subduing demons and eliminating demons is the duty of our Buddhist Race, so I’ll help everyone!” Shi Yongming was the first to charge out.","He was about to advance into the True Self Tier, and just happened to need this kind of treasure, which could allow him to advance faster, and increase his battle prowess.","“Buddha Son, let me help you!” Another person rushed to make a move.","Even the Imperial Clans would be tempted by this kind of treasure. After all, after the Ancestral King died, the number of this kind of Dao Stone would decrease with each use. Instantly, there were a dozen over people fighting over it as they charged forwards.","At first, the three ghostly shadows were only floating quietly, but when they neared, they immediately launched an attack. With a sharp cry, it pierced directly into everyone’s minds, as if they were about to be directly pierced through.","“Demons and monsters, retreat or disperse!” Shi Yongming shouted loudly. He was a Buddha","Son, and was specialized in suppressing Yin souls.","Peng!","A yin soul attacked. Its arm was clearly only two feet long, but as it struck, it extended","endlessly, landing heavily on Shi Yongming’s chest, sending him flying.","So strong, this was a True Self Tier Yin soul."]},{"number":4074,"title":"Chapter 4074: An Imperial Dao Stone","paragraphs":["Chapter 4074: An Imperial Dao Stone","True Self Tier!","Even if these people were all prodigies of the present generation, and even if there was no shortage of heirs of the Imperial Clans, there was still a gap of a major tier between their cultivation levels, so everyone frowned.","Even for them, against a Yin soul of this level, it was still possible that they would be killed.","The main reason was because Yin souls were too unique. They did not have a physical body, and were not injured by mystical power. They could only be attacked through high-level energy. This would undoubtedly erase a lot of their advantage, and make it so that they were not much stronger than ordinary prodigies.","The heirs of the Imperial Clans all carefully charged forwards to battle, but very soon, they all retreated, their expressions filled with fear.","The Yin soul was too terrifying, wanting to invade their minds and seize their bodies.","There was a gap between their cultivation levels, especially in terms of the strength of their souls. They indeed couldn’t withstand it.","What could they do? That was an Imperial Dao Stone!","“Blood-Patterned Dao Stone, this is a Blood-Patterned Dao Stone, one of the highest grade Dao Stones!” Someone’s eyes lit up, wanting nothing more than to rush forwards to snatch it, yet forcibly stopped himself.","Of course, the Dao Stone that the Great Emperor had refined was naturally top-notch.","Everyone knew how precious this stone was, but with three True Self Tier Yin souls keeping watch, how could they take it?","Could it be that they had to wait for those higher ups to come out of the blood-coloured palace?","However, in this way, this Blood-Patterned Dao Stone would be theirs. This was an Imperial Dao Stone, and even Saints would be tempted.","Everyone was scratching their heads. All of them were anxious, not wanting to give up, but also feeling helpless.","“Brother Ling, aren’t you going to give it a try?” Chi Menghan suddenly said to Ling Han. Yi, what do you mean?","“Haha!” Before Ling Han could even answer, someone laughed loudly, and said, “Him? He’s merely in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier, so Fairy Chi’s expectations of him are a bit too high, aren’t they?”","Ling Han looked at that person and said, “What business is it of yours whether I can or not?” If you want to mock me, then why should I be reserved?","A furious expression instantly appeared on that person’s face, “What an arrogant lowly commoner, you actually dare to be rude to the Imperial Clan!”","His name was Liu Yiming, and he was a member of the Seven Luminaries Imperial Clan. Although he wasn’t the Imperial Son, his status wasn’t low either. He could just barely be considered a reserve Imperial Son, or Pseudo-Imperial Son and so on. His natural talent and aptitude weren’t inferior either.","Just how high and noble was the Imperial Clan? To say nothing of the Imperial Son, even if it was only a Pseudo-Imperial Son, they would still be very arrogant as they travelled the world. Just from the fact that he directly called Ling Han a lowly commoner, it was clear how high an opinion of himself he had.","He was extremely interested in Chi Menghan, and he continued to curry Chi Menghan’s favor along the way, looking for all kinds of topics to talk about. However, Chi Menghan was cold and cheerless. He was clearly very polite, yet she still kept him at a distance.","So be it if this was all. Now that Chi Menghan had taken the initiative to speak to Ling Han, he couldn’t tolerate it any longer.","What right did he have?","‘I come from the Imperial Clan, yet I’m actually no match for a lowly commoner like you?’ -In the eyes of the Imperial Clans, even if they had come from a Holy Land, they were still lowly commoners. If they wanted to take them seriously, they would have to be at least Sect Master-level, and Venerate Tiers could be treated with respect, and in the case of Saints, even the Imperial Clans would view them as esteemed guests.","But Ling Han? He was nothing.","Ling Han ignored him completely. Instead, he looked at Chi Menghan, and asked, “Fairy Chi, why do you think I can do it?”","“How would you know if you don’t try?” Chi Menghan asked calmly.","Seeing that Ling Han was ignoring him completely, Liu Yiming was naturally even more furious. He glared fiercely at Ling Han, but when he thought that he couldn’t lose his demeanor in front of Chi Menghan, he forcefully suppressed his anger, and said in a disdainful tone, “I’ll make a bet with you. You definitely won’t succeed!”","Everyone was watching the excitement from the sidelines. They had nothing to do anyway, so they were not in a rush at all.","Bet?","Ling Han immediately came to his senses, and asked, “All right, what do we bet?”","Liu Yiming was startled. He said it was a bet, but in truth, he was only emphasizing it. He did not really want to make a bet with Ling Han. He scoffed, “A mere lowly commoner, you think you are worthy of making a bet with me?”","Ling Han was angered. This guy kept calling him a lowly commoner, which made him extremely displeased.","He took out ten Great Herbs and asked, “Can’t afford the stakes?”","Previously, he and the large black dog had worked together to trick people, and obtained a considerable number of Great Herbs. Naturally, they could not possibly consume all of them, and there were some left behind.","Ten Great Herbs were laid out, all of them exuding a soft lustre, causing one to feel intoxicated with a single sniff, which was incredibly comfortable.","Even Liu Yiming was startled. He had not thought that Ling Han would be so rich and","imposing.","However, wasn’t this just delivering money to him?","You, a cultivator in the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier, want to snatch the Blood- Patterned Dao Stone from the hands of three True Self Tier Yin souls? Hehe, isn’t that just a","fantasy?","He was definitely going to win.","“All right!” He also touched his Spatial Spirit Tool, but immediately looked awkward, because he only took out two Great Herbs, Great Herb.","As a dignified Pseudo-Imperial Son, his wealth was actually inferior to a lowly commoner. This made Liu Yiming feel incredibly awkward.","He immediately used his divine sense to transmit a message to the other Imperial Clan elites, asking them to lend him some treasures, and promised that he would repay them with double","the amount.","Those members of Imperial Clans were all tempted, because no matter how they looked at it, Ling Han was definitely going to lose, so they could take this chance to earn some profit.","Thus, Liu Yiming soon gathered ten Great Herbs.","“Fairy Chi, come and act as notary, and safeguard the stakes.” Ling Han turned around, and handed the ten Great Herbs over to Chi Menghan.","“All right.” Chi Menghan nodded.","Liu Yiming naturally believed Chi Menghan’s character as well. She was an Imperial Daughter,","so how could she possibly embezzle money in public?","Thus, the 20 Great Herbs all fell into Chi Menghan’s hands.","“Peasant, begin!” Liu Yiming said coldly, “I advise you to take a few more breaths, because it","is very possible that you will die immediately.”","Ling Han didn’t say anything. Later, he would let him know what it meant to be slapped in the","face.","Shi Yongming was also filled with anticipation. He couldn’t defeat Ling Han, yet he also hated Ling Han to the core. This was an extremely good opportunity. If Ling Han’s mind was invaded by the Yin soul, then this heaven-defying freak would disappear forever.","Die, die quickly.","“What is it, lowly commoner? Afraid now?” Seeing that Ling Han had not walked forwards for","a long time, Liu Yiming began to mock him.","Ling Han turned around and said, “Let’s make another bet. If I win, you’ll kneel on the ground and slap yourself three times, saying that your mouth stinks like a cesspit.”","Liu Yiming flew into a thunderous rage. How dare this lowly commoner! “Fine, I’ll oblige you!” he said balefully. “If you’re lucky enough not to die, I’ll personally","tear you into pieces!”","Ling Han laughed loudly, and strode forwards, greeting those three Yin souls.","In this place, the yin souls’ behavior was very strange. The yin souls that he had previously","seen actually possessed Battle Armor, and these three yin souls seemed to be guarding the Blood Patterned Dao Stone. It could be said to be completely different from the yin souls that","he had learned about.","What was so strange about this?","As he thought, he was also getting very close to those three Yin souls. Instantly, the three yin souls all released sharp cries, which then blasted towards Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He had even killed Spiritual Transformation Tier Yin souls in the Netherworld, okay? In terms of soul strength, what did he need to be afraid of?","A divine sense-level screech assaulted him, yet Ling Han was completely unmoved. His divine","sense was as sturdy as metal.","Hehe, you guys are still a little lacking.","Ling Han’s fists shook, and the Destructive Energy wrapped around him."]},{"number":4075,"title":"Chapter 4075: Betrothal Gift","paragraphs":["Chapter 4075: Betrothal Gift","The moment the Destructive Energy appeared, the three Yin souls all looked like they were shrinking back.","They were clearly Yin souls, yet they actually had such a human-like expression. This was really enough to make people click their tongues in amazement.","Boom!","Ling Han brandished Destructive Energy, and as he shot out a punch, fist light was shot out, mixed with Destructive Energy. This was the strongest weapon against Yin souls, and could even allow him to battle surpassing his cultivation level.","Otherwise, how could he kill a Spirit Transformation Tier Yin soul?","Logically speaking, since the three Yin souls were so afraid of the Destructive Energy, why didn’t they run?","Indeed, they kept retreating, but it was only limited to the vicinity of the Blood-Patterned Dao Stone. There seemed to be some kind of power, or even Regulations, that restricted them from leaving.","Under such circumstances, how could they possibly escape from Ling Han’s attack?","In just a few hundred punches, the three Yin souls were all killed by Ling Han. Then, he easily picked up the Blood-Patterned Dao Stone.","This caused everyone to be dumbfounded with shock. Who would have thought that not only had Ling Han obtained the Blood Patterned Dao Stone, he had even killed the three Yin souls.","Shua, everyone’s eyes turned towards Shi Yongming.","‘Aren’t you the Buddha Son?’","Dealing with Yin souls isn’t your forte?","But why was it that you were sent flying with a single strike, yet Ling Han easily killed three True Self Tier Yin souls?","Shi Yongming was naturally speechless. F***, how did he know?","The Buddhist Race was indeed skilled in exorcising Yin souls, but that was only limited to those at the same cultivation level!","Ling Han strode over to Chi Menghan, stretched out his hand, and said, “I’ll have to trouble Fairy Chi.”","Chi Menghuan handed over16 Great Herbs to Ling Han.","‘Huh? What’s the meaning of this? Are you trying to pluck my profits?’","“Celestial maiden Chi, there are still four missing,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Chi Menghan sent a message through divine sense, saying, “I’ll only say one name. Ding Yi.”","F***, this woman had indeed guessed correctly.","Ling Han still wanted to struggle for a while. After all, those were four Great Herbs! “Fairy Chi, I don’t know what you’re talking about.”","“As long as you cultivate the Heavenly Brilliance Technique, I’ll be able to sense it,” Chi Menghan said calmly. “Now, do you understand?”","Ling Han was rendered speechless. At first, he had thought that Chi Menghan was only speaking out of a woman’s intuition. He could still spout some nonsense about this, but with the Heavenly Brilliance Technique, there was no way he could deny it.","Depressing, this was really depressing.","“All right. Since Fairy Chi is willing to marry to a lower station, then the four Great Herbs will be the betrothal gift,” Ling Han suddenly said loudly.","Yi?","As soon as these words fell, everyone in the area was stunned. Even Chi Menghan hadn’t expected this. She couldn’t help but blush, but her face was hidden by a white veil. This was a top-grade treasure, and even Saints might not be able to see through it.","This guy was really shooting his mouth off.","Yet Ling Han bore the philosophy of the large black dog, and that was he definitely could not lose out!","‘You scammed four of my Great Herbs, so I’ll scam even you. This way, you’ll be mine, and the Great Herbs will still be mine.’","“Ling Han!” Liu Yiming shouted furiously. This guy actually dared to tease his goddess? ‘You’re seeking death!’","Ling Han gave an ‘oh’, and turned around, “I almost forgot. You still owe me a wager.” Hearing the matter of the wager, not only did Liu Yiming’s expression change drastically, even the expressions of the others did not look too good. At first, they had thought that they could easily make a profit, but they had not thought that Ling Han would actually win. However, it was fine. They had only lent the Great Herbs to Liu Yiming. Whetherhe won or lost, they only had to ask Liu Yiming for repayment.","As a member of the Imperial Clan, how could he renege on his promise?","“Impudence! You actually dare to humiliate the Imperial Clan? You’re seeking death!” Liu Yiming said with a humph. He immediately charged toward Ling Han.","That’s right. Ling Han was very awesome against Yin souls. He could even kill a Yin soul that was superior to his cultivation level by a whole major tier. However, he was not a Yin soul!","Boom, he delivered a palm strike, and seven streaks of light bloomed behind him, boosting his power, becoming even more terrifying.","However, this attack hadn’t reached its target yet, when Chi Menghan stepped out bravely, raised a hand to block, and said, “Brother Liu, you have to accept your loss. Don’t lose your demeanor!”","Demeanor?","You want me to kneel on the ground, slap myself three times, and say that my mouth stinks like a cesspit?","‘Sorry, I don’t have that kind of demeanor.’","As Liu Yiming attacked, he said, “Fairy Chi, please move aside. Don’t protect this lowly commoner!”","Chi Menghan didn’t reply. Instead, she simply sent out a casual palm strike. Her slender hand flipped over slightly, and it was indescribably beautiful. However, its might was incredibly powerful, and it easily suppressed Liu Yiming.","This was the gulf between the Imperial Daughter and someone who was not an Imperial Son, what more when Chi Menghan had a seven-star aptitude, and her battle prowess at the same cultivation level surpassed even the majority of Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters.","In just a few moves, Liu Yiming was outmatched. With a furious roar, he directly turned around and left.","He had no face to stay any longer. How could it be that he really had to kneel down and complete the bet?","Liu Yiming left, and all the Imperial Clan elites had a whole new respect for Chi Menghan.","They all had extremely high opinions of themselves, and even Galaxy Network prodigies such as Yi Yuanrong weren’t worthy of their notice. However, Chi Menghan’s strength caused them to admit that they were inferior. Thus, their attitudes immediately changed.","-They had become even more eager.","Who didn’t want to marry such an exquisite prodigy?","Everyone continued onwards, walking along the coastline.","Not long after, they saw another four Yin Souls, similarly guarding a Blood-Patterned Dao","Stone.","However, though there were many more Yin souls, their abilities had decreased to the level of the Core Formation Tier. Everyone was unafraid, and charged forwards to fight, easily","destroying the Yin souls.","However, there was only one Blood-Patterned Dao Stone, so what could they do?","Everyone decided to hand it over to Chi Menghan first. When there were enough of them, they would discuss how to divide them among themselves.","Someone immediately pointed out that Ling Han should also hand over his Blood-Patterned","Dao Stone.","Ling Han naturally refused. Chi Menghan actually spoke up for him, saying that Ling Han had obtained it with his own abilities, so it naturally belonged to him alone. This silenced","everyone.","They continued to advance, and it wasn’t long before they discovered the third Blood-","Patterned Dao Stone.","This time, there were still only three Yin souls guarding the Dao Stone. However, after Ling Han glanced at them, he resolutely gave up the idea of going up to fight.","Because these three were all Spiritual Transformation Tier elites.","“Brother Ling, how about we team up?” Chi Menghan suggested.","Ling Han knew that she wanted to join forces with him to unleash the Heavenly Brilliance","Technique. At that time, the two of them had joined forces and indeed killed a Spiritual Transformation Tier Yin soul, which also allowed the strength of their souls to finally break through to the Spiritual Transformation Tier.","However, the soul state was different from the physical state. In the soul state, the strength of the soul was the only factor, but in the physical state, there were all kinds of reservations. It would be corroded by the Yin Qi, causing great effects or even great damage.","Thus, Ling Han was extremely confident that he could defeat a Yin soul at the True Self Tier,","but against a Spirit Transformation Tier?","Hehe, forget it.","Ling Han was confident, and dared to take risks, but the gap between them was obviously too","wide.","“Don’t worry. I have a rare treasure, which can block even Sect Master-level attacks,” Chi Menghan said confidently. “If it weren’t for the fact that I can’t unleash the might of the Heavenly Brilliance Technique by myself, I wouldn’t need to join forces with you.” “All right, then let’s give it a try.” Ling Han nodded. This Imperial Daughter probably wouldn’t seek her own death."]},{"number":4076,"title":"Chapter 4076: White Mountain","paragraphs":["Chapter 4076: White Mountain","Ling Han and Chi Menghan walked out together.","Seeing the two of them walk side by side, everyone’s expressions did not look too good. They felt as if they were being cuckolded.","Chi Menghan drew out a mirror, which hovered above her head. Instantly, streaks of precious light shone down, encircling both herself and Ling Han.","“Quickly!” she said. “This treasured mirror has only been charged with energy three times. Once the energy is exhausted, I won’t be able to activate it with my current cultivation level.”","Ling Han nodded in understanding. This was the only logical explanation. If a Core Formation Tier cultivator could control a Sect Master-level treasure, that would be far too abnormal.","He extended his divine sense and intertwined it with Chi Menghan’s.","Instantly, the two of them felt an indescribably wonderful feeling, as if they were part of each other.","Realization dawned on Ling Han. No wonder Chi Menghan was said to be looking for a husband. As it turned out, when they used the Heavenly Brilliance Technique in their physical state, it was actually like this!","Chi Menghan’s pretty face was also flushed red, and her beautiful body trembled slightly. In fact, even her skin was covered with an enchanting blush. Unfortunately, no one could see it. That precious light concealed everything.","At this moment, the two of them were slightly intoxicated, and even stopped in their tracks.","However, it was still Ling Han who was more resolute. With a light cough, he interrupted Chi Menghan’s wandering thoughts.","“Attack!”","Ling Han said solemnly, channelling the Heavenly Brilliance Technique.","Though he could already cast this Imperial Technique on his own, he definitely did not want Chi Menghan to find out. Otherwise, who knew what the Donglin Imperial Clan would do? Capture him and imprison him? It was also possible that they would force him to have children forever.","Moreover, if the two of them worked together to cast this technique, its might would definitely be even greater.","Chi Menghan didn’t have the time to be shy, and hurriedly channeled the Heavenly Brilliance Technique as well. Working together with Ling Han, they charged towards the three Spiritual Transformation Tier Yin souls.","Boom!","The three Yin souls also immediately charged over. Their attacks were even faster, and the sharp whistles of the souls reached them at the first instant. However, when they came into contact with the precious light, they all bounced back, unable to cause any effect.","Ling Han and Chi Menghan teamed up, unleashing the Heavenly Brilliance Technique together. In fact, it was even entwined with the Destructive Energy, which was a deadly weapon against Yin souls.","As expected, the moment Destructive Energy appeared, those Yin souls all felt an instinctive fear. However, they had too much of an advantage in cultivation level, after all. They overcame this kind of fear, and faced Ling Han and Chi Menghan head-on.","The two sides fought fiercely. In terms of true strength, even if Ling Han and Chi Menghan teamed up, they would still be outmatched. However, in terms of defense, they had the boost of a Sect Master-level treasure, while in terms of attack, they had the Imperial Technique, Destruction Energy, and so on. This made the three Yin souls feel very helpless.","They couldn’t attack, and they could only defend. Faced with the Destructive Energy, they were completely unable to oppose it.","Every time they were hit, their bodies would shrink a little, and when they had shrunk to a certain extent, their power would drop drastically.","After more than an hour of grinding, Ling Han and Chi Menghan finally disposed of all three Yin souls.","“Yi, why isn’t there any reward from the heaven and earth?” Ling Han found this strange. Killing Yin souls in the Living Realm couldn’t increase the strength of the soul, but the heaven and earth would reward one with the purest energy to temper the body, which also had endless benefits.","Chi Menghan also nodded, a puzzled expression on her face.","“Could it be that this place doesn’t belong to the Living Realm, nor does it belong to the Netherworld?” she said.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before saying, “I’ll leave this dilemma to the Saints.”","Chi Menghan removed the treasure mirror and returned to the crowd with Ling Han. Meanwhile, the newly obtained Blood Patterned Dao Stone was naturally shared equally between the two of them.","The group set out, and encountered a great many Yin souls. They were all guarding a Blood Patterned Dao Stone.","After a few times, everyone decided to go their separate ways.","Because there were obviously a great many Blood-Patterned Dao Stones in this place, and a great many of them were guarded by Cauldron Forging Origin Tier and Core Formation Tier Yin souls. Thus, this would have to depend on luck. Whoever encountered such Yin souls would be able to easily obtain the Blood-Patterned Dao Stones.","Previously, a large part of the reason why they had gathered together was because of Chi Menghan. However, how could their pursuit of a beautiful woman surpass their thirst for","strength?","Moreover, only when he became stronger would he be qualified to pursue an Imperial","Daughter.","All of a sudden, only Ling Han, Chi Menghan, and that young man from the Chi Clan remained","in the group.","“Hello, my name is Chi Dao,” the man said with a smile, introducing himself.","“Your name... is really unique,” Ling Han said.","“Because I stayed in my mother’s womb for a whole three years,” Chi Dao said. “So, that irresponsible father of mine gave me this name.”","Ling Han was surprised. Forget about ordinary people, but for cultivators like them, the longer their pregnancy period, the more nutrients the infant would be able to absorb. This","was true congenital energy!","This guy had been in the womb for three years, so his natural talent and aptitude was","definitely strong.","“I have a very high opinion of you. If Meng Han decides to marry you, I will definitely speak","up for you, and convince the clan,” Chi Dao continued.","“Chi! Dao!” Chi Menghan spat out word by word, her killing intent blazing.","“I can’t say any more.” Chi Dao raised his hands, and winked at Ling Han.","Ling Han was extremely speechless. Previously, when he had seen that this guy was taciturn,","he had thought that he was a serious person. He had not thought that he was actually a secretly the opposite.","The three of them advanced, and after walking for a while, a stretch of white vaguely","appeared ahead of them.","Yi?","They were all very curious. This place was practically ruled by blood. The blood-coloured ground, the blood-coloured sky, the blood-coloured sea, the blood-coloured fog, but all of a sudden, a smear of white appeared. This was naturally inconceivable.","However, the fog was too heavy, and they could only vaguely see a sliver of white. As for what exactly it was, they were completely unclear.","“Let’s go.”","They quickened their pace, and after walking for a while, they could see that the white should","be a small hill.","What mountain was this? It was actually white?","The three of them exchanged looks. This place was too strange, and it would not be strange no","matter what appeared.","“Be careful.”","They all said this to each other, then quickly walked forwards.","It wasn’t long before the white hill revealed its true appearance.","“What!”","The three of them all exclaimed in shock, because this small mountain was actually built from","multiple skulls.","Not only were there humans, but there were also tigers, goats, and wolves. Basically, as long as they were a race that existed in the galaxy, their skulls would be left here. No wonder there were so many of them that they could build a mountain.","“How terrifying. Even from so far away, I can still sense a terrifying pressure,” Chi Dao said.","Ling Han nodded in understanding. He wouldn’t submit to pressure, but this didn’t mean that he could ignore pressure. After reaching a certain level, he would also be crushed by pressure. And now, he felt that if he took another hundred steps, he would be crushed by the terrifying","pressure.","“These people... just how powerful were they when they were alive?” Chi Menghan","murmured.","They had already been dead for who knew how many years, and still had such a terrifying","pressure. When they were alive, they must have been top tier elites.","Venerate Tier, or even Saint Tier?"]},{"number":4077,"title":"Chapter 4077: Corrosive Sea","paragraphs":["Chapter 4077: Corrosive Sea","Ling Han gritted his teeth. This couldn’t be another Black Heaven Temple, right?","He had a very deep impression of that hell for Saints, and also very much did not want to remember it.","“Which Great Emperor did this place belong to?” Chi Dao murmured. “Those who can become Emperors have all obtained the approval of the Dao of Heaven and Earth. Though the Imperial Might cannot be violated, I have never heard of an Ancestral King that has a fondness for bloodshed.”","To be able to obtain the Dao of Heaven and Earth, that did not only require a great talent and strategy, but also an open-minded person. He was definitely not the type to seek revenge for the smallest grievance.","Then, what had caused a Great Emperor to go on a killing spree, killing so many people that they had piled up into a mountain?","Was there any such record in history?","Ling Han activated his eye technique, penetrating through the blood mist and seeing even more details.","“These skulls have existed for hundreds of millions of years,” he said.","Several hundred million years!","Chi Menghan shook her head, and said, “There will always be lapses in history from time to time. To say nothing of a few hundred million years, even events tens of millions of years ago might not be known to anyone.”","The three of them circled around the pile of bones a few times, continuously searching for clues, but found nothing.","“Let’s go and take a look elsewhere.”","They roamed around, mainly to find Blood-Patterned Dao Stones, and they did indeed find a few.","This area may be very large, but when they had reached a certain depth, the fog turned into a hard wall, stopping them from continuing forwards.","With their strength, there was no way for them to break through at all. They could only retreat.","Right now, the only area that they could explore was the sea.","The three of them arrived at the edge of the sea. Although Chi Dao was born slowly and unhurriedly, they were now anxious and ready to cross the sea.","“Don’t be rash,” Ling Han stopped him.","He channeled his mystical power, which transformed into a giant hand that grabbed out at the","sea.","A terrifying scene appeared. When this giant hand of mystical power reached into the sea, it was immediately corroded. In fact, it was still rapidly spreading towards Ling Han’s main body.","Ling Han hurriedly severed the mystical power. However, the corrosive power didn’t stop, and it continued to chase after him.","Yi?","Ling Han hurriedly retreated, but the corrosive power was still pursuing him. It was as if an invisible willpower was controlling it.","“Menghan, hurry up and help!” Chi Dao called out. Speaking of which, it was also because of him that Ling Han had moved to test the waters.","Chi Menghan nodded, and was just about to make a move, when Ling Han stopped her.","“Don’t make a move. This corrosive power should be the power of Regulations, and is not something that we can contend against now!” Ling Han said. He was a person who distinguished clearly between goodwill and animosity, so how could he possibly trick those who were friendly to him?","“Then what are you going to do?” Chi Menghan’s slender brows wrinkled into a frown.","“I have a way,” Ling Han said. Then, he broke into a run and fled.","Er, is this your solution?","Chi Menghan and Chi Dao exchanged looks, both feeling slightly speechless.","Ling Han continued to run, and the corrosive power continued to pursue him. It was as if it wouldn’t give up until it killed him.","The blood mist here was too thick, and Ling Han had not run too far, when he had already left Chi Menghan and Chi Dao behind. With a thought, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower immediately flew out of his mind, greeting the corrosive power.","Ling Han couldn’t withstand this kind of corrosive power. This involved Regulations. However, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was forged from Origin Gold, a weapon to be used by a Great Emperor, so what need was there to be afraid of Regulations?","The corrosive power assailed, and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower vibrated lightly. Lightning filled the air, and the power of Primal Chaos surged.","Origin Gold, a top grade material that would last for eternity.","The corrosive power was instantly blocked. Then, it was slowly destroyed by the power of lightning and Primal Chaos. Finally, it completely disintegrated.","Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief. He had only touched a sliver of it, and the corrosive power was already so terrifying. Then what if he had to cross the sea with his own physical body? He would probably immediately be corroded to the point that not even scraps would be left,","right?","He turned around, only to see Chi Menghan and Chi Dao, who were both still waiting for him at the original location.","“Haha, it’s great that you’re fine.” Chi Dao laughed loudly, and patted Ling Han’s shoulder. Then, he turned to Chi Menghan and said, “This guy not only has freakish abilities, but also great luck. I suggest that you marry him.”","Chi Menghan rolled her eyes at him. This clan brother of hers was really too unreliable. “This is just touching a little bit of seawater, and the corrosive power is already so terrifying. Then, if we enter into the sea, what kind of damage would we suffer?” Chi Dao coughed, and forcefully changed the topic.","“I tried it just now. I threw a rock out, but it was directly corroded fully before it even touched the sea,” he added.","In other words, even if he didn’t go into the sea, crossing the sea directly was an extravagant","hope.","“Looks like we can only wait for those higher ups to come out of the Blood Palace.”","In less than two days, the people that had previously dispersed gradually returned, and the other youngsters that had fainted in the Blood Palace also woke up one after another, joining","their ranks.","However, it was a shame that there weren’t any Blood-Patterned Dao Stones now.","“Peasant, do you dare spar with me?” Liu Yiming naturally returned as well. He provoked","Ling Han again.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Sure. However, you’ll have to fulfill the bet that you owe me","first.”","These words caused Liu Yiming’s face to flush red, and he was rendered speechless.","“Hehe, a mere lowly commoner dares to be rude to the Imperial Clan. Where did you get such courage from?” Another member of the Liu Clan stepped out. His name was Liu Kaiji. Ling Han raised a brow, and said, “Don’t keep calling me lowly commoner. You people are merely relying on the lingering prestige of your ancestors. You’re not all that noble.” Liu Kaiji humphed, and said balefully, “Just for these words, you deserve to die ten thousand","times over!”","Chi Menghan wanted to mediate again, but the three clansmen of the Ten Thousand Thunder Imperial Clan stopped her simultaneously.","Liu Kaiji glanced over, and revealed a sliver of a cold smile. Then, he waved his palm in a palm strike towards Ling Han.","He was also at the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier, but his raw power was as high as 28 Heavens, not inferior to the Buddha Son, Shi Yongming, at all.","This caused Shi Yongming to frown slightly. That was because Liu Kaiji was not the Imperial","Son of the Ten Thousand Thunder Imperial Clan, but in terms of raw power, he was actually not inferior to him. Then, if the real Imperial Son appeared, would he be a match for him? He had great ambitions, and wanted to break through to the Imperial Path, but if he could not even be invincible among his peers, how could he possibly become a Great Emperor? There had never been such a weak Great Emperor in history.","Since Ling Han wasn’t afraid of Shi Yongming, he naturally wouldn’t be afraid of Liu Kaiji","either. He immediately charged forwards.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them began a fierce battle. Though Ling Han’s power and battle prowess were much weaker, he still had many trump cards. The murderous aura assault, the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, Starlight Screen, when these techniques were used, though Liu Kaiji had the advantage, he was completely unable to turn it into a victory.","In fact, with Ling Han’s endless mystical power as support, as long as the battle lasted long","enough, he could even turn the situation around and obtain victory.","Thus, Liu Kaiji had no choice but to stop and retreat after battling for half a day.","If they continued fighting, it would be his turn to be on the back foot.","Liu Kaiji’s expression was very ugly. An Imperial Clan prodigy was actually still unable to win","when his cultivation level was superior?","How humiliating!"]},{"number":4078,"title":"Chapter 4078: Hide and Seek","paragraphs":["Chapter 4078: Hide and Seek","In truth, Ling Han was also extremely displeased.","First, it was Shi Yongming, followed by Liu Yiming and Liu Kaiji. All of them relied on their high cultivation level and battle prowess to attack whenever they wanted. Did they really think that he was made of clay and had no temper?","Towards this kind of provocation, Ling Han’s response was to slap him across the face, beating him until he submitted.","But now, though these three people could do nothing against him, which was extremely embarrassing to them, Ling Han was still unable to personally beat them up, and was extremely displeased.","Fine, while those Saints and Venerate Tier elites were still comprehending, he would refine the Soul Nurturing Stone, and break through to the late stage of the Core Formation Tier.","If he advanced into the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, according to his experience, his original power would definitely be able to reach 25 Heavens. Then, the Primal Chaos Celestial Core would pull down the battle prowess of Shi Yongming, Liu Yiming, and so on by three Heavens. The two sides would be equal in terms of original power.","With equal power, who could be a match for him?","Ling Han found an excuse to excuse himself from Chi Menghan and Chi Dao. He then left quietly by himself, keeping his distance from the others.","However, there were no hidden places here, but there was fog everywhere, blocking divine sense. It would be extremely difficult for others to find him.","Fine, he would cultivate in seclusion here.","Ling Han took out the Soul Nurturing Stone, and began to refine it.","He held the Soul Nurturing Stone in both hands and channeled the Nine Suns Divine Scroll, extracting its essence for his own use.","An indescribable power surged into his body, yet he couldn’t feel the impact of the power. This was extremely strange.","Was this Regulations?","Ling Han thought. The Core Formation Tier had actually already come into contact with Regulations, but the cultivators were in a hazy state. They had clearly come into contact with it, yet were completely unable to understand it.","Just like how everyone knew that eating meat was nutritious, but why was it nutritious? There were a great many people that did not understand the logic behind this.","Who cares? I’ll just raise my cultivation level first. When I reach the True Self Tier, I’ll naturally be able to understand.","With the nourishment of the Soul Nurturing Stone, the Primal Chaos Celestial Core’s growth rate immediately sped up.","Ling Han was already nearing the end of the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier in the first place, and with the help of the Soul Nurturing Stone, he quickly took this step, cultivating the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier to the Consummate level.","At this moment, he needed to take that most crucial step and break through to the late stage of the Core Formation Tier.","Ling Han placed the Soul Nurturing Stone down first. He wouldn’t be able to use this thing in his break through into the late stage of the Core Formation Tier.","He sat in a cross-legged position, like a boulder. He was in no rush to break through. Instead, he first reflected on himself, to see if he had cultivated his present cultivation level to perfection.","Fixing it now would be a hundred times easier than coming back later. In fact, there were some shortcomings that could not be compensated, or would need the Saintly medicine to be able to mend.","Time passed very quickly. In the blink of an eye, four days had passed.","Ling Han suddenly shuddered, and sense of danger rose up in his heart.","Strange Shadow Steps!","Realization suddenly dawned on him. Someone was approaching him with the Strange Shadow Steps.","An assassin from the Battle God Palace.","Humph, he had not thought that there would actually be someone from the Battle God Palace here. He should have coincidentally participated in this expedition, and then accidentally discovered that he was here as well.","Previously, Ling Han had been with Chi Menghan and the others, so the assassin didn’t have the chance to attack. However, now that Ling Han was moving alone, the assassin had sneaked over.","Why had he only come after so many days?","Simple. The blood mist here cut off divine sense and vision, so it would naturally take some time to find him.","A smile appeared at the corners of Ling Han’s lips. ‘Then I’m really sorry. I also know the Strange Shadow Steps. In fact, it’s the complete version. When it suddenly unfolds, who knows who would be given a scare.’","He was really looking forward to it.","He remained calm and collected, not even raising a single finger.","The assassin was approaching, and had already reached Ling Han’s back. Then, he suddenly drew his sword. Weng, the Spirit Tool was activated, and a dazzling light burst forth from the sharp sword, a terrifying aura circulating around it.","This sword could be considered top grade among Three Star Spirit Tools. As an assassin, the requirement for “tools” was naturally high.","However, in the instant that he stabbed out with his sword, he suddenly discovered that Ling","Han had disappeared.","He was gone!","How was this possible?","How could a living person suddenly disappear? Was this a ghost?","“Looking for me?” Just as he was at a loss, a voice rang out from behind him.","Ling Han!","Hiss, it was really haunted here.","It could not be said that his reaction speed was not fast. Immediately, he stabbed his sword behind him, and then his figure rapidly turned around.","Where was he?","He suddenly discovered that it was completely empty ahead of him. There was not even a","single person.","This... A cold chill gripped at his heart. This was far too uncanny! His hair stood on end.","“Still looking for me?” At this moment, Ling Han’s voice was heard from behind him again. The assassin turned around again. Shua, he sent out a palm strike, but his long sword had stabbed out in a completely opposite direction.","But whether it was the palm strike or the sword, they both missed.","He forced himself to calm down. Using the Strange Shadow Steps, he immediately fled into the shadows. After quickly moving a few steps, he stopped.","His mastery of the Strange Shadow Steps had yet to reach the peak stage, so when he was moving, he would cause slight fluctuations in the air. As long as one was careful enough, they would discover it. However, once he stopped moving, there would really be no flaws.","He was waiting. He was waiting for Ling Han to appear first, and then he would seize the opportunity to deliver a fatal blow.","“Hehe, let’s play a game now. It’s called hide-and-seek.” Ling Han’s voice rang out. His figure appeared not too far away, but just as the assassin was about to make a move, Ling Han once again disappeared without a trace.","The assassin instantly broke out in a cold sweat, because this time, he could clearly see that Ling Han’s method of fleeing into the shadows was exactly the same as his. Furthermore, it","was even more covert and untraceable.","Strange Shadow Steps!","But how was this possible? This was a secret of the Battle God Palace that would not be taught","to outsiders, so why would it be used by an outsider? Furthermore, it was a target that the","Battle God Palace was determined to kill?","“I’ve caught you!” Right at this moment, Ling Han’s voice rang out behind him.","The assassin instantly felt his scalp go numb.","He had actually been caught by Ling Han while in the state of Strange Shadow Steps. What","kind of concept was that?","This meant that the other’s grasp of the Strange Shadow Steps was superior to his!","“You, how do you know the Strange Shadow Steps?” As he asked, he stabbed out like","lightning.","“You guess,” Ling Han said with a smile. His figure appeared, and he immediately grabbed onto his opponent’s sword. The Starlight Screen enveloped him, allowing him to catch the Spirit Tool with his bare hands.","In fact, when he tempered his physique to a slightly stronger level, even if he didn’t channel the Starlight Screen, he would still be able to take on a Spirit Tool of the same level head-on. The assassin’s eyes were about to pop out of his head. ‘F*cking caught a Spirit Tool with his bare hands? Are you a Body Arts cultivator? But there’s clearly no such data in the","information.’","This was too much of a failure. How had the intel been gathered?","Ling Han smiled calmly, “Are you the only one this time, or is there someone else travelling","with you?”","“Humph, you want me to reveal the secret of the Battle God Palace? Impossible!” the assassin said resolutely.","Ling Han laughed, and said, “Actually, we’re on the same side.” As he said this, he released","his grip, then continued, “You see, if that wasn’t the case, why would I know the Strange","Shadow Steps?”","Yi, that made sense.","The assassin was slightly dazed."]},{"number":4079,"title":"Chapter 4079: Counterattack","paragraphs":["Chapter 4079: Counterattack","No, no!","The assassin hurriedly shook his head. He had almost been tricked by Ling Han. This guy was on the must-kill list of the Battle God Palace, so how could he possibly be one of their own?","“Don’t even think of lying to me!” he shouted loudly.","Ling Han sighed. Previously, when he had been speaking, he had even used his powerful spiritual power to influence the other. He had almost succeeded. However, it was a pity that there was not much of a gap in their cultivation levels, after all. It was too difficult to use this kind of method to control the other’s mind.","‘Fine then, I’ll use force to extort a confession.’","Ling Han cracked a smile, “If you don’t confess honestly, you will suffer greatly.”","“Haha, among the disciples of the Battle God Palace, which one of them would be afraid of torture?” The assassin laughed loudly, appearing to be completely unafraid.","“Indeed.” Ling Han nodded, “Because it involves crucial information, it has been sealed by divine sense. If it is forcefully extracted, it would shatter the mind.”","“It’s good that you know.” The assassin humphed.","Ling Han asked, “Do you want to know a secret?”","The assassin ignored him.","“Aren’t you curious about how I learned the Strange Shadow Steps?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","The assassin’s eyelids involuntarily twitched. This was indeed something that he was extremely curious about. If that had not been the case, perhaps he would have been able to successfully assassinate Ling Han instead of being dragged out of the shadows by Ling Han. “Tell me how many more people have entered this place this time, and I’ll exchange this secret with you. How about it?” Ling Han suggested.","“Haha, how could I be the type to betray my companions!” The assassin resolutely refused. He naturally refused, because even if his curiosity was satisfied, he would still fall into Ling Han’s hands, and would not be able to escape.","This deal was really not worth it.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “That is not up to you to decide!”","Weng! The murderous aura activated.","However, Ling Han controlled his power very well. Otherwise, with such an impact, this assassin’s mind would be directly shattered.","“Ah!” The assassin immediately grabbed his head and screamed. How awesome was Ling Han’s divine sense now? He couldn’t resist at all, and could only passively endure it.","It was only an instant, and his whole body was covered in cold sweat, as if he was a drowned rat.","Meanwhile, Ling Han sat at the sidelines. He wasn’t in a hurry, and he was waiting very leisurely.","It was only a few minutes, and the assassin couldn’t bear it anymore. He moaned, and said, “I’ll talk, I’ll talk. Whatever you want to know, I’ll tell you!”","Ling Han withdrew the barrage of murderous aura, then said, “Aside from you, are there any other assassins from the Battle God Palace here?”","“Yes!” the assassin gasped. Sweat rolled down his forehead, and he still hadn’t recovered. “How many are there? What cultivation level are they at?” Ling Han asked again.","“There are four in total. One is a Foundation Building Tier cultivator, two are Core Formation Tier cultivators, and one is a True Self Tier cultivator,” the assassin said.","Ling Han shuddered. There were actually True Self Tier assassins?","If this was outside, he would naturally be unafraid. If he used Earth Qi, he might even be able to kill an assassin of True Self Tier, but it was different here. The ley lines were suppressed, and he couldn’t use them.","“Could it be that I have to use the Heavenly Dao Flames?” Ling Han frowned. By now, there were not many times left for him to use it. Using it on a True Self Tier would be too much of a waste.","Moreover, wasn’t this place only open to those at the Core Formation Tier?","That’s right. The others were all very self-aware, because the Saint had spoken, but these people from the Battle God Palace were shameless, and that was why an assassin from the True Self Tier had snuck in.","Of course, firstly, they had no backing, and secondly, the members of the Battle God Palace were like rats that traversed the streets in the first place. Who would dare to appear in such a grand manner?","“What else do you want to know?” the assassin asked.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Aside from the location of the Battle God Palace, I don’t need to know anything else. Unfortunately, you can’t tell me where the Battle God Palace is.” With a thought, pa, the assassin’s mind was instantly shattered, and he was completely dead. Ling Han naturally wouldn’t be reserved toward those who wanted to kill him. He casually stowed the corpse away before continuing his comprehension.","Nothing was more important than one’s own strength.","However, there were still assassins from the Battle God Palace here. That Foundation Building Tier cultivator obviously couldn’t assassinate him. However, there were still two Core Formation Tier cultivators, so they would definitely be eager to give it a try. As for True Self Tier assassin... it was a little troublesome.","Another day passed, and Ling Han was still stabilizing his cultivation level. However, he suddenly sensed killing intent again.","‘Here it comes.’","This one wasn’t strong, and was merely a Core Formation Tier cultivator.","Ling Han remained calm and composed, allowing the other party to approach.","Yi?","A hint of surprise appeared on Ling Han’s face. With his eye technique, he could see clearly that he had seen that person before.","One of the seeds.","Previously, when he had entered into the Blood Tower to receive the inheritance, he had been provoked by a few seeds when he came out, and he had even killed one of them. The person who had come now was a seed from that era.","Enemies were really bound to meet on a narrow road.","After a while, the other party was already close.","Shua, that person brandished his butcher’s knife. A cold light streaked past, slicing towards Ling Han, wanting to forcibly sever him into two.","Ling Han smiled, activated the Strange Shadow Steps, and took a step forward. Not only did","he dodge this saber strike, but he also fled into the darkness and directly disappeared.","That seed was instantly stupefied.","What was going on?","“I’ve seen that expression you have once the day before yesterday,” Ling Han said from","behind him.","Shua, that seed was very strong, and he immediately slashed his saber behind him.","Unfortunately, he had only missed like that person last time.","However, seeds were seeds, after all, so how could ordinary assassins compare?","He immediately used the Nine Styles of the God of War. Boom, battle prowess surged, and","blasted towards Ling Han.","This was a Saint Technique, which was extraordinarily powerful.","Unfortunately, merely in terms of Imperial Techniques, Ling Han had mastered more than","one, so how could he be able to show off his celestial technique in front of him?","The God Slaying Technique.","Ling Han raised both hands, and also greeted the incoming attack with a fierce strike.","Peng!","Just how powerful was he now? His raw power was as high as 20 Heavens, and with just a single strike, that seed was sent flying. Blood seeped out from all over his body, and at least a few blood vessels had been broken.","“How could you possibly know the Strange Shadow Steps?” That seed exclaimed in shock. This was something that he couldn’t understand no matter what.","“I also know the Nine Styles of the God of War. Do you want to try it?” Ling Han said with a","smile.","That seed was even more stunned. The world only knew the Three Styles of theGod of War, and to be able to say the Nine Styles of the God of War... he must be a higher-up of the Battle God Palace, or a seed that had crawled through the Blood Tower. However, how could a target of assassination be a higher-up or seed of the Battle God Palace?","“Hehe, only a year and a half has passed, and you don’t remember me anymore?” Ling Han patted his shoulder. With a thought, he transformed into Ding Yi’s appearance.","“You, you, you—” That guy was completely stupefied, his eyes wide.","Who would have thought that the target that the Battle God Palace had sworn to kill would actually sneak into the Battle God Palace, and even become a seed!","No wonder Ding Yi had defected. As it turned out, he was Ling Han, so how could he not have","fled?"]},{"number":4080,"title":"Chapter 4080: Late stage of the Core Formation Tier!","paragraphs":["Chapter 4080: Late stage of the Core Formation Tier!","Ling Han smiled and said, “After learning the truth, what are you feeling?”","That seed was speechless. At this moment, he was filled with regret and confusion. How could a mere Core Formation Tier cultivator fool the elites of the Battle God Palace?","You are really f****** suited to become an assassin. This ability of disguise is invincible.","“In the past, the few of you were jumping around. Now... I’ll send you on your way,” Ling Han said calmly.","“Spare me!” That guy hurriedly called out, “No matter what, we can still be considered fellow disciples!”","Ling Han faltered for a moment before breaking into laughter. “You’re so shameless. I think you’ve also chosen the wrong profession. You shouldn’t be an assassin, but rather a salesperson.”","Peng! With a single punch, he killed the seed of the Battle God Palace.","He would uproot the entire Battle God Palace, but his present strength was still insufficient, so he could only kill any of their assassins he saw.","After stowing away the corpse, Ling Han continued to comprehend.","Merely half a day later, the last Core Formation Tier assassin also sneaked over. This naturally was delivering himself up to be killed. After Ling Han casually killed him, he began to","comprehend again.","One day, two days, three days... Time flew by, and what surprised Ling Han was the fact that the True Self Tier assassin still hadn’t appeared.","Had he found some great opportunity? Or had he died?","Ling Han didn’t care either. Under his continuous stabilization, the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier had already been perfected by him.","He could break through now.","In the late stage of the Formation Tier, the cultivator would inscribe the patterns of great dao on the Celestial Core, and the more patterns were inscribed, the higher the grade of the Celestial Core would be, and the battle prowess of the cultivator would naturally be stronger. The problem was, the Core Formation Tier was still unable to directly comprehend the Regulations of heaven and earth, so how could they inscribe the patterns of great dao? Simple, high-level energy.","The use of high-level energy belonged to the Regulations of heaven and earth in the first place. However, cultivators below the True Self Tier only knew how to use them, but did not know the profoundness of it. It was just like how it was very simple for an ordinary person to control a firearm, and there was absolutely no need to understand the construction principles of a firearm.","The Primal Chaos Celestial Core was built with the structure of Destructive Energy as its core. Thus, it was very simple to “draw” the first veined pattern. One only had to stimulate the Celestial Core and allow this structure to appear.","However, this process was not something that could be accomplished overnight. After spending a whole three days, on top of the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, a complex veined pattern appeared.","The core of Destructive Energy, the structure that was left after being shredded and cocooned, could be said to be the embodiment of the Regulations of heaven and earth.","The Primal Chaos Celestial Core shuddered violently, inhaling and exhaling a great volume of mystical power. It was a great improvement from before.","Ling Han broke into a grin. He had already advanced into the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, so his power naturally soared.","He casually threw a punch, and instantly, a terrifying power surged.","“As expected, 25 Heavens!”","Ling Han laughed loudly. He had just advanced into the late stage of the Core Formation Tier. However, his raw power had already surpassed the likes of Yi Yuanrong, the strongest Core Formation Tier in the West Heavenly Realm.","Of course, some Holy Lands’ Dao Child and Holy Daughters had hidden depths. They clearly had superior battle prowess, yet did not even have a Galaxy Network account.","He did not immediately return, but rather continued to draw the patterns of heaven and earth. In theory, there were countless high-level energies, so wouldn’t it be very easy to cultivate the late stage of the Core Formation Tier to the fullest? That was because the size of the Celestial Core was limited, and one was only capable of drawing so many patterns. However, precisely because the Celestial Core was limited in size, the more one had to be careful when drawing the patterns of heaven and earth, and try as much as possible to draw high-level patterns. Otherwise, it would affect the quality of the Celestial Core, which would in turn affect the height that one could reach in future.","Ordinarily, one could only draw nine patterns at most on the Celestial Core so there was the saying of Nine Inscriptions Golden Core in the case of Silver Core and Bronze Core, they were much smaller.","Thus, Silver Core had Six Inscriptions, while Bronze Core had Three Inscriptions. Theoretically speaking, Three Inscriptions Bronze Core could help one break through to the True Self Tier, but those who formed the bronze Celestial Foundation and still managed to advance into the Core Formation Tier were pitifully few in number. Thus, Three Inscriptions Bronze Cores were extremely rare.","Ordinarily, it would be Six Inscriptions Silver Cores, and prodigies would have to have Nine Inscriptions Golden Core, at least, and in the case of Three Colored Crystal Cores and Nine Colored Crystal Cores, they could even reach Twelve or Eighteen Inscriptions!","Ling Han’s Celestial Core was the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, so it naturally far surpassed the Nine Colored Crystal Core. However, he wasn’t sure exactly how many inscriptions he could","reach.","“No matter what, it is better to have nothing than settle for inferiority.”","Ling Han began to choose the second pattern of heaven and earth. That would definitely be the Heavenly Dao Flames. In future, this would be able to evolve into the highest level of Fire Energy, and was completely qualified to occupy a place in the Celestial Core.","However, when he began to draw the veined patterns, he shockingly discovered that though the pattern representing Destructive Energy only occupied a small area, this guy was extremely domineering, snatching away a large blank area nearby, not allowing him to draw patterns at all.","‘F*ck! Are you just preventing another pattern from using the space even when you yourself have no use for it?’","Ling Han tried a few times, but was still unable to do anything.","He understood now, because the current Destructive Energy was still incomplete, and if it was in its complete state, the patterns formed should have occupied such a large area. Going by that calculation, how many Dao Patterns could he draw on his Celestial Core?","If they were all as awesome as Destructive Energy, then there wouldn’t even be nine of them. At most, there would only be seven.","Er, that was fine. In any case, as long as the Dao Patterns were high-level, it was fine. Quantity","was secondary.","Ling Han comforted himself.","He began to extract the Regulations of heaven and earth from the Heavenly Dao Flames. Because he had already experienced it once, this was naturally a walk in the park for him. Furthermore, compared to the Destructive Energy, the Heavenly Dao Flames were much","simpler to extract.","In a mere two days’ time, he had extracted an incredibly complicated pattern, and branded it onto the Primal Chaos Celestial Core.","Two Inscriptions.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. Could he also extract the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning and transform it into a Dao Pattern?","To be honest, mixing the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning and the black light of illusion together, though it was very powerful, it was also very wasteful. If it could be dismantled, it could be turned into two Mystical Powers, which would be more nimble to use. However, this was also risky. This was because once he dismantled the two streaks of divine light and was unable to analyze the essence, these two streaks of divine light would “die” and","completely disappear.","Ling Han only hesitated for a moment before immediately deciding to continue!","Only by transforming it into his own understanding would it truly belong to him.","He began to dismantle the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning, extracting the essence from the terrifying lightning. Because he had long since refined it, even if the divine lightning was incredibly terrifying, it was very docile, and would not resist in the slightest.","Ling Han was extremely careful, analyzing bit by bit.","Five days later, he was already close to success.","However, Ling Han’s forehead was also covered with sweat. He was extremely focused, and there couldn’t be the slightest mistake. Otherwise, his two Mystical Powers would be ruined.","‘Soon, soon, soon... I’ve succeeded!’","Ling Han revealed a smile. When he completely dismantled the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning, the divine lightning actually split into two, turning into two incredibly complex","patterns.","One was the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning, and the other was the black light of illusion. They were not one and the same in the first place. It was only because the Ten Cauldrons were fused into one that they were forced to fuse together, and now, they were once again separated."]},{"number":4081,"title":"Chapter 4081: Get out here and accept your death","paragraphs":["Chapter 4081: Get out here and accept your death","What followed was much simpler. Ling Han branded the two patterns on the Primal Chaos Celestial Core. Now, the two Mystical Powers had completely become his celestial techniques. He made a comparison. It was still Destructive Energy that was the most awesome, occupying the largest territory. Then, it was Primal Chaos Divine Lightning and Heavenly Dao Flames. However, the design for the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning covered the territory it occupied fully, while Heavenly Dao Flames was the same as Destructive Energy. Its design wasn’t big, but it occupied a large area.","Obviously, this was territory it was keeping in reserve.","Whether it was Destructive Energy or Heavenly Dao Flames, they were both incomplete, far from reaching the height that they should have. Thus, they occupied a large area, but their designs were extremely small.","It was the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning that was more realistic. It occupied as much space as it could.","In other words, it didn’t have any more room for further advancement.","However, the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning was already unbelievably strong in the first place, and could increase Ling Han’s battle prowess by five Heavens.","The black light of illusion was also very realistic, occupying the same space as itself, but among the four patterns, it occupied the smallest space. In other words, its potential was the smallest, and there was already no room for improvement.","Even so, Ling Han did some calculations. Even if they were all this size, his Celestial Core could only be inscribed with 12 patterns.","From this, it could be seen that the black light of illusion was also very, very awesome. It just couldn’t compare to the other three.","Ling Han stood up, raised his hand, and zi, a bolt of lightning struck out, surging with the shards of terrifying seals.","Primal Chaos Divine Lightning!","After launching an attack, Ling Han once again raised his hand. Primal Chaos Divine Lightning struck continuously, and accompanying it was the corresponding pattern on the Primal Chaos Celestial Core dimming.","After striking twelve times of divine lightning in one go, the pattern completely dimmed, and Ling Han was no longer able to strike Primal Chaos Divine Lightning for the thirteenth time.","A smile appeared on his face. Now, the number of times he could use the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning was greatly increased, which naturally increased his explosive power by a whole lot as well.","“I can now be considered a Four Inscriptions. Based on the remaining space of the Celestial Core, I have already walked halfway out of the late stage of Core Formation Tier.”","“With the support of the Celestial Core, my power has reached... between 27 and 28 Heavens.” “All right!”","Ling Han’s eyes lit up. At this moment, he would be able to sweep aside the likes of Shi Yongming. Even if he encountered a real Imperial Son and Imperial Daughter, he would at least be able to fight them to a tie.","“Now, I want to find the most fundamental, high-level energy. At least, it has to be Heavenly Dao Flames-level.”","“Time to go back!”","Ling Han determined the direction and returned the way he came. Strangely, the True Self Tier assassin still didn’t make a move. Could it be that he had really died here?","This was extremely likely. This place was strange and dangerous, so it wouldn’t be strange if a True Self Tier died here.","A few hours later, Ling Han returned to the coast. He saw that many people had stayed here, trying various methods to cross the sea, but it was all useless. Instead, a few people were killed by the corrosive power.","“Yi, Ling Han, you’re back!” Chi Dao immediately greeted him.","This was a man who liked to hide his emotions. Even though he usually didn’t speak much, that was because he wasn’t familiar with him yet. Once they were familiar with each other, this guy would speak too much.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Brother Chi, I’ll talk to you later.”","He took a slight breath, then shouted loudly, “Shi Yongming, get out here and accept your death!”","After this roar, the whole area was instantly left with dead silence.","What was going on? Someone actually dared to provoke the Buddha Son?","Shi Yongming was resting with his eyes closed, and when he heard this, he couldn’t help but sneer. He stood up, and said calmly, “Ling Han, are you dreaming?”","“Haha, a mere lowly commoner, you can only talk tough.” Liu Yiming sneered.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “The both of you can come at me together. I will fight both of you alone.”","When these words were said, it instantly caused a bout of laughter.","Ling Han was indeed powerful. In the past, he had been the number one elite of the Cauldron Forging Tier, and even the Imperial Son had been defeated by him. However, everyone was in the Core Formation Tier now, so unless you reached the Consummate level of the Core Formation Tier, what right did you have to challenge an Imperial Son?","A Buddha Son was an Imperial Son!","“Ling Han, you are too arrogant!”","“You can only act arrogantly in the North Heavenly Realm, because the people there are too weak!”","“Now that you’ve come to our West Heavenly Realm, it’s best to keep a low profile.”","Everyone said one after another, not having the sligthest bit of positive feelings towards Ling","Han.","Prejudice and discrimination due to territory was still quite serious.","Shi Yongming stepped out, and said, “You’ve only mastered an extremely powerful defensive technique. In terms of battle prowess, I can suppress you single-handedly!”","Xiu, Ling Han shot out, and shot out a punch.","Peng!","Shi Yongming greeted that with a palm strike, but just as palm and fist made contact, he was","sent flying.","Thankfully, his raw power was also as high as 28 Heavens. In fact, he was just that bit stronger than Ling Han. However, he was at a disadvantage because he had not used a secret technique, and that was why he was inferior to Ling Han in terms of battle prowess, and was sent flying. With a turn of his body, he had already steadied his footing, and stood in midair.","However, after this attack, a dead silence fell once more.","Who would have thought that the power of Ling Han’s punch would be so domineering?","Chi Menghan’s beautiful eyes lit up. She had always had a high opinion of Ling Han. After all, Ling Han was the only cultivator with an eight-star aptitude. As long as his cultivation level could keep up, he would definitely be inconceivably powerful.","“This guy broke through to the late stage of Core Formation Tier,” Chi Dao said. “Hiss, what a monster. Once he advanced into the late stage of Core Formation Tier, his battle prowess can reach such a terrifying extent.”","Shi Yongming’s expression changed drastically. He had just been boasting, saying that he could suppress Ling Han with one hand, but what happened? Ling Han sent him flying with a","single punch.","However, only a dozen over days had passed, so how had Ling Han’s strength increased to","such a terrifying extent?","“Late stage of Core Formation Tier!” He used a Mystical Power from the Buddhist Race, and finally discovered that Ling Han had improved further.","Heavens, he had just newly advanced into the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, so how","could his battle prowess be as strong as this?","Are you even human? Ling Han smiled faintly, “How does this punch taste like?”","Hearing his mockery, Shi Yongming’s face instantly flushed red and then paled. He flew into a humiliated rage, and roared loudly. A Buddha Halo formed behind his head, instantly","transforming into the Golden Arhat, as he charged towards Ling Han.","Ling Han was completely unafraid as he faced his opponent head-on.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","After exchanging more than ten blows in a row, Ling Han didn’t back down in the slightest,","nor did he fall into a disadvantage.","This caused Shi Yongming to feel disbelief. Previously, he had exchanged blows with Ling","Han, and knew that though Ling Han was freakish, his raw power was only around 19 or 20","Heavens, but now?","It was more than 27 Heavens, and looked to be close to 28 Heavens. This was practically not inferior to him at all.","He had only advanced one minor level, yet his power could actually increase so drastically?","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Come, have a taste of this punch!”","He threw another punch, but when his fist was thrown, lightning blazed.","Primal Chaos Divine Lightning!","With this strike, peng, Shi Yongming’s whole person was instantly sent flying, completely","unable to resist."]},{"number":4082,"title":"Chapter 4082: Complete Battering","paragraphs":["Chapter 4082: Complete Battering","Shi Yongming was sent flying. Peng! He landed heavily on the ground.","Hiss, when everyone saw this, they all inhaled sharply.","That was because not only had Shi Yongming been sent flying, there was also a wound on his lower abdomen. It was presently fuming with burnt smoke, and one could vaguely see the flicker of lightning.","It should be known that in the state of Golden Arhat, Shi Yongming’s battle prowess and defense-especially defense-would be greatly improved, but his physical body was actually pierced by a single strike from Ling Han. Just how terrifying was his attack power?","This strike was truly astounding.","Chi Menghan was also astonished. She was an Imperial Daughter, and her battle prowess was even above that of the so-called Buddha Son, Shi Yongming. She was also completely capable of defeating Shi Yongming with a single strike. However, what cultivation level was she at?","Consummate level of Core Formation Tier!","What about Ling Han?","Was this the aptitude of an eight-star genius? How impressive.","And those like Liu Yiming, Liu Kaiji and the two members of the Ten Thousand Thunder Imperial Clan, all had extremely ugly expressions.","Too strong, how could there be such a freak?","Ling Han’s killing intent was on full display. This Shi Yongming was not just trying to suppress him, but also harboring killing intent towards him.","Then who cares if you are Buddha Son or Imperial Son? Die!","-Even a force like the Battle God Palace was going all out against him, so it was fine even if there was the Buddhist Race added in.","Shi Yongming got to his feet. Blood was flowing from the wound on his lower abdomen, but it was golden in colour. Furthermore, it was still glowing, as if he was a god. He could not believe that he was actually no match for Ling Han.","Previously, he had clearly been able to easily thrash Ling Han. However, the latter had relied on a strange method to weaken his battle prowess by a few Heavens, and also had an awesome defense, so he could only suppress him but could not defeat him.","This change was too fast and too sudden, that he could not believe it.","“How could this be! How could this be!” His hands were tightly clenched into fists, flames practically leaping out of his eyes.","“I’ll send you on your way!” Ling Han charged over, his expression cold and emotionless. “In your dreams!” Shi Yongming gritted his teeth and made up his mind. His forehead suddenly split open, and a majestic light instantly burst forth, making even Ling Han feel slightly apprehensive. He immediately stopped.","“Ah!” Shi Yongming shouted loudly. His right hand stretched into his brow, and actually grabbed out a Demon Subduing Staff.","This Demon Subduing Staff was glowing all over, and there were multiple seals on it. It looked incredibly solemn and austere.","“Yi, why does this Demon Subduing Staff give me an incredibly terrifying pressure?”","“This looks like a True Self Tier... no, a Spiritual Transformation Tier-level precious treasure!”","“I understand now. This isn’t a physical body, but a Spirit Body!”","“How could that be? Without reaching the Spiritual Transformation Tier, how could one possibly form a Spirit Body?","“That must be the power of the Buddhist Race.”","Everyone was engaged in a heated discussion, all of them very excited, because this kind of method was an eye-opener for them.","Even Liu Yiming nodded and said, “The Buddhist Race is most skilled in the aspect of the soul. They were actually able to implant a Spirit Body into the mind of a cultivator at the Core Formation Tier. This technique is truly amazing.”","“Hehe, once the Spirit Body appears, Ling Han definitely won’t be able to endure it.” Liu Kaiji laughed.","“Ling Han!” Shi Yongming shouted loudly, his eyes shooting out golden light, appearing to be extremely furious. That was because he had taken out the Spirit Body in advance, and this originally could only be used by Spiritual Transformation Tier elites. If he took it out now, it would cause massive damage to the Spirit Body.","However, he didn’t want to lose, nor did he want to die. Thus, he had to use his trump card. Once the Spirit Body appeared, what Core Formation Tier wouldn’t be razed to the ground? “You will pay the price for all that you have done!” he forced out through gritted teeth. Who cares about how the Buddhist Race was supposed to avert anger? He was going to commit murder.","Ling Han smiled faintly as he silently unleashed the black light of illusion.","After splitting it up, the Mystical Power was finally able to unleash its true might. Otherwise, the target would be awakened the moment it took effect, completely burying the effectiveness of this Mystical Power.","If Shi Yongming was calm, then he was the Buddhist Race prodigy, so it was still possible for him to defend against Ling Han. However, in this state of losing control of his anger, he was naturally immediately affected, falling into the illusion that he had created.","Everyone was anticipating Shi Yongming’s sudden burst of power. After all, Shi Yongming had even unleashed his Spirit Body, so he was definitely going to start a massacre and completely suppress Ling Han.","However, why was there still no movement?","Multiple gazes focused on Shi Yongming. What was going on with this guy?","Had he had a stroke?","Struck dumb?","Because Ling Han didn’t make a move at all, no one associated Shi Yongming’s dazed state with Ling Han. However, it was also because of this that everyone was at a loss and confused.","This was too strange, wasn’t it?","Ling Han paid no further attention to Shi Yongming. This guy now had a Spirit Body in his hands, and his attack power far surpassed that of the Core Formation Tier. Thus, he just let him stand there and waited for the might of the Spirit Body to disappear.","-Ling Han could see very clearly with his eye technique. After this Demon Subduing Staff was unleashed, its energy was continuously draining away. Thus, as time passed, it would soon become a piece of trash.","“Next, it’s the two of you!” Ling Han set his eyes on Liu Kaiji and Liu Yiming.","Both members of the Liu Clan were both a little apprehensive, because Shi Yongming’s present state was too baffling.","If this had nothing to do with Ling Han, that would be too much of a coincidence, but if it was really Ling Han’s doing, that would be even more terrifying. He did not even need to raise his hand, and one would have already been hit. Then how were they supposed to guard against","him?","“Lowly commoner, you are too arrogant!” Liu Yiming said, putting on a fierce appearance but was actually cowardly.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “I almost forgot. You still owe me a bet.”","Hearing him mention this again, Liu Yiming’s face instantly flushed red. He glanced at Liu Kaiji, and the latter nodded at him. The two of them immediately joined forces to attack.","Ling Han shook his head. They thought they could resist him just by joining forces?","They were really too naive.","He activated the Primal Chaos Celestial Core, and instantly, the battle prowess of these two","people dropped drastically by three Heavens.","This base power was inferior to Ling Han, so how could it match him?","Ling Han charged out, and as he brandished his fists, Liu Kaiji and Liu Yiming were instantly","beaten into disarray.","The gap in battle prowess was really too wide. They were not on the same level at all, all","right?","No matter what Liu Kaiji and Liu Yiming did, it was completely useless. Very soon, they were suppressed by Ling Han.","“Come, fulfill your bet first, then we’ll settle the other debts!” Ling Han pressed Liu Yiming","and Liu Kaiji onto their knees.","“Why do I have to kneel as well?” Liu Kaiji asked defiantly.","“Er!” Ling Han pondered for a moment, before saying, “It was just a passing thought.","However, since one is already kneeling, the other might as well.”","‘Mighat as well your sister, don’t be so casual!’","Liu Kaiji was both furious and embarrassed. Kneeling down in public was naturally a complete","loss of face. He had completely lost all his face, so how would he be able to face others in","future?","However, what could he do? He was no match for Ling Han’s strength at all, and was firmly","pressed onto the ground.","Ling Han smiled, “It’s fine even if you guys don’t slap yourselves. In any case, I’m not in a","hurry, so you guys can just continue to kneel like this!”","F***!","Liu Kaiji glanced at Liu Yiming, and Liu Yiming also glanced at him. The two of them decided","to admit defeat for the moment. The longer they knelt, the deeper the humiliation they would suffer. They had best end this nightmare as soon as possible."]},{"number":4083,"title":"Chapter 4083: Killing a Buddha Son","paragraphs":["Chapter 4083: Killing a Buddha Son","Liu Kaiji and Liu Yiming both slapped themselves. Though this was also very humiliating, it was still better than continuing to kneel.","At the same time, the dazed Shi Yongming suddenly moved, brandishing the Demon Subduing Staff in his hands and attacking everywhere, not caring at all, causing the people in the surroundings to be greatly shocked and hurriedly move out of the way.","A Core Formation Tier cultivator that wielded a Spirit Body; who dared to block him?","Was this guy crazy?","Shi Yongming seemed to have encountered a life-or-death enemy, and brandished the Demon Subduing Staff in his hands. Every strike was delivered with his full strength, and his expression would be twisted at times, proud at others, nervous at others. It was truly colourful.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel rueful. The black light of illusion was truly astonishing. Though its level was inferior to Destructive Energy or Primal Chaos Divine Lightning, Heavenly Dao Flames, but its practical use was not the slightest bit inferior. Ling Han did not feel regret at having branded it on the Celestial Core, and turning it into his true celestial technique.","Others didn’t know that Shi Yongming had fallen into an illusion, and only thought that he had gone mad. They all retreated. If they were wounded, or even killed by a maniac, then there would really be no place for them to seek justice.","However, after Shi Yongming brandished it for a while, the Demon Subduing Staff slowly dimmed, its might decreasing time and time again.","At this time, Shi Yongming’s expression suddenly changed, and he regained consciousness. He was a disciple of the Buddhist Race, after all, and he cultivated the art of the soul, so it was easier for him to break free from an illusion than any other person. However, it was naturally too late now. The energy of the Demon Subduing Staff had almost been exhausted.","“No!” he cried out in frustration.","This Demon Subduing Staff was planted in his body by an Arhat from the Buddha Race of the West Heavenly Realm. He nurtured it, and when he advanced into the Spirit Transformation Tier, he would possess a deadly weapon.","But now that he had used it in advance, not only did it not have the effect of subduing the enemy, it had instead exhausted all its energy. This meant that all the effort he had previously put in was completely wasted.","Damn it, damn it!","“Ling Han, if I don’t expiate you, I swear that I won’t live!” he said through gritted teeth.","Ling Han merely smiled, “For someone like me, how could hell dare to take me in? Shi Yongming, it would be better for you to go to hell to exorcise the departed souls, and follow in the footsteps of Buddha Doga!”","He charged out. At this moment, Shi Yongming’s Spirit Body was already exhausted, so what did he have to fear?","Boom!","Shi Yongming parried, but he had previously fallen into an illusion, and used all his powerful moves. How could he possibly be a match for Ling Han at this moment?","In just two or three moves, he had completely fallen into a disadvantage, and was suppressed extremely terribly by Ling Han.","This was still the result of Ling Han not using the Primal Chaos Celestial Core. Otherwise, he wouldn’t even be able to withstand a single strike.","Even so, it was only a few dozen moves, and he was already in a perilous situation. His vital points were repeatedly hit, and he was throwing up blood endlessly.","“Ling Han, you dare to kill me?” Shi Yongming didn’t dare to believe this. He was West Heavenly Realm’s Buddha Son, and his status was extremely high. Wouldn’t he be afraid that the Buddha Race would be angered and exterminate your entire clan?","“So what if I kill you?” Ling Han was cold, and his attacks were extraordinarily heavy, showing no mercy at all.","This caused everyone to inhale sharply. They could not believe this at all.","Ling Han was far too arrogant, wasn’t he? He actually dared to kill a member of an Imperial Clan!","At first, Liu Yiming and Liu Kaiji were extremely furious, but now, their hatred towards Ling Han actually decreased slightly. Just look, he even dared to kill the Buddha Son. In comparison, just having the two of them kneel on the ground and slap themselves three times was nothing?","“Please consider carefully!” Chi Menghan suddenly spoke up, sending a message through divine sense to Ling Han.","Ling Han knew that Chi Menghan was deliberately reminding him to prevent him from being too arrogant or being blinded by hatred and making drastic actions. However, this wasn’t his drastic actions, but rather his actions after careful consideration.","Peng!","With a single punch, Shi Yongming was already killed. Under the barrage of Destructive Energy, Shi Yongming didn’t even have the chance to burn his Celestial Core to extend his life. There was dead silence.","A Buddha Son had died. This was equivalent to an Imperial Son. It was equivalent to having poked a hole in the heavens.","Next, the Buddhist Race would definitely fly into a thunderous rage.","Yet Ling Han was unconcerned. The true Buddhist Race was located in the thirty three Heavens. Though there were branches in the North, South, East and West Heavenly Realms, and they all had Buddha Sons, they could only be considered Pseudo Buddha Sons.","Because compared with an Imperial Daughter like Chi Menghan, Shi Yongming’s strength was not just a little bit weaker.","Thus, the Buddha Sons of the four Heavenly Realms were all Pseudo-Buddha Sons. The real Buddha Sons would definitely be in the thirty three Heavens.","Of course, killing Shi Yongming would definitely anger the Buddhist Race, but it should only be the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm. At most, this can only be considered the equivalent of a Holy Land. What did he have to fear?","Everyone looked at Ling Han and felt rueful.","Incredible, this was really incredible. If this freak from the North Heavenly Realm could continue to live, he would definitely become a Saint in the future. Furthermore, he would be an incredibly powerful Saint, the kind that dared to oppose even an Imperial Clan. However, as the saying went, the tallest tree in the forest would be destroyed by the winds. Putting aside the Buddhist Race, the Battle God Palace had already issued a killing order against him. Would this brat be able to live until the day he became a Saint?","Shua, right at this moment, a flash of sword light suddenly appeared out of thin air, slashing towards Ling Han’s back.","This strike was both fast and accurate!","Pu! The sword slashed down, splitting Ling Han into two.","“Hahaha!” The person who had launched the sneak attack revealed his true form. It was an ordinary-looking middle-aged man, but at this moment, he was exuding a burning brilliance. He was the True Self Tier assassin from the Battle God Palace. Previously, he had been searching for the Blood-Patterned Dao Stone, and had only arrived here not too long ago. However, he had coincidentally discovered Ling Han.","He had succeeded with a single strike!","He laughed loudly. He had finally killed the target that the Battle God Palace had to kill. He had done a great service this time, and when he returned, he would definitely be rewarded.","However, in reality, Ling Han just happened to be standing nine meters away, completely","unscathed.","-This assassin had already fallen into an illusion.","He wanted to show off the Strange Shadow Steps in front of Ling Han?","What a joke. He had long since grasped the complete Strange Shadow Steps, and also had an eye technique. If anyone wanted to approach him soundlessly and sneak attack him, that was","practically deceiving himself.","However, Ling Han simply took advantage of this fact and secretly used the black light of illusion, causing the other party to unknowingly fall into the illusion that he had woven.","Seeing this assassin smile foolishly, everyone gritted their teeth.","This was a True Self Tier cultivator, and he had actually concealed his cultivation level and","snuck in secretly. How disgraceful!","“Judging by the way he sneak attacked, he seems to be an assassin from the Battle God","Palace.”","“It should be. Ling Han is on the must-kill list of the Battle God Palace.”","“But what’s wrong with him? He’s smiling so brightly. Could it be that he thinks that he has","successfully killed Ling Han?”","“It’s like he’s gone mad.” “Yi, don’t you think this is very similar to Shi Yongming’s situation just now?”","At this point, everyone stopped in unison. Then, they turned to look at Ling Han, their faces","filled with shock.","This guy... could it be that he could make one enter into an illusion at any time?","Heavens, just how many Mystical Powers had this guy grasped?","“Ah!” The assassin suddenly came back to his senses. After all, he was a True Self Tier","cultivator, so the illusion couldn’t confuse him for too long.","“I’m going to kill you!” He glared furiously at Ling Han, his face burning. He was laughing like an idiot in public; this was too embarrassing."]},{"number":4084,"title":"Chapter 4084: Backer","paragraphs":["Chapter 4084: Backer","The True Self Tier assassin roared loudly, and charged towards Ling Han again. Then, he stabbed and slashed again and again, strike after strike. Black light blazed, and killing intent spread out, his divine might incredibly powerful.","But as everyone watched, they all felt a sense of amusement and terror rise up in their hearts.","That was because that assassin was randomly attacking again, and was completely slashing at empty air.","Right, he had once again fallen into an illusion.","After a while, the assassin came back to his senses. He faltered for a moment, and his whole face was as red as blood.","“Ling Han, I’m going to tear you into pieces!” He charged over again, and then... very tragically, continued to slash at the air.","“Ling Han!”","Cutting at empty air.","“Ling Han!”","Cutting at empty air.","...","A considerable number of people couldn’t help but laugh. This scene was indeed quite hilarious, but top-notch prodigies such as Chi Menghan and the others didn’t smile at all. They only felt a deep wariness towards Ling Han’s strength.","That was a True Self Tier assassin, and he was actually being toyed around with by Ling Han. This was practically a freak.","However, what they didn’t know was that Ling Han also felt very regretful. Being trapped in an illusion didn’t mean that he had lost consciousness. When he was attacked, he would still instinctively counterattack. Thus, even if Ling Han attacked, it would only be a waste of energy.","The higher one’s cultivation level, the more difficult it would be to win with a disadvantage in cultivation level. Even a disadvantage of a minor level was extremely difficult, let alone a diadvantage of a major tier.","However, those who could advance into the True Self Tier definitely had very high natural talent in martial arts, so the assassin’s resistance to illusions was also getting stronger and stronger. At the beginning, the illusion was enough to trap him for about half a minute, but now, one or two seconds was already the limit.","“Ling Han, you’re definitely going to die today!” the assassin said balefully. He already knew how to deal with the illusion.","It couldn’t be helped. After all, there was a gap of a major tier between their cultivation levels. It was already quite impressive that Ling Han was able to affect him, and if their cultivation levels were equal, Ling Han could even use an illusion to trap his opponent until he died of old age.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “I’m afraid you won’t be able to!”","“You, a mere Core Formation Tier cultivator, and I have already broken through your illusion technique, so how are you going to stop me?” That assassin walked towards Ling Han, step by step. The tip of his sword was lowered, and killing intent surged out, drawing an obvious mark on the ground.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “You’re dreaming!”","“Haha, die!” The assassin pounced over. He became one with his sword, and he was like a fleeting swan.","However, a large hand suddenly swatted over. Peng, that assassin was pressed into the ground. Then, that large hand turned into drifting energy that returned to the heaven and earth, and the assassin had already been smashed into mush of blood.","Hiss!","Which elite had made a move?","Weng, everyone felt a frightening pressure assault them, and saw that those Saints that had disappeared, Venerate Tiers, and Sect Masters had all returned.","The Nine Mountains Venerate also appeared beside Ling Han. He was the one who had struck Battle God Palace’s assassin to death.","What a joke. He had already considered Ling Han as his personal disciple, and had placed his hopes on him becoming an Emperor. How could he allow others to assassinate him?","“Senior, did you gain anything?” Ling Han asked.","The Nine Mountains Venerate nodded, and smiled. “I’ve gained quite a lot.”","Ling Han retrieved a Spatial Tool and handed it over, saying, “This is a small token from this disciple.”","The Nine Mountains Venerate couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. This disciple of his actually gave him something. Hehe, it had only ever been an elder giving something to a junior. Now that it was him, why was it the other way around?","However, he didn’t mind this. After receiving the Spatial Spirit Tool, he swept his divine sense over it and was astonished.","This was a Dao Stone, and one that had been refined by a Great Emperor at that!","This time, he was excited. At his cultivation level, it was already extremely difficult to take another step forward. Previously, he had observed the Regulations of heaven and earth in the Blood Palace, which gave him a feeling of appreciation. If he could strike while the iron was hot, and comprehend with the Dao Stone of a Great Emperor, the possibility of taking another step forward would be extremely high.","However, after only a single thought, the Nine Mountains Venerate returned the Spatial Spirit Tool to Ling Han, and said, “You have boundless future prospects. These Dao Stones will be left for you to use when you attempt to break through to the Saint Path in future.”","In comparison, he valued Ling Han’s future more.","Ling Han smiled, and pushed the Spatial Spirit Tool back towards him, “Senior, you need more than I do. Furthermore, if you take another step further, or even become a Saint in fact, then wouldn’t my backer be even more reliable?”","The Nine Mountains Venerate faltered upon seeing Ling Han’s serious expression. He couldn’t help but laugh loudly and put away the Spirit Tool. “Alright, I’ll be your backer in the","future!”","He naturally liked Ling Han even more.","Ling Han, on the other hand, did not feel the slightest heartache. He was filled with confidence in himself, and believed that he would be able to comprehend the Regulations of heaven and earth without depending on this kind of external object. Furthermore, comprehending the Dao Stones refined by a Great Emperor would definitely affect him. For those who were determined to break through to the Imperial Path, this was actually disadvantageous.","-Part of the reason why the Imperial Clans could not produce a second Great Emperor was because they were too deeply influenced by their own clan’s Great Emperor, so how could they possibly walk their own path?","On the other side, Liu Kaij and Liu Yiming were also making complaints, but when the Shattering Stars Saint heard this, he only warned the two of them. As members of the Imperial Clan, this was indeed an incredibly glorious matter, but if they only used their power to bully others, that would be embarrassing the Imperial Clan.","It had to be admitted that those that could become Saints did indeed have a great bearing. Of course, it was also possible that Saints could not bring themselves to bully a mere Core Formation Tier cultivator.","At the very least, Shattering Stars Saint hadn’t attacked Ling Han yet.","All the juniors related the current situation, and this caused the three Saints to feel curious.","They were very proud. What place in this world could imprison them?","It should be known that they still had an Imperial Weapon on them!","Thus, the three Saints each grabbed their own juniors, and with a flash, they had already","begun to cross the ocean.","They were Saints, how awesome!","“Senior, would you like to try as well?” Ling Han asked.","The Nine Mountains Venerate shook his head. He kept staring at the surface of the sea, and after a while, he said, “There are astonishing Regulations in this seawater and on the surface of the sea, and they are intertwined. I can resist them, but it won’t last long, and this will corrode my flesh and blood completely.”","In other words, even if a Venerate Tier crossed the sea bravely, it was very likely that he would","die midway.","This was the power of a Great Emperor. Even though he had been dead for heaven knows how many years, even Venerate Tier elites had to respect him.","Then what could they do? Just go back like this?","“Come, let’s go take a look at that pile of bones,” the Nine Mountains Venerate suddenly said.","Previously, Ling Han had mentioned this to him .","“All right.” Ling Han naturally would not object.","The two of them soon arrived at the pile of skulls. The Nine Mountains Venerate swept an eye","over it, then turned to Ling Han and said, “Are you brave?”","“Quite so, I should think.”","“That’s good.”","The Nine Mountains Venerate moved, and began to dismantle this pile of skulls. Then, he","turned these skulls into a raft.","No way, you want to use this to cross the sea?","The Nine Mountains Venerate seemed to have seen through his confusion, and said, “According to my deductions, the bones should be immune to the corrosion of Regulations, so it wouldn’t hurt to give it a try.”"]},{"number":4085,"title":"Chapter 4085: Floating Corpse","paragraphs":["Chapter 4085: Floating Corpse","It wasn’t just the Nine Mountains Venerate, but also other Venerable Tier elites who were harvesting skulls to build rafts.","Being able to become a Venerate Tier elite, they indeed had amazing insight.","The Nine Mountains Venerate brought the bone raft to the coast, and said with a smile, “Come on.”","“Senior, take it easy.” Ling Han gritted his teeth. This looked a little unreliable.","“Haha, as long as I’m still breathing, I guarantee that not a single hair on your head would be hurt,” the Nine Mountains Venerate said with a smile. He grabbed Ling Han and threw a palm strike. A terrifying power surged, immediately pushing the bone raft into the depths of the","sea.","The bone raft rode the winds and waves, its speed astonishingly fast.","However, the sea wasn’t calm and without waves, especially when the bone raft was advancing at high speed, creating waves that crashed over. However, these waves were all neutralized by the Nine Mountains Venerate.","After walking for a while, the Nine Mountains Venerate stopped steering the ship. Because he was continuously dispersing the impact of the waves, he was also slightly strained. Though he still had a lot of energy left, who knew what other dangers lay here? It was naturally impossible that he would use up all his power.","After resting for a while, they saw another bone raft row over from behind them. There were a total of three people on this raft. One was a Venerate Tier elite, while the other two were young men.","“Nine Mountains, you are really outrageously bold. You actually dare to enter into the West Heavenly Realm!” that Venerate Tier said. There was no anger or joy on his face, and it was unknown what kind of attitude he had.","The Nine Mountains Venerate smiled faintly, and said, “What is it? Is the West Heavenly Realm the Underworld or Hell? Can’t I come?”","“When we get out, let’s fight,” the Venerate Tier elite said.","“All right.” The Nine Mountains Venerate was completely unafraid.","“Now, should we join forces?” the Venerate Tier elite suddenly said with a smile.","The Nine Mountains Venerate raised a brow, and said, “Deal.”","The two Venerate Tier elites both needed to rest. They were too strong, and could extract the energy of heaven and earth at any time. There was absolutely no need for them to wait until the sun rose.","“Brother Ling, let’s get to know each other. I am Ning Yanghao, and this is my clansman, Ning Bian.” A young man clasped his hands in Ling Han’s direction, his expression very modest.","Ling Han also clasped his hands in greeting, “Greetings, Brother Ning.”","However, Ning Bian was much more arrogant. He merely raised a brow, then said, “I’ve heard others speak of you in such a grand manner, but you’re only in the late stage of the Core Formation Tier. I really don’t know why those rumors are so exaggerated.”","It was clear that he had not seen the scene of Ling Han defeating Shi Yongming, Liu Kaiji and Liu Yiming on the beach. Otherwise, no matter how high his opinion of himself was, he would not dare to say such flippant words.","Ling Han merely smiled. There was nothing to be concerned about this kind of young brat.","Of course, he was also unwilling to destroy the alliance that had just been formed between two Venerate Tier elites. Otherwise, no matter what, he would have to teach this brat who had an exaggerated opinion of his own abilities a lesson.","“Brother Ling, please don’t be angered. This clan brother of mine rarely goes out, so he is a little rash.” Ning Yanghao played mediator.","“Brother Hao!” Ning Bian was still defiant.","“It’s fine. He’s just a child.” Ling Han waved his hand casually.","This infuriated Ning Bian, and also made Ning Yanghao grit his teeth. ‘You still say it’s all right? You didn’t show any mercy with your words either.’","“Yi?” Ling Han suddenly shuddered, and looked into the distance. Using his eye technique, he saw something floating.","Ning Yanghao and Ning Bian also looked over, but they didn’t have eye techniques, so they naturally couldn’t see anything.","Ning Bian humphed, “Stop pretending!”","Ning Yanghao was also slightly surprised. He believed that Ling Han was not that kind of person, but he had indeed not seen anything.","What was going on?","After a while, he also let out a surprised exclamation, and suddenly stood up.","“Brother Hao, what’s wrong?” Ning Bian asked. After being rebuked by Ling Han, and thought that he had been tricked, so at this moment, he was extremely displeased.","“See for yourself,” Ning Yanghao said darkly.","Ning Bian looked in the direction he was pointing, and couldn’t help but reveal a shocked expression.","That was... a corpse!","He couldn’t help but feel shocked. There was a terrifying power of Regulations in the seawater, and even Venerate Tier elites would be corroded. Otherwise, why would they have used bones to make rafts? But now, there was a corpse that was moving with the waves, its physical body uncorroded. How could this not be terrifying?","Xiu, the Nine Mountains Venerate and the Heavenly Venerable Tier both stood up, their expressions stern.","“To be able to keep his physical body from decaying, there must be endless Regulations interwoven within his body,” the Nine Mountains Venerate said.","The Heavenly Martial Venerate nodded, “Regulations intertwine with the physical body, this is-”","“Saint!” the two Venerate Tier elites exclaimed at the same time.","Hearing the word “Saint”, Ling Han and the other juniors all felt their hearts skip a beat. Throughout history, there would always be lapses in Ancestral Kings. For example, in the current era, Saints were the strongest in the world, and even Imperial Clans would treat them as esteemed guests.","But now, the corpse of a Saint had been thrown into the sea, so how could they not be","shocked?","“When an Emperor descends into the world, even Saints are like ants!” Nine Mountains Venerate exclaimed.","The Heavenly Martial Venerate was also in a complicated state of mind, filled with a feeling of loneliness and dejection.","Both of them had set becoming Saints as their lifelong goal. Thus, seeing a Saint’s corpse thrown into the sea naturally caused endless feelings to rise up in their hearts.","So what if he was as strong as a Saint? In front of a Great Emperor, he was nothing but trash.","Right at this moment, a terrifying aura assaulted him. It was like a supreme God Tool,","piercing the skin painfully.","Ning Yanghao and Ning Bian immediately couldn’t bear it, and blood oozed from their skin,","presenting a horrible sight.","“Not good, saintly might!”","The two Venerate Tier elites hurriedly steered the rafts to dodge, retreating into the distance. Only then did that terrifying aura disappear.","Ning Bian glanced at Ling Han, and could not help but feel dissatisfied, because both he and Ning Yanghao were covered with blood, and looked extremely disheveled. However, Ling Han was completely unscathed. Merely with this comparison, it was clear who was superior among","them.","And it should be known that the two of them were both at the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier, which was a minor level higher than Ling Han.","“Nine Mountains, your Nine Suns Holy Land has really picked up a treasure!” The Heavenly Martial Venerate looked at Ling Han with undisguised envy.","“Haha!” The Nine Mountains Venerate laughed loudly, his expression incredibly smug.","He might not be able to become a Saint in this lifetime, but Ling Han would definitely be able","to. In fact... there was still hope for him to become an Emperor.","Becoming an Emperor... Just the thought of it made him incredibly excited. That was the ultimate elite of the universe, capable of suppressing an era, leaving behind an eternal name that would be praised for eternity.","“Yi, why has the Saint’s corpse floated over again?” The Nine Mountains Venerate suddenly","frowned. They had steered the rafts away, and did not move with the waves. Instead, they headed in a sideways direction. Thus, if that Saint’s corpse was drifting with the waves, they should have been separated.","“Strange!” The Heavenly Martial Venerate nodded, his expression slightly serious.","“Let’s go!”","The Nine Mountains Venerate continued to steer the raft. After all, it was a Saint’s corpse. If it","really turned into a zombie or something, it would definitely be incredibly terrifying, so it","was best to stay as far away from it as possible.","The Heavenly Martial Venerate nodded, and hurriedly steered the bone raft as well, floating alongside the Nine Mountains Venerate.","Ling Han turned around, only to see that the Saint’s corpse was rapidly disappearing into the distance. It wasn’t long before it disappeared from his sight.","The five of them soon forgot about this matter. After travelling for another half a day, they","stopped to rest.","Ling Han was bored, and looked around. All of a sudden, his expression changed, and he blurted out, “Not good, that Saint’s corpse has floated over again!”"]},{"number":4086,"title":"Chapter 4086: Blood Lotus Pond","paragraphs":["Chapter 4086: Blood Lotus Pond","In the distance, a corpse floated over at an unhurried pace.","Wasn’t this the Saint’s corpse that he had previously seen?","He was dressed in robes, completely purple-red in colour, and wore a purple-gold crown on his head. These were obviously all treasures, and there was not the slightest sign of decay.","However, this Saint’s corpse wasn’t floating very fast, and it was far from being able to compare to the speed at which the two Venerate Tier elites were rowing the rafts. Yet, it had actually caught up to them after only a moment. This was naturally terrifying.","Strange!","The Heavenly Martial Venerate opened his eyes, and looked towards the Nine Mountains Venerate. There was a questioning look in his eyes.","“We have to recover power, or we might encounter even greater danger,” the Nine Mountains Venerate muttered to himself.","The Heavenly Martial Venerate nodded in understanding. If they expended too much of their power, then in such a strange sea of blood, they could possibly encounter even more danger. The Saint’s corpse floated closer and closer, and that terrifying aura came again.","Ling Han and the others hurriedly steered the rafts as well. Their power was insufficient, so the speed of the bone raft was naturally not too fast either. Thankfully, the Saint’s corpse was not moving very fast either, and just followed behind them at a leisurely pace.","Though they had not been caught up, the expressions of the three young men were a little ugly.","Being pursued by a corpse, just the thought of it was enough to make one’s scalp go numb. What in the world was going on?","“Yi, there’s an island ahead!” Ling Han’s eyes were sharp, and he looked into the distance. “Row over,” the Nine Mountains Venerate immediately said.","“All right!” Ling Han steered the bone raft and headed towards that island.","The Ning brothers naturally moved as well, steering the bone raft to follow.","Behind them, that Saintl’s corpse was also chasing closely, as if it had eyes of its own, completely ignoring the movement of the ocean currents.","In a short while, the island in front of them appeared. It was not very big, and its greatest length was only 2.5 km.","But for the five of them, having a firm foothold and a place to rest was already enough.","They docked and landed on the island. The two Venerate Tier elites moved one after another, and grabbed the bone rafts from the sea. If they were washed away by the seawater, or destroyed by the Saint’s corpse, it was really possible that they would not be able to return.","This small island was very desolate. It was just a field of rocks, but there was a pool in the centre of the island.","“Yi, there’s a Great Herb!” The Nine Mountains Venerate and the Heavenly Martial Venerate said at the same time.","They arrived at the side of the pool, and saw that there was presently a blood-coloured lotus flower growing in the pool. Additionally, the lotus flower had long since borne seeds, forming a blood-coloured lotus pod, covered with light silver veined patterns.","“Haha!” The Nine Mountains Venerate immediately laughed loudly, “Brat, your luck is not too bad. These lotus seeds contain Regulations, and its grade is definitely not low. This is just in time to add a new veined pattern to your Celestial Core!”","“Wait!” The Heavenly Martial Venerate hurriedly stretched out a hand, “Nine Mountains, have you forgotten that I still exist?”","“What is it? You want to compete with a junior for this kind of treasured medicine?” Nine Mountains Venerate’s expression was filled with disdain.","The Heavenly Martial Venerate humphed, “I don’t need it. But don’t I have any juniors?”","“These two people are already at the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier. Don’t tell me what they incribed previously on their Celestial Cores corresponds to the Regulations of the Blood Lotus. Eating these lotus seeds can help them complete the Regulations.” The Nine Mountains Venerate mocked.","“Yi, how did you guess?” The Heavenly Martial Venerate pretended to be surprised.","F***, you are really too shameless, aren’t you?","The Nine Mountains Venerate thought for a moment, and said, “If we fight, we’ll need at least a few days to decide the victor. Moreover, this place is extremely strange, and unpredictable dangers might appear at any time.”","“Therefore, why don’t we let these three juniors fight over it?”","When the Heavenly Martial Venerate heard this, he hesitated slightly.","Ling Han was only at the late stage of the Core Formation Tier, while Ning Yanghao and Ning Bian were at the consummate level of the Core Formation Tier. There was a gap of a minor level between them, and this was an irreversible gap for top-notch prodigies. Thus, no matter how one looked at it, Ling Han had no chance of winning.","However, since there was no chance of victory, why had the Nine Mountains Venerate brought it up?","He was no idiot!","“Okay!” Ning Bian interrupted. He stared at Ling Han. Young people were hot-tempered, and he was really too defiant. What right did Ling Han have to make such a great name for","himself?","-Though he had already witnessed how extraordinary Ling Han was previously.","When it came to background, the Ning Clan had descended from a Saint. They were both members of the Holy Land, and the style of a clan was completely different from the style of a sect. Since childhood, he had been ingested with various natural treasures, and had cultivated a top-grade cultivation technique. How could this be compared to a person who had no solid foundation?","Moreover, he also had an advantage in terms of cultivation level.","“All right.” The Heavenly Martial Venerate nodded. Indeed, he couldn’t think of any reason to lose, so he agreed, “For the sake of fairness, all Celestial Tools are forbidden from being","used.”","Fair your head!","The Nine Mountains Venerate didn’t expose that. He had too much confidence in Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled, stepped out, and said, “Brothers Ning, the two of you can attack together.”","This... how arrogant!","Ning Bian was infuriated. Pointing at Ling Han, he said, “I’ll immediately let you know the consequences of being arrogant!”","He pounced, and delivered a palm strike at Ling Han. Shua, golden light blazed, turning into a","sharp sword.","Ling Han replied with a punch. Peng, this golden sword was instantly shattered, and the power of the punch did not decrease, continuing to blast towards Ning Bian.","What!","Ning Bian was astonished. In his eyes, Ling Han was only at the late stage of the Core Formation Tier. His power could only reach 20 Heavens at most, yet upon contact, he discovered that Ling Han’s power was actually as high as 28 Heavens!","This was too terrifying. It should be known that his power was only 22 Heavens. Even if he channelled the Saint Technique, his battle prowess would only increase another two Heavens, far from being Ling Han’s match.","Peng!","He was sent flying by Ling Han’s punch. Thankfully, Ling Han withdrew his power when he hit him. Otherwise, with this blow, Ning Bian would be finished.","Of course, the Heavenly Martial Venerate was just standing at the sidelines, so how could he possibly watch helplessly as his junior was killed? He would definitely move to stop him, so Ling Han simply withdrew the power of his own accord.","Ning Bian’s face alternated between red and white. At this moment, no matter how stubborn he was, he had to admit that there was a gap between him and Ling Han, and it was not small","either.","“Nine Mountains, I’m really jealous this time.” The Heavenly Martial Venerate looked at Ling Han. Previously, though he had a high opinion of this young man, he now discovered that this young man’s freakishness far exceeded his imagination.","The Nine Mountains Venerate smiled as he stroked his beard. At this moment, he only needed","to smile reservedly.","A thought flashed through the Heavenly Martial Venerate’s mind, and he said to Ling Han smilingly, “Young man, have you married?”","Yi, what kind of imagination was this? His imagination was running too fast, wasn’t it?","Ling Han nodded, “I already have a wife.”","The Heavenly Martial Venerate couldn’t help but sigh. Such an outstanding young man, it would be great if he could take him as a son-in-law of the Ning Clan. Unfortunately, Ling Han was already married, and the Ning Clan was a noble Holy Land, so how could they possibly allow their noble daughter to serve the same husband as another woman?","The Nine Mountains Venerate moved and plucked the lotus seed pod. As for the lotus, the Heavenly Martial Venerate had plucked it. Although it hadn’t ripened yet, it would still have","some effect. It was better than wasting it.","They searched around the island again, but did not find anything else.","Just as they were about to leave, they saw the Saint’s corpse float over from the sea again. It was as if it were guarding them."]},{"number":4087,"title":"Chapter 4087: Blood Wave","paragraphs":["Chapter 4087: Blood Wave","“Let’s go,” the Nine Mountains Venerate said solemnly.","The two Venerate Tier elites tossed out their bone rafts, then set out, quickly leaving this small island.","After travelling far away, the Saint’s corpse floated over unhurriedly again. It was really like a lingering ghost.","They all ignored him. At least until now, this Saint’s corpse had only been following them, and had not harmed them.","Even the two Venerate Tier elites needed to rest, but with their strength, who knew how far they could travel in a single day. However, this great sea was terrifyingly huge. They travelled for a whole three days, yet still had not managed to cross this great sea.","However, the weather on the seas suddenly changed. Multiple arcs of blood-red lightning flashed, and their might caused even the expressions of the two Venerate Tier elites to change. That was because this had reached Saint Tier, and even Saint Tier elites would have to go all out. Otherwise, it was possible that they would die.","Thankfully, the blood-coloured lightning was far away in the distance, and did not strike","over.","A rain of blood began to fall from the skies. This did not have any corrosive effects, but had a very strong negative effect on the mentality, and gave rise to endless despondent thoughts. Ling Han was still fine. The quality of the Primal Chaos Celestial Core was too high, allowing him to suppress such negative emotions. However, Ning Yanghao and Ning Bian couldn’t hold on any longer. They were in a daze, and almost threw themselves into the sea to commit suicide. Thankfully, the Heavenly Martial Venerate was there, and the two of them were directly knocked unconscious.","Seeing that Ling Han was still calm and composed, the Heavenly Martial Venerate’s love for talent grew even stronger. Too bad, why had Ling Han already married? Otherwise, with such a good son-in-law, it was a sure bet that a Saint would emerge from the Ning Clan in future.","After walking for another day, not only was there a shower of blood, but a strong wind was also blowing on the sea.","This was no ordinary wind. It could be seen that there were seals of Regulations flickering in the air. If one was scraped by this kind of wind, it was guaranteed that he would be torn into pieces.","The two Venerate Tier elites didn’t dare to be careless. They placed the two bone rafts so that they were side by side. One Venerate Tier elite focused on steering the rafts, while the other raised a shield to resist the terrifying winds of Regulation.","This was like a great battle. The opponent was equivalent to Sect Master-level. Originally, he should not have been able to withstand a single blow, but there was no end to it. This was even more powerful. With several hundred, tens of thousands, or even tens of thousands of Sect Masters battling in turns, even Venerate Tier elites would have to be careful.","At this kind of time, Ling Han wasn’t even qualified to interfere, and could only watch from the sidelines.","However, since he had nothing to do, he took out the lotus seed pod, peeled out a lotus seed, and began to eat.","Others would definitely be filled with shock and fear at this moment. Even if it was a top- grade prodigy, he would like he was facing a great enemy, so how could he still have the mood to refine the Great Herb and extract the Regulations? However, Ling Han was no ordinary person. The more he was in such a situation, the calmer and more composed he was.","The Heavenly Martial Venerate saw this, and felt even more regretful. He secretly decided that in future, he would have Ning Haoyang and Ning Bian become closer to Ling Han. He would not be able to get a live-in son-in-law, but at least they could get a friend.","According to Nine Mountains Venerate, this lotus seed contained the secrets of Regulations, and was the most suitable for Ling Han to consume now. He could extract the heaven and earth’s Regulations from it, and transform it into veined patterns for the Celestial Core. After eating the lotus seeds, the taste could not be considered delicious. Ling Han spoke from the perspective of a professional glutton.","Not long after, a mysterious power rose up in his mind, turning into pieces of seals.","This was Regulations, but Ling Han couldn’t understand them, and could only think of them as complicated seals.","He extracted these shards, and attempted to combine them. Only by forming a complete seal would he be able to analyze a useful seal, and that was the Regulations of heaven and earth, which could be inscribed on the Celestial Core.","Of course, he had to confirm the level of this Regulations first. If it was too weak, he didn’t want it.","The Celestial Core was only so big, so how could it allow a piece of trash-level Regulations to waste its space?","Kuang, a clap of thunder rang out, waking Ling Han from his comprehension.","In the skies, blood-coloured lightning flashed unhindered in the distance, and the wind and rain became heavier in an instant. This gave the two Venerate Tiers immense pressure, and they both became extremely alert, not daring to be the slightest bit careless.","“Nine Mountains!” The Heavenly Martial Venerate suddenly called out, his voice trembling slightly.","What kind of world had a Venerate Tier not seen? His voice was actually trembling?","The Nine Mountains Venerate was originally focused on resisting the wind and rain, and when he heard this, he turned to look sideways. He couldn’t help but reveal an astounded expression, and saw that there was a blood-coloured massive wave rolling over from the distance, and this massive wave was actually as tall as three thousand meters.","He swept an eye over it, and shook his head. This massive wave was extraordinarily huge, and there was no boundary to either side of it. There was no way to circle around it at all.","“We have to take it head-on!” he said.","The speed of this massive wave was too fast. With their present speed, they would be caught up. Thus, they had to face this massive wave head-on.","The Heavenly Martial Venerate nodded. He took out a jade cauldron, and floated it above his head. Then, it rapidly enlarged, just enough to completely shield the bone rafts.","Weng, multiple streaks of light descended. This was manifested from Regulations, and could be considered the strongest guardian in this world.","This was the Spirit Tool that he had cultivated with his life.","Now that it was a matter of life and death, Ling Han naturally had no intention of hiding his strength. He prepared to take out the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and hand it over to the Nine Mountains Venerate.","Though this was not a real Imperial Weapon, the Origin Gold itself possessed great might. When used in the hands of a Venerate Tier elite, its might should be stronger than an ordinary","Saint Tool.","However, the Nine Mountains Venerate had already summoned the Saint Tool, the Nine Suns Parasol. After endless power was poured into it this precious tool quickly revived. A saintly might spread out, but it didn’t target the people on the bone rafts.","Not far away, the blood-colored wave was already approaching. It could be seen that the wave was densely covered with seals. In fact, it had even turned into multiple divine chains.","“Get ready!” The Nine Mountains Venerate roared. The Nine Suns Parasol unleashed its full might, blasting towards that massive wave.","Peng!","The Saint Tool unleashed its might, shooting out a pillar of light.","After this attack, a hole was blasted into the massive wave, which was about 30 meters in","diameter.","“Pass through!”","“All right!”","The Heavenly Martial Venerate steered the bone rafts and rushed through the bloody hole. The waves crashed rapidly, their speed astonishingly fast. Thankfully, it was a Venerate Tier that was steering the raft. Whether it was in terms of power or ability to adapt, he was top- notch in the world, and managed to pass through the bloody hole without any mishaps. The strange thing was that it was calm on this side. There was no wind or rain in the sky at all. If it was not for the fact that they could still see that massive wave rapidly leaving when they turned around, who would believe all that was happening in front of their eyes? However, they had finally left the danger zone. The two Venerate Tier elites and Ling Han all breathed a sigh of relief. The situation just now was truly dangerous. Even the Venerate Tier elites were on edge.","The Heavenly Martial Venerate woke Ning Yanghao and Ning Bian up. There was no more blood rain by now, so there was no need for them to continue lying down.","“Yi, what’s that in front of us?” the Heavenly Martial Venerate asked.","The Nine Mountains Venerate looked over, and he couldn’t see clearly either.","The two Venerate Tier elites couldn’t even see clearly, let alone Ling Han, who couldn’t see","anything even after activating his eye technique.","“Hiss!” All of a sudden, the two Venerate Tier elites inhaled sharply."]},{"number":4088,"title":"Chapter 4088: Hole","paragraphs":["Chapter 4088: Hole","F***, what the hell was going on?","Ling Han’s heart was filled with curiosity. Something that could cause the expressions of two Venerate Tier elites to change drastically, what great matter had happened?","Ning Yanghao and Ning Bian had not experienced the massive waves previously, so the two of them were at a loss and confused.","“Should we go and take a look?” the Nine Mountains Venerate asked the Heavenly Martial Venerate.","“Alright.” The Heavenly Martial Venerate pondered for a moment before nodding.","The two Venerate Tier elites steered the bone rafts forward.","Ling Han calmed down slightly. Since the two Venerate Tier elites had actively charged over, it meant that the situation wasn’t serious. At the very least, it wasn’t as dangerous as being attacked by massive waves.","“Yi?”","After walking for a while, Ling Han suddenly discovered that the originally calm seawater had begun to flow, and looking around, the strange thing was that all the seawater was surging in one direction.","This was a little inconceivable. Unless a large hole had appeared in the sea, it was possible that all the seawater would be drawn in that direction.","Hehe, a hole had appeared in the ocean; this was really too funny.","Ling Han was just mocking himself, when his expression froze.","If that was not the case, how could the expressions of the two Venerate Tier elites change drastically?","No way, a hole would appear in this sea of blood?","After walking for a while longer, the surging of the seawater became faster and faster. After walking for a while longer, loud splashing sounds could already be heard.","Ling Han activated his eye technique and looked forward. A look of astonishment instantly spread across his face.","Ahead of them, a massive hole had really appeared in the sea, forming a circular waterfall. Boundless seawater crashed down, creating a colossal noise.","Heavens!","“Look!” The Heavenly Martial Venerate pointed ahead.","The Nine Mountains Venerate immediately looked over, and Ling Han also looked over. With the channeling of his eye technique, his eyesight far surpassed the eyes of ordinary Core Formation Tiers.","They saw that there were actually multiple corpses in the seawater that had rushed into that massive hole!","They were whole corpses, and had not been corroded into bones.","It should be known that only a Saint would be able to maintain the integrity of his physical body in this kind of seawater – whether he was alive or dead.","In other words, these were the corpses of Saints!","This was terrifying. Just how many Saints were there?","“Saints died, these are the deaths of Saints!” the Nine Mountains Venerate muttered. He had really been shocked.","The Heavenly Martial Venerate wasn’t much better off. Only these Venerate Tier elites knew that the Saint Tier definitely wasn’t superior to the Venerate Tier by a whole level of cultivation. This kind of literal strength was actually an earth-shattering change.","In front of a Saint, even Venerate Tiers were like ants.","Theoretically speaking, there should only be a pitifully small number of Saints in the universe. In fact, even a galaxy could barely produce a single Saint. Thus, how many Saints could there be in the universe?","Alright, even if every Imperial Clan had two Saints, taking into account the Saints of the other forces, there would only be over a hundred of them in total. At most, it would not exceed two hundred.","But in this place? Every minute or so, there would be a few Saint corpses that had been washed into the hole.","Just how terrifying was this number?","Meanwhile, Ling Han and the others were completely ignorant. They only knew that Saints were powerful, and there were very few of them. However, they were completely unclear about how powerful they were, and how rare they were.","Thus, though they were also stunned for a moment, they were not as shaken as the two Venerate Tier elites.","Behind them, the Saint’s corpse also floated over. Drawn by the water flow, it directly floated towards the hole ahead of them, sliding down and disappearing without a trace.","Now that there was no Saint’s corpse following behind them, they should have breathed a sigh of relief, but in this strange place, the five of them felt even more anxious.","“Let’s go,” the Nine Mountains Venerate said. There was nothing much to see here. Although the Saint corpses descended one after another, and the scene was filled with impact, it would naturally become boring after watching for a long time.","The Heavenly Martial Venerate nodded. The two great Venerate Tier elites controlled the bone rafts to go against the flow. With their power as Venerate Tier elites, they were naturally capable of resisting this kind of oceanic current. Very soon, the hole in the ocean was far away from them.","The five of them did not speak. Seeing so many Saint corpses all of a sudden, they were still in a state of shock, and it was very difficult for them to immediately come back to their senses.","Ling Han also thought of the Black Heaven Temple. That was also because Saints had died all over the place, but compared with the number of Saints here, it was like an amateur watching","an expert.","Was there no record of such Saints dying in history?","Ling Han thought back to what Chi Menghan had said. There would always be gaps in history from time to time. Even the truth of events tens of millions of years ago might not be","deduced.","True, the Great Emperor only had a lifespan of ten million years, so what was so strange about some things being annihilated in history?","The two bone rafts rode the winds and waves, and another few days passed. That annoying wave rose again, causing the two Venerate Tier elites to once again be on tenterhooks. Thankfully, that massive wave that was three thousand meters tall did not appear.","Most importantly, they had lost their way now. There was no difference between day and night here. The sky would always be blood-red, so it was extremely difficult to determine","their location.","Originally, the Venerate Tier elites should have a very good sense of direction. Even if there was no reference material, it was fine. However, the environment here was unique, and it was extremely easy to affect one’s mind. Even the Venerate Tier elites were no exception. At least, in terms of direction, they were already dumbfounded.","Just like that, they floated on the sea for many days. The five of them were already a little numb, and did not know when such days would end.","Ling Han was still fine. He had already finished eating all the blood lotus seeds, and there were innumerable shards in his mind. He was reconstructing them every day, so there was not much time left for him. That was because if he did not combine them into seals and brand them on the Celestial Core, they would dissipate not too long after.","Thus, he would sit cross-legged on the bone raft every day, and concentrate on cultivating. This caused the Heavenly Martial Venerate to nod repeatedly as he watched. Being able to calmly cultivate under such conditions, how could Ling Han not be freakish?","Ling Han’s body trembled slightly. By now, he had finally completely comprehended the heaven and earth Regulations contained within the blood lotus, turning it into an incredibly complicated seal. With a slight tremor, it seemed capable of shattering the heavens.","A murderous aura circulated, causing his eyes to instantly become bloodshot. In fact, even his hair was vaguely showing a hint of red.","So terrifying!","Ling Han was very pleased. The level of Regulations should not be inferior to Heavenly Dao","Flames and the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning.","It could be branded.","He inscribed this seal on the Celestial Core, and discovered that this was another incomplete blood-coloured seal. It was clearly not very big, but it occupied a very large space.","This was natural, aside from the complete Primal Chaos Divine Lightning that he had coincidentally obtained, with his current cultivation level, how could he possibly grasp the","complete top tier Regulations?","However, the Heavenly Dao Flames, developed to the pinnacle, could even soften Origin Gold.","It could be claimed to be the strongest flame in the world, and it would not be an exaggeration to call it the Imperial Flame. Then, going by the same logic, the Primal Chaos Divine Lightning and the blood-coloured seal were all Great Emperor-level.","However, the Destructive Energy was actually a level higher- judging from the size of the","area it had reserved, this was terrifying. Was there anything in this world that was stronger","than Emperor Tier?","Or could it be that there were actually differences in strength among Great Emperors as well?","It was just that there was no comparison, so it was impossible to determine who was","stronger?","“Mainland! We can finally see mainland!” It was at this moment that the two Venerate Tier elites exclaimed in excitement."]},{"number":4089,"title":"Chapter 4089: Giant Island","paragraphs":["Chapter 4089: Giant Island","A piece of mainland finally appeared ahead of them.","Including the two Venerate Tier elites, the five of them were all very excited. They had either returned to their starting point in a daze, or had already crossed the great sea. No matter","what, it was better than being trapped on the great sea.","“No!” The Nine Mountains Venerate suddenly said, “This isn’t mainland, but a large island.”","What!","Ning Yanghao and Ning Bian were both stunned. No way, the two of them couldn’t see the edge of this island even with their full vision. What kind of island was this? It was ridiculously huge, wasn’t it?","Ling Han activated his eye technique and looked into the distance at the coastline. Only then did he catch sight of the edge of the land.","Indeed, this was an island and not a mainland, but it was incredibly huge.","“No matter what, we’ve finally arrived at a new place. Let’s look around. Who knows, there might be a great secret here,” Heavenly Martial Venerate said.","The remaining four nodded. It was unknown which Ancestral King had built this, but since it involved an Ancestral King, there must be a great secret.","The five of them landed on the shore, and stowed away the bone rafts. They still needed to use it when they returned, and then began searching on this colossal island.","This island was the same colour as the sea. It was blood-red in colour, and there was blood- coloured mist wafting in the air, which greatly affected vision.","“Hmm?”","The two Venerate Tier elites showed vigilant expressions at the same time. They stopped in their tracks, as if they were facing a great enemy.","Mist filled the air, and nothing could be seen.","After waiting for a while, the two Venerate Tier elites advanced in unison, but their footsteps were extremely slow. In an instant, Ling Han immediately felt a powerful aura assault him, causing all the hairs on his body to stand on end.","There was a supreme elite ahead of them!","No wonder the two Venerate Tier elites looked on guard. The fog here was dense, and it greatly affected vision and divine sense. Who would dare to mess around?","It should be known that they had seen who knew how many Saint corpses in the last few days, so how could even a Venerate Tier dare to be careless?","Who would want a lifetime of hard cultivation to result in nothing?","A figure gradually appeared ahead of them.","“Primary Constant!”","“Nine Mountains! Heavenly Martial!”","The Nine Mountains Venerate and the Heavenly Martial Venerate called out at the same time, and a voice came from ahead of them. Both sides felt as if a heavy weight had been lifted from their shoulders.","As it turned out, it wasn’t an enemy, but rather another Venerate Tier that had entered this space at the same time they did.","Hu!","Ling Han and the other juniors also relaxed. Both sides walked towards each other. There was only one Venerate Tier elite on the other side, while he had brought three juniors with him.","When they saw Ling Han, the three juniors all looked disgusted-the West Heavenly Realm had always looked down on the North Heavenly Realm, and they couldn’t possibly change their perceptions just because of Ling Han.","On the other hand, the more powerful Ling Han’s performance was, the more he suppressed the West Heavenly Realm so much that they couldn’t even raise their heads. This made them detest him even more.","“Nine Mountains, why aren’t you staying at the Nine Suns Holy Land? Why have you come here?” Primary Constant Venerate asked, a hint of provocation in his voice.","“What can you do about it?” the Nine Mountains Venerate said proudly.","“Nine Mountains, you still dare to be so arrogant after coming all the way to the West Heavenly Realm?” Primary Constant Venerate raised a brow.","The competition and competitiveness among Heavenly Realms was not just limited to the juniors.","“What is it? Do you want to fight?” The Nine Mountains Venerate wasn’t afraid at all.","“When we get out of here, I really want to ask you for some guidance,” Primary Constant Venerate said calmly.","“Then you’ll have to queue up.” The Nine Mountains Venerate laughed loudly as he pointed at Heavenly Martial Venerate.","The Heavenly Martial Venerate laughed loudly, playing mediator, “All right, all right. Now, everyone should work together and explore the island together.”","Primary Constant Venerate nodded. On his way here, he had also seen a great many corpses of Saints, and was naturally filled with wariness of this place. Even Saints would die here, so it was no different for Venerate Tiers like them.","The three Venerable Tier elites teamed up and started to search the large island.","However, the fog here affected even Venerate Tier elites, so they couldn’t see clearly how far ahead they were. Thus, their progress wasn’t fast.","After two days, they didn’t discover anything, but the team expanded considerably, because they encountered several Venerate Tier elites along the way, bringing their juniors to join the","team.","Thankfully, the blood mist only obstructed vision and divine sense, and did not have the ability to confuse others. Thus, everyone did not lose their way. Though the efficiency was not high, they were still steadily searching through the various areas on the island.","The island’s environment had also changed. Previously, it was a flat mountainous area, but gradually, sharp stone pillars protruded. They were incredibly long, as if they were about to pierce through the heavens.","At first, everyone was unconcerned, but as they walked, they discovered that there were actually traces of blood on a pillar, but it had long since dried up.","Yi?","A Venerate Tier elite soared into the sky, and when he landed, there was already a corpse in his","hand.","“Hiss, this is a Venerate Tier elite!” After the Venerate Tier elites examined him, they all","paled in shock.","A mighty Venerate Tier elite was actually stabbed to death on a stone pillar?","They were also Venerate Tiers. If the culprit was still here, would they be spared?","“He’s already been dead for who knows how many years,” the Nine Mountains Venerate said. “The divine essence has all been lost. Otherwise, we should feel pressure when we pass by this","place.”","“En!” Everyone nodded.","“Could it be that it was also the doing of that Ancestral King?” someone asked.","This caused all the Venerate Tier elites to fall silent.","Those who could become a Great Emperor were not only extraordinarily talented, but also broad-minded. This had been developed through being tested by the heaven and earth. Looking at history, which Great Emperor hadn’t suppressed an era, allowing a supreme prosperity to appear in martial arts?","But in this place, there were innumerable Saint corpses, and there were also Venerate Tiers that were slaughtered like animals, hanging on stone pillars. These methods were really too cruel. No matter how they looked at it, it did not seem like the actions of a Great Emperor. The problem was, if it wasn’t a Great Emperor, who would be able to kill so many Saints? “Could it be that it was a Pseudo-Emperor?” a Venerate Tier said with a frown. “That’s not very likely.” His conjecture was immediately denied, “Any Pseudo-Emperor would take that final leap, but once he failed, he would definitely die. Thus, if it is claimed that a Pseudo-Emperor could live for so many years and kill so many Saints, that doesn’t","make sense!”","Indeed, there were really too many Saint corpses here. They did not seem like they belonged","to the same generation at all. No matter what, they had to traverse millions of years, and aside from an Ancestral King, who else could live for so long?","Everyone was scratching their heads in confusion. They couldn’t figure it out no matter what. “We can’t be careless. Let’s continue forward!” the Nine Mountains Venerate said in a solemn","voice.","If this had been set up by an Ancestral King Ancestral King, then even if that Ancestral King had died, the methods that he left behind would be able to easily Venerate Tiers, and it was probable that even Saints would not be spared.","For example, the Heavenly Dao Flames could completely accumulate for millions of years. Once they gushed out, even Saints would be turned into ashes.","They continued onwards. They had not walked too far, when they encountered people again.","This time, it was a Saint.","The Donglin Imperial Clan’s Crystal Saint.","Chi Menghan and Chi Dao were naturally present as well. Chi Menghan was reserved, while Chi Dao came over very warmly to greet Ling Han, causing the other young people to be","dumbfounded.","What was going on here? Was Ling Han planning to leap over the Dragon’s Gate and become the son-in-law of an Imperial Clan?"]},{"number":4090,"title":"Chapter 4090: Red-Haired Beauty","paragraphs":["Chapter 4090: Red-Haired Beauty","The appearance of a Saint in the team naturally calmed everyone’s hearts.","At present, there were no Emperors in the world, and the Crystal Saint also had the Imperial Weapon. Thus, no matter what kind of danger they encountered, the Crystal Saint could resolve it.","Speaking of which, the Crystal Saint really unlucky. Though his speed was faster, he had completely lost his sense of direction in the sea of blood. In truth, he had just arrived here, but Saints were Saints after all, so he was still faster than the others.","Furthermore, he was the first to arrive among the three Saints, which showed that Saints were actually not very useful here.","The deeper they went into the island, the thicker the fog became. Another day later, they really couldn’t even see their own fingers.","The Crystal Saint summoned his Imperial Weapon. The Mysterious Ice Banner danced above his head, easily tearing a hole into the blood mist. The area within 3000 meters became clear again.","The Imperial Weapon was the Imperial Weapon, after all. It hadn’t awakened yet, yet it was already so mighty. If it fully awakened, would it be able to raze this sea of blood to the ground?","Seeing the might of the Imperial Weapon, everyone’s courage increased greatly.","Even if an Ancestral King came back to life, the Imperial Weapon should be able to last a few moves, right?","In Ling Han’s mind, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower trembled slightly.","It was doing it again. This guy seemed to have been provoked, and was determined to jump out and fight.","“Yi?” The Crystal Saint looked slightly surprised, because he could feel the Imperial Weapon become restless, as if it had been provoked. It was actually showing signs of awakening on its","own.","However, the problem was that there weren’t any other Imperial Weapon here.","Could it be that the Ancestral King that had set up this place had also left behind the Imperial Weapon, and it was presently on this island? That was why the Imperial Weapon had sensed it, and that was why it wanted to actively awaken and battle it?","-Which Ancestral King hadn’t swept through the world and ruled over an era? Thus, the Ancestral King’s ambition was higher than the heavens, and the Imperial Weapon that they had forged was naturally unafraid of any challenge.","“Be careful. It’s extremely likely that there’s an Imperial Weapon standing guard here!” the old Saint said.","Hearing his words, everyone paled in shock.","If the Imperial Weapons engaged in a fierce battle, even Saints would have no option but to turn around and flee. In fact, if they were the slightest bit slower, their only fate would be death.","At this moment, even the Venerate Tiers almost wanted to retreat. It was too dangerous. Only Ling Han knew the truth, and he couldn’t help but wear a strange expression.","If everyone knew that he was the cause of this Saint looking like he was facing a great enemy, or rather, it was the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower in his mind, would he be beaten to death by these Venerate Tiers that had flown into a rage out of humiliation?","Yes, it was really possible.","Hence, he definitely could not say.","Ling Han was also slightly proud of himself. This was something that could induce fear in the hearts of a group of Venerate Tiers. He, a Core Formation Tier, should be the one and only to achieve this in history.","Everyone was extremely careful. It was extremely possible that there was another Imperial Weapon here. Once it unleashed its might, even Saints would be killed. It was extremely dangerous, and they had to be extremely careful.","The Mysterious Ice Banner fluttered lightly, and the blood mist in front of them was easily dispersed, giving everyone a clear view.","All around them, stone pillars soared into the sky one after another, and what was terrifying was that there was actually a corpse pierced by every stone pillar. However, the bloodstains of the majority of the corpses had only flowed to one third of the length of the stone pillars, and were gone. Hence, at this moment, though the air of their blood spread out, they could not be discovered.","These corpses were all Venerate Tier corpses.","The sea was filled with the corpses of Saints, while this place was filled with the corpses of Venerate Tier elites. They were all hanging on stone pillars like livestock. Was this a sacrificial ceremony for worship?","There was also the pile of skulls from before, and there was no shortage of Venerate Tiers and Saints among them. Otherwise, it could not have possibly formed such a terrifying pressure.","Just what kind of world was this!","“Let’s go, continue walking!”","Led by the Saint, they continued onwards, penetrating deep into this island, and the further ahead they went, the steeper the terrain became. On the fifth day, a mountain peak appeared","ahead of them.","“Let’s go!”","Now that they were here, there was naturally no reason for them to retreat. They all ascended the mountain.","However, though the environment here was terrifying, with Saint corpses and Venerate Tier corpses appearing at the drop of a hat, there was actually no danger at all. On the other side of the great ocean, there were still Yin souls, but here, there weren’t even any ghosts.","The mountain was very tall, but there was a Saint here, so what was the height of the mountain worth?","In less than half a day, they had already arrived at the summit.","“Yi!” “Ah!” “Ya!”","After reaching the summit, quite a number of people immediately exclaimed in shock. That was because there was a blood-coloured great tree at the summit, but it did not have even half a leaf. Its thick trunk was actually semi-transparent like jade.","What caused everyone to exclaim in shock was how innumerable branches hung down, supporting a woman.","This woman was wearing a blood-coloured long dress, and her hair was also blood-red. As the mountain winds blew, it fluttered slightly, like flames.","Her eyes were tightly closed, as if she was sleeping, but even so, her beauty was still world-","shaking.","Even Ling Han had to admit that this woman’s beauty was already not inferior to the empress and Hu Niu.","And near the Blood Tree, there were also blood-coloured giant eggs, as tall as a man. They were no longer semi-transparent, but every single one of them was squirming slightly, as if","life was nurtured within.","This scene was too bizarre.","That red-haired woman was breathtakingly beautiful, but those giant blood-coloured eggs were disgusting. The two images intertwined, incompatible, yet inseparable.","“Is she dead?” someone murmured, starry-eyed.","“How could such a beautiful woman possibly die!” Immediately, someone rebuked, his face similarly filled with adoration.","To say nothing of these youngsters, even a few Venerate Tiers looked captivated.","This woman was really too dazzlingly beautiful, causing their hearts that were completely focused on cultivation to waver.","Immediately, someone wanted to rush up and “rescue” the red beauty.","“Wait!”","There were always calm people, especially those Venerate Tiers who had cultivated for so many years. Even if their minds were affected, they could still control themselves very well.","“I can sense that this Blood Tree is extracting the energy from the ground, supplying it to that woman!” a Venerate Tier said.","“That’s right, and I have a bold conjecture. Previously, those Venerate Tiers that had been stabbed to death on the stone pillars had all had their energy essence extracted and transformed by this Blood Tree in some way, to be supplied to her,” another Venerate Tier","said.","When everyone heard this, some immediately looked shocked, while others shook their","heads.","“Impossible, how could such an exceptionally beautiful, untainted woman possibly do such a cruel thing!” These people refused to believe it.","“It is indeed impossible that this woman was the culprit,” the Crystal Saint said. “To be able to kill so many Saints, it must be the handiwork of a Great Emperor. However, this place has existed for who knows how many years, and there has never been a Great Emperor that could","live for so long.”","“Furthermore, if this woman was really a Great Emperor, and we were so close, we would have long since been shocked to death by the Imperial Might.”","This was indeed very useful evidence. Furthermore, if this woman was really a Great Emperor, then no one should have any extravagant hopes with regards to her."]},{"number":4091,"title":"Chapter 4091: Split into Pieces","paragraphs":["Chapter 4091: Split into Pieces","“But all this is too strange!” someone said.","Indeed, there was a sea of corpses of Saints, pillars stabbing the corpses of Venerate Tiers, and this exquisite red-haired woman was currently in slumber. It was completely impossible to connect all of this.","“If she hasn’t died, we can wake her up. Who knows, we might be able to know the whole story,” a Venerate Tier suggested.","This won the agreement of the majority. Whether they were interested in the red-haired beauty, or were more curious about this world, they all needed to awaken this woman first.","“I’ll go.” A junior immediately jumped out. He was already completely captivated by the red- haired beauty.","The Saint did not speak, and all the Venerate Tiers also tacitly agreed. This young man then walked towards the Blood Tree.","However, the elites were all prepared to move. This place was too strange, and things definitely could not go so smoothly.","At first, the young man was walking very slowly, but his footsteps soon became faster and faster. Then, he became faster and faster, and it became a run. There was also excitement on his face. With such an exquisite beauty, if he could get close to her, he was even willing to live a few hundred years less.","However, just as he was about to reach her, shua, a branch suddenly moved, and whipped towards him.","Extremely fast!","“Humph, how dare you!” A Venerate Tier moved. Pa, a majestic light flashed, interwoven with Regulations, turning into a Divine Sword. With a slash, the branch was severed.","He was the elder of that young man, so he naturally could not just sit by and watch.","The young man was given a fright, but when he saw that the branch had been severed, he showed an expression of pride.","With the support of his senior, what did he have to fear?","Beauty, I’m here!","The infatuation in his eyes deepened, and he couldn’t wait to pull that red-haired beauty into his arms, and love her tenderly.","Involuntarily, he sped up, and then lost consciousness.","And in the eyes of the masses, as this young man ran, he suddenly broke into pieces, as if there was an invisible supreme divine blade that had instantly sliced him into several pieces. Then, The turned into a mist of blood, and disappeared completely.","This!","“Qian’er!” the Venerate Tier cultivator who had attacked earlier couldn’t help but call out. Not only was this his clansman, but this was also his direct descendant. He had placed great hopes on him, yet in the end, he had died in front of him, without even leaving a piece of himself behind.","-If the large black dog was here, he would definitely grumble, “What is it? You want him to leave a piece of himself behind for you to eat?”","He roared loudly, and pounced forwards. The precious tool of the Venerate Tier had already been drawn. It was a long green saber, and was fully activated at the first instant. The terrifying might of the Venerate Tier surged out, causing even heaven and earth to pale.","The Crystal Saint frowned slightly. He had not seen clearly how that young man had died, but he still stretched out a hand, dispersing the pressure that surged over from that Venerate Tier. “Destroy!” That Venerate Tier was furious, and struck out with his saber, intending to destroy that blood tree along with the red-haired beauty.","“No!” This caused a great many young people to exclaim in shock. Even a considerable number of Venerate Tiers were slightly out of control. Should they make a move to stop him? Whether the Blood Tree was struck or not, they were completely unconcerned, but it was a different story for that red-haired beauty. She was really breathtakingly beautiful, and even they were moved.","The Blood Tree immediately launched a counterattack. One after another, its branches waved, lashing out at that Venerate Tier. There were actually Regulations moving as well, and their might was powerful.","This was very inconceivable. Though there were innumerable Celestial medicines in the world, Celestial medicines were only very nutritious. They themselves did not have any battle prowess. At most, they would only release some poisonous Qi, or create illusions to confuse others.","And those that could directly “make a move” would definitely have developed intelligence, and gained spiritual consciousness.","Once they gained spiritual consciousness, even Wood-aligned creatures couldn’t possess a long lifespan. They would also be limited by their cultivation level. However, although it was unclear how many years this place had existed for, it was definitely astonishingly long.","Thus, why was this Blood Tree still alive?","Boom!","The Blood Tree battled fiercely with the Venerate Tier. It was extremely powerful, and was not the slightest bit inferior to the Venerate Tier.","“Humph, a mere Demonic Tree dares to commit violence!” Another Venerate Tier moved, charging towards the Blood Tree. As a dignified Venerate Tier, time was very precious, so how could he possibly have so much free time to just observe the battle for a long time?","The two Venerate Tiers teamed up, and the situation was naturally different. They immediately suppressed the Blood Tree, and victory was only a matter of time.","However, there were also Venerate Tiers who felt that they were too slow and joined the battle as well.","Three against one, this formed a qualitative change, and the Blood Tree could not hold up at","all.","More importantly, it was rooted here, and couldn’t run around randomly. Naturally, it was a huge disadvantage, losing even faster.","But right at this moment, a terrifying scene appeared. The three Venerate Tiers suddenly shattered into pieces, and then turned into a mist of blood, not leaving behind the slightest","trace.","‘F*ck! F*ck! F*ck!’","This time, everyone’s hair stood on end.","Those were three Venerate Tiers, supreme elites that were only inferior to Saints, and they had actually died so soundlessly, without the slightest bit of preparation, without the slightest bit of resistance. How could this not be frightening?","Was it the action of a Saint? Or... was it an Ancestral King?","If there really was an Ancestral King here, then all of them added together would be killed with a single palm strike. Even the awakening of the Imperial Weapon would be useless. Great Emperors were invincible in the world, and those that could stand against a Great Emperor were definitely not the Imperial Weapon, but only another Great Emperor. The Crystal Saint walked out. With a wave of his hands, multiple streaks of Regulations of heaven and earth were instantly extracted, turning into threads of silk. Even though each thread was as thin as a spider’s web, if one was cut by this silk, it was guaranteed that even Venerate Tiers would be instantly split into half.","Instantly, someone understood, and exclaimed in shock, “They were all killed by the threads","of Regulations!”","This would explain why the young man from before, as well as the three Venerate Tiers, had","been silently torn into pieces.","However, was there another Saint here?","Everyone turned to look at the red-haired beauty, and then shook their heads in unison.","Putting aside the fact that she was a Saint, even if she was, she was either dead now, or in an extremely sealed state. How could she possibly make a move?","This was a strange place, and it was far too strange. Even Venerate Tiers could die so soundlessly, and they were like crops being harvested. This caused a boundless chill to rise up","in everyone’s hearts.","Obviously, this Blood Tree, or rather this red-haired beauty, was a taboo that could not be","touched.","The Crystal Saint humphed upon hearing this. He was a member of the Imperial Clan, and in this era where there were no Emperors, what did he have to fear? He strode forward, with the Imperial Weapon hovering above his head. It was in a state of awakening at any moment.","He strode forward, and could clearly see that the Regulations of heaven and earth had solidified, forming a complicated three-dimensional network.","The Imperial Weapon was even more terrifying. With a light wave, it directly tore a rip into","the Void, and a terrifying energy surged out.","That was high-level energy!","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. As it turned out, high-level energy did not exist in this","time and space, but rather in the Void.","However, this high-level energy was not all that powerful. At most, it was equivalent to the energy corresponding to the first Spirit Diagram that he had learnt.","However, the Imperial Weapon didn’t need to channel its power at all. It could easily pierce through the Void and draw out high-level energy. This was naturally terrifying. “You guys, look!” Someone suddenly exclaimed, pointing into the distance, even his voice","trembling."]},{"number":4092,"title":"Chapter 4092: Assault of the Saint Corpses","paragraphs":["Chapter 4092: Assault of the Saint Corpses","In the distance, a blood-coloured wall was presently approaching.","No, that was not a wall, but a wave!","The sea suddenly roared, creating a wave that was as tall as three thousand meters, that was presently crashing towards this massive island.","This was hard for everyone to believe. The sudden arrival of the massive wave had nothing to do with what they were doing now.","Just how terrifying were these waves?","It was filled with corrosive power, and even Venerate Tiers would be melted to the point that only their bones would remain. Only Saints would be unafraid.","The Crystal Saint couldn’t help but stop in his tracks. He was unafraid of these waves, but what lay behind these waves made him extremely wary.","Because this was the power of a Great Emperor!","Furthermore, it was suspected that there was another Imperial Weapon here, so he dared not be careless even more.","-This one had been tricked quite seriously.","Of course, he was not afraid either, because he firmly believed that there was no Emperor in this present world!","“Heavens!” A Venerate Tier suddenly exclaimed, and stretched out a finger to point at that massive wave. They saw that it was not something as simple as a wave, and there were","actually multiple figures appearing in the waves.","The Saint corpses!","Peng, the massive wave had already crashed onto this colossal island, shaking the ground madly. Then, that wave began to recede, turning into countless waves, but a terrifying scene was presently happening.","One after another, the corpses of Saints flew over, and then... they opened their eyes!","Dead people opening their eyes?","Everyone was numb with shock. Those who had already died had opened their eyes again. This was already frightening enough, and these dead people were Saints at that. That was even more terrifying.","Weng, weng, weng! Boundless aura surged, enshrouding over.","The Saint corpses didn’t simply open their eyes. Instead, it was as if they had come to life. They radiated with the unique might of Saints.","Heavens, several thousand Saints had appeared at the same time. What kind of concept was that?","The corpses of these Saints were all exuding a piercing killing intent. Though they had opened their eyes, they were all expressionless.","They had long since died!","These Saints came from all kinds of races. There were pure humans, Tiger Tribe, Wolf Tribe, and Snake Tribe. All of them exuded a powerful aura that could suppress heaven and earth. One of them was capable of shattering planets. When there were a few thousand of them, just their aura alone was enough to tear apart the heavens.","The Crystal Saint immediately activated his Imperial Weapon. Although he was a Saint and the most powerful being in the world, he would definitely be obliterated if he were to face several thousand of the most powerful beings.","The Imperial Weapon awakened, and instantly, an indescribable aura circulated, as if an Emperor had descended.","Instantly, everyone knelt down. No one was an exception — aside from Ling Han.","However, those few thousand Saint corpses were completely unafraid, and charged towards him like moths flying into a flame.","Peng, peng, peng!","Even someone as powerful as a Saint was useless. The Imperial Weapon shook slightly, and the Saint corpses that had crashed into it was forcefully shattered into pieces.","Great Emperor, the strongest in the world, and there weren’t any prerequisites.","Everyone raised their heads, only to see the corpses of Saints explode one after another like firecrackers. However, not a single drop of blood splattered. It was as if they were dried corpses.","This was a one-sided “slaughter”. However, the problem was that another massive wave crashed over from the distance, and another few thousand Saint corpses appeared.","The expression of the Crystal Saint changed drastically. Although the Imperial Weapon was invincible, the problem was that he wasn’t a Great Emperor, so he couldn’t activate it endlessly. At most, it would only take a few minutes, and he would be exhausted. By then, what would he do?","Thousands of Saint corpses crashed into him, and even he could only die.","“Retreat! Retreat! Retreat!” he roared loudly. With a wave of his large hand, he had grabbed everyone. Then, the Imperial Weapon cleared the path, turning rapidly, heading back the way it had come.","Xiu, a Saint’s speed was extremely fast, and with the Imperial Weapon leading the way, what else could block it?","The Crystal Saint forcibly carved out a path, but he was also as anxious as a stray dog.","Ling Han looked at the island, and it instantly became a black dot. However, through the eye technique, he could still see the red-haired beauty. He didn’t know if it was an illusion, but he saw that the woman’s eyelids actually twitched!","But when he was about to confirm, whether it was the red-haired beauty or the giant island, they had all disappeared from his field of vision. The only thing that could be seen was the colossal wave that was chasing after them, determined to smash them into pieces. However, a Saint’s speed was far too quick. In just a few hours, they could already see the coastline.","The Crystal Saint didn’t stop. Instead, he continued to advance until he arrived before the entrance. Only then did he descend and loosen his grip. Everyone regained their mobility.","A Saint was really too strong. There were so many Venerate Tiers in his grasp, and not one of them actually managed to break free.","Of course, at that time, no one really wanted to break free.","“There’s a terrifying background here. If we want to investigate this place, we’ll probably have to work together with the other Imperial Clans and have them bring the Imperial","Weapons over,” the Crystal Saint said.","Everyone nodded.","Though there were no Great Emperors in the world now, and as long as he drew out the Imperial Weapon, it would be enough to sweep aside all opposition, the power of a Saint was inferior to the Ancestral King by who knew how much. There was a limited amount of time that he could keep the Imperial Weapon activated, so how could he possibly withstand the barrage of attacks from tens of thousands of Saint corpses?","Thus, the only way to investigate this place was to gather more members of the Imperial Clans and send out a large number of Saints along with the Imperial Weapons. Then, no matter how many thousands or tens of thousands of Saint corpses you had, they would all be","razed to the ground.","“Let’s go our separate ways.” The Crystal Saint directly tore a rip into space, and left with Chi Menghan and Chi Dao. The area from before was a separate space, and even if they tore it open, they would not be able to leave.","Now that the Saint had left, it was naturally even more impossible for them to enter and take risks. They all tore a rip into space and left.","The Nine Mountains Venerate stayed behind. He had promised to spar with severae Venerate Tiers, and with his status and identity, he naturally wouldn’t go back on his word. Thus, after staying here for close to ten days, the Nine Mountains Venerate finally brought Ling Han back to the Nine Suns Holy Land with him.","Even so, this was still much faster than Ling Han returning by himself.","After receiving the news, the empress, Hu Niu, the large black dog and the others all came out","to receive him. This parting had taken about a year’s time. Thankfully, they had all come out of the Genesis World, and would often go into seclusion for tens of millions of years. In comparison, a year’s time was only enough for them to take a nap.","The Nine Mountains Venerate started to cultivate in seclusion as soon as he returned. He had gained a lot from the Blood Palace, and he had even obtained the Blood Patterned Dao Stones later. This had been refined by a Great Emperor, so it was extremely beneficial to him. Perhaps, after the Nine Mountains Venerate came out of seclusion, he would become a Saint. Ling Han thought optimistically that his backer would be strong enough. The large black dog had already broken through to the Core Formation Tier. Because he had fused Nine Cauldrons into a single Celestial Cauldron, the first step of the Core Formation Tier was extremely easy for him to complete. However, the empress and Hu Niu were still in Cauldron Forging Tier, and needed to stabilize their cultivation level before they could break","through.","Ling Han divided the Soul Nurturing Stone among them, and told the two women and dog to each take a portion. This could be used immediately after they broke through to the middle stage of the Core Formation Tier.","He began to pass on what he had learnt. The Nine Styles of the the God of War, the Strange Shadow Steps were all extremely powerful and practical ultimate techniques. However, this peaceful life didn’t last long. On this day, the members of an Imperial Clan","suddenly arrived.","The Heaven Wolf Imperial Clan!"]},{"number":4093,"title":"Chapter 4093: Unexpected Person","paragraphs":["Chapter 4093: Unexpected Person","Ling Han suddenly received a notification. He ran out to take a look, and saw that the atmosphere was extremely tense.","“Ling Han!” A cold voice rang out, bearing deep resentment.","Ling Han looked over. This was a woman, and she was quite beautiful. However, her pretty face was currently twisted with fury.","Di Hailan.","The Heaven Wolf Imperial Clan, the only clan with the surname of ‘Di’.","He, they had finally come looking for him.","Ling Han acted as if he had not seen anything, and merely paid his respects to the Nine Mountains Venerate. Wasn’t this Venerable Tier in seclusion? Yet now, even he had been alerted, which showed that the situation this time was slightly serious.","The Nine Mountains Venerate raised his hand, indicating that there was no need for excessive courtesy.","“My request is very simple. Hand Ling Han over, and I’ll immediately take him away,” an elder said. He was tall and sturdy, and he radiated with an incredibly powerful aura.","The Nine Mountains Venerate smiled coldly, and said, “When did the Nine Suns Holy Land fall to the point of having someone come to our doors and demanding one of our own?”","The elder was the Venerate Tier elite of the Heavenly Wolf Imperial Clan. His title was Eastern Sea. He raised his white brows and said, “Nine Mountains, do you want to become enemies with the Imperial Clan?”","“You still can’t represent the Imperial Clan!” the Nine Mountains Venerate scoffed. Although the Eastern Sea Venerate and Di Hailan belonged to the Imperial Clan, they weren’t part of the main branch. Rather, they had long since been separated from the main branch.","However, this was the bloodline of a Great Emperor, after all. This bloodline had also produced Saints before, and had left behind a renowned reputation.","Of course, because the Saint had already passed away, this branch of Imperial Clan only had Venerate Tier elites keeping watch. In terms of abilities, they were completely inferior to the Nine Suns Holy Land.","“Very well, you even dare to look down on the Imperial Clan!” the Eastern Sea Venerate said balefully. “Do you really think that just because my branch has left the main branch, it no longer belongs to the Imperial Clan?”","The Nine Mountains Venerate waved his hand dismissively, and said, “Cut the crap and get to the point!”","‘Holy f*ck!’","The Eastern Sea Venerate faltered for a moment. This Nine Mountains Venerate was truly domineering. However, this was also in line with the tradition of the Nine Suns Holy Land. This force was famous for shielding its own people.","“Ling Han killed the son-in-law of our Di Clan. No matter what, he has to give an explanation, right?” he said balefully.","The Nine Mountains Venerable Tier elite, Nine Mountains Venerate, waved his hand, and said, “Ancient sites are searching for treasures, so it’s unavoidable that there would be fights. Isn’t it very normal for there to be casualties and injuries? If someone were to be wounded or killed, his family would have to seek justice, so would everyone still need to cultivate their cultivation techniques? If they seek justice every day, they would have to give an explanation.”","The Eastern Sea Venerate humphed. He seemed to have foreseen that the Nine Mountains Venerate would say this. Thus, he wasn’t angered, and he said, “Fine, I won’t pick on the weak either. Let the two of them fight again!”","Yi, wasn’t this person already dead? How was he supposed to fight? Fight with a ghost?","Not only was Ling Han stunned for a moment, but even the Nine Mountains Venerable Tier elite was slightly surprised. He turned to look at the Eastern Sea Venerable.","The Venerate of the Eastern Sea smiled proudly, “How could the means of our Imperial Clan be something that you can imagine?”","He paused, raised his voice, and called out, “Heaven Step!”","“Fourth great-grandfather!” A young man walked out from behind Di Hailan.","Previously, he had kept his head lowered, so that no one could see his face. Now that he had walked out, he immediately strode forwards with his head held high, exuding an aggressive","aura.","Hong Tianfan, Hong Tianbu.","It was actually Hong Tianfan, Tianbu. He really hadn’t died.","Ling Han found this strange. In the Black Heaven Temple’s Heaven Temple, he had indeed cut Hong Tianjing in half. Why wasn’t this guy dead yet?","That’s right. No wonder he hadn’t seen Di Hailan come to seek revenge. He should have immediately brought Hong Tianbu back to the Imperial Clan Clan with him, and only then did The manage to save him.","Tsk, tsk, tsk. He had survived a great calamity, and this guy was really blessed with good fortune. He had actually advanced into the True Self Tier!","However, although he hadn’t died after being cut in half, his foundations had definitely been severely damaged. Even if he was treated by a supreme Godly medicine, it would still be very difficult for him to recover to his prime condition in a short period of time. Yet, he had actually broken through.","This kind of True Self Tier elite definitely wouldn’t be very strong.","Thinking about it, it made sense. If Hong Tianfan wanted to take revenge with his own hands, he could only do so in terms of cultivation level. Otherwise, in a battle of equal cultivation levels, even the Imperial Son had been defeated by Ling Han. No matter how arrogant he was, he wouldn’t dare to compare to the Imperial Son, right?","Thus, he was the first to advance into the True Self Tier, intending to use his cultivation level to suppress Ling Han.","“Ling Han, you didn’t expect this, did you? I didn’t die!” Hong Tianju said balefully, his killing intent cold.","His situation wasn’t as bad as Ling Han thought, because he also had the eye of a Primordial Beast, Primordial Beast, fused into his body. It was also because of this thing that Hong Tianbu hadn’t died instantly even though he had been cut in half. Instead, he had held on until he returned to the Imperial Clan Clan.","And also because of this Primordial Vicious Eye, his battle prowess was still considerably stronger than the usual early stage of the True Self Tier.","Ling Han shrugged nonchalantly, “It’s all right. I’ll just kill you again.”","F***!","Hong Tianbu didn’t know how to respond at this moment. ‘You’re far too f*cking arrogant!’ “Haha, a mere Core Formation Tier cultivator dares to boast shamelessly!” he finally spoke. “Not convinced? I’ll kill until you’re convinced!” Ling Han smiled faintly.","On the other side, the Nine Mountains Venerable Tier elite, the Nine Mountains Venerate, frowned, and said to the Eastern Sea Venerate, “There is a gap of a major tier between the Nine Mountains Venerable Tier and the Nine Mountains Venerate. Is this interesting?” “They’re about the same age, and their cultivation levels were also the same when we first met. Now that Heaven Tier is in the lead, how could it be that he can be blamed for having higher natural talent?” the Venerate of the Eastern Sea retorted coldly.","“All right.” Unexpectedly, the Nine Mountains Venerate Tier elite, the Nine Mountains Venerate, nodded decisively, “Just let the two juniors deal with it themselves. Neither you nor I are allowed to interfere. Whoever interferes will be the grandson.”","The Eastern Sea Venerate was startled. He had not thought that the Nine Mountains Venerate Tier would agree so readily, but he was immediately angered. What grandson? You are a Venerate Tier, after all, so can’t you have some manners when you speak?","He was slightly confused, but when he thought about it, it was very possible that the Nine Mountains Venerate Tier elite, the Nine Mountains Venerate, had agreed to this solution because he didn’t want to embarrass the Holy Land and didn’t want to offend the Imperial","Clan Clan.","True, no matter how strong the Holy Land was, how could they dare to offend the Imperial","Clan Clan?","“Then, the two of you can begin!” The Eastern Sea Venerate waved a hand dismissively. As he saw it, Ling Han was already a corpse.","Regardless of how talented Ling Han was, he didn’t care at all. Those who dared to offend the Imperial Clan Clan were naturally seeking death.","Meanwhile, Hong Tianbu clasped his hands behind his back and slowly walked toward Ling Han. This time, he was truly brimming with confidence.","The True Self Tier against the Core Formation Tier, this was an absolute one-sided domination. No matter how prodigious and beautiful you were, there was no way you could compensate for such a gap in cultivation level.","“Ling Han, everything... is finally about to end,” he said calmly.","Ling Han cracked a smile, and nodded, “It certainly should end now. From the Dark North","Nation until now, everything has come to an end!”","“I’m impressed that you can still smile,” Hong Tianbu said.","“It takes one to know one.”","Hong Tianbu’s smile suddenly disappeared, and boundless killing intent exploded from his","eyes.","If Ling Han didn’t exist in this world, his life wouldn’t have been like this. Instead, he would have been able to obtain even more opportunities! In his eyes, all of Ling Han’s achievements should have belonged to him. It was Ling Han who had snatched away the opportunities that should have belonged to him, and the glory that belonged to him.","“From today onwards, there will no longer be a person like Ling Han in this world!” he said softly, but his voice was incredibly firm."]},{"number":4094,"title":"Chapter 4094: There should be a limit to shamelessness","paragraphs":["Chapter 4094: There should be a limit to shamelessness","The True Self Tier against the Core Formation Tier, this should be an absolute one-sided domination.","Thus, even the people of the Nine Suns Holy Land didn’t have a high opinion of Ling Han at all. They thought that he would definitely die in this battle.","-Aside from the the Nine Mountains Venerate, the empress, and a few others.","They naturally knew that Ling Han was also a Formations Grandmaster, and could draw on the power of the ley lines to support himself. At the very least, he would be able to protect himself. Otherwise, with the Nine Mountains Venerate’s high opinion and love for Ling Han, would he deliberately screw Ling Han over?","Of course, Lu Qi smiled in satisfaction. He had been anticipating this day for a long time. It was a shame that he couldn’t kill Ling Han himself. This made him feel slightly regretful. Meanwhile, Song Lan looked nervous, her slender hands involuntarily clenching into fists. Seeing this beauty ranked ninth in the galaxy so concerned about a man, many people instantly looked jealous.","Prosperous Heaven’s expression was slightly strange. She already knew that Ling Han had killed Shi Yongming, so she was naturally more optimistic about Ling Han’s talent. However, the key was that Ling Han was too good at causing trouble, causing her to begin to hesitate. Would this bring great trouble to the Buddhist Race of the North Heavenly Realm?","Hong Tianbu strode forwards. He didn’t need to soar into the skies. The Nine Suns Holy Land was continuously strengthened by generations of elites. If this place wasn’t able to withstand even True Self Tier-level battle prowess, then others would really be laughing their heads off. “Farewell!” he said calmly, and finally made his move.","Weng, he sent out a palm strike lightly, but endless power of heaven and earth surged out, turning into a giant hand that was like white jade. Multiple veined patterns could be seen glowing. That was the profound will of heaven and earth.","This was the strength of the True Self Tier. He could stimulate the Regulations of heaven and earth, and the power of the attacks he delivered would form a qualitative change.","Crushing all Core Formation Tiers!","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t face this attack head-on. He activated the Imminent Skyline and quickly dodged. He then unleashed a murderous aura attack at Hong Tianbu.","“Humph!” A crack appeared on Hong Tianbu’s forehead, and he similarly exuded a terrifying murderous aura, blocking the murderous aura.","“Don’t forget, my fated opportunity is not inferior to yours!” he declared proudly. The Primordial Beast’s eye could be considered a supreme treasure, far surpassing his present cultivation level, “Speaking of which, I still have to thank you. Because you have defeated it, in order to protect the life of a host like me, this eye has now fallen truly under my control.”","As he said this, a ray of light shot out from Hong Tianbu’s forehead. It was incredibly fast, and there was no way for him to dodge at all. It shot onto Ling Han.","“Haha, die!” He charged over, and after being shot by the Primordial Beast’s eye, his body would instantly turn to stone. He only had to calmly follow up with another attack, and he would be able to easily take Ling Han’s life.","It was too simple. Under the crushing pressure of a major tier, even if you were a supreme prodigy, so what? It was guaranteed that you would die completely.","Peng, as expected, with a palm strike, Ling Han was instantly turned into a shower of blood. Hong Tianbu retracted his hand and stood, laughing loudly. However, at the same time, he also felt some regret. It could be said that he had hated this opponent for many years, but he had killed him all of a sudden, which made him feel like his hatred had not been vented.","However, it was good that he was dead. This was a matter of the past, after all. However, in the eyes of the masses, Hong Tianbu had suddenly become mad. He blasted randomly at the air, and then revealed expressions of disdain.","Er, what are you so proud of?","Could this ideal son-in-law of the Heaven Wolf Imperial Clan be a little out of his mind? He actually dared to come out and embarrass himself!","Faced with this scene, the Eastern Sea Venerate also revealed a hint of anger. Why was Hong Tianbu so unreliable at this moment?","In truth, he also had a very high opinion of Hong Tianbu. In fact, he had even thought of going to the main branch to ask for a Saint-level Great Herb to treat Hong Tianbu and remove all of his hidden ailments – of course, he could not possibly ask for the whole Saint-level Great Herb, but if it was just a small portion, there would be no problem.","But now, Hong Tianbu was actually behaving in such an unbearable manner, which caused anger to rise up in his heart. Was there any need to nurture this kind of guy who would go mad?","However, Venerate Tier elites were Venerate Tier elites, after all, so their eyes were naturally sharp. The more he looked, the more he felt that something was off. Then, he suddenly came to a realization. It was not that Hong Tianbu had gone mad, but he had been affected by Ling Han’s illusion technique.","Impressive, being able to affect his opponent with a gap of a major cultivation level. Even he had not been able to tell at the first instant. In fact, he had not even seen Ling Han make a move. What kind of illusion was this?","“Tianbu, don’t be careless!” He opened his mouth and shouted loudly. As he spoke, a sliver of divine sense also shot into Hong Tianbu’s mind.","The Venerate Tier was too powerful. This sliver of divine sense entered into his mind, and immediately destroyed the illusion as easily as crushing dry weeds and smashing rotten wood.","Hong Tianbu faltered for a moment before coming to his senses. He couldn’t help but reveal a humiliated and furious expression.","He had the advantage of a major tier over Ling Han, yet his mind had actually been affected by Ling Han?","This was a great humiliation!","In a battle of True Self Tier against Core Formation Tier, he was actually unable to decide the battle with a single strike, and was instead bewitched?","“Die!” he roared loudly, and charged towards Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled slightly. The black light of illusion activated, and who cares if you were prepared or not. This was the celestial light that he had obtained from the Black Heaven Temple. Being worthy of the notice of Pseudo-Emperor Doga, how could it be bad?","Hong Tianbu was immediately hit again, and began his performance.","The Eastern Sea Venerate was just about to move again, yet he suddenly saw a gust of wind from a palm strike sweep over. There was an endless power of Regulation, and even he had no choice but to deal with it carefully. Hurriedly, he retreated, and naturally had no more time to deal with it for Hong Tianbu.","The Nine Mountains Venerate withdrew his palm, and said calmly, “There’s a limit to shamelessness!”","The Eastern Sea Venerate’s chest rose and fell in fury, but he had indeed interfered in the battle between two juniors. Originally, if the Nine Mountains Venerate acted as if he didn’t know, then everyone would be fooled, but after he was exposed, his expression naturally","became ugly.","Most importantly, some people had even activated Galaxy Network’s livestream!","As a Venerate Tier elite of the Imperial Clan, he actually interfered in the battle between two juniors. Moreover, he had been exposed in public. How humiliating.","He humphed, and crossed his arms behind his back. By now, he finally knew that the Nine Mountains Venerate had no intention of compromising at all, but rather knew that Ling Han had a way to oppose the True Self Tier.","This was boosting Ling Han’s popularity.","Previously, Ling Han had killed Core Formation Tier when he had been in Cauldron Forging Tier. Now, in the Core Formation Tier, and even only in the late stage of the Core Formation Tier at that, he could match the True Self Tier. This naturally caused Ling Han’s reputation to rise greatly. Probably, a considerable number of Imperial Clans would come over to fight over","this son-in-law, right?","“Fourth great-grandfather!” Di Hailan said worriedly.","“It’s fine!” The Eastern Sea Venerate waved his hand, “That brat only has one illusion technique, no matter how hard he tries. Though this can affect Tianbu, the instincts of Tianbu are still present. When he encounters danger, he would naturally counterattack. With the advantage that Tianbu has of a major tier in cultivation level, he would be able to easily kill","that brat.”","Hearing his words, Di Hailan instantly looked relieved.","Eastern Sea Venerate paused for a moment, then continued, “Furthermore, Tianbu is also a","supreme prodigy, and also has the advantage of a major tier in cultivation level. The effects of illusions on him would become smaller and smaller, until they disappear, and by then...","hehe.”","Needless to say, if a True Self Tier cultivator could go all out, what Core Formation Tier cultivator would be able to survive?"]},{"number":4095,"title":"Chapter 4095: Shocking the galaxy","paragraphs":["Chapter 4095: Shocking the galaxy","This sparring match of the Nine Suns Holy Land was broadcasted live through Galaxy Network and spread throughout the entire universe.","Originally, this was only a battle between juniors, and could not possibly attract the attention of mighty figures. However, one side had a Core Formation Tier, while the other side had e True Self Tier. Furthermore, it was the side of the Core Formation Tier that was on the upper hand now. This was a different story.","More and more people were paying attention to this battle, and in the discussion area below the livestream, it was even livelier.","“It can’t be, right? A True Self Tier cultivator is actually unable to kill a Core Formation Tier cultivator? Hehe, allow me to laugh for five minutes first,” a newcomer said.","“Hehe, then just laugh for an hour. There really is such an inconceivable thing.”","“Hey, hey, hey, is there really such an inconceivable thing?”","“Of course.”","“Yi, this guy is Ling Han!”","“That’s right. He’s the guy who’s still alive and kicking even though he’s being hunted by the Battle God Palace.”","“No wonder the Battle God Palace couldn’t kill him. As a Core Formation Tier, he is able to stand against a True Self Tier, and the Battle God Palace would have to send out Spirit Transformation Tier assassins to succeed.”","“However, Ling Han’s battle prowess isn’t on par with the True Self Tier. Rather, it’s because he possesses a precious tool or some secret technique that can create illusions and bewitch the True Self Tier.”","“If it’s an illusion, it can’t last for long. There will always be a way to resolve it.”","“That’s right. At that time, how would Ling Han be able to block him?”","A unanimous conclusion was reached on the Galaxy Network, and that was when Hong Tianbu solved the problem of the illusion, that would be the instant of Ling Han’s defeat.","Donglin Imperial Clan.","“Big Sister, Big Sister, Big Sister!” Chi Mengshan ran over energetically, “Look at Galaxy Network’s livestream. My brother-in-law is currently fighting with a True Self Tier.”","Chi Menghan’s pretty face immediately darkened. At this moment, she was no longer wearing a white veil, revealing an extremely beautiful face. She was definitely not inferior to the red- haired beauty on the island of the sea of blood. She was indeed worthy of being called the third most beautiful woman in the galaxy. In fact, she was completely qualified to be called the number one beauty in the galaxy.","She glared at him, and said, “What nonsense are you spouting!”","“Yi, didn’t you dual cultivate with that guy? What is it? You’ve already been devoured, yet you don’t even get a title?” Chi Mengshan asked, her eyes wideR.","F***, this damn child!","Chi Menghan immediately delivered a harsh knock, instantly causing Chi Mengshan to grab her head and cry out in pain.","“Chi Menghan, just because you were born a few years earlier than me, your cultivation level is higher than mine. You keep bullying me!” the little girl shouted. “Just you wait. When my cultivation level catches up to you, I’ll immediately marry you off!”","Chi Menghan was rendered speechless. Were they really born from the same parents? Why were their personalities so different?","However, Ling Han was battling a True Self Tier cultivator?","She couldn’t help but help but be moved. She summoned a servant, and had him connect to the Galaxy Network, then project the live broadcast.","-If Ling Han was here, he would definitely be puzzled. Why didn’t the Imperial Clan use Galaxy Network? It was obviously so useful.","Seeing Ling Han toy around with Hong Tianbu with his illusions, she couldn’t help but smile, bright and beautiful.","“Sister, are you really moved?” Chi Mengshan asked softly from the sidelines. She was a mischievous little girl.","“Don’t spout nonsense,” Chi Menghan rebuked. She only admired this young man very much, and indeed had the idea of taking Ling Han into the Donglin Imperial Clan. However, it was definitely impossible that she would be the one to “marry” him.","She had great aspirations, and wanted to break through to the Imperial Path. She had not considered romantic matters at all.","Chi Mengshan cocked her head and pondered for a moment. Then, she suddenly reached over and wrapped her arms around Chi Menghan’s back. At the same time, she continued to grope Chi Menghan, saying, “Chi Menghan’s breasts are already so big, so she can finally get married!”","‘Fall!’","—","Hong Tianbu was a prodigy, after all. Moreover, he had the advantage of a major tier in cultivation level, and he also had the Primordial Beast’s eye inside him. Thus, the time that the illusion could take effect on him was becoming shorter and shorter.","At first, the illusion could last for about half a minute, but very soon, it became twenty seconds, ten seconds, and finally, there were only two or three seconds left.","However, the black light of illusion was also overwhelmingly awesome. Even if Hong Tianbu had already been hit many times, it was still effective. However, the time limit was only two seconds or so, but it didn’t decrease any further.","However, once the number of times increased, the pattern of the black light of illusion on Ling Han’s Celestial Core would become dimmer and dimmer. When it completely dimmed, it could no longer be used.","After all, this was not a celestial technique that he had cultivated himself.","They couldn’t play any longer.","That’s right, Ling Han was just playing around.","“Ling Han!” Hong Tianbu roared in fury. In just a short while, he had already fallen into dozens of illusions, experiencing the ups and downs of life. Sometimes, he would become successful in illusions, but at other times, his parents, children, and grandchildren would all die, and he would become a jinx that would cause the deaths of all those around him. Thus, he alternated between laughing and crying, appearing extremely disheveled. He had powerful strength, yet was unable to use it fully. Who could understand this kind of helplessness?","“Die!” He leaped up high, and Regulations materialized, forming into a God Tool that stabbed towards Ling Han.","Ling Han didn’t move or dodge, and he simply crossed his arms behind his back. His","demeanor was as lofty as could be.","“What!”","“He actually didn’t dodge!”","“Hiss, Hong Tianbu wasn’t affected by an illusion this time!”","“Furthermore, this attack has already been launched. Even if Hong Tianbu is under the effects","of an illusion, he should still be able to attack directly. With the battle prowess of a True Self","Tier, he would still be able to easily kill him.”","“Sigh, he’s too conceited.”","“Does he really think that he can rival those at the True Self Tier just by relying on illusion","techniques?”","“Childish!”","On the Galaxy Network, countless people also witnessed this scene in real time. They all shook their heads, thinking that Ling Han was definitely going to die.","However, when Hong Tianbu’s attack landed, boom, an Earth Qi surged out and turned into a","furious dragon.","Peng!","Hong Tianbu’s attack instantly landed on the Earth Dragon. Although he had just broken through to the True Self Tier, his battle prowess surpassed that of ordinary cultivators at the early stage of the True Self Tier. With this attack, the Earth Dragon instantly shattered, no longer able to withstand a single blow from him.","However, after this exchange, the might of his attack had mostly dissipated. Ling Han shot out a punch, and instantly dispersed this burst of power from Hong Tianbu.","‘F*ck! F*ck! F*ck!’","Seeing this scene, everyone was shocked speechless. This time, Ling Han didn’t use any illusion techniques, but rather blocked Hong Tianbu’s attack head-on.","Heavens, how could this be possible!","A Core Formation Tier cultivator actually had the ability to face a True Self Tier cultivator","head-on?","Furthermore, looking at how Ling Han was acting, he was really too relaxed. It was as if he was the True Self Tier, easily dispersing the attack of a Core Formation Tier.","“I know!” someone said. “That’s Earth Qi!”","“What, Earth Qi?”","“That’s right, Earth Qi. Every planet has ley lines, and within the ley lines, there is Earth Qi, which is actually heaven and earth energy. However, only Formations Grandmasters can use","it.”","“Hiss, what you mean is that Ling Han is actually a Formations Grandmaster?”","“Precisely.”","The Galaxy Network was in an uproar, and quite a number of people were grabbing their","heads, exclaiming in disbelief.","Ling Han was a genius of martial arts, freakish to the point of being freakish, but it was this","kind of freak that was actually a Formations Grandmaster!","Would you let others live?","Hong Tianbu was also taken aback. He stared blankly at Ling Han, his eyes filled with shock","and confusion.","Ling Han was actually a Formations Grandmaster!","‘Holy f*ck!’"]},{"number":4096,"title":"Chapter 4096: Retreating","paragraphs":["Chapter 4096: Retreating","Hong Tianbu had also studied formation techniques before, but this was only limited to the mortal level. After stepping onto the Celestial Path, formation techniques were far too time- consuming, and they also required the support of powerful Spiritual Power. Thus, he placed all of his focus on cultivation.","Even so, he still felt that there was not enough time, but what about Ling Han?","Comparisons would drive one crazy.","He was not willing to accept this, nor could he accept that the gap between the two of them would be so overwhelmingly wide.","“Die! Die! Die!” His fighting spirit was completely ignited. At this moment, he only had one thought, and that was to kill Ling Han.","Once Ling Han died, all the humiliation he had suffered would disappear without a trace, and no matter how outstanding Ling Han was, he would only become a piece of history.","Ling Han was calm and unperturbed. He extracted the Earth Qi and transformed it into the Earth Dragon.","And this time, the two Earth Dragons appeared at the same time.","Even if Hong Tianbu was stronger than the average True Self Tier cultivator, so what? It was impossible for him to destroy two Earth Dragons in one go. Instead, he was countered by the Earth Dragons, which made him feel extremely terrible.","The expressions of the Eastern Sea Venerate and Di Hailan were both extremely terrible. This was a scene that they could never have imagined.","A dignified True Self Tier cultivator couldn’t do anything to a Core Formation Tier cultivator, and even showed signs of being counter-suppressed.","This was a fantasy story.","It wasn’t that Hong Tianbu was too weak-no matter how weak a True Self Tier cultivator was, he was still a True Self Tier cultivator. He could crush a Core Formation Tier cultivator single-handedly, but Ling Han was too freakish. He was actually a Formations Grandmaster, an existence that could match a Spiritual Transformation Tier cultivator.","Thus, it wouldn’t be strange for Hong Tianbu to be blocked, or even defeated in fact. If it weren’t for the fact that Ling Han was still limited by his own cultivation level and unable to fully unleash his powerful spiritual power, he could have even insta-killed Hong Tianbu with a single strike.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","Hong Tianbu continued to attack, yet he was completely unable to break through the Earth Dragons’ blockade. Under Ling Han’s control, five Earth Dragons appeared at the same time, launching attacks at Hong Tianbu.","Five Earth Dragons!","This was equivalent to five True Self Tier cultivators. Even if Hong Tianbu was quite extraordinary, he was still someone who had damaged his foundations, after all. Forcibly breaking through to True Self Tier would definitely lead to an evil consequence that his battle prowess at the same cultivation level was not strong enough.","Thus, when all five Earth Dragons appeared at the same time, he would not be able to hold on any longer.","He was outmatched!","He was overcome with grief. He was a dignified True Self Tier cultivator, yet he was no match for a Core Formation Tier cultivator. He had lost all face.","However, defeat was still better than being defeated and dying.","Hong Tianbu was already thinking of retreating. He knew that after retreating, he would no longer have the chance to defeat Ling Han. However, if he didn’t retreat, he would die. He naturally didn’t want to die even more.","However, Ling Han had no intention of sparing Hong Tianbu’s life.","-You have come to kill me, so you must be prepared to die as well.","He shot out the black light of illusion, and Hong Tianbu immediately fell into an illusion. Then, the five Earth Dragons took advantage of the opening to attack him.","The disadvantage of the Earth Dragon was that it was not agile. Against a real True Self Tier, it would only be effective for defense, but if it wanted to hurt someone... the latter would just have to dodge, which was very easy.","However, the Earth Dragon added with the black light of illusion was a completely different story.","Two seconds, wasn’t that enough time for the Earth Dragons to completely outflank their target?","When Hong Tianbu broke free from the illusion, he had to face the mad barrage of attacks from the five Earth Dragons, forcing him to use his trump card, and use the Primordial Beast’s eye to petrify and shatter the Earth Dragons.","But the problem was that the Earth Dragons were only formed from Earth Qi, and did not have any life. So be it if they exploded. Ling Han could easily create another Earth Dragon, and his attacks would not stop at all.","At the risk of sustaining some injuries, Hong Tianbu forcefully barged out of the Earth Dragons’ encirclement. However, the black light of illusion attacked, and he once again fell into the illusion. When he struggled free, he was once again surrounded by the Earth Dragons. In everyone’s eyes, Ling Han didn’t need to do it himself. He could simply summon the Earth Dragons and deal with Hong Tianbu.","Who could compare to such a prodigy?","“Sister, just marry him. I don’t think this kind of brother-in-law can be found no matter how hard you try.” Among the members of the Donglin Imperial Clan, the mischievous Chi Mengshan began to persuade again. Seeing that Chi Menghan didn’t answer her at all, she placed her hands on her hips, and said, “Let me tell you, Chi Menghan, if I weren’t too young, I wouldn’t have given such a good man to you!”","Chi Menghan placed a hand on her forehead, feeling a headache coming on. Why was this little sister of hers giving her such a headache?","‘Can’t you act like a little girl in her teens? Why are you so mature?!’","The Eastern Sea Venerate frowned. He couldn’t sit by and watch any longer. Otherwise, Hong Tianbu would definitely die.","However, just as he was about to make a move, he saw the Nine Mountains Venerate had","already stepped in front of him.","“Nine Mountains, move aside!” he declared darkly.","“What a joke. This is my territory, and you think you’re worthy of shouting here?” Nine Mountains Venerate said coldly.","“Heng, if Hong Tianbu dies, I definitely won’t let the matter go!” the Eastern Sea Venerate","threatened.","En, are you trying to scare me?","The Nine Mountains Venerate directly summoned the Nine Suns Parasol. Although the Saint Tool hadn’t awakened, merely a sliver of saintly might circulated, which was enough to give a Venerate Tier a headache.","‘F*** you!’","The Eastern Sea Venerate was completely dumbfounded at this moment. ‘I’ve only said one word, and you’ve already taken out the Saint Tool. Is that appropriate?’","He was protective of his own people, but compared with Nine Mountains Venerate, the two of them weren’t on the same level at all.","“Just obediently stay there. Otherwise, I won’t mind detaining you here forever,” the Nine Mountains Venerate said calmly. However, his tone was extremely firm.","The Eastern Sea Venerate was rendered speechless, and could only tremble in fury. Return to the main branch and ask the Saint to bring the Imperial Weapon to flatten this","place?","What a joke; even Imperial Clan elites couldn’t act recklessly. Even if they mobilized an Imperial Weapon, they would have to be reasonable and justified – oh, you, a True Self Tier elite, bullied a Core Formation Tier. You didn’t win and were killed, yet you still want a Saint to take out an Imperial Weapon to avenge you. If word got out, wouldn’t you be laughed at by","others?","In the whole universe, the Heaven Wolf Imperial Clan was not the only Imperial Clan. The Imperial Clan could not do as they liked, simply suppressing all negative public opinion.","“Fourth great-grandfather!” Di Hailan was getting anxious. Hong Tianjin’s situation was getting worse and worse.","“Shut up!” the Eastern Sea Venerate shouted. He then looked at the Nine Mountains Venerate and said, “Fine, I admit defeat. I can guarantee that the Heaven Wolf Imperial Clan will never cause trouble for this brat again.”","Yet the Nine Mountains Venerate scoffed, and said, “If you want to target that brat, just make your move. Without experiencing some hardships, how could that brat be able to grow? However, this battle must be fought to the end!”","‘F*ck! I’ve never seen anyone like you before. How can you be so shameless?’","This was a member of the Imperial Clan; did they really think that they were so easily","offended?","However, the Nine Mountains Venerate had already made his stand clear. The Saint Tool was also on the verge of awakening at any moment, and the Eastern Sea Venerate didn’t dare to provoke it at all. Otherwise, he would definitely die here today.","To be killed by a Saint Tool, there was definitely no way he could be saved.","His eyes were spitting fire, while his hands were tightly clenched. “Nine Mountains, are you planning to push the Nine Suns Holy Land into a fire pit?”","“What a joke, this is a ‘fair’ battle. What is it? Does your Di Clan have any objections?” The Nine Mountains Venerate said calmly, not feeling threatened at all.","“Good! Good! Good!” The Eastern Sea Venerate said good three times. He had already decided","that after this, he would go to the main branch. No matter what, he had to ask an Imperial Son","to come out and kill Ling Han.","In a fair battle, so there would be no argument!"]},{"number":4097,"title":"Chapter 4097: Killed","paragraphs":["Chapter 4097: Killed","Hong Tianbu was filled with utter despair.","His retreat was fruitless, so he placed his hopes on the Eastern Sea Venerate. Thus, he naturally heard the conversation between the Eastern Sea Venerate and the Nine Mountains Venerate. The two Venerates had absolutely no intention of concealing their conversation.","The Eastern Sea Venerate could not make a move, and he was also trapped, so he could only fight all out. The result of fighting all out... was naturally death.","He didn’t want to die, and he more so didn’t want to die in Ling Han’s hands. This was the greatest opponent he had faced in his entire life. He would truly die with remaining grievances.","But so what? Under the frenzied barrage of attacks from the five Earth Dragons, he could only parry. Furthermore, he was still unable to parry, and could do nothing at all.","The injuries on his body were also getting more and more serious, continuously spurting out blood. In some places, even his bones were revealed, and his appearance was too horrible to look at.","He was already going all out, extracting the Regulations of heaven and earth, turning them into his strongest attack.","With such might, if it landed on Ling Han, then even with the strength of Ling Han’s physique, and with the Primal Chaos Celestial Core being able to disperse the power that he was hit with, even if he did not die, he would still be severely injured.","But the problem now was that he did not have the chance to hit Ling Han at all.","This, he really could only wait for death.","“Tianbu! Tianbu!” Di Hailan shouted from the sidelines, but she also knew that she would be of no help at all if she just called out like this. Thus, she looked at Ling Han, and said, “If you dare to kill Tianbu, I will capture all your family and friends, and kill them one by one in front of you, and then kill you!”","A powerful killing intent instantly rose up in Ling Han’s heart. This was his reverse scale, and touching it would result in death.","You want to kill my family and friends?","Then I’ll kill you first!","Ling Han summoned another five Earth Dragons. In the previous battle, he had already revealed his ability to summon ten Earth Dragons at the same time. Thus, he was not afraid of others finding out now. In any case, his true trump card was as many as sixteen.","Hong Tianbu couldn’t even withstand five Earth Dragons, let alone ten.","He was completely outmatched, and was blasted into smithereens.","This time, he had really died, and there was no longer the slightest possibility of revival.","“Tianbu—” Di Hailan released a shrill cry. She really liked Hong Tianbu. Otherwise, with her identity as a member of the Imperial Clan, how could she have married a person with no background like Hong Tianbu?","“Good! Good! Good!” The Eastern Sea Venerate’s aged face was livid, “Nine Mountains, you will definitely regret what happened today!”","“Farewell!” The Nine Mountains Venerate said calmly.","With a wave of his hand, the Eastern Sea Venerate grabbed Di Hailan and tore a rip into the Void.","The Nine Mountains Venerate smiled at Ling Han. He was extremely satisfied with this disciple.","Just ask the Imperial Sons and Imperial Daughters of the world. Which one of them could counterattack and kill a True Self Tier cultivator in the Core Formation Tier? Especially when Ling Han was only in the late stage of Core Formation Tier.","“Don’t be arrogant and don’t be proud. Focus on cultivating, and strive to advance into the True Self Tier as soon as possible,” he said.","“All right.” Ling Han nodded.","“Go on.” The Nine Mountains Venerate waved his hand, and took the lead to leave. He had been in seclusion at first, and had been awakened by the aura of a Venerate Tier. Now that the opponent was defeated, he naturally had to return to continue his seclusion.","If he could become a Saint, he would become Ling Han’s sturdiest support, and assist this strongest disciple in breaking through to the Imperial Path.","The crowd dispersed, but they were still discussing spiritedly. Meanwhile, it was as if Lu Qi had been beaten, and he looked extremely despondent.","Was it really that difficult to kill a Core Formation Tier late stage cultivator?","Ling Han returned in a flash, and continued to teach the secret techniques of the Battle God Palace to the two women and the large black dog. However, only a few days later, the Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm also sent someone over, and made the same request, demanding that the Nine Suns Holy Land hand over Ling Han.","This time, the Nine Mountains Venerate didn’t even show himself. Several Sect Master elites aggressively rebuked the people from the Buddhist Race.","It couldn’t be helped. The Buddhist Race of the West Heavenly Realm could only be considered a Holy Land, at most. With how Nine Suns Holy Land had always been assertive, how could they possibly admit defeat?","When the news spread out, it naturally caused another round of heated discussions on the Galaxy Network. They both admired Ling Han’s ability to cause trouble, and at the same time, praised the Nine Yang Holy Land for protecting their disciple.","Ling Han didn’t care too much. After the his lessons ended, he couldn’t sit still any longer.","The late stage of the Core Formation Tier wasn’t cultivated in seclusion.","He had to obtain more high-level Spirit Diagrams, extract the Regulations of heaven and earth from them, and brand them onto the Celestial Core, completing this stage of cultivation.","Of course, theoretically speaking, one could break through with just Three Inscriptions. By now, Ling Han had already reached Five Inscriptions. In fact, he was already qualified to advance to the fourth stage of the Core Formation Tier, the Liquefied Gold Core, to lay the foundations for the True Self Tier.","However, if he broke through now, it would be too much of a waste.","Ling Han was someone who was going to attempt breaking through to the Imperial Path, so he naturally had to cultivate every cultivation level to perfection.","There were indeed Spirit Diagrams sold on the Galaxy Network, but their level was too low. There was absolutely no way that Ling Han would waste the space on his Celestial Core.","Thus, if he wanted to obtain a high-level Spirit Diagram, he could only go out.","The Nine Mountains Venerate was willing to open up the Spirit Diagrams of the Holy Land to Ling Han, but not one of them was Great Emperor Tier-level. Though Ling Han had learnt it, he was not in a rush to break through now, so he just left it for now. However, if he didn’t have a target, he couldn’t just run around randomly, right?","Though Ling Han was very awesome, he was only a Core Formation Tier, after all, and the opponents that he had provoked... there were already two Imperial Clans alone.","He checked on the Galaxy Network every day to see if any ancient site had appeared. There was definitely, but the level was too low. They didn’t even have Sect Master-level, so they","definitely wouldn’t attract him.","However, another few days passed, and finally, a big piece of news spread out.","The True Dragon Abyss was about to open!","The entire world was in an uproar. Even the Imperial Clans couldn’t remain calm.","Why? Were there some supreme precious treasures hidden here?","It could be said that there was, but it could also be said that there wasn’t.","That was because what they were fighting over in the True Dragon Abyss was not treasures in the traditional sense, cultivation techniques, celestial techniques, but rather... fortune! Fortune was something that could not be grasped, but it did indeed exist.","For example, if you faced a choice at a crossroads, that could lead you to hell, or it could lead","you to heaven.","Those with great fortune would subconsciously make the most beneficial choice.","Moreover, this fortune was not only applicable to individuals. In fact, it could even benefit the","sects and clans.","For sects or forces that were flourishing with fortune, there would be prodigies joining them, and freakish prodigies emerging. They were destined to rise up, and no matter what, they could not be stopped.","Additionally, one would only need to cultivate earnestly to become a Venerate, but becoming a Saint would definitely need fortune, and becoming an Emperor would also need to gather the great fortune of heaven and earth.","In the True Dragon Abyss, there was the True Dragon of Fortune. Those who obtained it could increase the fortune of themselves and the force behind them, and would be favoured by heaven and earth.","When Ling Han found out, he hurriedly investigated the exact situation of the True Dragon","Abyss.","Every time the True Dragon Abyss opened, there would be six True Dragons of Fortune, which belonged to the six cultivation levels from Foundation Building Tier to Minor Advanced Tier. Meanwhile, cultivators could only enter into the area corresponding to their cultivation level, and whether one could obtain the True Dragons of Fortune would depend on one’s abilities","and natural talent.","Was there... a Spirit Diagram inside?","Ling Han thought. However, whether there was a Spirit Diagram or not, this trip was","obviously necessary.","The Nine Mountains Venerate supported him so much. He naturally had to do something for","the Nine Suns Holy Land. Furthermore, the True Dragon of Fortune was also greatly beneficial for Ling Han. Merely for this reason, he had to go."]},{"number":4098,"title":"Chapter 4098: True Dragon Abyss","paragraphs":["Chapter 4098: True Dragon Abyss","Deciding to go was one matter, but how to go was another matter.","Though Ling Han never admitted it, in truth, there were indeed a great many forces that wanted to get rid of him.","There were some that truly had enmity with him, such as the Heaven Wolf Imperial Clan and the Buddhist Sect of the West Heavenly Realm. There were also those that actually did not have any enmity with him. They were only wary of his talent, and wanted to kill him.","There had been no Emperor in the world for tens of millions of years. Theoretically speaking, the door to becoming an Emperor had already been opened. Any prodigy would be qualified to attempt it, and a freakish guy like Ling Han... would drive a great many people to despair.","Killing Ling Han was equivalent to eliminating a powerful competitor for their own juniors. He was sure that there would be a great many elites willing to make a move.","Thus, Ling Han had to take it easy.","“There are a total of six True Dragons of Fortune in the True Dragon Abyss, so it’s also divided into six regions, corresponding to the six cultivation levels from Foundation Building Tier to Minor Advanced Tier.","“In other words, Sect Master elites will also participate. Thankfully, I won’t clash with them head-on. Otherwise, no matter how lucky I am, if I want to compete with them, the","possibility of me being killed would definitely be higher.”","“The large black dog and I are in the Core Formation Tier. Of course, we’re entering the territory of the Core Formation Tier. Luan Xing and Hu Niu are still in the Cauldron Forging Tier, so if we go to the True Dragon Abyss, we’ll definitely be separated.”","“En, they are both Nine Cauldrons Fusion Cauldron, and have also mastered a considerable number of Imperial Techniques and Saint Techniques. Even against an Imperial Son and Imperial Daughter, they may not be at a disadvantage.”","“Moreover, it’s said that the True Dragon Abyss also contains Great Herbs, as well as inheritances left behind by predecessors. Even if one can’t obtain the True Dragon of Fortune, there are still many benefits.”","Ling Han discussed with the empress, Hu Niu, and the large black dog, and decided to set out immediately.","This kind of great fortune was definitely not something that could be obtained through hard cultivation. Something like fortune was bestowed by the heavens. If one missed it, it was possible that he would never be able to obtain it again.","Ling Han communicated with the ley lines, and with a twist of Earth Qi, they had already arrived at the Transfer Formation on the Nine Suns Planet.","Right now, the Nine Mountains Venerate was cultivating in seclusion, so he didn’t have time to bring Ling Han and the others through the galaxy. Thus, Ling Han and the others could only rely on themselves to travel.","Thankfully, the opening of the True Dragon Abyss would need a very long time, so there was no need to worry that it would not make it in time.","The three people and one dog were still travelling at night, and only when their bodies could no longer bear it did they stop to rest and recover. In this manner, they endlessly travelled through the galaxy, and after spending more than three months, they finally arrived at the True Dragon Abyss.","The True Dragon Abyss was on the Heavenly Dragon Planet. This was a damaged great planet, and was located at the borders of the four great Heavenly Realms. It possessed a very special","status.","According to legends, the first and only True Dragon in the world was born here, and was overseer in the heart of the entire galaxy. Thus, the Heavenly Dragon Planet did not belong to any one of the Heavenly Realms.","However, at some point in history, a great battle had erupted here, blasting the Heavenly Dragon Planet into bits, turning it into a damaged planet. At the same time, it also allowed the True Dragon Abyss to appear in the world for the first time.","The True Dragon was an existence that was comparable to the Great Emperor, and dragons were the symbol of great fortune in the first place. Thus, the True Dragon was born here, and died here, as if it had formed a whirlpool of fortune of heaven and earth. Every once in a while, a True Dragon of Fortune would be nurtured.","Of course, this period of time was also astonishingly long, numbering in the tens of millions of years.","And every time the True Dragon Abyss opened, it spoke of a fact.","-The heaven and earth had already prepared themselves to welcome the birth of the next Emperor. This was the greatest significance.","However, looking through history, of all the Ancestral Kings that had been born after the appearance of the True Dragon Abyss, only 50% had ever been to the True Dragon Abyss.","In other words, even if one didn’t obtain the great fortune of the True Dragon Abyss, it actually wouldn’t have any effect on becoming an Emperor.","Because the Heavenly Dragon Planet had already been shattered, it was far worse off than Celestial Sea Planet. There was no longer a sliver of life here, because without the protection of the atmosphere, mortals would not be able to survive at all.","Thus, those who could come here had to be at least in the Foundation Building Tier.","Ling Han, the empress, Hu Niu and the dog didn’t directly arrive at the Heavenly Dragon Planet. Instead, they first arrived at a nearby great planet, then boarded a warship, crossed the galaxy, and arrived at the Heavenly Dragon Planet. For this, they also paid a huge sum of Dao","Stones.","Looking from the galaxy, there was a massive fissure on the Heavenly Dragon Planet, that lay across the entire damaged planet, like an eye that was presently opening.","That was the True Dragon Abyss. When this “eye” was completely open, one could enter.","The warship landed, and Ling Han came out. He saw that this originally barren broken planet was extremely lively. There were people everywhere, and they were all waiting for the True Dragon Abyss to open.","Ling Han and the others kept an extremely low profile-mainly because of Ling Han and the large black dog. It could be said that there were definitely several times more people who wanted to kill them than those who liked them.","In this place, the aura of Venerate Tier would appear and disappear intermittently. In fact, occasionally, there would even be saintly might spreading out.","If the power of a Great Emperor suddenly exploded here, and completely destroyed the Heavenly Dragon Planet, then it could instantly cause the overall level of cultivation of the entire galaxy to decline by tens of thousands of years, or even more.","Now, there were too many prodigies and elites gathered here.","“Low-key! Low-key!” Ling Han and the large black dog encouraged each other. Ling Han and the large black dog didn’t provoke anyone, and the large black dog also suppressed the urge to steal their underpants. The man and dog both hid in a simple tent.","However, how could such provocative beings like them keep a low profile for too long?","“I’d better go out and take a look.”","“That’s right. In any case, we have already changed our appearances, and even our soul fluctuations have changed. We would definitely not be recognized.”","“En, let’s go!”","The man and dog walked out boldly just like that. Because there were too many prodigies gathered here, there was no shortage of people with money and treasures. Thus, some people simply set up a stall here.","At the beginning, there had even been an incident of robbery, but this had caused a Saint to speak up, saying that rules had to be observed in all matters. Thus, the whole marketplace became very well-behaved. Even the Imperial Clans dared not act recklessly.","Saints were just that freakish. Their words were as effective as law.","Ling Han strolled around with the large black dog. The large black dog had been holding back for a few days, and instantly turned into a chatterbox, chattering non-stop. There was still quite a lot of good stuff here. In fact, there were a considerable number of high-grade items that had been obtained from ancient ruins. However, no one knew how to use them now, but once they figured it out, the buyers exclaimed that they had made a killing.","Ling Han and the large black dog also wanted to try their luck. As they walked, Ling Han also used his eye technique to estimate the age of these ancient items.","“Brother, come and take a look. There are a lot of treasures here!” A stall keeper waved at Ling Han. There was a pile of things laid out in front of him, including sabers and swords, as well","as exquisite small towers, white jade fans, and so on. Ling Han walked over and flipped through them one by one.","“Brother, look at this!” He spread out his hands and handed over a dagger, “This has just been","taken out of the ancient site, and is an ancient item that is at least several million years old. Just look at these veined patterns. Tsk tsk, they conform to the Dao of Heaven and Earth!”","The large black dog immediately snatched it over. He had now transformed into a large man, but he still couldn’t change his habit as a dog. He sniffed with his nose, then said to Ling Han, “Little Han, this is genuine old stuff!”","The stall keeper couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. ‘What’s wrong with you? You don’t even look with your eyes, yet you’re sniffing with your nose. Are you born in the year of","the dog?’","Er, he wasn’t born in the Year of the Dog, he was indeed a dog!"]},{"number":4099,"title":"Chapter 4099: Bidding","paragraphs":["Chapter 4099: Bidding","Ling Han activated his eye technique, and said, “Hehe, the layer of rust outside is indeed an old thing.”","How smart was the large black dog? He was the ancestor of trickery in the first place, so he immediately understood after hearing Ling Han’s words. He immediately tossed the dagger onto the ground before grabbing the stall keeper and saying, “Good one, you actually dared to trick Grandpa Dog!”","Yi, are you really a dog?","That person spread out his hands and smiled awkwardly. In the first place, doing business here was based on one’s insight. If one had good insight, they could avoid being deceived, or even pick up real treasures. However, it was your own fault for having poor insight, and having bought fake goods, who could you blame?","“Old Black, don’t drop down to his level.” Ling Han waved his hand dismissively.","“Humph, consider yourself lucky!” The large black dog withdrew his hand. He and Ling Han had to keep a low profile now. Otherwise, with his petty nature, how could he possibly let go of someone who wanted to trick him so easily?","Ling Han searched through the stall. Needless to say, the counterfeiting ability of this stall keeper was quite strong. Each item was exuding an ancient aura, but if one looked closely with an eye technique, they were actually all new items deliberately made old. However, their craftsmanship was extremely good, and ordinary people really wouldn’t be able to tell.","He swept an eye over them before withdrawing his gaze. Everything here had been faked, so there was nothing interesting about it.","“Old Black, let’s go.”","“All right!” The large black dog nodded, then glared harshly at the stall keeper as a warning.","They walked, but they had not walked too far when Ling Han suddenly stopped in his tracks.","“Little Han, what are you doing?” the large black dog asked in confusion.","“Let’s go back.” Ling Han’s expression became serious.","“Yi?” The large black dog faltered for a moment, then looked excited, “Then there really is treasure?”","“I don’t know whether it’s a treasure or not, but I did miss it,” Ling Han said with a nod.","“Let’s go, let’s go.”","The man and dog returned. However, in such a short while, there were already other people watching the stall. They were two men, and they were both very young. They were handsome and energetic, exuding a captivating aura.","One of them was at the Core Formation Tier, while the other was at the True Self Tier. Moreover, he wasn’t just newly advanced into the True Self Tier. He was at the consummate level of the True Self Tier. When Ling Han observed him, he also turned around to glance at him, and his gaze was so piercing that Ling Han felt a little pain.","The other Core Formation Tier cultivator also turned around, and when he saw Ling Han, he was disdainful, because now that Ling Han had disguised himself, he naturally wouldn’t recognize that this was the most popular Galaxy Network celebrity.","The large black dog didn’t care about this. To him, treasure was the most important.","“Make way.” It squeezed through, then said to Ling Han, “Little Han, come and pick.”","Seeing that the two “people” had come again, the stall keeper’s expression involuntarily darkened. ‘You guys are here to cause trouble, right?’","Seeing the large black dog forcefully squeeze in, the other two frowned slightly. That man in the Core Formation Tier had a bad temper, and immediately said, “What’s the rush? Can’t you come back after we leave?”","“What is it? Is this place reserved by you people? Do I have to wait until you’re satisfied before I can come here?” The large black dog immediately retorted. When it came to a matter of principle that involved precious treasures, he naturally would not give in.","What if the treasure was picked up by someone else?","“He!” The Core Formation Tier cultivator was enraged, and he immediately stood up.","“Little Han, there’s room.” The large black dog, and Ling Han took advantage of the opening to fill his position, forcibly pushing the Core Formation Tier cultivator out of the way.","F***!","The Core Formation Tier cultivator was instantly enraged. “Who are you two? You even dare to trifle with me, Liu Fang?”","He thought that after announcing his name, Ling Han and the large black dog would definitely feel “respect”, because he was ranked 76th in Core Formation Tier on the Galaxy Network, and it could be claimed that he was inconceivably strong.","However, he immediately discovered in fury that neither Ling Han nor the large black dog paid any attention to him. Instead, they were searching around in the stall.","He was being completely ignored!","“How dare you!” Liu Fang’s eyes were spitting fire.","Young people were hot-tempered in the first place, and he was also a top-notch prodigy that was ranked high on the Galaxy Network. Usually, he was used to being flattered and ingratiated, and now that he was being ignored like this, he immediately felt an urge to make a move.","“Junior Brother!” The True Self Tier cultivator stretched out a hand to block, holding Liu Fang back.","“Senior Brother Tu, don’t stop me. I want to teach them a good lesson!” Liu Fang said angrily.","“Don’t forget the rules here!” the True Self Tier said solemnly. His name was Tu Yang.","Liu Fang shuddered upon hearing this. No matter how proud he was, he couldn’t ignore the words of a Saint.","A single word from a Saint was a law.","He waved his hand angrily, and made up his mind. As long as he left this “market”, he would definitely catch these two people and teach them a good lesson.","Tu Yang, meanwhile, was calm, and communicated through divine sense, “In a while, no matter what he buys, we will raise the bid to compete with them.”","Liu Fang’s eyes instantly lit up. This was indeed a good way to cause trouble for others.","Haha, they had all come from the Holy Land, so which one of them wasn’t rich and imposing?","Have a bidding war with them, humph!","“Little Han, which one is it?” the large black dog also asked through divine sense.","Ling Han had already found his target. That was a Buddha that was about a foot tall. He communicated with the large black dog through divine sense, then said, “Don’t be anxious. I don’t think those two have any good intentions.”","“That’s right. They’re not picky either. They keep staring at Grandpa Dog’s behind, they definitely don’t have any good intentions.” The large black dog nodded, then bared his teeth, “Grandpa Dog knows very well that these two brats have a lot of bad ideas. They must have seen what we wanted to buy, so they will compete over it with us, to disgust us.”","This kind of little trick was left over from Grandpa Dog’s bag of tricks, all right?","“Come, Grandpa Dog will play with them.”","The stall keeper’s forehead was covered with cold sweat. He had really seen weirdos today. Four people were surrounding his stall, yet all of them were silent. Are you guys playing a mime?","“Er, how much is this?” The large black dog suddenly picked up a mirror.","‘Ancestor, you’ve finally made a sound.’","The stall keeper breathed a sigh of relief, but his expression was still strange. ‘Didn’t you f****** just say that it was a fake, and still asked me for a price? Are you deliberately messing with me?’ However, there was still Tu Yang and Liu Fang on the sidelines, so he could not call out too cheap a price.","“A thousand Dao Stones,” he said.","“Alright, I’ll take it.” The large black dog nodded, and did not bargain.","“Wait!” Liu Fang hurriedly stopped him, “I offer 1500. Give me the item.”","The large black dog turned around, and said, “Grandson, Grandpa Dog has already reached an agreement with the stall keeper. Why are you interrupting?”","Grandson?","Liu Fang gritted his teeth, and the flames of fury in his eyes burned even brighter. However, he had not lost his reason. Fighting was not allowed here.","“The highest bidder wins. Don’t you understand this logic?” he said, pretending to be indifferent. Then, he asked the stall keeper, “Don’t you agree?”","Of course. Who would not want to take money given to him freely?","The stall keeper hurriedly nodded, “That’s right. The highest bidder wins.”","He looked at the large black dog with slight anticipation. ‘Come, don’t be reserved. Please increase the bid.’","“Little Han, what do you think about this one?” The large black dog ignored him completely, and pointed at another item.","F***, why didn’t you play by the rules?"]},{"number":4100,"title":"Chapter 4100: Trick","paragraphs":["Chapter 4100: Trick","The large black dog’s principle was that if he couldn’t take advantage, then no one could. Thus, it definitely wouldn’t raise the price for the stall keeper!","In any case, Liu Fang was already at a disadvantage by offering this price, and it had already enjoyed itself to its heart’s content, so how could the stall keeper enjoy himself further?","Seeing that the large black dog’s battle prowess was so weak, Liu Fang instantly felt as if he had punched cotton. He did not feel any force at all. Instead, he felt very uncomfortable, as if he was about to suffer internal injuries.","“Boss, how much is this?” The large black dog pointed at a bronze mirror again. It had an ancient appearance, and looked to be very old.","“This, 10,000 Dao Stones.” The stall keeper hurriedly tried to save himself.","Initially, he had only planned to ask for 3,000 for this copper mirror, but he could tell that there seemed to be signs of a fight between the two of them. Thus, he could completely ask a high price.","“Oh.” The large black dog placed the bronze mirror back down.","‘F*ck!’","The stall keeper was confused. ‘What do you mean? Ah, is there anyone like you?’","Even Liu Fang was a little confused. What was going on? He had never seen anyone play cards like this.","The large black dog bared his teeth in a grin. ‘You’re still too naive to make use of Grandpa Dog to earn money!’","It picked up another sword, and asked, “What about this?”","The stall keeper somewhat understood, and answered honestly, “A thousand and five hundred Dao Stones.”","“I’ll take it.” The large black dog nodded.","“2000!” Liu Fang said coldly.","The large black dog directly stuffed the sword into his hands, then turned to the stall keeper and said, “Boss, do I count as a trustworthy support of the universe? Remember, I want half of the extra money earned today.”","Is it really good for you to say that?","The stall keeper was extremely embarrassed, and Liu Fang and Tu Yang’s expressions also became very ugly. At first, they had wanted to disgust the other party, but why was it that they were the ones being disgusted now?","Who was this guy? This was practically, practically a f*cking trap.","The large black dog ordered a few more items. At first, Liu Fang even perked up and increased the bid a few times, but afterwards, he finally realized that it was actually the large black dog that was toying with him.","‘F*ck! I’m not bidding anymore! Let’s see what you can do!’","“Oh, then I don’t want it.” The large black dog directly placed the item in his hand back onto the ground.","‘Holy sh*t! Is that even possible?’","The stall keeper was stunned, and so were Liu Fang and Tu Yang. How could there be someone as shameless as you? You had already asked for the price, and said that you were going to buy it. Why did you go back on your word?","“What is it? Grandpa Dog hasn’t paid yet, and you still want to rob me?” The large black dog looked at the stall keeper viciously, “When doing business, you have to behave and do your job, don’t you think so?”","The stall keeper was already unable to speak. However, thanks to the large black dog, he had also earned a small profit. In truth, he was still a little grateful to the large black dog, but there was a deep feeling of awkwardness mixed in.","At this moment, the large black dog finally picked up the Buddha statue and asked Liu Fang, “Boss, how much is this?”","Yi, just ask the price, why are you staring at me?","Do I look so much like a fool?","A muscle twitched in Liu Fang’s cheek. He wanted to hit someone again. Furthermore, previously, if he had only been slightly displeased with Ling Han and wanted to teach him a lesson, then now he really had the intention to kill the large black dog.","F***, he was too despicable.","“Five hundred Dao Stones,” the stall keeper said.","“I’ll buy it,” the large black dog said. Then, he didn’t pay, and just looked at Liu Fang expectantly.","You, you, you... have gone too far!","Liu Fang turned his head away. If he took another look at the large black dog, he would definitely lose control.","“Here, the money is here.” The large black dog directly tossed out 500 Dao Stones. Then, he hugged the Buddha statue in his arms. This time, no one could take it from him.","Yi, why didn’t you put it down?","Liu Fang and Tu Yang were both startled, but they were also smart people. Otherwise, how could they have cultivated to such a high cultivation level at such a young age? In fact, they had even squeezed into the top hundred of the Galaxy Network?","Sh*t, they had been tricked!","His target was this Buddha statue. Previously, he was simply trying to divert their attention, and then take advantage of the opening to make a move.","‘F*ck! F*ck! F*ck!’","This time, even Tu Yang was angered. Two mere Core Formation Tier cultivators actually dared to toy with him?","Who was he?","The Dao Child of the Azure Snow Holy Land, the supreme prodigy ranked 54th in True Self Tier on the Galaxy Network!","The large black dog snickered. Pa! With a powerful toss, the Buddha statue instantly crashed into the ground, revealing multiple cracks.","The stall keeper’s face instantly paled, and he hurriedly said, “This has nothing to do with me. You were the one who accidentally broke it.”","‘That’s not right. This wasn’t an accident. It was clearly deliberate.’","He was a little confused. He had just spent 500 Dao Stones to buy it, and in the blink of an eye, it had been smashed. Just what kind of illness did he have?","“Boss, this Spirit Tool of yours is far too fragile. It shattered at the first contact, so can it be used in a fight?” the large black dog asked with a smile. He then forcefully knocked on the stone statue, causing it to instantly shatter into pieces.","This Buddha statue seemed to be solid, but the strange thing was that there was actually a clay figure in the centre!","The large black dog was overjoyed. This was definitely what Ling Han had said about seeing","wrongly.","“Yi, why is there another clay figurine here?” It asked, pretending to be surprised.","How pretentious!","Whether it was Tu Yang, Liu Fang, or that stall keeper, they could all see very clearly that the large black dog’s act was really too fake. He was not the slightest bit surprised, and was","grinning from ear to ear.","“You dare to trick me!” Liu Fang said darkly. By now, he naturally knew that the large black dog had long since known that there was something inside this Buddha statue, yet still tricked","him into buying a pile of things that he did not need.","Damn it, absolutely damn it.","Moreover, though the Buddha statue was a fake, and had shattered with a few throws, it was a bit unreasonable to say that one fake was used to conceal another fake, wasn’t it? Thus, it was extremely possible that this clay figurine was really some kind of treasure!","With such a discovery, even the stall keeper was shocked. He had indeed found this Buddha statue in a small shop. With his expertise in counterfeiting, he immediately discovered that the Buddha statue was indeed quite old, but it was definitely no treasure.","He deliberately forged some patterns on it so that it would look pricier, so that he could sell it for a high price. Who would have thought that he was the one who had misjudged? As it turned","out, there was a clay figurine inside the Buddha statue!","“I, I’m not selling anymore,” he said, beginning to act shamelessly.","“Sure.” The large black dog kicked the shards of the Buddha statue to him, “Give me back the","500 Dao Stones.”","Er!","The stall keeper was rendered speechless. He was already shameless enough, but he had never thought that he would encounter someone even more shameless.","Ling Han smiled, and said to Tu Yang and Liu Fang, “The two of you, farewell!”","Liu Fang did not speak, but his fists were already tightly clenched. He swore that he would","definitely kill Ling Han and the large black dog, especially that shameless swindler. He would shatter him into ten thousand pieces!","Ling Han and the large black dog didn’t continue to wander around. They were very curious about this clay figure. What was its use?","They left the marketplace, but they had not walked too far, when they saw that Liu Fang had already appeared in front of them, blocking their path, and Tu Yang had cut off their path of retreat. He crossed his arms over his chest, looking disdainful.","Indeed, not only was he in the True Self Tier, but he was also in the consummate level of the True Self Tier. There was absolutely no need for him to take Ling Han and the large black dog seriously. He was far too powerful."]}]);
